 that the lock does not name was added by the game.\"},{\"line_number\":10065,\"content\":\"- `STARTER` (const): The starter game: copied into a new game, then the game's own.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"b20342b7-c4f3-4be5-aa3b-a6c08ef2962b"}
