{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_25","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking vite.config.ts to see if npm test runs all engine tests or only the game.\n\nEngine tests are skipped during new-game setup, so the game workspace has no engine tests. npm test likely only runs labs/game and tools tests.\n\nOnly the starter game tests remain. The engine copy rule skips all .test.ts files, so labs/game and labs/box tests were excluded. The template's own tests likely survived because the copy order prioritizes the starter match.\n\nReplacing starter tests with game tests. npm test may grow longer with 10 seeds across activities. verify.mjs will run the full suite separately. Activity tests need roughly 1.26 million steps.\n\nEmpty scene step time is the main bottleneck. At 0.05 ms per step, one million steps take about a minute; at 0.2 ms, about four minutes. Direct bot calls inside activity steps are forbidden because tests must use the shipped step function. Rate-based scoring could shorten activities, but the plan specifies fixed durations and does not clarify whether those apply to the full activity or just the test loop.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-881b2fb1-5472-4a5f-906a-1c3c0ffc9fff-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/vite.config.ts","offset":60,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-881b2fb1-5472-4a5f-906a-1c3c0ffc9fff-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export async function createHeadless|step\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/headless.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4176,"output_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":92928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_