{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_98","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing the Thumb Yoga game build per PLAN.md.\n\nsettings.ts and wobble.ts are written but untested. Next up are bot.ts, state.ts, and score.ts. Then activities, scenes, and UI. I will read existing files first to confirm state.\n\nThe plan is to write core simulation modules, wire scenes, build UI, and verify. Existing files and PLAN.md will be read in parallel to guide implementation.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The balance model is on disk but not wired or tested. I’ll read the current sim files and the plan’s activity rules, then keep building from there."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd732a93-a17b-46c1-b54c-df2b43ea273c-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"ac1","content":"ac1: Hand-in, title, and records (PROGRESS, exit-interview, HTML, RNG title)","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"ac2","content":"ac2: One balance verb, every shipped activity with score bands and bots","status":"pending"},{"id":"ac3","content":"ac3: Five-day retreat: island, cast, saves, 200+ lines, code audio","status":"pending"},{"id":"ac4","content":"ac4: 10-foot shell: pad/keyboard/mouse, pause, attract, touch, WebGPU fallback","status":"pending"},{"id":"ac5","content":"ac5: Couch Group Class and AI Hub ghost sessions with harness","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"verify: Run verification plan and save proof under scratch","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd732a93-a17b-46c1-b54c-df2b43ea273c-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd732a93-a17b-46c1-b54c-df2b43ea273c-2","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54fac