{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_101","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a large game. I will implement it comprehensively and efficiently.\n\nI am examining the API signatures for headless mode, actor spawning, and scene definition. I will follow a five-step architecture: core simulation modules, activity mechanics, a unified page, tests, and build. I also need to check how settings register and review a starter test pattern.\n\nI will write original pose strips and credit Mesh2Motion for the rest pose. I need to verify the clip set format for clips.ts. I am also checking defineLook and defineSong signatures from box examples, and simplifying the art layer to terrain, actors, and HTML UI.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1f64a55d-c2ec-4f2d-9402-ed857f482274-10","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/headless.ts","offset":340,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1f64a55d-c2ec-4f2d-9402-ed857f482274-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/actors.ts","offset":180,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1f64a55d-c2ec-4f2d-9402-ed857f482274-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1f64a55d-c2ec-4f2d-9402-ed857f482274-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export function defineScene","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/scene.ts","-A":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool