{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5c46c899-a069-4ef1-9352-f2c44d9a0c7c-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The song `song:boxHall`: the box's demo song (PLAN.md WP 9.5), two bars in A minor at 100 bpm that loop in the\\n * hall and the room, calm until a fight raises the intensity.\\n *\\n * Its layers (engine/audio/runtime/music.ts): a triangle bass and a square arpeggio from intensity 0, the calm; drums\\n * and a pulse lead join from 0.5, which labs/box/sounds/page.ts reaches while blows land and leaves once they stop.\\n *\\n * Invariants: tracker notation, one token per step: a note (C4, F#3, Bb2), - holding the note before it, . a rest,\\n * and | a bar line, which takes no step; a drums track writes the kit's tokens (k kick, s snare, h hat, o open hat,\\n10→ * c crash, t tom). At `steps` per beat and `beats` per bar, every track fills whole bars or divides one (node x\\n * describe song lists the fields; engine/audio/data/song.ts gives the rules). `intensity` makes a track join only\\n * when the music's intensity reaches it.\\n *\\n * @example\\n * import { songTiming } from '../../../engine';\\n * songTiming(boxHall).seconds; // 4.8: two bars of 4/4 at 100 bpm\\n * @see labs/box/sounds/boxHall.test.ts\\n */\\nimport { defineSong } from '../../../engine';\\n20→\\n/** The song `song:boxHall`: the box's music, calm, with a fight's drums and lead from intensity 0.5. */\\nexport const boxHall = defineSong('song:boxHall', {\\n  bpm: 100,\\n  tracks: [\\n    {\\n      wave: 'triangle',\\n      vol: 0.22,\\n      notes: 'A2 - - - - - - - E2 - - - - - - - | F2 - - - - - - - G2 - - - E2 - - -',\\n    },\\n30→    {\\n      wave: 'square',\\n      vol: 0.07,\\n      notes: 'A4 . C5 . E5 . C5 . B4 . E5 . G#4 . B4 . | A4 . C5 . F5 . C5 . G4 . B4 . D5 . B4 .',\\n    },\\n    { wave: 'drums', vol: 0.14, intensity: 0.5, notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h o' },\\n    {\\n      wave: 'pulse',\\n      vol: 0.09,\\n      intensity: 0.5,\\n40→      notes: 'E5 - - - D5 - C5 - B4 - - - G#4 - - - | A4 - - - C5 - D5 - E5 - - - - - . .',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The song `song:boxHall`: the box's demo song (PLAN.md WP 9.5), two bars in A minor at 100 bpm that loop in the\\n * hall and the room, calm until a fight raises the intensity.\\n *\\n * Its layers (engine/audio/runtime/music.ts): a triangle bass and a square arpeggio from intensity 0, the calm; drums\\n * and a pulse lead join from 0.5, which labs/box/sounds/page.ts reaches while blows land and leaves once they stop.\\n *\\n * Invariants: tracker notation, one token per step: a note (C4, F#3, Bb2), - holding the note before it, . a rest,\\n * and | a bar line, which takes no step; a drums track writes the kit's tokens (k kick, s snare, h hat, o open hat,\\n10→ * c crash, t tom). At `steps` per beat and `beats` per bar, every track fills whole bars or divides one (node x\\n * describe song lists the fields; engine/audio/data/song.ts gives the rules). `intensity` makes a track join only\\n * when the music's intensity reaches it.\\n *\\n * @example\\n * import { songTiming } from '../../../engine';\\n * songTiming(boxHall).seconds; // 4.8: two bars of 4/4 at 100 bpm\\n * @see labs/box/sounds/boxHall.test.ts\\n */\\nimport { defineSong } from '../../../engine';\\n20→\\n/** The song `song:boxHall`: the box's music, calm, with a fight's drums and lead from intensity 0.5. */\\nexport const boxHall = defineSong('song:boxHall', {\\n  bpm: 100,\\n  tracks: [\\n    {\\n      wave: 'triangle',\\n      vol: 0.22,\\n      notes: 'A2 - - - - - - - E2 - - - - - - - | F2 - - - - - - - G2 - - - E2 - - -',\\n    },\\n30→    {\\n      wave: 'square',\\n      vol: 0.07,\\n      notes: 'A4 . C5 . E5 . C5 . B4 . E5 . G#4 . B4 . | A4 . C5 . F5 . C5 . G4 . B4 . D5 . B4 .',\\n    },\\n    { wave: 'drums', vol: 0.14, intensity: 0.5, notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h o' },\\n    {\\n      wave: 'pulse',\\n      vol: 0.09,\\n      intensity: 0.5,\\n40→      notes: 'E5 - - - D5 - C5 - B4 - - - G#4 - - - | A4 - - - C5 - D5 - E5 - - - - - . .',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/box/sounds/boxHall.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The song `song:boxHall`: the box's demo song (PLAN.md WP 9.5), two bars in A minor at 100 bpm that loop in the\\n * hall and the room, calm until a fight raises the intensity.\\n *\\n * Its layers (engine/audio/runtime/music.ts): a triangle bass and a square arpeggio from intensity 0, the calm; drums\\n * and a pulse lead join from 0.5, which labs/box/sounds/page.ts reaches while blows land and leaves once they stop.\\n *\\n * Invariants: tracker notation, one token per step: a note (C4, F#3, Bb2), - holding the note before it, . a rest,\\n * and | a bar line, which takes no step; a drums track writes the kit's tokens (k kick, s snare, h hat, o open hat,\\n * c crash, t tom). At `steps` per beat and `beats` per bar, every track fills whole bars or divides one (node x\\n * describe song lists the fields; engine/audio/data/song.ts gives the rules). `intensity` makes a track join only\\n * when the music's intensity reaches it.\\n *\\n * @example\\n * import { songTiming } from '../../../engine';\\n * songTiming(boxHall).seconds; // 4.8: two bars of 4/4 at 100 bpm\\n * @see labs/box/sounds/boxHall.test.ts\\n */\\nimport { defineSong } from '../../../engine';\\n\\n/** The song `song:boxHall`: the box's music, calm, with a fight's drums and lead from intensity 0.5. */\\nexport const boxHall = defineSong('song:boxHall', {\\n  bpm: 100,\\n  tracks: [\\n    {\\n      wave: 'triangle',\\n      vol: 0.22,\\n      notes: 'A2 - - - - - - - E2 - - - - - - - | F2 - - - - - - - G2 - - - E2 - - -',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      wave: 'square',\\n      vol: 0.07,\\n      notes: 'A4 . C5 . E5 . C5 . B4 . E5 . G#4 . B4 . | A4 . C5 . F5 . C5 . G4 . B4 . D5 . B4 .',\\n    },\\n    { wave: 'drums', vol: 0.14, intensity: 0.5, notes: 'k . h . s . h . k k h . s . h o' },\\n    {\\n      wave: 'pulse',\\n      vol: 0.09,\\n      intensity: 0.5,\\n      notes: 'E5 - - - D5 - C5 - B4 - - - G#4 - - - | A4 - - - C5 - D5 - E5 - - - - - . .',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":43}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5c46c899-a069-4ef1-9352-f2c44d9a0c7c-23","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,50,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,97,110,105,109,47,99,108,105,112,47,99,108,105,112,115,101,116,115,46,116,115,10,49,48,54,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,100,101,102,105,110,101,67,108,105,112,83,101,116,40,105,110,112,117,116,58,32,67,108,105,112,83,101,116,32,124,32,115,116,114,105,110,103,32,124,32,111,98,106,101,99,116,44,32,111,112,116,105,111,110,115,58,32,123,32,114,101,103,105,115,116,114,121,63,58,32,82,101,103,105