{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_149","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand how the inspector works.\n\nThe settings from play.ts and settings.ts use non-overlapping keys, so both can be registered. However, the play.ts scene may still load if tests import it. I should either delete play.ts before running tests or ensure tests only import the bench scene.\n\nVitest will still import play.ts through play.test.ts. I will delete starter files before running tests so npm test does not fail on a missing play module.\n\nI defined the Activity interface with setup, step, teardown, score, and bot methods. The driver will boot by drawing sway, spawning flow, act, and island entities, setting the island base to 0.4. It will then process frames while an activity is active.\n\nThe director mode will ignore player intents and instead call the activity bot for the human band. For attract mode, the driver needs to reduce noise to 25% of normal, but the activity step applies its own noise scale internally, so injecting that reduced value may require a global setting.\n\nThe driver will swap player intents for bot intents before calling activity.step. For attract mode, the driver may need to temporarily lower game.wobble.noise or read game.auto inside the activity step.\n\nThe driver can temporarily set game.wobble.noise to 25% of its default during attract mode and restore it afterward. This avoids editing every activity. However, settings.set might persist across seed() calls, so the driver must ensure noise is restored after each attract slice to prevent tests from permanently altering the setting.\n\ncfgOf could multiply noise by 0.25 whenever game.auto is attract, applying the cheat to all activities without editing each one. The plan still allows the driver to inject this reduction.\n\ncfgOf is the right hook for the attract-mode noise reduction.\n\nThe onDone flow scores the activity, updates age for morning events, and spawns pebbles unless in attract mode. Director mode shows results for roughly 45 steps before carrying forward; attract mode advances to the next slice without pebbles; human mode continues until game.carry.\n\nCarry increments the cursor. Evening transitions to evening mode with a visit; credits transitions to credits mode with a visit and sets credits=1; all other cases start a new event.\n\nSleep from evening advances the day and resets island.base to 0.4 plus half the day offset, setting tiltX to that base. startEvent tears down the previous activity, resets balance and act for seat 0, visits the event id, and if that id starts with pose also visits 'pose', then calls activity.setup.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03fd694a-205c-46e3-9660-08d8faf737ac-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"director|attract|game\\.start|carry|credits|Begin|programme|Dev Mode","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03fd694a-205c-46e3-9660-08d8faf737ac-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"actions|game\\.start|auto playthrough|director","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/goal/plan.md","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03fd694a-205c-46e3-9660-08d8faf737ac-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/morning.ts","limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03fd694a-205c-46e3-9660-08d8faf737ac-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6595,"output_tokens":1611,"cache_read_input_tokens":60928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0676a7bf-46e0-478e-b109-db2accdb9c37"}
