117,99,104,32,99,111,110,116,114,111,108,115,44,32,116,104,101,32,109,101,115,115,97,103,101,44,32,83,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,44,32,97,116,116,114,97,99,116,32,114,117,110,115,32,124,32,56,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":28,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"You build this without the director. This plan is complete: follow it, and where it is silent use your judgment and\"},{\"line_number\":103,\"content\":\"| 5 The Tilt | Group Class. Then the storm, The Great Tilt (section 7), dawn, the last Morning Check, credits. |\"},{\"line_number\":259,\"content\":\"| After | Final Morning Check, credits, then Free Play with every activity and daily checks |\"},{\"line_number\":294,\"content\":\"bot, attract, short? }` in `labs/game/scenes/events/`. `step` emits sim events; the page turns them into text, sound and\"},{\"line_number\":295,\"content\":\"HUD. `bot` writes the same seat input a player does, and is used by tests, attract mode and dev auto-play. `short` is the\"},{\"line_number\":389,\"content\":\"- The credits roll. \\\"Thanks for playing! Press ✕ to continue.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":422,\"content\":\"always scores 4. Wait too long at the lip and you slip off anyway, a small splash, low cards. This is the attract mode's best shot.\"},{\"line_number\":500,\"content\":\"Load → Title ─┬─ Begin/Continue → Pier or the day's morning → Island ⇄ Activity → Results → … → Evening → next day\"},{\"line_number\":516,\"content\":\"  Resume, Restart Activity, Back to the Island, Settings, Controls, Dev Mode, About / Credits, Quit to Title.\"},{\"line_number\":520,\"content\":\"- **About / Credits:** paged, from one data file: Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback, credits\"},{\"line_number\":523,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode** (from the pause menu; absent in hub sessions; a clear panel that works with pad, keyboard and mouse):\"},{\"line_number\":535,\"content\":\"The sim's director runs a loop with the bot cheating freely: island flyby and jog, Pose Class, Still Pond with its lures, The Line,\"},{\"line_number\":608,\"content\":\"- No title, menus or attract. Straight to the game's own card: the four mats in the pavilion, Plumb in front, each player standing on their\"},{\"line_number\":852,\"content\":\"**The pilot.** Keep every character, the Guest included, at `player: false`, and let one sim system, `pilot`, write `actor.intents` each step: the step's `move` on the island, nothing in an activity, the bot's in attract, the slope added in the finale. This one rule makes roam, activities, attract and the Great Tilt the same code. Cameras follow only a `player: true` actor by themselves, so give them the Guest's feet with `createEngine({ cameraInput: () => ({ follow: feet }) })` **[tested: walks and the chase camera follows]**.\"},{\"line_number\":858,\"content\":\"- **Sim-side** (lint enforces it only under `labs/game/scenes/` and `labs/game/cast/`, so keep all sim code there; imports only `engine/sim-api.ts`): flow, wobble, events, bot, director, round, data tables.\"},{\"line_number\":861,\"content\":\"  1. Scene `actions` **[tested]**: `defineScene(id, { actions: { 'game.start': (w, args) => … } })`, called with `inspector.actions.run('game.start', { event: 'pond' })`. Runs between steps, recorded in replays. **Use this for every menu pick:** `game.begin` (with the save's state, since the sim cannot read the store), `game.start`, `game.leave`, `game.sleep`, `round.go`.\"},{\"line_number\":871,\"content\":\"  scenes/   island.ts  round.ts  flow.ts  wobble.ts  breath.ts  pilot.ts  director.ts\"},{\"line_number\":918,\"content\":\"**`window.__game`**, a small read-only state handle the page publishes for tests: screen, attract, last device, glyph set, volumes, day, event, focus.\"},{\"line_number\":965,\"content\":\"- **The whole game:** a scripted playthrough with `game.auto`: every day, every activity, the finale's steps, ending at credits, on 3 seeds. It is the softlock finder. Keep it running in Node at step speed.\"},{\"line_number\":976,\"content\":\"- **Pause and dev:** pause menu reaches Dev Mode; a slider changes behaviour; Reset restores defaults; jumps work; not present in a session.\"},{\"line_number\":978,\"content\":\"- **Touch-only:** Playwright's iPhone and tablet profiles in Chromium: \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\", a Settings button that opens by `page.touchscreen.tap`, attract runs, no touch controls in the DOM.\"},{\"line_number\":984,\"content\":\"**Screenshots, at the end, by eye, 1920 × 1080:** title, island, Pose Class HUD, Still Pond with a lure, The Line, Great Tilt wide shot, results, pause, Dev Mode, About. `node x shot labs/game --png` or a Playwright screenshot: both worked here.\"},{\"line_number\":999,\"content\":\"8. **The finale.** Great Tilt, ending, credits.\"},{\"line_number\":1001,\"content\":\"10. **The shell.** Attract, full Dev Mode, Settings, Controls, About, touch-only, no-WebGPU page.\"},{\"line_number\":1005,\"content\":\"**Cut line, if and only if you run out of budget.** Cut whole things and re-flow `days.ts`, leaving no trace (no greyed-out rows, no mentions), in this order: Great Tilt step 3 → Expert variants and outfits → Hoop Patrol → Reps Hall → Island Jog's race (keep the walk) → Cliff Plunge → Step Class. Never cut: Morning Check, Pose Class, Still Pond, The Line, Sand Garden, Paddle Glide, Great Tilt steps 1, 2, 4 and 5, Group Class, hub ghost round, attract, Dev Mode, About.\"},{\"line_number\":1012,\"content\":\"- A new player can reach the credits from the title with a pad alone, and again with keyboard and mouse alone.\"},{\"line_number\":1040,\"content\":\"| Title: playful riff, picked by a real RNG from 50 | Yours, per TASK.md. This plan just says \\\"the game's title\\\": on the title screen, hub card, attract banner, About |\"},{\"line_number\":1057,\"content\":\"| Touch-only: no touch controls, the message, Settings, attract runs | 8 |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-03fd694a-205c-46e3-9660-08d8faf737ac-21","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,46,103,114,111,107,47,115,101,115,115,105,111,110,115,47,37,50,70,104,111,109,101,37,50,70,109,105,99,104,97,37,50,70,100,101,118,37,50,70,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,37,50,70,114,117,110,115,37,50,70,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,37,50,70,119,111,114,107,47,48,49,97,49,97,97,51,53,45,100,52,102,102,45,55,52,102,48,45,57,102,49,56,45,51,51,48,56,97,49,100,100,53,49,100,99,47,103,111,97,108,47,112,108,97,110,46,109,100,10,49,49,58,51,46,32,42,42,70,105,118,101,45,100,97,121,32,114,101,116,114,101,97,116,32,121,111,117,32,99,97,110,32,102,105,110,105,115,104,46,42,42,32,65,32,116,104,105,114,100,45,112,101,114,115,111,110,32,105,115,108,97,110,100,32,104,117,98,32,104,97,115,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,97,116,105,111,110,115,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,99,97,115,116,32,84,97,114,101,44,32,80,108,117,109,98,44,32,71,101,114,97,108,100,44,32,66,101,120,44,32,79,108,100,32,78,97,110,44,32,116,104,101,32,71,117,108,108,44,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,101,32,70,114,111,103,46,32,87,97,108,107,105,11