its (`preserve`), so\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"/// <reference types=\\\"vitest/config\\\" preserve=\\\"true\\\" />\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"import { vitestRerunTriggers } from './tools/lib/tiers';\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"    testTimeout: 30_000,\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"    forceRerunTriggers: vitestRerunTriggers(),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/package.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"    \\\"test\\\": \\\"vitest run\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"    \\\"@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner\\\": \\\"9.6.1\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"    \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\"\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine-lock.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"      \\\"test\\\": \\\"vitest run\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"      \\\"@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner\\\": \\\"9.6.1\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"      \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":2111,\"content\":\"    \\\"tools/stryker/vitest.config.ts\\\": \\\"sha256:4b36bd62bda784e2f45f383207f9b41a619fa8e936b06a4d5e2dd18528045dc6\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/best.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"import { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/package-lock.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"        \\\"@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner\\\": \\\"9.6.1\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":32,\"content\":\"        \\\"vitest\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":7055,\"content\":\"    \\\"node_modules/@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner\\\": {\"},{\"line_number\":7057,\"content\":\"      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"https://registry.npmjs.org/@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner/-/vitest-runner-9.6.1.tgz\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7072,\"content\":\"        \\\"vitest\\\": \\\">=2.0.0\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":7536,\"content\":\"    \\\"node_modules/@vitest/expect\\\": {\"},{\"line_number\":7538,\"content\":\"      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"https://registry.npmjs.org/@vitest/expect/-/expect-4.1.12.tgz\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7545,\"content\":\"        \\\"@vitest/spy\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7546,\"content\":\"        \\\"@vitest/utils\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7551,\"content\":\"        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://opencollective.com/vitest\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":7554,\"content\":\"    \\\"node_modules/@vitest/mocker\\\": {\"},{\"line_number\":7556,\"content\":\"      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"https://registry.npmjs.org/@vitest/mocker/-/mocker-4.1.12.tgz\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7561,\"content\":\"        \\\"@vitest/spy\\\": \\\"4.1.12\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":7566,\"content\":\"        \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://opencollective.com/vitest\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":7581,\"content\":\"    \\\"node_modules/@vitest/pretty-format\\\": {\"},{\"line_number\":7583,\"content\":\"      \\\"resolved\\\": \\\"https://registry.npmjs.org/@vitest/pretty-format/-/pretty-format-4.1.12.tgz\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0339bcd8-e16e-4f17-a8b8-4bf82cf4e0ca"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_169","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Default timeout is 30 seconds. Big tests will use 600000.\n\n2640 steps should finish in about 2.6 seconds, well under the 30-second limit. I'll write files and run a quick morning test now. I also verified that `w.settings.get` works without a type parameter, and confirmed that mutating act goals via array replacement is safe.\n\nmake() copies arrays by reference, so replacing act.goals later is safe. The driver will handle the programme cursor correctly: boot auto-starts leave it at 0, attract poses use slice indices, and pebbles are skipped during attract.\n\nDirector results mode waits 45 frames before carrying. Evening sleep resets act wait to zero and advances the day for island updates. The advance function checks the programme cursor and event match, then moves forward or reverts to roam.\n\nThe advance function now handles evening and credits transitions explicitly. A trace of the morning-to-pose-a flow confirms the cursor increments correctly after carry.\n\nThe trace continues through pose-a and pond. Evening is reached at cursor 3. The sleep function increments the cursor past evening, advances the day, or opens credits if the programme ends.\n\nIsland base and tiltX rise by 0.5 each day from a 0.4 starting value. Day 1 evening sets the base to 0.9. The final day 5 evening sets it to 2.4 before morning begins.\n\nA `jumpStep` function will handle finale step jumps. It starts a tilt event and sets actor and flow state for specific steps like `tilt:east` and `tilt:stone`.\n\nThe `jumpStep` function now covers the `tilt:dawn` case, which sets phase 3 and activates all tilt flags. It also records visits for `tilt:east`, `tilt:stone`, and `tilt:dawn`. `game.jump` will not trigger auto-attract.\n\n`game.finish` checks that the current mode is an event. It marks the actor done, calls `finishEvent`, and overrides the result with a provided rank if given.\n\nfinishEvent computes the real score before applying any override rank. It still calls teardown even when overriding. game.leave during title mode simply returns to roam. islandOf will use part<Island>(w, 'island'). The flow spawn initializes day as 1 and credits as 0.\n\nI'll use integer schema values to avoid float rejection. The spawn object will explicitly set flow mode, day, act state, and island base and tilt. cfgOf attract reads game.auto each step, but auto is off during tests. I'll write catalog.ts, driver.ts, bench.ts, patch kit.ts, and a small test. I also need to check line length for prettier 120.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ca427acb-0778-4a27-99ce-2385f4d22805-58","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/members.ts","offset":100,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1291,"output_tokens":1923,"cache_read_input_tokens":110848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"a276fe21-3907-4dbb-9d8a-a300dc1bee85"}
