{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_175","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The recorded world's query returns frozen copies.\n\nTests can avoid the live world by extending the driver so game.auto values trigger the scene to call bot internally. The smoke test still needs the live world.\n\ncreateAppHost could provide a live world, but it may not be exported from the public engine index. Tests currently import createHeadless directly, so using createAppHost would require verifying public API access.\n\nTests under `labs/game/` may import `engine/app/headless`. This confirms `createAppHost` is accessible for the live world.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-45e872a2-70c3-48bd-93ad-a503d0516e2c-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"actions\\.run|createAppHost","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656","glob":"**/*.test.ts","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3129,"output_tokens":719,"cache_read_input_tokens":119680,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"af49f354-c904-40c9-b092-b366d0449e82"}
