{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_176","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll use createHeadless and createAppHost.\n\ncreateHeadless is simpler for band tests if the driver triggers the bot when a setting is set. The test will call the bot between steps using a live world from createAppHost, then stepOnce with those intents. Scene step auto-off calls activity.step. finishEvent runs inside the same step that sets done, so score() executes before finishEvent clears state and stores the result in flow.result.\n\nThe test will call activity.score after the loop to compare results. It will use createAppHost with a seeded scene, start the game via inspector actions, and iterate stepOnce calls driven by the bot.\n\nThe test will assert the bot's score matches flow.result within a tolerance of five. It will verify that teardown restores the world count to its boot value, captured after scene setup but before game start.\n\nTeardown correctly removes group, tilt, and CPU wobble entities while preserving the wobble seat and flow entity. The world count returns to its boot value after the final stepOnce that triggers results mode. A smoke test will directly call setup, step, score, and teardown to verify all four methods.\n\nThe smoke test will step directly without engine.step in the same iteration. The band path will not call step in the test. For model probing, stepBalance will be called directly on the live wobble between steps with time passed manually. This avoids engine.step and scene loops because the model is not in the scene unless an activity runs.\n\nThe verify command imports and calls stepBalance directly to drive the shipped balance step. Morning idle will run through the scene to show ring share emergence, but a dedicated probe is clearer. createAppHost is exported from the module. The session.world type is World<AnyComponents> and must be cast to World for flowOf, since the components exist at runtime. I am checking whether any types are allowed in test files.\n\nTests are game code, so `any` types must be avoided. The inspector actions will use a type assertion to `Actions` instead of `any`. I will update `cfgOf` for the attract cheat and then write the tests and run them. The director auto-starts on the first frame during `frame()`, but test-driven `game.start` actions still work correctly.\n\nThe director boot sequence creates a one-frame delay. The first step flushes title and startEvent spawns, and the second step begins play. This yields 719/720 samples instead of 720/720 for morning idle, and may shift the idle share slightly. I am considering whether to let tests trigger the director via game.begin to skip this delay.\n\nThe director will auto-start via the `game.auto` setting in createAppHost, so the test only needs to set that and step. Calling `game.begin` separately would reset the director, and the one-frame boot delay is acceptable. The string schema accepts `'director'` directly.\n\nThe string type for `game.auto` accepts any string without an enum list, so `'director'` is valid. I will not use `'perfect'`. Attract mode in `cfgOf` scales noise by 0.25, but director and band tests keep auto off. I am also checking group try/catch blocks for empty or unused variables.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f8c34090-6f50-4078-a6da-956fcf5237a2-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/morning.ts","offset":50,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":839,"output_tokens":1516,"cache_read_input_tokens":122752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"32ba9e71-a629-4695-8d85-161d683d6d87"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f8c34090-6f50-4078-a6da-956fcf5237a2-67","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"50→    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n60→    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n70→        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n80→      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const named = act.foot === 1 ? seat.fl > 0.5 : seat.fr > 0.5;\\n  act.samples += 1;\\n  if (named && Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= 0.3) act.acc += 1;\\n  if (act.left >= FOOT) {\\n90→    act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n    act.done = 1;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** `1000 * (0.45 A + 0.3 B + 0.25 C)`. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.45 * act.a + 0.3 * act.b + 0.25 * act.c));\\n}\\n100→\\n/** The thumb for the part that is running. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const dx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const dy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n110→    return stickIntents(seek(band, dx, dy, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick), {});\\n  }\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick, inst);\\n  if (act.phase === 2) return stickIntents(stick, act.foot === 1 ? { l: true } : { r: true });\\n  return stickIntents(stick, {});\\n}\\n\\n/** Removes anything this check spawned. It spawns nothing, and still sweeps. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n120→  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const morning = {\\n  id: 'morning',\\n  title: 'Morning Check',\\n  seconds: 44,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\",\"content_concise\":\"50→    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n60→    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n70→        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n80→      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const named = act.foot === 1 ? seat.fl > 0.5 : seat.fr > 0.5;\\n  act.samples += 1;\\n  if (named && Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= 0.3) act.acc += 1;\\n  if (act.left >= FOOT) {\\n90→    act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n    act.done = 1;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** `1000 * (0.45 A + 0.3 B + 0.25 C)`. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.45 * act.a + 0.3 * act.b + 0.25 * act.c));\\n}\\n100→\\n/** The thumb for the part that is running. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const dx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const dy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n110→    return stickIntents(seek(band, dx, dy, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick), {});\\n  }\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick, inst);\\n  if (act.phase === 2) return stickIntents(stick, act.foot === 1 ? { l: true } : { r: true });\\n  return stickIntents(stick, {});\\n}\\n\\n/** Removes anything this check spawned. It spawns nothing, and still sweeps. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n120→  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const morning = {\\n  id: 'morning',\\n  title: 'Morning Check',\\n  seconds: 44,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/morning.ts\",\"offset\":50,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const named = act.foot === 1 ? seat.fl > 0.5 : seat.fr > 0.5;\\n  act.samples += 1;\\n  if (named && Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= 0.3) act.acc += 1;\\n  if (act.left >= FOOT) {\\n    act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n    act.done = 1;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** `1000 * (0.45 A + 0.3 B + 0.25 C)`. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.45 * act.a + 0.3 * act.b + 0.25 * act.c));\\n}\\n\\n/** The thumb for the part that is running. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const dx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const dy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    return stickIntents(seek(band, dx, dy, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick), {});\\n  }\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick, inst);\\n  if (act.phase === 2) return stickIntents(stick, act.foot === 1 ? { l: true } : { r: true });\\n  return stickIntents(stick, {});\\n}\\n\\n/** Removes anything this check spawned. It spawns nothing, and still sweeps. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const morning = {\\n  id: 'morning',\\n  title: 'Morning Check',\\n  seconds: 44,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\\n\",\"total_lines\":133}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"7bc79a36-c0ad-4fae-9da8-737c497a0eb2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_177","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug in morning phase 0 causes it to return before incrementing.\n\nThe tick and left counters increment before the phase check, so the bug is not there. The morning phase logic is sound. Ready to write code.\n\nActivity teardown safely handles empty queries. Bad start IDs throw and restore state. I will export boot, frame, retreatActions, and startEvent for tests. Rank scores are constant. The carry action advances the flow only when results mode is active. I am now drafting the sleep handler.\n\nThe sleep handler only triggers during evening mode. Auto-advance in results mode and auto-sleep in evening are safe from double-advancing. Credits mode leaves frame idle, but game.start still works for free play and game.begin restarts from the cursor. The implementation is complete. I will keep files compact and readable and patch cfgOf.\n\nI will run the morning test first with a Vitest filter. ESLint allows test files to import from engine modules. I may use a seeded random generator in tests instead of Math.random.\n\nI will use a deterministic Math.sin pattern for test inputs instead of Math.random. The driver file should stay near 280 lines. Pose class titles are pose-b and pose-c. I am now drafting the ACTIVITIES array in catalog order.\n\nThe ACTIVITIES array is now fully ordered. I will run one activity test first. TypeScript errors in existing files may appear because vitest uses esbuild without type checking. I will run tsc afterward to catch them.\n\ncreateAppHost is synchronous and accepts the scene object directly. The bench module imports settings, which registers game.* keys via defineSettings. This ensures settings are ready before createAppHost runs.\n\nThe bench scene ID will not collide with existing scenes. I will assert activity bands and scores directly in the test, collecting failures in an array so Vitest prints the expected and received values.\n\nThe attract cheat reads the auto setting inside cfgOf. The bench import of settings is preserved by Vite and will not be tree-shaken. The driver needs activityById, programme, score helpers, state, wobble reset, and kit flowOf actOf rowOf. I am now drafting startEvent.\n\nThe `startEvent` function tears down the previous event if it is still active. It resets the current activity and balance state, sets the new event ID and mode to `'event'`, visits the activity and its `'pose'` category, clears the line buffer, and runs the activity setup.\n\nActivity setup and balance reset inside startEvent are idempotent. Double teardown is safe because sweep is empty. A new activityOrNull helper finds activities by ID. finishEvent is being drafted.\n\nfinishEvent computes the activity score, clamps it, and stores the result and rank. It adds pebbles based on the rank and pebble multiplier unless the auto mode is attract. For morning events it preserves the prior age.\n\nfinishEvent updates the age wobble from the score. It resets the activity done and wait counters. In attract mode it advances to the next slice and returns early. Otherwise it switches to results mode. The director timer uses act.wait.\n\nfinishEvent resets the activity wait counter to zero, overriding any value set by the finishing frame's step. The frame function is now being drafted for director auto mode.\n\nThe director auto-mode path in frame starts the next non-evening, non-credits event. It opens evening or credits when those are reached. In attract mode it starts pose-a. During events it steps the current activity with human or perfect bot inputs.\n\nThe frame function now finishes an event when the activity is done or attract mode reaches 15 seconds. In results or evening mode, director and attract auto modes advance after 45 frames. The director bot is called before the activity step.\n\nBot inputs are computed before the activity step, so they see the previous tick and history. The band test calls bot between steps, which is one frame behind the current tick; this is acceptable. Director and attract modes replace player intents entirely, so band tests must run with auto off.\n\nThe `finish` command now only triggers `finishEvent` during an active event. Invalid ranks are ignored and the real score is used instead. The `jump` command supports tilting to a step, starting an event, or advancing to a day.\n\nThe `jump` command now supports advancing to a specific day. It updates the flow cursor and day, sets the island base and tilt from the day index, and opens evening or credits if the target item is one of those events. Otherwise it starts the corresponding event. A new `islandOf` helper is needed. The `begin` command restores state before starting.\n\nThe island base updates during sleep, not during the morning start. Finale step visits are handled inside tilt rather than the driver; director mode plays full tilts so tests will see them. I am ready to write the files and run tests.\n\nI will run a filtered band test first to avoid waiting ten minutes if the morning path is broken. I am enforcing Prettier with 120-character print width and single quotes, and I will skip Math destructuring and exponentiation in simulation code. I also noticed a potential runtime bug: `flowOf` might be called before the spawn flushes during the first step, though boot spawns the flow inside setup.\n\nThe flow component is guaranteed to exist before the first step because setup flushes it. The activity component is also present at spawn and resetAct replaces its fields correctly. I will avoid double `as unknown as` casts and use `part()` and `flowOf` instead.\n\n`islandOf` is a one-line helper that queries the `Island` component from the world. A `budget()` function computes the director test cap by summing each activity’s seconds plus two minutes, then adds one thousand steps. The full director run is roughly seventy-two thousand steps across three seeds, so I will time a single seed first.\n\nI will add console.time to the test command rather than the file itself. The first test run will use a filtered Vitest filter to isolate morning failures before expanding coverage. I also confirmed that createAppHost is generic and inspector.actions can be safely cast as unknown.\n\nThe `open` helper now returns the run, world, and an `act` function that calls inspector actions. `stepOnce` accepts custom intents through `normalizeIntents`. The bench scene will be exported as default. Nothing is deleted yet. After morning works, the full band test suite will run.\n\nThe test will be split into three phases. First model checks. Then seed 1 with all bands and activities to tune the loop. Finally all ten seeds. This avoids waiting through a full run if early failures appear.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The activities are written but nothing runs them yet. I’ll add the catalog, the day driver, and a headless bench, then score the real sim."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts","old_string":"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. */\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\n  return {\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist,\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\n  };\n}","new_string":"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. Attract mode quiets the sway so the demo can cheat. */\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\n  const cheat = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract' ? 0.25 : 1;\n  return {\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist * cheat,\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\n  };\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/catalog.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file Every shipped activity, by id. Days and the noticeboard look them up here. There is no second list.\n */\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\nimport type { Band } from './bot';\nimport { garden } from './events/garden';\nimport { group } from './events/group';\nimport { line } from './events/line';\nimport { morning } from './events/morning';\nimport { paddle } from './events/paddle';\nimport { pond } from './events/pond';\nimport { poseA, poseClass } from './events/pose';\nimport { tilt } from './events/tilt';\n\n/** What every activity module hands the driver. */\nexport interface Activity {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  seconds: number;\n  setup(w: World): void;\n  step(w: World, intents: Intents): void;\n  teardown(w: World): void;\n  score(w: World): number;\n  bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents;\n}\n\n/** The activities a guest can be sent to, in programme order. */\nexport const ACTIVITIES: readonly Activity[] = [\n  morning,\n  poseA,\n  poseClass('pose-b', 'Pose Class'),\n  poseClass('pose-c', 'Pose Class'),\n  pond,\n  garden,\n  paddle,\n  line,\n  group,\n  tilt,\n];\n\n/** The activity with this id, or undefined when the id is an evening or the credits. */\nexport function findActivity(id: string): Activity | undefined {\n  return ACTIVITIES.find((item) => item.id === id);\n}\n\n/** The activity with this id. Throws when the id is not shipped. */\nexport function activityById(id: string): Activity {\n  const found = findActivity(id);\n  if (!found) throw new Error(`no activity ${id}`);\n  return found;\n}\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-70","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\n */\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\nimport { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\n\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\nconst BEAT = 45;\n\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\n\n/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\n\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\n  Present: 0,\n  Adequate: 300,\n  Composed: 550,\n  Serene: 750,\n  Unsettling: 900,\n};\n\n/** The island lean. */\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\n}\n\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\n  return {};\n}\n\n/** A finite number argument. */\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\n  const value = args[key];\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\n}\n\n/** A string argument. */\nfunction strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\n  const value = args[key];\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\n}\n\n/** Who is driving this step. */\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\n}\n\n/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\n}\n\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\n  const island = islandOf(w);\n  const base = leanFor(day);\n  island.base = base;\n  island.tiltX = base;\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\n}\n\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\n  const activity = activityById(id);\n  const act = actOf(w);\n  resetAct(act);\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n  flow.mode = 'event';\n  flow.event = id;\n  visit(flow, id);\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\n  activity.setup(w);\n}\n\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\n  let value = activity.score(w);\n  activity.teardown(w);\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\n  value = clampScore(value);\n  flow.result = value;\n  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\n  }\n  const act = actOf(w);\n  act.done = 0;\n  act.wait = 0;\n  if (auto === 'attract') {\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\n    return;\n  }\n  flow.mode = 'results';\n}\n\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const list = programme();\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\n    flow.event = '';\n    return;\n  }\n  flow.cursor += 1;\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\n}\n\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  if (!item) {\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\n    flow.event = '';\n    return;\n  }\n  flow.day = item.day;\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\n}\n\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const act = actOf(w);\n  resetAct(act);\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\n  flow.event = 'evening';\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\n}\n\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  resetAct(actOf(w));\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\n  flow.event = 'credits';\n  flow.credits = 1;\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\n}\n\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const list = programme();\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\n  if (!next) {\n    openCredits(w);\n    return;\n  }\n  flow.day = next.day;\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\n  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\n  else if (next.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\n  else startEvent(w, next.event);\n}\n\n/** Puts the finale on a named step. Storm is where the activity already starts. */\nfunction jumpTilt(w: World, step: string): void {\n  startEvent(w, 'tilt');\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\n  const flow: Flow = flowOf(w);\n  const name = step.startsWith('tilt:') ? step : `tilt:${step}`;\n  if (name === 'tilt:east') {\n    act.phase = 1;\n    act.a = 1;\n    act.left = 0;\n    flow.line = 'tilt.east';\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:stone') {\n    act.phase = 2;\n    act.a = 1;\n    act.b = 1;\n    act.left = 0;\n    flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:dawn') {\n    act.phase = 3;\n    act.a = 1;\n    act.b = 1;\n    act.c = 1;\n    act.hz = 1;\n    act.left = 0;\n    flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\n  }\n}\n\n/** Copies a save the page handed in. The sim never reads the store itself. */\nfunction applySave(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const day = numArg(args, 'day');\n  const cursor = numArg(args, 'cursor');\n  const pebbles = numArg(args, 'pebbles');\n  const age = numArg(args, 'age');\n  const prior = numArg(args, 'prior');\n  const credits = numArg(args, 'credits');\n  const result = numArg(args, 'result');\n  const seen = strArg(args, 'seen');\n  const rank = strArg(args, 'rank');\n  if (day !== undefined) flow.day = day;\n  if (cursor !== undefined) flow.cursor = cursor;\n  if (pebbles !== undefined) flow.pebbles = pebbles;\n  if (age !== undefined) flow.age = age;\n  if (prior !== undefined) flow.prior = prior;\n  if (credits !== undefined) flow.credits = credits;\n  if (result !== undefined) flow.result = result;\n  if (seen !== undefined) flow.seen = seen;\n  if (rank !== undefined) flow.rank = rank;\n}\n\n/** One seat, the day, and the island. The first step starts a director or a demo. */\nexport function boot(w: World): void {\n  drawSway(w);\n  w.spawn({\n    flow: { mode: 'title', day: 1 },\n    act: emptyAct(),\n    island: { tiltX: 0.4, tiltZ: 0, base: 0.4 },\n  });\n}\n\n/** One step of whatever the day is doing. */\nexport function frame(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'director') {\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\n    return;\n  }\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'attract') {\n    startEvent(w, 'pose-a');\n    return;\n  }\n  if (flow.mode === 'event') {\n    const activity = activityById(flow.event);\n    let use = intents;\n    if (auto === 'director') use = activity.bot(w, 'human');\n    else if (auto === 'attract') use = activity.bot(w, 'perfect');\n    activity.step(w, use);\n    const act = actOf(w);\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\n    return;\n  }\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\n    const act = actOf(w);\n    act.wait += 1;\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\n      else sleep(w);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\nexport const retreatActions = {\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\n    const given = rec(args);\n    applySave(w, given);\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\n    applyLean(w, flow.day);\n    if (flow.credits) {\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\n      flow.event = '';\n      return;\n    }\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\n  },\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\n    if (!event) return;\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\n    else startEvent(w, event);\n  },\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\n  },\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\n  },\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\n    flow.event = '';\n  },\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\n    const given = rec(args);\n    const step = strArg(given, 'step');\n    const event = strArg(given, 'event');\n    const day = numArg(given, 'day');\n    if (step) {\n      jumpTilt(w, step);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (event) {\n      startEvent(w, event);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (day === undefined) return;\n    const list = programme();\n    const at = list.findIndex((item) => item.day === day);\n    if (at < 0) return;\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\n    flow.cursor = at;\n    flow.day = day;\n    applyLean(w, day);\n    openItem(w, list[at]);\n  },\n  'game.finish': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\n    if (flowOf(w).mode !== 'event') return;\n    finishEvent(w, strArg(rec(args), 'rank'));\n  },\n};\n","old_string":""}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/bench.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file The score scene. No terrain and no physics: the bot matrix is a balance problem, not a render.\n */\nimport { defineScene } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\nimport './settings';\n\n/** Headless play and the page's balance tests share this scene. */\nexport const bench = defineScene('game:bench', {\n  description: 'The retreat with no island mesh. Activities, the day, and the balance step.',\n  physics: false,\n  setup(w) {\n    boot(w);\n  },\n  step(w, intents) {\n    frame(w, intents);\n  },\n  actions: retreatActions,\n});\n\nexport default bench;\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2468,"output_tokens":8918,"cache_read_input_tokens":123520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"2f2c3a94-0d6e-496b-8de0-a9ac1e7b95dc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-68","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. */\\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\\n  return {\\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist,\\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\\n  };\\n}\",\"new_string\":\"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. Attract mode quiets the sway so the demo can cheat. */\\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\\n  const cheat = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract' ? 0.25 : 1;\\n  return {\\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist * cheat,\\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\\n  };\\n}\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. */\\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\\n  return {\\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist,\\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\\n  };\\n}\",\"old_line\":84,\"new_string\":\"/** The balance numbers, including steadier hands. Attract mode quiets the sway so the demo can cheat. */\\nexport function cfgOf(w: World): BalanceCfg {\\n  const g = (path: string) => Number(w.settings.get(path));\\n  const assist = g('game.assist') > 0.5 ? 0.5 : 1;\\n  const cheat = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract' ? 0.25 : 1;\\n  return {\\n    gain: g('game.wobble.gain'),\\n    instability: g('game.wobble.instability'),\\n    damping: g('game.wobble.damping'),\\n    noise: g('game.wobble.noise') * assist * cheat,\\n    noiseRate: g('game.wobble.noiseRate'),\\n    reach: g('game.wobble.reach'),\\n    calmEffect: g('game.breath.calmEffect'),\\n    period: g('game.breath.period'),\\n    sens: g('game.mouse.sens'),\\n  };\\n}\",\"new_line\":84,\"context_before\":\"  };\\n}\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\n/** The wobble and its history for a seat. */\\nexport function rowOf(w: World, seat: number): { wobble: Wobble; hist: Hist } {\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-69","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file Every shipped activity, by id. Days and the noticeboard look them up here. There is no second list.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport type { Band } from './bot';\\nimport { garden } from './events/garden';\\nimport { group } from './events/group';\\nimport { line } from './events/line';\\nimport { morning } from './events/morning';\\nimport { paddle } from './events/paddle';\\nimport { pond } from './events/pond';\\nimport { poseA, poseClass } from './events/pose';\\nimport { tilt } from './events/tilt';\\n\\n/** What every activity module hands the driver. */\\nexport interface Activity {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  seconds: number;\\n  setup(w: World): void;\\n  step(w: World, intents: Intents): void;\\n  teardown(w: World): void;\\n  score(w: World): number;\\n  bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents;\\n}\\n\\n/** The activities a guest can be sent to, in programme order. */\\nexport const ACTIVITIES: readonly Activity[] = [\\n  morning,\\n  poseA,\\n  poseClass('pose-b', 'Pose Class'),\\n  poseClass('pose-c', 'Pose Class'),\\n  pond,\\n  garden,\\n  paddle,\\n  line,\\n  group,\\n  tilt,\\n];\\n\\n/** The activity with this id, or undefined when the id is an evening or the credits. */\\nexport function findActivity(id: string): Activity | undefined {\\n  return ACTIVITIES.find((item) => item.id === id);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity with this id. Throws when the id is not shipped. */\\nexport function activityById(id: string): Activity {\\n  const found = findActivity(id);\\n  if (!found) throw new Error(`no activity ${id}`);\\n  return found;\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/catalog.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/catalog.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/catalog.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file Every shipped activity, by id. Days and the noticeboard look them up here. There is no second list.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport type { Band } from './bot';\\nimport { garden } from './events/garden';\\nimport { group } from './events/group';\\nimport { line } from './events/line';\\nimport { morning } from './events/morning';\\nimport { paddle } from './events/paddle';\\nimport { pond } from './events/pond';\\nimport { poseA, poseClass } from './events/pose';\\nimport { tilt } from './events/tilt';\\n\\n/** What every activity module hands the driver. */\\nexport interface Activity {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  seconds: number;\\n  setup(w: World): void;\\n  step(w: World, intents: Intents): void;\\n  teardown(w: World): void;\\n  score(w: World): number;\\n  bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents;\\n}\\n\\n/** The activities a guest can be sent to, in programme order. */\\nexport const ACTIVITIES: readonly Activity[] = [\\n  morning,\\n  poseA,\\n  poseClass('pose-b', 'Pose Class'),\\n  poseClass('pose-c', 'Pose Class'),\\n  pond,\\n  garden,\\n  paddle,\\n  line,\\n  group,\\n  tilt,\\n];\\n\\n/** The activity with this id, or undefined when the id is an evening or the credits. */\\nexport function findActivity(id: string): Activity | undefined {\\n  return ACTIVITIES.find((item) => item.id === id);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity with this id. Throws when the id is not shipped. */\\nexport function activityById(id: string): Activity {\\n  const found = findActivity(id);\\n  if (!found) throw new Error(`no activity ${id}`);\\n  return found;\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-70","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\\nconst BEAT = 45;\\n\\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\\n\\n/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\\n\\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 0,\\n  Adequate: 300,\\n  Composed: 550,\\n  Serene: 750,\\n  Unsettling: 900,\\n};\\n\\n/** The island lean. */\\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\\n}\\n\\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\\n  return {};\\n}\\n\\n/** A finite number argument. */\\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** A string argument. */\\nfunction strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** Who is driving this step. */\\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\\n}\\n\\n/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\\n  const island = islandOf(w);\\n  const base = leanFor(day);\\n  island.base = base;\\n  island.tiltX = base;\\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(id);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  flow.mode = 'event';\\n  flow.event = id;\\n  visit(flow, id);\\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n  let value = activity.score(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\\n  value = clampScore(value);\\n  flow.result = value;\\n  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\\n  }\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  act.done = 0;\\n  act.wait = 0;\\n  if (auto === 'attract') {\\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.mode = 'results';\\n}\\n\\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.cursor += 1;\\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\\n}\\n\\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!item) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = item.day;\\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\\n  flow.event = 'evening';\\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\\n}\\n\\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  resetAct(actOf(w));\\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\\n  flow.event = 'credits';\\n  flow.credits = 1;\\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\\n}\\n\\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!next) {\\n    openCredits(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = next.day;\\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\\n  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else if (next.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, next.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the finale on a named step. Storm is where the activity already starts. */\\nfunction jumpTilt(w: World, step: string): void {\\n  startEvent(w, 'tilt');\\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\\n  const flow: Flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const name = step.startsWith('tilt:') ? step : `tilt:${step}`;\\n  if (name === 'tilt:east') {\\n    act.phase = 1;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:stone') {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:dawn') {\\n    act.phase = 3;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    act.c = 1;\\n    act.hz = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Copies a save the page handed in. The sim never reads the store itself. */\\nfunction applySave(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const day = numArg(args, 'day');\\n  const cursor = numArg(args, 'cursor');\\n  const pebbles = numArg(args, 'pebbles');\\n  const age = numArg(args, 'age');\\n  const prior = numArg(args, 'prior');\\n  const credits = numArg(args, 'credits');\\n  const result = numArg(args, 'result');\\n  const seen = strArg(args, 'seen');\\n  const rank = strArg(args, 'rank');\\n  if (day !== undefined) flow.day = day;\\n  if (cursor !== undefined) flow.cursor = cursor;\\n  if (pebbles !== undefined) flow.pebbles = pebbles;\\n  if (age !== undefined) flow.age = age;\\n  if (prior !== undefined) flow.prior = prior;\\n  if (credits !== undefined) flow.credits = credits;\\n  if (result !== undefined) flow.result = result;\\n  if (seen !== undefined) flow.seen = seen;\\n  if (rank !== undefined) flow.rank = rank;\\n}\\n\\n/** One seat, the day, and the island. The first step starts a director or a demo. */\\nexport function boot(w: World): void {\\n  drawSway(w);\\n  w.spawn({\\n    flow: { mode: 'title', day: 1 },\\n    act: emptyAct(),\\n    island: { tiltX: 0.4, tiltZ: 0, base: 0.4 },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** One step of whatever the day is doing. */\\nexport function frame(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'director') {\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'attract') {\\n    startEvent(w, 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (flow.mode === 'event') {\\n    const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n    let use = intents;\\n    if (auto === 'director') use = activity.bot(w, 'human');\\n    else if (auto === 'attract') use = activity.bot(w, 'perfect');\\n    activity.step(w, use);\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    act.wait += 1;\\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n      else sleep(w);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\\nexport const retreatActions = {\\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    applySave(w, given);\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    applyLean(w, flow.day);\\n    if (flow.credits) {\\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\\n      flow.event = '';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n  },\\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\\n    if (!event) return;\\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n    else startEvent(w, event);\\n  },\\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n  },\\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    const step = strArg(given, 'step');\\n    const event = strArg(given, 'event');\\n    const day = numArg(given, 'day');\\n    if (step) {\\n      jumpTilt(w, step);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (event) {\\n      startEvent(w, event);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (day === undefined) return;\\n    const list = programme();\\n    const at = list.findIndex((item) => item.day === day);\\n    if (at < 0) return;\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    flow.cursor = at;\\n    flow.day = day;\\n    applyLean(w, day);\\n    openItem(w, list[at]);\\n  },\\n  'game.finish': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode !== 'event') return;\\n    finishEvent(w, strArg(rec(args), 'rank'));\\n  },\\n};\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\\nconst BEAT = 45;\\n\\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\\n\\n/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\\n\\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 0,\\n  Adequate: 300,\\n  Composed: 550,\\n  Serene: 750,\\n  Unsettling: 900,\\n};\\n\\n/** The island lean. */\\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\\n}\\n\\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\\n  return {};\\n}\\n\\n/** A finite number argument. */\\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** A string argument. */\\nfunction strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** Who is driving this step. */\\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\\n}\\n\\n/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\\n  const island = islandOf(w);\\n  const base = leanFor(day);\\n  island.base = base;\\n  island.tiltX = base;\\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(id);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  flow.mode = 'event';\\n  flow.event = id;\\n  visit(flow, id);\\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n  let value = activity.score(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\\n  value = clampScore(value);\\n  flow.result = value;\\n  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\\n  }\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  act.done = 0;\\n  act.wait = 0;\\n  if (auto === 'attract') {\\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.mode = 'results';\\n}\\n\\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.cursor += 1;\\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\\n}\\n\\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!item) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = item.day;\\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\\n  flow.event = 'evening';\\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\\n}\\n\\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  resetAct(actOf(w));\\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\\n  flow.event = 'credits';\\n  flow.credits = 1;\\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\\n}\\n\\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!next) {\\n    openCredits(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = next.day;\\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\\n  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else if (next.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, next.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the finale on a named step. Storm is where the activity already starts. */\\nfunction jumpTilt(w: World, step: string): void {\\n  startEvent(w, 'tilt');\\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\\n  const flow: Flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const name = step.startsWith('tilt:') ? step : `tilt:${step}`;\\n  if (name === 'tilt:east') {\\n    act.phase = 1;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:stone') {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n  } else if (name === 'tilt:dawn') {\\n    act.phase = 3;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    act.c = 1;\\n    act.hz = 1;\\n    act.left = 0;\\n    flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Copies a save the page handed in. The sim never reads the store itself. */\\nfunction applySave(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const day = numArg(args, 'day');\\n  const cursor = numArg(args, 'cursor');\\n  const pebbles = numArg(args, 'pebbles');\\n  const age = numArg(args, 'age');\\n  const prior = numArg(args, 'prior');\\n  const credits = numArg(args, 'credits');\\n  const result = numArg(args, 'result');\\n  const seen = strArg(args, 'seen');\\n  const rank = strArg(args, 'rank');\\n  if (day !== undefined) flow.day = day;\\n  if (cursor !== undefined) flow.cursor = cursor;\\n  if (pebbles !== undefined) flow.pebbles = pebbles;\\n  if (age !== undefined) flow.age = age;\\n  if (prior !== undefined) flow.prior = prior;\\n  if (credits !== undefined) flow.credits = credits;\\n  if (result !== undefined) flow.result = result;\\n  if (seen !== undefined) flow.seen = seen;\\n  if (rank !== undefined) flow.rank = rank;\\n}\\n\\n/** One seat, the day, and the island. The first step starts a director or a demo. */\\nexport function boot(w: World): void {\\n  drawSway(w);\\n  w.spawn({\\n    flow: { mode: 'title', day: 1 },\\n    act: emptyAct(),\\n    island: { tiltX: 0.4, tiltZ: 0, base: 0.4 },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** One step of whatever the day is doing. */\\nexport function frame(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'director') {\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (flow.mode === 'title' && auto === 'attract') {\\n    startEvent(w, 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (flow.mode === 'event') {\\n    const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n    let use = intents;\\n    if (auto === 'director') use = activity.bot(w, 'human');\\n    else if (auto === 'attract') use = activity.bot(w, 'perfect');\\n    activity.step(w, use);\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    act.wait += 1;\\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n      else sleep(w);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\\nexport const retreatActions = {\\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    applySave(w, given);\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    applyLean(w, flow.day);\\n    if (flow.credits) {\\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\\n      flow.event = '';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n  },\\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\\n    if (!event) return;\\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n    else startEvent(w, event);\\n  },\\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n  },\\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    const step = strArg(given, 'step');\\n    const event = strArg(given, 'event');\\n    const day = numArg(given, 'day');\\n    if (step) {\\n      jumpTilt(w, step);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (event) {\\n      startEvent(w, event);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (day === undefined) return;\\n    const list = programme();\\n    const at = list.findIndex((item) => item.day === day);\\n    if (at < 0) return;\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    flow.cursor = at;\\n    flow.day = day;\\n    applyLean(w, day);\\n    openItem(w, list[at]);\\n  },\\n  'game.finish': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode !== 'event') return;\\n    finishEvent(w, strArg(rec(args), 'rank'));\\n  },\\n};\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f9b7f286-c438-49dd-93ce-da4e35a644b7-71","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The score scene. No terrain and no physics: the bot matrix is a balance problem, not a render.\\n */\\nimport { defineScene } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\\nimport './settings';\\n\\n/** Headless play and the page's balance tests share this scene. */\\nexport const bench = defineScene('game:bench', {\\n  description: 'The retreat with no island mesh. Activities, the day, and the balance step.',\\n  physics: false,\\n  setup(w) {\\n    boot(w);\\n  },\\n  step(w, intents) {\\n    frame(w, intents);\\n  },\\n  actions: retreatActions,\\n});\\n\\nexport default bench;\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/bench.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/bench.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/bench.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The score scene. No terrain and no physics: the bot matrix is a balance problem, not a render.\\n */\\nimport { defineScene } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\\nimport './settings';\\n\\n/** Headless play and the page's balance tests share this scene. */\\nexport const bench = defineScene('game:bench', {\\n  description: 'The retreat with no island mesh. Activities, the day, and the balance step.',\\n  physics: false,\\n  setup(w) {\\n    boot(w);\\n  },\\n  step(w, intents) {\\n    frame(w, intents);\\n  },\\n  actions: retreatActions,\\n});\\n\\nexport default bench;\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"f0e19486-49d2-4075-a4f3-91a8cf6337a8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_178","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug exists in the interaction between advance/openItem and startEvent.\n\nadvance() checks flow.event against programme[cursor].event. After finishEvent sets mode to results, flow.event still holds the activity id. This causes advance() to skip the next event and fail to call openItem.\n\nstartEvent correctly skips teardown when mode is results. The director first frame spawns wobble and queues guests, but returns without stepping the activity; the next frame processes them.\n\nfinishEvent attract calls startEvent during the event step after activity.step. The new activity is not stepped this frame.\n\nfinishEvent sets act.done and act.wait to zero before attract startEvent resets the activity. This is safe.\n\nIn results mode wait is cleared but other fields may have changed; score is already captured.\n\nA bug exists with morning age: finishEvent checks flow.event against 'morning' before startEvent changes it.\n\nMorning age is safe because the event check happens before attract startEvent. Non-attract events defer the change until advance, so age is already set.\n\ngame.jump day updates the cursor before openItem. If the target is morning, the event becomes morning but the cursor stays at that index, allowing advance to match later.\n\nA dev jump that uses only the event id without updating the cursor correctly routes carry to roam.\n\nopenItem sets flow.day before calling startEvent. Credits are handled separately and do not trigger an activity. After evening, the cursor advances past the event and the next item is selected via applyLean.\n\nThe final morning after evening is correctly visited and advances to credits. A step-by-step simulation of day 1 confirms that after morning finishes in results mode, advance matches the next event and starts pose-a.\n\nThe full day 1 programme sequence is confirmed: morning, pose-a, pond, evening, then day 2 morning. Next is writing and running the morning test. The World type import from sim-api must be checked because createAppHost expects World.\n\nVitest uses esbuild and does not typecheck, so the test can proceed without strict TypeScript alignment. createAppHost returns a Session with world typed as World<C,E>, which should be assignable to flowOf. The inspector actions object is undefined until members load, but createInspector adds the run action.\n\nThe inspector run action is invoked via `run.inspector.actions` with a cast to `{ run: (name: string, args?: unknown) => unknown }`. The `{ event: 'morning' }` argument is JSON serializable and valid. Omitting the args parameter is also supported because `session.act` skips serialization when args are undefined.\n\nTypeScript allows a function with fewer parameters to be assignable to one expecting more, so the single-argument `game.carry` and `game.begin` handlers satisfy the `SceneAction` type without runtime issues. The test file is now being written.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-536f2b1e-7aa4-43dd-b8ff-946b105ae562-72","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts","offset":1,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9287,"output_tokens":1528,"cache_read_input_tokens":125952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d8069a6f-296e-4cdc-b8d3-90994a77d843"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-536f2b1e-7aa4-43dd-b8ff-946b105ae562-72","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The one verb. Centre of balance is a point in the unit disc. Each step slews the stick, then\\n * accelerates toward it with instability, slow sway and breath. Past the rim for six steps the body topples,\\n * stumbles, and recentres. It is never a game over.\\n */\\nimport { defineComponent, type World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\n\\n/** Numbers the balance step reads. Sliders change them between steps. */\\nexport interface BalanceCfg {\\n10→  gain: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  damping: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  noiseRate: number;\\n  reach: number;\\n  calmEffect: number;\\n  period: number;\\n  sens: number;\\n}\\n20→\\n/** What the thumb, the feet and the activity are doing this step. */\\nexport interface Stick {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  gentle: boolean;\\n  both: boolean;\\n  mdx: number;\\n  mdy: number;\\n  disturbX: number;\\n30→  disturbY: number;\\n  noiseScale: number;\\n  instabilityScale: number;\\n}\\n\\n/** The centre of balance and the sway drawn once for the seat. */\\nexport interface Wobble {\\n  seat: number;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n40→  vx: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  sx: number;\\n  sy: number;\\n  mx: number;\\n  my: number;\\n  calm: number;\\n  lungs: number;\\n  sync: number;\\n  over: number;\\n50→  recover: number;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The one verb. Centre of balance is a point in the unit disc. Each step slews the stick, then\\n * accelerates toward it with instability, slow sway and breath. Past the rim for six steps the body topples,\\n * stumbles, and recentres. It is never a game over.\\n */\\nimport { defineComponent, type World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\n\\n/** Numbers the balance step reads. Sliders change them between steps. */\\nexport interface BalanceCfg {\\n10→  gain: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  damping: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  noiseRate: number;\\n  reach: number;\\n  calmEffect: number;\\n  period: number;\\n  sens: number;\\n}\\n20→\\n/** What the thumb, the feet and the activity are doing this step. */\\nexport interface Stick {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  gentle: boolean;\\n  both: boolean;\\n  mdx: number;\\n  mdy: number;\\n  disturbX: number;\\n30→  disturbY: number;\\n  noiseScale: number;\\n  instabilityScale: number;\\n}\\n\\n/** The centre of balance and the sway drawn once for the seat. */\\nexport interface Wobble {\\n  seat: number;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n40→  vx: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  sx: number;\\n  sy: number;\\n  mx: number;\\n  my: number;\\n  calm: number;\\n  lungs: number;\\n  sync: number;\\n  over: number;\\n50→  recover: number;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The one verb. Centre of balance is a point in the unit disc. Each step slews the stick, then\\n * accelerates toward it with instability, slow sway and breath. Past the rim for six steps the body topples,\\n * stumbles, and recentres. It is never a game over.\\n */\\nimport { defineComponent, type World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\n\\n/** Numbers the balance step reads. Sliders change them between steps. */\\nexport interface BalanceCfg {\\n  gain: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  damping: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  noiseRate: number;\\n  reach: number;\\n  calmEffect: number;\\n  period: number;\\n  sens: number;\\n}\\n\\n/** What the thumb, the feet and the activity are doing this step. */\\nexport interface Stick {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  gentle: boolean;\\n  both: boolean;\\n  mdx: number;\\n  mdy: number;\\n  disturbX: number;\\n  disturbY: number;\\n  noiseScale: number;\\n  instabilityScale: number;\\n}\\n\\n/** The centre of balance and the sway drawn once for the seat. */\\nexport interface Wobble {\\n  seat: number;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  vx: number;\\n  vy: number;\\n  sx: number;\\n  sy: number;\\n  mx: number;\\n  my: number;\\n  calm: number;\\n  lungs: number;\\n  sync: number;\\n  over: number;\\n  recover: number;\\n\",\"total_lines\":258}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"a68b08fb-a9af-4920-b8f6-7ec64f8e154f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_179","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will write a comprehensive test.\n\nI'll run a quick morning-only test first to verify the harness. Then I'll test seed 1 across all activities and bands. If that passes, I'll run the full suite with 10 seeds in the background.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bb2d4c5a-9085-4abc-9998-80156c5ce09b-73","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplements the disc.\n */\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\nimport { bench } from './scenes/bench';\nimport type { Band } from './scenes/bot';\nimport { ACTIVITIES, activityById, type Activity } from './scenes/catalog';\nimport { programme } from './scenes/data/days';\nimport { actOf, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\nimport { disturbed, pond } from './scenes/events/pond';\nimport { wobbleAge } from './scenes/score';\nimport { inRing, resetBalance, stepBalance, type Stick } from './scenes/wobble';\n\nconst BANDS: readonly Band[] = ['perfect', 'human', 'sloppy', 'idle'];\n\n/** A live world and the menu actions that drive it. */\nfunction open(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: bench, seed, settings });\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\n  const act = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\n  };\n  return { run, w, act };\n}\n\n/** Plays one activity with a band. The scene calls step. The test calls bot and score. */\nfunction play(activity: Activity, band: Band, seed: number): number {\n  const { run, w, act } = open(seed);\n  const bootCount = w.count;\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\n  activity.setup(w);\n  activity.teardown(w);\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\n  const cap = activity.seconds * 60 + 120;\n  let score = Number.NaN;\n  for (let i = 0; i < cap; i++) {\n    const intents = activity.bot(w, band);\n    run.stepOnce(intents);\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') {\n      score = activity.score(w);\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n  activity.teardown(w);\n  expect(w.count, `${activity.id} teardown`).toBe(bootCount);\n  expect(Number.isFinite(score), `${activity.id} ${band} seed ${seed} finished`).toBe(true);\n  return score;\n}\n\n/** A stick with every field, so the probe does not invent a second model. */\nfunction stick(x: number, y: number, both = false): Stick {\n  return {\n    x, y, gentle: false, both, mdx: 0, mdy: 0, disturbX: 0, disturbY: 0, noiseScale: 1, instabilityScale: 1,\n  };\n}\n\ndescribe('balance', () => {\n  it('keeps a still thumb inside the 0.22 ring only part of the time', () => {\n    const shares: number[] = [];\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\n      const { w } = open(seed);\n      const row = rowOf(w, 0);\n      resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n      const cfg = cfgOf(w);\n      let inside = 0;\n      const steps = 20 * 60;\n      for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\n        stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n        if (inRing(row.wobble, 0.22)) inside += 1;\n      }\n      shares.push(inside / steps);\n    }\n    const mean = shares.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0) / shares.length;\n    expect(mean).toBeGreaterThan(0.15);\n    expect(mean).toBeLessThan(0.55);\n  });\n\n  it('topples a held full stick and quiets sway when the breath is calm', () => {\n    const { w } = open(1);\n    const row = rowOf(w, 0);\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    const cfg = cfgOf(w);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 180; i++) stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(1, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n    expect(row.wobble.topples).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    let wild = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n      wild += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\n    }\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    row.wobble.calm = 1;\n    let quiet = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\n      row.wobble.calm = 1;\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0, true), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n      quiet += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\n    }\n    expect(quiet).toBeLessThan(wild);\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe('activities', () => {\n  it('scores the four bands on ten seeds', () => {\n    const failures: string[] = [];\n    for (const activity of ACTIVITIES) {\n      for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\n        const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\n        for (const band of BANDS) {\n          const score = play(activity, band, seed);\n          scores[band] = score;\n          expect(score).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(0);\n          expect(score).toBeLessThanOrEqual(1000);\n          if (band === 'perfect' && score < 750) failures.push(`${activity.id} perfect ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n          if (band === 'human' && score < 550) failures.push(`${activity.id} human ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n          if (band === 'sloppy' && score < 300) failures.push(`${activity.id} sloppy ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n          if (band === 'idle' && score > 500) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n        }\n        const idle = scores.idle ?? 0;\n        const human = scores.human ?? 0;\n        if (idle >= human) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${idle.toFixed(1)} vs human ${human.toFixed(1)} seed ${seed}`);\n      }\n    }\n    expect(failures).toEqual([]);\n  }, 600_000);\n\n  it('lets a mash of input finish, and an idle pond scores exactly 500', () => {\n    const { run, w, act } = open(3);\n    act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\n      const mash: Intents = {\n        'game:r': Math.sin(i * 0.7),\n        'game:f': Math.cos(i * 0.4),\n        'game:fl': i % 5 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\n        'game:act': i % 11 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\n      };\n      expect(disturbed(w, mash)).toBe(true);\n      run.stepOnce(mash);\n    }\n    expect(flowOf(w).mode).toBe('results');\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(w).result)).toBe(true);\n    const idle = open(4);\n    idle.act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\n      const intents = pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle');\n      idle.run.stepOnce(intents);\n    }\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\n  });\n\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\n    const { w, act } = open(2);\n    act('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\n    const morning = activityById('morning');\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\n      w.step ? undefined : undefined;\n      runStep(w, morning);\n    }\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\n  });\n});\n\n/** Steps the live world once. Declared under the tests so the scene, not a copy, advances the day. */\nfunction runStep(w: World, activity: Activity): void {\n  void w;\n  void activity;\n}\n\ndescribe('director', () => {\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\n    const seen = ['morning', 'pose', 'pose-a', 'pose-b', 'pose-c', 'pond', 'garden', 'paddle', 'line', 'group', 'tilt:storm', 'tilt:east', 'tilt:stone', 'tilt:dawn', 'evening', 'credits'];\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\n      const list = programme();\n      let guard = 0;\n      for (const item of list) guard += item.event === 'evening' || item.event === 'credits' || item.event === 'morning' ? 50 * 60 : 200 * 60;\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\n        run.stepOnce({});\n        if (flowOf(w).credits === 1 && flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\n      }\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed} credits`).toBe(1);\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\n      for (const id of seen) expect(got, `seed ${seed} ${id}`).toContain(id);\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n    }\n  }, 600_000);\n});\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1940,"output_tokens":2845,"cache_read_input_tokens":135168,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e4c680b2-3e97-4247-9800-9b0e0bfb6ea6"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bb2d4c5a-9085-4abc-9998-80156c5ce09b-73","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplements the disc.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { bench } from './scenes/bench';\\nimport type { Band } from './scenes/bot';\\nimport { ACTIVITIES, activityById, type Activity } from './scenes/catalog';\\nimport { programme } from './scenes/data/days';\\nimport { actOf, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { disturbed, pond } from './scenes/events/pond';\\nimport { wobbleAge } from './scenes/score';\\nimport { inRing, resetBalance, stepBalance, type Stick } from './scenes/wobble';\\n\\nconst BANDS: readonly Band[] = ['perfect', 'human', 'sloppy', 'idle'];\\n\\n/** A live world and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction open(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: bench, seed, settings });\\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const act = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, act };\\n}\\n\\n/** Plays one activity with a band. The scene calls step. The test calls bot and score. */\\nfunction play(activity: Activity, band: Band, seed: number): number {\\n  const { run, w, act } = open(seed);\\n  const bootCount = w.count;\\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\\n  const cap = activity.seconds * 60 + 120;\\n  let score = Number.NaN;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < cap; i++) {\\n    const intents = activity.bot(w, band);\\n    run.stepOnce(intents);\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') {\\n      score = activity.score(w);\\n      break;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  expect(w.count, `${activity.id} teardown`).toBe(bootCount);\\n  expect(Number.isFinite(score), `${activity.id} ${band} seed ${seed} finished`).toBe(true);\\n  return score;\\n}\\n\\n/** A stick with every field, so the probe does not invent a second model. */\\nfunction stick(x: number, y: number, both = false): Stick {\\n  return {\\n    x, y, gentle: false, both, mdx: 0, mdy: 0, disturbX: 0, disturbY: 0, noiseScale: 1, instabilityScale: 1,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('balance', () => {\\n  it('keeps a still thumb inside the 0.22 ring only part of the time', () => {\\n    const shares: number[] = [];\\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n      const { w } = open(seed);\\n      const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n      resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n      const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n      let inside = 0;\\n      const steps = 20 * 60;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\\n        stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n        if (inRing(row.wobble, 0.22)) inside += 1;\\n      }\\n      shares.push(inside / steps);\\n    }\\n    const mean = shares.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0) / shares.length;\\n    expect(mean).toBeGreaterThan(0.15);\\n    expect(mean).toBeLessThan(0.55);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('topples a held full stick and quiets sway when the breath is calm', () => {\\n    const { w } = open(1);\\n    const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 180; i++) stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(1, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n    expect(row.wobble.topples).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    let wild = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      wild += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    row.wobble.calm = 1;\\n    let quiet = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      row.wobble.calm = 1;\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0, true), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      quiet += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    expect(quiet).toBeLessThan(wild);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('activities', () => {\\n  it('scores the four bands on ten seeds', () => {\\n    const failures: string[] = [];\\n    for (const activity of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n        const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\\n        for (const band of BANDS) {\\n          const score = play(activity, band, seed);\\n          scores[band] = score;\\n          expect(score).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(0);\\n          expect(score).toBeLessThanOrEqual(1000);\\n          if (band === 'perfect' && score < 750) failures.push(`${activity.id} perfect ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'human' && score < 550) failures.push(`${activity.id} human ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'sloppy' && score < 300) failures.push(`${activity.id} sloppy ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'idle' && score > 500) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n        }\\n        const idle = scores.idle ?? 0;\\n        const human = scores.human ?? 0;\\n        if (idle >= human) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${idle.toFixed(1)} vs human ${human.toFixed(1)} seed ${seed}`);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    expect(failures).toEqual([]);\\n  }, 600_000);\\n\\n  it('lets a mash of input finish, and an idle pond scores exactly 500', () => {\\n    const { run, w, act } = open(3);\\n    act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      const mash: Intents = {\\n        'game:r': Math.sin(i * 0.7),\\n        'game:f': Math.cos(i * 0.4),\\n        'game:fl': i % 5 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n        'game:act': i % 11 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n      };\\n      expect(disturbed(w, mash)).toBe(true);\\n      run.stepOnce(mash);\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      const intents = pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle');\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(intents);\\n    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { w, act } = open(2);\\n    act('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    const morning = activityById('morning');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      w.step ? undefined : undefined;\\n      runStep(w, morning);\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n/** Steps the live world once. Declared under the tests so the scene, not a copy, advances the day. */\\nfunction runStep(w: World, activity: Activity): void {\\n  void w;\\n  void activity;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    const seen = ['morning', 'pose', 'pose-a', 'pose-b', 'pose-c', 'pond', 'garden', 'paddle', 'line', 'group', 'tilt:storm', 'tilt:east', 'tilt:stone', 'tilt:dawn', 'evening', 'credits'];\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      const list = programme();\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of list) guard += item.event === 'evening' || item.event === 'credits' || item.event === 'morning' ? 50 * 60 : 200 * 60;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).credits === 1 && flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed} credits`).toBe(1);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n      for (const id of seen) expect(got, `seed ${seed} ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplements the disc.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { bench } from './scenes/bench';\\nimport type { Band } from './scenes/bot';\\nimport { ACTIVITIES, activityById, type Activity } from './scenes/catalog';\\nimport { programme } from './scenes/data/days';\\nimport { actOf, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { disturbed, pond } from './scenes/events/pond';\\nimport { wobbleAge } from './scenes/score';\\nimport { inRing, resetBalance, stepBalance, type Stick } from './scenes/wobble';\\n\\nconst BANDS: readonly Band[] = ['perfect', 'human', 'sloppy', 'idle'];\\n\\n/** A live world and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction open(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: bench, seed, settings });\\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const act = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, act };\\n}\\n\\n/** Plays one activity with a band. The scene calls step. The test calls bot and score. */\\nfunction play(activity: Activity, band: Band, seed: number): number {\\n  const { run, w, act } = open(seed);\\n  const bootCount = w.count;\\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  act('game.start', { event: activity.id });\\n  const cap = activity.seconds * 60 + 120;\\n  let score = Number.NaN;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < cap; i++) {\\n    const intents = activity.bot(w, band);\\n    run.stepOnce(intents);\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') {\\n      score = activity.score(w);\\n      break;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  expect(w.count, `${activity.id} teardown`).toBe(bootCount);\\n  expect(Number.isFinite(score), `${activity.id} ${band} seed ${seed} finished`).toBe(true);\\n  return score;\\n}\\n\\n/** A stick with every field, so the probe does not invent a second model. */\\nfunction stick(x: number, y: number, both = false): Stick {\\n  return {\\n    x, y, gentle: false, both, mdx: 0, mdy: 0, disturbX: 0, disturbY: 0, noiseScale: 1, instabilityScale: 1,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('balance', () => {\\n  it('keeps a still thumb inside the 0.22 ring only part of the time', () => {\\n    const shares: number[] = [];\\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n      const { w } = open(seed);\\n      const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n      resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n      const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n      let inside = 0;\\n      const steps = 20 * 60;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\\n        stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n        if (inRing(row.wobble, 0.22)) inside += 1;\\n      }\\n      shares.push(inside / steps);\\n    }\\n    const mean = shares.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0) / shares.length;\\n    expect(mean).toBeGreaterThan(0.15);\\n    expect(mean).toBeLessThan(0.55);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('topples a held full stick and quiets sway when the breath is calm', () => {\\n    const { w } = open(1);\\n    const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 180; i++) stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(1, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n    expect(row.wobble.topples).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    let wild = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      wild += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    row.wobble.calm = 1;\\n    let quiet = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      row.wobble.calm = 1;\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0, true), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      quiet += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    expect(quiet).toBeLessThan(wild);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('activities', () => {\\n  it('scores the four bands on ten seeds', () => {\\n    const failures: string[] = [];\\n    for (const activity of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n        const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\\n        for (const band of BANDS) {\\n          const score = play(activity, band, seed);\\n          scores[band] = score;\\n          expect(score).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(0);\\n          expect(score).toBeLessThanOrEqual(1000);\\n          if (band === 'perfect' && score < 750) failures.push(`${activity.id} perfect ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'human' && score < 550) failures.push(`${activity.id} human ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'sloppy' && score < 300) failures.push(`${activity.id} sloppy ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n          if (band === 'idle' && score > 500) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n        }\\n        const idle = scores.idle ?? 0;\\n        const human = scores.human ?? 0;\\n        if (idle >= human) failures.push(`${activity.id} idle ${idle.toFixed(1)} vs human ${human.toFixed(1)} seed ${seed}`);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    expect(failures).toEqual([]);\\n  }, 600_000);\\n\\n  it('lets a mash of input finish, and an idle pond scores exactly 500', () => {\\n    const { run, w, act } = open(3);\\n    act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      const mash: Intents = {\\n        'game:r': Math.sin(i * 0.7),\\n        'game:f': Math.cos(i * 0.4),\\n        'game:fl': i % 5 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n        'game:act': i % 11 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n      };\\n      expect(disturbed(w, mash)).toBe(true);\\n      run.stepOnce(mash);\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.act('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      const intents = pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle');\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(intents);\\n    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { w, act } = open(2);\\n    act('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    const morning = activityById('morning');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      w.step ? undefined : undefined;\\n      runStep(w, morning);\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n/** Steps the live world once. Declared under the tests so the scene, not a copy, advances the day. */\\nfunction runStep(w: World, activity: Activity): void {\\n  void w;\\n  void activity;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    const seen = ['morning', 'pose', 'pose-a', 'pose-b', 'pose-c', 'pond', 'garden', 'paddle', 'line', 'group', 'tilt:storm', 'tilt:east', 'tilt:stone', 'tilt:dawn', 'evening', 'credits'];\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      const list = programme();\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of list) guard += item.event === 'evening' || item.event === 'credits' || item.event === 'morning' ? 50 * 60 : 200 * 60;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).credits === 1 && flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed} credits`).toBe(1);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n      for (const id of seen) expect(got, `seed ${seed} ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"50d1d2b0-00ea-402a-b221-b532ba3708c0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_180","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test has bugs that need fixing before running.\n\nThe smoke test calls setup and teardown, then game.start again. The loop handles bot and score. Step is called by the scene, not the test.\n\nThe smoke test needs an explicit step call. The double setup before the scored run consumes RNG streams and corrupts state. I will remove the redundant setup from play().\n\nThe smoke test will call setup, step, score, and bot directly without using the scene path. play() will only use the scene path: game.start, then bot plus stepOnce, then score.\n\nThe age test's broken runStep needs to be fixed to use run.stepOnce. The pond mash activity calls disturbed() every frame even when the stick is small.\n\nThe pond mash test should only verify the function is callable and some frames disturb, not every frame. The idle pond test correctly reads score after the finish event in the same step.\n\nThe director test guard is large enough for the longest activities. The age test still needs a proper fix.\n\nThe smoke test will use a fresh world without game.start. The act component is already present from boot, so setup can call actOf and resetAct directly. It will then step, score, and teardown without any engine.step.\n\nThe age test contains a broken `w.step ?` guard. I will rewrite the test file cleanly to remove it and the redundant setup calls. After the scene finishes, activity.score(w) should match flow.result because finishEvent already scored and teardown ran. Idle pond pose correctly stays zero.\n\nI will run the test to check if `createAppHost` is a type-only issue. The director title frame calls `startEvent` through `openItem`, which is a driver bug I need to fix before running.\n\nThe director title frame bug is harmless. `startEvent` queues spawns during the step, and the next step processes them correctly. The main remaining work is fixing the age test to actually step, removing the redundant setup from `play()`, and running the morning activity.\n\nThe smoke test reuses one world across activities, so RNG streams continue cleanly. Band play will reuse a single engine via `run.inspector.seed(n)` to avoid creating 400 separate engines.\n\nThe `inspector.seed()` call may need a type cast because the inspector index signature could return `unknown`.\n\nThe test file will be rewritten completely. The morning band test will run first as a focused subset to avoid waiting for the full ten-seed matrix. The suite will be split into model tests, a fast smoke test for all activities, and the pond 500 test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bca3c1bf-649a-4fb4-93c8-0df9cec105e2-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts","new_string":"/**\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplements the disc.\n */\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\nimport { createAppHost, type AppRun } from '../../engine/app/headless';\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\nimport { bench } from './scenes/bench';\nimport type { Band } from './scenes/bot';\nimport { ACTIVITIES, type Activity } from './scenes/catalog';\nimport { programme } from './scenes/data/days';\nimport { actOf, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\nimport { disturbed, pond } from './scenes/events/pond';\nimport { wobbleAge } from './scenes/score';\nimport { inRing, resetBalance, stepBalance, type Stick } from './scenes/wobble';\n\nconst BANDS: readonly Band[] = ['perfect', 'human', 'sloppy', 'idle'];\nconst SEEN = [\n  'morning', 'pose', 'pose-a', 'pose-b', 'pose-c', 'pond', 'garden', 'paddle', 'line', 'group',\n  'tilt:storm', 'tilt:east', 'tilt:stone', 'tilt:dawn', 'evening', 'credits',\n];\n\n/** A live world and the menu actions that drive it. */\nfunction open(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: bench, seed, settings });\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\n  };\n  const reseed = (next: number) => {\n    (run.inspector.seed as (n?: number) => number)(next);\n  };\n  return { run, w, menu, reseed };\n}\n\n/** A stick with every field, so the probe does not invent a second model. */\nfunction stick(x: number, y: number, both = false): Stick {\n  return {\n    x, y, gentle: false, both, mdx: 0, mdy: 0, disturbX: 0, disturbY: 0, noiseScale: 1, instabilityScale: 1,\n  };\n}\n\n/** Plays one activity. The scene calls step. This calls the activity's bot and score. */\nfunction play(run: AppRun, w: World, menu: (name: string, args?: unknown) => void, activity: Activity, band: Band): number {\n  const bootCount = w.count;\n  menu('game.start', { event: activity.id });\n  const cap = activity.seconds * 60 + 120;\n  let score = Number.NaN;\n  for (let i = 0; i < cap; i++) {\n    const intents = activity.bot(w, band);\n    run.stepOnce(intents);\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') {\n      score = activity.score(w);\n      break;\n    }\n  }\n  activity.teardown(w);\n  expect(w.count, `${activity.id} teardown`).toBe(bootCount);\n  return score;\n}\n\ndescribe('balance', () => {\n  it('keeps a still thumb inside the 0.22 ring only part of the time', () => {\n    const shares: number[] = [];\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\n      const { w } = open(seed);\n      const row = rowOf(w, 0);\n      resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n      const cfg = cfgOf(w);\n      let inside = 0;\n      const steps = 20 * 60;\n      for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\n        stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n        if (inRing(row.wobble, 0.22)) inside += 1;\n      }\n      shares.push(inside / steps);\n    }\n    const mean = shares.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0) / shares.length;\n    expect(mean).toBeGreaterThan(0.15);\n    expect(mean).toBeLessThan(0.55);\n  });\n\n  it('topples a held full stick and quiets sway when the breath is calm', () => {\n    const { w } = open(1);\n    const row = rowOf(w, 0);\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    const cfg = cfgOf(w);\n    for (let i = 0; i < 180; i++) stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(1, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n    expect(row.wobble.topples).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    let wild = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n      wild += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\n    }\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\n    let quiet = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\n      row.wobble.calm = 1;\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0, true), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\n      quiet += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\n    }\n    expect(quiet).toBeLessThan(wild);\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe('activities', () => {\n  it('calls setup, step, score and bot on each activity', () => {\n    const { w } = open(1);\n    for (const activity of ACTIVITIES) {\n      activity.setup(w);\n      const intents = activity.bot(w, 'idle');\n      activity.step(w, intents);\n      expect(Number.isFinite(activity.score(w))).toBe(true);\n      activity.teardown(w);\n    }\n    expect(w.count).toBe(2);\n  });\n\n  it.each(ACTIVITIES.map((item) => [item.id]))('bands %s', (id) => {\n    const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((item) => item.id === id);\n    if (!activity) throw new Error(`missing ${id}`);\n    const { run, w, menu, reseed } = open(1);\n    const failures: string[] = [];\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\n      const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\n      for (const band of BANDS) {\n        reseed(seed);\n        const score = play(run, w, menu, activity, band);\n        scores[band] = score;\n        if (!Number.isFinite(score)) failures.push(`${id} ${band} ${seed} did not finish`);\n        else if (score < 0 || score > 1000) failures.push(`${id} ${band} ${seed} ${score}`);\n        else if (band === 'perfect' && score < 750) failures.push(`${id} perfect ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n        else if (band === 'human' && score < 550) failures.push(`${id} human ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n        else if (band === 'sloppy' && score < 300) failures.push(`${id} sloppy ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n        else if (band === 'idle' && score > 500) failures.push(`${id} idle ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\n      }\n      const idle = scores.idle ?? 0;\n      const human = scores.human ?? 0;\n      if (Number.isFinite(idle) && Number.isFinite(human) && idle >= human) {\n        failures.push(`${id} idle ${idle.toFixed(1)} vs human ${human.toFixed(1)} seed ${seed}`);\n      }\n    }\n    expect(failures).toEqual([]);\n  }, 600_000);\n\n  it('survives a mash, and an idle pond scores exactly 500', () => {\n    const mashed = open(3);\n    mashed.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\n    let threw = false;\n    try {\n      for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n        if (flowOf(mashed.w).mode === 'results') break;\n        const mash: Intents = {\n          'game:r': Math.sin(i * 0.7),\n          'game:f': Math.cos(i * 0.4),\n          'game:fl': i % 5 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\n          'game:act': i % 11 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\n        };\n        disturbed(mashed.w, mash);\n        mashed.run.stepOnce(mash);\n      }\n    } catch {\n      threw = true;\n    }\n    expect(threw).toBe(false);\n    expect(flowOf(mashed.w).mode).toBe('results');\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(mashed.w).result)).toBe(true);\n    const idle = open(4);\n    idle.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\n      idle.run.stepOnce(pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle'));\n    }\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\n  });\n\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\n    const { run, w, menu } = open(2);\n    const morning = ACTIVITIES[0];\n    if (!morning) throw new Error('no morning');\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\n      run.stepOnce(morning.bot(w, 'human'));\n    }\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe('director', () => {\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\n      let guard = 0;\n      for (const item of programme()) {\n        const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((entry) => entry.id === item.event);\n        guard += activity ? (activity.seconds + 2) * 60 : 60 * 60;\n      }\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\n        run.stepOnce({});\n        if (flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\n      }\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed}`).toBe(1);\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\n      for (const id of SEEN) expect(got, `seed ${seed} saw ${id}`).toContain(id);\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n    }\n  }, 600_000);\n});\n","old_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2949,"output_tokens":5220,"cache_read_input_tokens":137088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"08ffdd33-70c1-41e5-8412-b9ee7adba4ff"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-bca3c1bf-649a-4fb4-93c8-0df9cec105e2-74","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplements the disc.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createAppHost, type AppRun } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { bench } from './scenes/bench';\\nimport type { Band } from './scenes/bot';\\nimport { ACTIVITIES, type Activity } from './scenes/catalog';\\nimport { programme } from './scenes/data/days';\\nimport { actOf, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { disturbed, pond } from './scenes/events/pond';\\nimport { wobbleAge } from './scenes/score';\\nimport { inRing, resetBalance, stepBalance, type Stick } from './scenes/wobble';\\n\\nconst BANDS: readonly Band[] = ['perfect', 'human', 'sloppy', 'idle'];\\nconst SEEN = [\\n  'morning', 'pose', 'pose-a', 'pose-b', 'pose-c', 'pond', 'garden', 'paddle', 'line', 'group',\\n  'tilt:storm', 'tilt:east', 'tilt:stone', 'tilt:dawn', 'evening', 'credits',\\n];\\n\\n/** A live world and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction open(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: bench, seed, settings });\\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  const reseed = (next: number) => {\\n    (run.inspector.seed as (n?: number) => number)(next);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu, reseed };\\n}\\n\\n/** A stick with every field, so the probe does not invent a second model. */\\nfunction stick(x: number, y: number, both = false): Stick {\\n  return {\\n    x, y, gentle: false, both, mdx: 0, mdy: 0, disturbX: 0, disturbY: 0, noiseScale: 1, instabilityScale: 1,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/** Plays one activity. The scene calls step. This calls the activity's bot and score. */\\nfunction play(run: AppRun, w: World, menu: (name: string, args?: unknown) => void, activity: Activity, band: Band): number {\\n  const bootCount = w.count;\\n  menu('game.start', { event: activity.id });\\n  const cap = activity.seconds * 60 + 120;\\n  let score = Number.NaN;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < cap; i++) {\\n    const intents = activity.bot(w, band);\\n    run.stepOnce(intents);\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') {\\n      score = activity.score(w);\\n      break;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  expect(w.count, `${activity.id} teardown`).toBe(bootCount);\\n  return score;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('balance', () => {\\n  it('keeps a still thumb inside the 0.22 ring only part of the time', () => {\\n    const shares: number[] = [];\\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n      const { w } = open(seed);\\n      const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n      resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n      const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n      let inside = 0;\\n      const steps = 20 * 60;\\n      for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) {\\n        stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n        if (inRing(row.wobble, 0.22)) inside += 1;\\n      }\\n      shares.push(inside / steps);\\n    }\\n    const mean = shares.reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0) / shares.length;\\n    expect(mean).toBeGreaterThan(0.15);\\n    expect(mean).toBeLessThan(0.55);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('topples a held full stick and quiets sway when the breath is calm', () => {\\n    const { w } = open(1);\\n    const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 180; i++) stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(1, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n    expect(row.wobble.topples).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    let wild = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      wild += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n    let quiet = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 600; i++) {\\n      row.wobble.calm = 1;\\n      stepBalance(row.wobble, stick(0, 0, true), cfg, i / 60, w.dt);\\n      quiet += Math.abs(row.wobble.x);\\n    }\\n    expect(quiet).toBeLessThan(wild);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('activities', () => {\\n  it('calls setup, step, score and bot on each activity', () => {\\n    const { w } = open(1);\\n    for (const activity of ACTIVITIES) {\\n      activity.setup(w);\\n      const intents = activity.bot(w, 'idle');\\n      activity.step(w, intents);\\n      expect(Number.isFinite(activity.score(w))).toBe(true);\\n      activity.teardown(w);\\n    }\\n    expect(w.count).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n  it.each(ACTIVITIES.map((item) => [item.id]))('bands %s', (id) => {\\n    const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((item) => item.id === id);\\n    if (!activity) throw new Error(`missing ${id}`);\\n    const { run, w, menu, reseed } = open(1);\\n    const failures: string[] = [];\\n    for (let seed = 1; seed <= 10; seed++) {\\n      const scores: Record<string, number> = {};\\n      for (const band of BANDS) {\\n        reseed(seed);\\n        const score = play(run, w, menu, activity, band);\\n        scores[band] = score;\\n        if (!Number.isFinite(score)) failures.push(`${id} ${band} ${seed} did not finish`);\\n        else if (score < 0 || score > 1000) failures.push(`${id} ${band} ${seed} ${score}`);\\n        else if (band === 'perfect' && score < 750) failures.push(`${id} perfect ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n        else if (band === 'human' && score < 550) failures.push(`${id} human ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n        else if (band === 'sloppy' && score < 300) failures.push(`${id} sloppy ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n        else if (band === 'idle' && score > 500) failures.push(`${id} idle ${seed} ${score.toFixed(1)}`);\\n      }\\n      const idle = scores.idle ?? 0;\\n      const human = scores.human ?? 0;\\n      if (Number.isFinite(idle) && Number.isFinite(human) && idle >= human) {\\n        failures.push(`${id} idle ${idle.toFixed(1)} vs human ${human.toFixed(1)} seed ${seed}`);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    expect(failures).toEqual([]);\\n  }, 600_000);\\n\\n  it('survives a mash, and an idle pond scores exactly 500', () => {\\n    const mashed = open(3);\\n    mashed.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    let threw = false;\\n    try {\\n      for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n        if (flowOf(mashed.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n        const mash: Intents = {\\n          'game:r': Math.sin(i * 0.7),\\n          'game:f': Math.cos(i * 0.4),\\n          'game:fl': i % 5 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n          'game:act': i % 11 === 0 ? 1 : 0,\\n        };\\n        disturbed(mashed.w, mash);\\n        mashed.run.stepOnce(mash);\\n      }\\n    } catch {\\n      threw = true;\\n    }\\n    expect(threw).toBe(false);\\n    expect(flowOf(mashed.w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(mashed.w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle'));\\n    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { run, w, menu } = open(2);\\n    const morning = ACTIVITIES[0];\\n    if (!morning) throw new Error('no morning');\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      run.stepOnce(morning.bot(w, 'human'));\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of programme()) {\\n        const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((entry) => entry.id === item.event);\\n        guard += activity ? (activity.seconds + 2) * 60 : 60 * 60;\\n      }\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed}`).toBe(1);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n      for (const id of SEEN) expect(got, `seed ${seed} saw ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/**\\n * @file The retreat, driven through the shipped scene. Bands, the balance step, teardown and the director\\n * all call the activities' own setup, step, score and bot. Nothing here reimplemen