{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_191","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 16 tests passed, including the 3-seed director to credits test.\n\nBalance simulation is solid. Remaining work covers island, cast, page, audio, lines, hub, HTML, exit interview, PROGRESS, and verification. I will write verify.mjs and run the test suite.\n\nI mapped the remaining verification checklist to specific build tasks. I will remove the starter gem game to prevent test conflicts, then create the island scene with terrain and cast, the hub round scene, clips, the main page with UI and audio, and the songs.\n\nI will write verify.mjs, onefile.mjs, exit-interview.json, PROGRESS.md, and the HTML hand-in. I am reviewing labs/box for patterns and the starter main.ts to replace it efficiently. I also noticed GAME_SETTINGS is defined in both play.ts and settings.ts, but the keys differ so there is no conflict.\n\nI will delete play.ts, play.test.ts, and best.test.ts to remove the gem game. The new main.ts will strip the aihub query, check WebGPU, connect the hub, create an engine with island and round scenes, and provide UI for title, menus, disc, pause, settings, dev, and about. It will also handle audio and attract mode. The island scene will import the driver and add terrain, actors, and the pilot.\n\nI will work in batches. First I will grep the engine APIs for terrain, audio, and menus. Then I will write the clips, songs, lines, and about data. Next I will build the island and round scenes. After that I will write main.ts and delete the starter game. Finally I will write verify.mjs and run the tests.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-91f046ae-ffa3-4d5a-983c-360c48dccab3-97","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export function createEngine|export async function createEngine|cameraInput","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh