{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_193","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found a good song example. Now reading boxHall for a complete small song and ActionMapSpec.\n\nReviewing PLAN sections 4 and 10 for balance map, look, and hub tags. Will write files in bulk. Critical verification behaviors include title screen text, music volume, engine readiness, canvas size, consistent menu state across boots, and glyph synchronization.\n\nThe UI scope is now fully defined. It covers hover and click focus, 10-second attract mode, a dev slider with reset, About text, 28px glyphs, and responsive controller or touch messages. The main.ts will be split into modules under ui/. Next I need to check menu item shapes, input.lastDevice, WebGPU detection before engine creation, and hub client usage.\n\nWriting the essential files now and iterating on test failures later. The planned files are retreat.ts for six songs, voice.ts for syllables and speech, lines/retreat.ts as a long record, about-data.ts for the About screen, and scenes/maps.ts for action maps. Need to verify whether defineActionMap should be exported from sim-api so the page can import it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f7ec5417-b919-409a-b650-7df828456281-106","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"defineActionMap|defineSong|defineTerrain|defineLook|defineSfx|createAudio","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/index.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f7ec5417-b919-409a-b650-7df828456281-107","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/box/sounds/boxHall.ts","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f7ec5417-b919-409a-b650-7df828456281-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc