{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_218","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"drawSway spawns a wobble entity. boot spawns flow.\n\nTests expect two entities after teardown. The bench scene is used for testing, not the island scene. Island setup spawns an actor and marks, but requires physics enabled and a terrain module. Need to verify whether scene physics:true creates the physics world before actor spawning.\n\nSetup runs after the physics world exists when physics:true is set. Sea can be a large mark at y=2. Pebbles are marks that the pilot collects near stations. Plaques are text marks shown near guests. The cairn is a mark at the lodge. Cast spawns non-player actors with roles.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-42","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function parseClipSet|CLIPSET|format","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-43","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts","offset":130,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"interface ClipsSpec|play\\?:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/actorClips.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-45","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/store.ts","offset":140,"limit":5