 and the decode that rebuilds 36 body points from a key pose on a measured rest body. Ported\"},{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" * Invariants: a format-1 key decodes as the source's does; format 2's key fields are carried, in-betweened, mirrored\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"/** One key pose. Format 1's fields, then format 2's (all optional). Angles in degrees, distances in % of hip height. */\"},{\"line_number\":176,\"content\":\" * The decode's arm on side `s`: the shoulder, the elbow, the IK's end (format 1's fist), the forearm's direction, the\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\" * key with format 2's `hand` or `grip` on a side places that hand as engine/anim/clip/hands.ts does.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/layer.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\" * them over the pose. Events are a clip's own (format 2), `hit` (an attack's: its `hit` event, else its strike time),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/hands.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * knuckles round the fist; format 2 writes what the source's finger bones show, so a hand on a ledge or a rung lies\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * Invariants: a key without `hand` and `grip` decodes as format 1 does (readable.ts); angles in degrees, grip 0–100;\"},{\"line_number\":32,\"content\":\"/** Half the knuckles' span: the index and pinky knuckles either side of the middle one, mm (format 1's 20). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/clipsets.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"export const CLIPSET_FIELDS = defineSchema({\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"  format: { type: 'integer', description: 'The readable format its clips are in: 1, or 2 (PLAN.md §10.2).' },\"},{\"line_number\":65,\"content\":\"  legend: { type: 'array', description: 'How to read its clips, line by line (format 2).' },\"},{\"line_number\":90,\"content\":\"    fields: CLIPSET_FIELDS,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/retarget.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\" * rule), fully for a foot on the floor, not at all `soleFade` up. A hand reaches the source's inside a format-2\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/frames.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\" * exactly the torso its decode rebuilds, and a change to it (format 2's spine override, WP 8.8) reaches both.\"},{\"line_number\":162,\"content\":\"/** The spine bones format 2's `spine` override turns: the two between `spine1` and the chest. */\"},{\"line_number\":166,\"content\":\" * A key pose's torso on rest body `R`: the pelvis, chest and head frames, the spine's points (format 2's `spine`\"},{\"line_number\":175,\"content\":\"  // format 2's spine override turns the spine's two middle bones together, relative to the body, in their shares' place\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/lens.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * legs), format 2's fields after format 1's, so a format-1 clip prints exactly as the source printed it. The lens\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"/** What each field means, one line each, as a set file or a reader shows it (shardfall's legend, format 2 added). */\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"  'Readable key poses (the my-3D2dge format). Times in seconds; every other number is a whole number. Rig frame: forward, right, up.',\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"  'format 2, each optional: handL handR [flex, side, roll] at the wrist; rollL rollR (foot roll); yaw (root); spine [turn, lean, tilt]; gripL gripR (0-100)',\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"/** Each key's fields in the three lines `clipText` writes: torso, arms, legs (format 2's after format 1's). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/bake.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * skeleton (engine/anim/skeleton.ts), 30 frames a second on format 1's key grid (`bakeTimes`): each frame holds the\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\" * - format 2 (WP 8.8) turns the hand to its `hand` frame, the middle spine joints by `spine`, a foot by its `roll`\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-43","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"130→export function slew(current: number, target: number, maxDelta: number): number {\\n  const d = target - current;\\n  if (Math.abs(d) <= maxDelta) return target;\\n  return current + Math.sign(d) * maxDelta;\\n}\\n\\n/** The slow sway on one axis. Phases come from the seat, never from Math.random. */\\nexport function swayNoise(t: number, rate: number, m1: number, m2: number, m3: number, p1: number, p2: number, p3: number): number {\\n  const a = Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * m1 * t + p1);\\n  const b = 0.6 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 1.7 * m2 * t + p2);\\n140→  const c = 0.3 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 3.1 * m3 * t + p3);\\n  return (a + b + c) / 1.3;\\n}\\n\\n/** Draws the six ratios and phases for a seat from the stream `sway`. */\\nexport function drawSway(w: World): void {\\n  const rng = w.rng('sway');\\n  const ratio = () => rng.range(0.8, 1.25);\\n  const phase = () => rng.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n  const body = w.spawn({\\n150→    wobble: {\\n      m1: ratio(), m2: ratio(), m3: ratio(), p1: phase(), p2: phase(), p3: phase(),\\n      n1: ratio(), n2: ratio(), n3: ratio(), q1: phase(), q2: phase(), q3: phase(),\\n    },\\n    hist: { xs: [], ys: [] },\\n  });\\n  void body;\\n}\\n\\n/** Clears the motion and the breath, and keeps the sway. A new activity starts here. */\\n160→export function resetBalance(b: Wobble, hist: Hist): void {\\n  b.x = 0; b.y = 0; b.vx = 0; b.vy = 0; b.sx = 0; b.sy = 0; b.mx = 0; b.my = 0;\\n  b.calm = 0; b.lungs = 0; b.sync = 0; b.over = 0; b.recover = 0; b.topples = 0; b.guide = 0;\\n  hist.i = 0; hist.n = 0; hist.xs.length = 0; hist.ys.length = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Remembers a centre. The ring holds 24, which covers the sloppy thumb’s delay. */\\nexport function remember(hist: Hist, x: number, y: number): void {\\n  const cap = 24;\\n  if (hist.xs.length < cap) {\",\"content_concise\":\"130→export function slew(current: number, target: number, maxDelta: number): number {\\n  const d = target - current;\\n  if (Math.abs(d) <= maxDelta) return target;\\n  return current + Math.sign(d) * maxDelta;\\n}\\n\\n/** The slow sway on one axis. Phases come from the seat, never from Math.random. */\\nexport function swayNoise(t: number, rate: number, m1: number, m2: number, m3: number, p1: number, p2: number, p3: number): number {\\n  const a = Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * m1 * t + p1);\\n  const b = 0.6 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 1.7 * m2 * t + p2);\\n140→  const c = 0.3 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 3.1 * m3 * t + p3);\\n  return (a + b + c) / 1.3;\\n}\\n\\n/** Draws the six ratios and phases for a seat from the stream `sway`. */\\nexport function drawSway(w: World): void {\\n  const rng = w.rng('sway');\\n  const ratio = () => rng.range(0.8, 1.25);\\n  const phase = () => rng.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n  const body = w.spawn({\\n150→    wobble: {\\n      m1: ratio(), m2: ratio(), m3: ratio(), p1: phase(), p2: phase(), p3: phase(),\\n      n1: ratio(), n2: ratio(), n3: ratio(), q1: phase(), q2: phase(), q3: phase(),\\n    },\\n    hist: { xs: [], ys: [] },\\n  });\\n  void body;\\n}\\n\\n/** Clears the motion and the breath, and keeps the sway. A new activity starts here. */\\n160→export function resetBalance(b: Wobble, hist: Hist): void {\\n  b.x = 0; b.y = 0; b.vx = 0; b.vy = 0; b.sx = 0; b.sy = 0; b.mx = 0; b.my = 0;\\n  b.calm = 0; b.lungs = 0; b.sync = 0; b.over = 0; b.recover = 0; b.topples = 0; b.guide = 0;\\n  hist.i = 0; hist.n = 0; hist.xs.length = 0; hist.ys.length = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Remembers a centre. The ring holds 24, which covers the sloppy thumb’s delay. */\\nexport function remember(hist: Hist, x: number, y: number): void {\\n  const cap = 24;\\n  if (hist.xs.length < cap) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts\",\"offset\":130,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"export function slew(current: number, target: number, maxDelta: number): number {\\n  const d = target - current;\\n  if (Math.abs(d) <= maxDelta) return target;\\n  return current + Math.sign(d) * maxDelta;\\n}\\n\\n/** The slow sway on one axis. Phases come from the seat, never from Math.random. */\\nexport function swayNoise(t: number, rate: number, m1: number, m2: number, m3: number, p1: number, p2: number, p3: number): number {\\n  const a = Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * m1 * t + p1);\\n  const b = 0.6 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 1.7 * m2 * t + p2);\\n  const c = 0.3 * Math.sin(2 * Math.PI * rate * 3.1 * m3 * t + p3);\\n  return (a + b + c) / 1.3;\\n}\\n\\n/** Draws the six ratios and phases for a seat from the stream `sway`. */\\nexport function drawSway(w: World): void {\\n  const rng = w.rng('sway');\\n  const ratio = () => rng.range(0.8, 1.25);\\n  const phase = () => rng.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n  const body = w.spawn({\\n    wobble: {\\n      m1: ratio(), m2: ratio(), m3: ratio(), p1: phase(), p2: phase(), p3: phase(),\\n      n1: ratio(), n2: ratio(), n3: ratio(), q1: phase(), q2: phase(), q3: phase(),\\n    },\\n    hist: { xs: [], ys: [] },\\n  });\\n  void body;\\n}\\n\\n/** Clears the motion and the breath, and keeps the sway. A new activity starts here. */\\nexport function resetBalance(b: Wobble, hist: Hist): void {\\n  b.x = 0; b.y = 0; b.vx = 0; b.vy = 0; b.sx = 0; b.sy = 0; b.mx = 0; b.my = 0;\\n  b.calm = 0; b.lungs = 0; b.sync = 0; b.over = 0; b.recover = 0; b.topples = 0; b.guide = 0;\\n  hist.i = 0; hist.n = 0; hist.xs.length = 0; hist.ys.length = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Remembers a centre. The ring holds 24, which covers the sloppy thumb’s delay. */\\nexport function remember(hist: Hist, x: number, y: number): void {\\n  const cap = 24;\\n  if (hist.xs.length < cap) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":258}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0dfd886b-3bb9-4cb4-9659-cd77ec35ff32-44","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,101,110,103,105,110,10