{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_220","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Built-in props will be used for the pavilion: bench, crate, and pillar.\n\nThe sea will be a large kinematic box prop. Materials must be defined on the page before createEngine starts. Built-in materials like default and planks will be used for props. Sand, lawn, and sea will be defined for terrain.\n\nTerrain and materials load before the engine starts. The sea prop will be a 400 by 400 by 0.4 box.\n\nThe sea prop body uses a fixed box shape. A sand material prop is defined as a cylinder. Props without bodies still render. The island will spawn a guest actor and plumb and tare actors, skipping clips if they are risky.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cc9b00a0-f0d1-4d98-82c6-373431d5667d-50","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"axis\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cc9b00a0-f0d1-4d98-82c6-373431d5667d-51","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"virtual","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3551,"output_tokens":799,"cache_read_input_tokens":95488,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e455e8c9-2091-4a0a-825f-c05632edbfdc"}
