{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_267","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session might not automatically add a terrain collider.\n\nI need to import `addTerrainBody`, `defineTerrain`, `getTerrain`, and `physicsOf` from sim-api. In setup, I will call `physicsOf(w)` and then `addTerrainBody(physics, getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'))`. The sea prop should be kinematic at y=2 with a size of 400. I will keep the collider small to avoid performance issues.\n\nThe sea prop will be visual-only without a physics body. Walkers will be clamped by code instead. It uses a 280×0.3×280 box at y=2 so the surface sits at y=2. Materials, cairn, and pavilion pillars will use `prop:pillar` and `prop:bench`.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c9f31a67-b4fb-4bd8-bb93-04c69dc9b1d7-122","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"defineSetBuild","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/api.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":248,"output_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":153600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ec1fde3f-20fb-49a9-9b65-c7374f4362c8"}
