48,48,44,32,113,58,32,49,46,51,32,125,32,125,44,10,50,54,54,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,123,32,119,97,118,101,58,32,39,110,111,105,115,101,39,44,32,100,117,114,58,32,52,44,32,118,111,108,58,32,48,46,48,53,44,32,97,116,116,97,99,107,58,32,49,44,32,114,101,108,101,97,115,101,58,32,49,44,32,102,105,108,116,101,114,58,32,123,32,116,121,112,101,58,32,39,98,97,110,100,112,97,115,115,39,44,32,102,114,101,113,58,32,49,53,48,48,44,32,116,111,58,32,49,49,48,48,44,32,113,58,32,49,46,53,32,125,32,125,44,32,47,47,32,112,114,101,116,116,105,101,114,45,105,103,110,111,114,101,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":3,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/audio/data/foley.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":122,\"content\":\"    { wave: 'noise', dur: 0.45, vol: 0.14, attack: 0.02, filter: { type: 'bandpass', freq: 500, to: 2600, q: 1.2 } },\"},{\"line_number\":179,\"content\":\"    { wave: 'noise', dur: 0.2, vol: 0.14, attack: 0.06, filter: { type: 'bandpass', freq: 650, to: 1900, q: 1.3 } },\"},{\"line_number\":266,\"content\":\"      { wave: 'noise', dur: 4, vol: 0.05, attack: 1, release: 1, filter: { type: 'bandpass', freq: 1500, to: 1100, q: 1.5 } }, // prettier-ignore\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0a5ebc48-f732-4737-94b8-e7c811aa113e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_271","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The filter works. The q at the voice top level in the plan might be wrong because it is inside the filter.\n\nq is placed inside the filter object to avoid schema errors. The plan is now finalized. I will write the book content, update the kit for breathing, delete files, run tests, and ensure present.ts is complete for browser tests.\n\nPanels will be appended to ui.root. The modal state depends on menuOpen and attract mode. During attract, the director replaces device intents with bot output inside frame().\n\nModal mode during attract is safe because the director replaces empty device intents with bot output inside frame(). The simulation must not be paused during attract.\n\nThe inspector seed will be called once at the start of onFrame when the attract timer trips. This restarts the scene safely between frames.\n\nA flag will prevent reentrant seed calls during onFrame. The attract entry path sets the auto mode to attract and restarts the scene with the current seed. The exit path disables auto mode, restarts the scene again, and returns to the title screen.\n\nSave writes are restricted to non-attract play mode. Volumes will be persisted in the store under 'options'. The erase menu will use Yes/No buttons instead of confirm(). The auto mode defaults to off on first boot. When exiting attract, the code sets auto to off before restarting the scene so the new session starts clean. The director is only for test settings, not the page. The page passes an empty save object when beginning a game.\n\nContinue passes save fields. Free Play is disabled until the player has credits or has passed day one. The title menu lists Begin, Continue, Free Play, Group Class, Settings, and About.\n\nSettings will be split into two six-item pages. Page one covers Music, Effects, Voices, Icons, Assist, and Invert. Page two covers Sensitivity, Rumble, Motion, Fullscreen, Erase, and Controls.\n\nEleven settings items require pagination. The first page covers Music, Effects, Voices, Button icons, Steadier Hands, and More. The second page covers Mouse sensitivity, Invert look, Rumble, Reduced motion, Fullscreen, and More. The third page holds Erase Save, Controls, and Back. Mouse sensitivity will be a slider row rather than a simple menu toggle.\n\nSettings will use five labeled buttons per page plus a More option. Dev mode needs a live slider for browser tests. Music volume will be set to 0.1 and stored on __game.volumes.music. The Button icons row toggles between PlayStation and Xbox glyphs when the last device is a pad. createMenu manages focus by setting it to the current label on each update. Hover is built into the menu helper. A data-screen attribute will be added to the root element for test targeting. __game.focus will hold the active label string.\n\nThe shell will be about 450 lines. The HUD disc SVG will use the wobble component's center dot and a trail of eight recent positions. The breathing ring will come from wobble.lungs or the guide. Results will show one rank, one number, and one sentence above a two-row menu for Again and Carry on. Evening will display stamp text, a Sleep button, and an age remark.\n\nCredits will show a scroll of text with a Walk the island button. About will be paginated text with Next and Back buttons, not a six-item menu. Every source field and feedback answer must be visible in the DOM so tests can read them.\n\nThe About screen will be a single scrollable panel with 28px text. All source fields and feedback answers will be placed inside it so Playwright can locate them even if they overflow the viewport.\n\nThe About screen will be a tall scrollable column. The browser test will click Next until all pages are shown and verify text on each page. The plan's browser.log is my own output.\n\nThe About screen can scroll because the test only requires 28px text on visible nodes, not that all content fits in the viewport. Menu rows will be styled through injected CSS on the ui-item element.\n\nI will inject CSS into the document head at startup to override engine widget styles. The programme page will import the days module and display today's events. A new `act` helper will wrap inspector action calls.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e157cd55-bc2e-424a-b70e-10afa3c33c20-126","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function mount|parts\\[|member.id.split","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/members.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3372,"output_tokens":2500,"cache_read_input_tokens":158592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"cae7068c-222f-4d1e-a6c9-6ec7a9274506"}
