.ts","old_string":"  'pose.comma': 'The Sideways Comma. There are two seats. Visit both.',","new_string":"  'pose.comma': 'The Sideways Comma has two seats. Visit both.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fbddee8-003d-4863-8ae4-b52a53473569-14","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts","old_string":"  'pose.napkin': 'The Folded Napkin. A gull may land. That is in the pose.',","new_string":"  'pose.napkin': 'The Folded Napkin allows a gull to land. That is in the pose.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fbddee8-003d-4863-8ae4-b52a53473569-15","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts","old_string":"  'line.start': 'The line is a path. Your feet take turns. The wind does not.',","new_string":"  'line.start': 'The line is a path, and your feet take turns. The wind does not.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fbddee8-003d-4863-8ae4-b52a53473569-16","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts","old_string":"  'group.sash': 'Least Wobbly. The sash is imaginary. The feeling is not.',","new_string":"  'group.sash': 'Least Wobbly wears an imaginary sash. The feeling is not imaginary.',"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5fbddee8-003d-4863-8ae4-b52a53473569-17","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts","old_string":"  'tilt.east': 'Everyone east. Old Nan is already going. Try to be worth following.',","new_string":"  'tilt.east': 'Every