{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_335","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The lure ID is stored in act.text.\n\nThe page renders the LURES line as the on-screen fake text. The book's real sentences are separate. The 200 lines are in the book.\n\nThe menu lure will render as a fake \"Resume\" button instead of a real menu. The hub card uses HTML with no menus: Enter or Triangle triggers ready, and taps or clicks also count. I'm declaring minimal TypeScript interfaces on window for HubPlayer and HubInfo.\n\nThe AIHubClient interface is now fully defined. It covers connection, ready, answer, event listeners, time, progress, messaging, and results.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-31f65a0b-fbfc-4014-bf83-ddb7da07aca7-155","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"answer:|progress:|rng:|on:|time:|result:|send:|connect:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1482,"output_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":135040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"086580c8-7060-4472-97a1-08813c9ff65a"}
