{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_371","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The rng function returns a function that produces numbers.\n\nI'll call `hub.rng('card')` once to generate a decorative pebble count for the card. This satisfies the requirement that generated numbers come only from the hub RNG. The countdown will still use the card event.\n\nThe countdown is official hub data, not a random draw. I'll write stage.ts thoroughly and fix minor formatting issues.\n\nDesigning the `Page` interface with modal, frame, follow, and bind methods. The page is created before the engine so hub listeners are ready. Mouse deltas will be handled by window listeners inside `createPage`. Canvas access will be deferred to `bind`. I need to avoid calling `virtual.axis` before the engine exists.\n\nMenu updates must handle null input. Opening dev mode should resume the simulation so sliders are live. Pausing will not re-open an already open menu. Attract mode starts only on front menus or touch gates while flow is title or roam and no event is active. It stays off during settings or paused events.\n\nThe attract idle threshold is ten seconds of no input. When attract starts, it sets the game auto mode to attract and reseeds the inspector. The settings menu stays open if it was already active.\n\nAttract mode closes the menu when the screen is title or touch. Exiting attract resets the auto mode to off, resumes the inspector, reseeds it, and returns to the title or touch screen. Touch input does not exit attract. Gamepad polling in the frame loop checks button presses and notes the device when any button is pressed.\n\nAny pad button press exits attract mode, including the select button. The plan's rule to ignore engine pause while button 8 is held applies only during active play, not while attract is running. I am now implementing group seat claiming for the event screen.\n\nGamepad axes and buttons are mapped into claim and seats arrays for each seat. Null values passed to virtual.axis delete the axis. Mouse input handling is next.\n\nMouse deltas are only sent to the virtual axis while the pointer is locked. A `songOf` function selects the background music based on the current mode, defaulting to the lobby track and using a stamp track for results.\n\nThe `songOf` function now maps specific modes and events to background tracks. Credits and early tilt phases use the dawn song. Garden uses rake. Line and paddle use water. Tilt uses tilt. Morning, pose, group, and pond use stillness. Evening uses lobby. The default is lobby.\n\nA storm post-processing effect is applied when the tilt event is active but its phase is below three.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff8d02bf-cb68-4983-9aa6-043964287ba9-209","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/looks/retreat.ts","old_string":"defineLook('look:storm', {","new_string":"defineLook('look:dawn', {\n  description: 'The last light. The same toon line under the dawn sky.',\n  sky: 'sky:retreatDawn',\n  style: 'toon',\n  filters: {\n    bloom: { scope: 'all', strength: 0.4, threshold: 0.88 },\n    grade: { scope: 'all', brightness: 1.04, saturation: 0.84, lift: 0.04 },\n    outline: { scope: 'characters+objects', width: 1, darken: 0.2 },\n  },\n});\n\ndefineLook('look:storm', {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":542,"output_tokens":2015,"cache_read_input_tokens":197248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"2dc9ce6c-3893-4975-9d32-4db10417a2da"}
