tent\":\" * settings are never recorded. Split from scene.ts to keep each under 400 lines (ADR-0014 amendment 16).\"},{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\"import type { SettingChange, SettingValue } from '../core/settings';\"},{\"line_number\":66,\"content\":\" * (`settings`: set, setText, load, fromUrl, reset, override) are logged as `set` points: before each `set`, `act` and\"},{\"line_number\":79,\"content\":\"  /** Sets a setting between steps; a non-view change is recorded at this step (as is any change through `settings`). */\"},{\"line_number\":83,\"content\":\"   * checked, its settings set, then its run), all or nothing, then records it. Throws `SIM_NO_ACTION`, or\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"  const { world, settings } = run;\"},{\"line_number\":119,\"content\":\"  const start = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(options.settings ?? {}).filter(([path]) => !viewOf(path)));\"},{\"line_number\":123,\"content\":\"  let seen = settings.sim.values();\"},{\"line_number\":139,\"content\":\"    const now = settings.sim.values();\"},{\"line_number\":174,\"content\":\"      const change = settings.set(path, value);\"},{\"line_number\":192,\"content\":\"      const before = world.capture(); // the sim and its recorded settings: a throw puts both back\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\"        for (const [path, value] of Object.entries(engine?.settings(checked) ?? {})) settings.set(path, value);\"},{\"line_number\":202,\"content\":\"      if (!own && !changesSim(engine!)) return; // settings alone: recorded as set (view ones never)\"},{\"line_number\":230,\"content\":\"        settings: deserialize(serialize(start as Canonical)) as Record<string, SettingValue>,\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ae294e5f-e92d-4946-b3eb-9697e03bbc5f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_387","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`inspector.state()` returns a WorldState object that contains settings.\n\nLive values come from `inspector.state().settings[path]`. Defaults come from `describe('setting', path).fields.find(f => f.key === 'default').value`. View settings are excluded from state. Game tunables are simulation settings. I will write a `liveSetting` helper.\n\nThe `liveSetting` helper returns the live numeric value from `inspector.state().settings[path]`, or falls back to `defaultSetting(path)`. The latter reads the default from `describe('setting', path).fields.find(f => f.key === 'default').value`, defaulting to 0 if missing. Calling `state()` on every slider rebuild is acceptable because it only happens when opening the dev menu. Next up is the hub ghost protocol.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b909b80f-62ea-49e6-b26d-f5fa2f6e6c41-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"max-lines","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/eslint.config.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b909b80f-62ea-49e6-b26d-f5fa2f6e6c41-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub:session|ghost|round\\.go|progress","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b909b80f-62ea-49e6-b26d-f5fa2f6e6c41-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/round.ts","limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b909b80f-62ea-49e6-b26d-f5fa2f6e6c41-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt","limit":150}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3930,"output_tokens":714,"cache_read_input_tokens":67968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c52f5fc6-40a8-41bc-8f2c-66af2b1853d0"}
