{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_395","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need act.a, act.b, and act.c for the live group score.\n\nHub progress will show the live average of a, b, and c. Ghost messages will use classIndex as poseId. Axis data will be packed in groups of five.\n\nPlayer IDs map to seats 1, 2, and 3 in order, excluding the local player. Incoming ghost messages carry a score and a sender ID; the sender ID must be translated into a seat number.\n\nA message handler will store incoming ghost data keyed by sender ID. Each frame, the three other players are packed into the axis array with their seat number, a visibility flag that only activates when the ghost's class matches the current phase, and the ghost's x, y, and pose values.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34d3061a-a07c-4c87-a89a-9b6fb36cca75-67","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"defineComponent\\('mark'|mark:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34d3061a-a07c-4c87-a89a-9b6fb36cca75-68","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"kind: 'mark'|defineComponent\\('mark'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2185,"output_tokens":898,"cache_read_input_tokens":106624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0c84ac94-4fd0-4ca0-bd70-78b1999eb70b"}
