{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_400","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan requires name labels from the hub to be plain text, never HTML.\n\nui.label is the engine's world-anchored text overlay. It will be positioned at mat positions with player colors to display names on screen.\n\nSpawning colored crate props per ghost seat was considered but abandoned as too complex. Player names will instead be set directly on mark.text via a string intent in applyGhosts.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-39fa5d94-8b85-4a91-a033-21feb04ea5fd-78","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/ui/overlay.ts","offset":70,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":344,"output_tokens":451,"cache_read_input_tokens":114944,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0c4e5773-f22e-45fe-88f1-b6b7c8034b84"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-39fa5d94-8b85-4a91-a033-21feb04ea5fd-78","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"70→  'top-right',\\n  'bottom-left',\\n  'bottom',\\n  'bottom-right',\\n];\\n\\n/** How a HUD line is shown. */\\nexport interface HudOptions {\\n  /** Its place (`top-left`); lines in one place stack in the order they were first set. */\\n  at?: HudPlace;\\n80→  /** A key hint (false): marked `data-keyboard`, so touch screens hide it. */\\n  keys?: boolean;\\n  /** Its text colour (CSS). */\\n  color?: string;\\n}\\n\\n/** How an overlay is made. */\\nexport interface OverlayOptions {\\n  /** The canvas the game draws on: the overlay covers it, and follows its size and place each frame. */\\n  canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;\\n90→}\\n\\n/** The overlay over one canvas (see the file comment). */\\nexport interface Overlay {\\n  /** The root element (`.ui-overlay`), over the canvas. */\\n  readonly root: HTMLElement;\\n  /** Adds a label that follows a point in the world. */\\n  label(text: string, options: LabelOptions): Label;\\n  /** Shows a damage number, rising from `options.at` and stacking with the last (see engine/ui/labels.ts). */\\n  damage(value: number | string, options: DamageOptions): void;\\n100→  /** Sets the HUD line `id` to `text`; null or '' removes it. */\\n  hud(id: string, text: string | null, options?: HudOptions): void;\\n  /** Puts a widget's element (engine/ui/widgets.ts: a bar, hearts, a box) in the HUD place `at`, after what is there. */\\n  attach(element: HTMLElement, at?: HudPlace): void;\\n  /** Shows or hides the crosshair at the canvas's centre. */\\n  crosshair(on: boolean): void;\\n  /** Places everything for this frame: `camera` as drawn, `dt` seconds since the last frame. */\\n  update(camera: OverlayCamera, dt: number): void;\\n  /** The overlay's elements as text, places, boxes and visibility (engine/ui/state.ts). */\\n  state(): UiStat