{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_414","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ghost host-leave requires remaining copies to result in a played status.\n\nOn time-up, result() must be called immediately. Ghost messages and progress reports are sent on start. The engine stops on end. Math.random must not be used.\n\nCard Enter uses a window capture keydown listener. The harness sends a synthetic Enter event and the listener answers ready. Main calls AIHub.ready() after engine.ready(). The 14-second watchdog calls ready() regardless of engine state. Tests assert __engine.ready every frame. Calling ready() before the engine is ready would fail that assertion.\n\nIf WebGPU is unavailable, the engine will not be created and ready() will be skipped. Search keys are filtered to remove aihub prefixes, touch is disabled, post look is set to look:retreat, and cam3 defaults to chase when absent. Scene info uses game:round and the seed from info.seed. Storage mode is demo for replays or info, otherwise play, with a thumb-yoga prefix. Audio volume for music is set to 0.1 immediately, then saved preferences are applied if present. Touch detection uses a matchMedia query for coarse pointers without hover.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34a6d000-2621-4d0d-89c1-b15db4f63cd5-98","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"from ['\\\"].*/(play|best|bot|player)['\\\"]|cast/player|scenes/play","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-34a6d000-2621-4d0d-89c1-b15db4f63cd5-99","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"game\\.gems|play\\.ts|best\\.ts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656","glob":"*.{ts,json,mjs}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2770