s, the way\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/play.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * Game code, sim-side: it imports only engine/sim-api.ts, so `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts` runs it in Node.\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\" * // node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --steps 600\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\" * // node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --set game.gems=3 --seed 7\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"export const ARENA = compileLevel(ARENA_TEXT, { file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts', name: 'arena' });\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"/** The game's settings: each is reachable through `x set`, URL parameters (`?game.gems=3`) and `__engine.set`. */\"},{\"line_number\":62,\"content\":\"  'game.gems': {\"},{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"    const gems = w.settings.get<number>('game.gems');\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The starter game's tests (labs/game/scenes/play.ts): what every game made from it starts with, and keeps as it\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * @see labs/game/scenes/play.ts\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"    const engine = await createHeadless({ scene: play, settings: { 'game.seconds': 5, 'game.gems': 3 } });\"},{\"line_number\":85,\"content\":\"    const engine = await createHeadless({ scene: twin, settings: { 'game.gems': 1 } }); // no neighbour within reach\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * the scene `game:play` (labs/game/scenes/play.ts) with the arena's text registered for the view, offers the bot's\"},{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * the controls, the best round kept across sessions (labs/game/best.ts, through the engine's store) and, when the\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * Open it at http://127.0.0.1:5173/labs/game/ (`npm run dev`): `?seed=7&game.gems=20` plays another round,\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"  levels: { 'level:arena': { text: ARENA_TEXT, file: 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts' } },\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/intents.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"    doc: 'Raised by `normalizeIntents`, `applyIntents` and the replay checks (engine/input/intents.ts, engine/sim/replay.ts) for an unknown key (named with the closest), a non-finite or misshapen number, a button that is not a non-empty string, or a custom value that is not plain data. Every problem is listed at once.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/cast/player.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * spawn them. `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel` measures how the player handles: response, top speed, the\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * @see labs/game/scenes/play.ts\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/best.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file Tests for the starter game's best round (labs/game/best.ts, PLAN.md WP 10.9's Done-when: \\\"the starter game keeps\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/box/scenes/clips.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\" * under data/anim/sets/ before