less` (WP 1.6) all start scenes here, so no scene imports `app/`; engine/sim/replay.ts plays them.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/session.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * The kernel fixture, the box's scenes and `createHeadless` (WP 1.6) all record through it; engine/sim/replay.ts plays\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\" * Invariants: the recording is plain data, from step 0, and replays to the same hashes (engine/sim/replay.ts); view\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/feel/course.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * such as a scene's `place` among them, engine/sim/replay.ts), and the numbers to measure on the run, each against its\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"    description: 'Change-points [step, change], as a replay’s (engine/sim/replay.ts): after that many steps, before the next.', // prettier-ignore\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/feel/run.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * as a replay plays (engine/sim/replay.ts: setting values, dev actions, then intents, at each change-point), samples\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0f0472c6-9f74-4253-9161-52d3cfd29557"}
