{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_417","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"npm test runs all **/*.test.ts files, including engine tests.\n\nDeleting play.test.ts avoids conflicts with starter tests. The engine registry is a singleton, so loading both play.ts and the starter in the same Vitest worker could cause collisions.\n\nStarter tests can remain because their registry paths and scene IDs do not overlap. The plan still calls for deletion to keep the game focused on retreat.\n\nThe full npm test suite may take many minutes. I will run it as required and save the log.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f15a2303-4ead-409f-81a7-e2f00aab9e75-103","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"play\\.ts|starter","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/check.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1425,"output_tokens":551,"cache_read_input_tokens":148224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"7cb8833c-37a0-4026-8858-b91a9693e3d1"}
