\\nDELETED\\n---GREP PLAY---\\nAGENTS.md:24:4. See it without a screen: `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts` (the hash and the events), `node x shot labs/game`\\nlabs/game/README.md:16:| labs/game/scenes/play.ts          | The rules, sim-side: the arena's text, the settings, the gems, the round, the systems |\\nlabs/game/README.md:17:| labs/game/cast/player.ts          | The player: its character (run, jump, dash) and the body it is drawn as        |\\nlabs/game/README.md:18:| labs/game/bot.ts                  | The bot: plays through intents, down the flow field to the nearest gem         |\\nlabs/game/README.md:20:| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts     | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock |\\nlabs/game/README.md:33:node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts --feel          # the rules in Node: hash, events, how the player handles\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:88:| labs/game/scenes/play.ts     | The rules: a level as text, settings, components (`gem`, `round`), systems, a random stream, events |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:89:| labs/game/cast/player.ts     | The player: a character on the controller (run, jump, dash) drawn as the humanoid          |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:90:| labs/game/bot.ts             | A bot that plays through intents, steering down a flow field to the nearest gem            |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:92:| labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts | The tests: the golden replay, capture and restore, the bot wins on 10 seeds, the clock     |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:103:| A level                        | A text map in a scene module; `compileLevel`, glyphs (`#` wall, `.` floor, `@` spawn, `w` low wall, `P` pillar, `^` stairs, `=` gallery, `o` dais, `t` brazier), `defineGlyph` for your own; `addLevelBodies`; the page registers the text (`createEngine({ levels })`); a building of storeys: `node x new level`; buildings on a terrain: `defineSite`, `addSiteBodies` | labs/game/scenes/play.ts, labs/box/levels/hall.txt, labs/playground/levels/site.ts |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:104:| A player or character          | `createCharacter` (speed, jump, dash, coyote time, buffer), `spawnActor`, `measureFeel`; Apex's movement, `{ movement: 'movement:apex' }`, or your own: `defineMovement` (`node x new movement`); `node x feel`, `createFeelPanel` | labs/game/cast/player.ts, labs/box/cast/hero.ts, labs/playground/cast/player.ts |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:121:Saves, high scores and settings go in the page's store (`createStore`, never read by the sim), as labs/game/best.ts\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:152:| `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts [--steps n] [--seed s] [--set k=v] [--feel]` | Runs a scene in Node: its hash, events, entities; `--feel` measures the player |\\ndocs/GAME-GUIDE.md:155:| `node x eye labs/game/scenes/play.ts [--cam code] [--steps n]` | What a camera sees of the bodies, in Node with no GPU: a text picture and its legend (`__engine.eye()` in a page) |\\ntools/game/files.mjs:24: * ownerOf('labs/game/scenes/play.ts'); // 'game'\\ntools/templates/scene/template.json:12:  \\\"games\\\": \\\"this kind makes the box's scenes, on the box room's level; a game's new scene starts as a copy of labs/game/scenes/play.ts and its test, with a scene id of its own, and the page lists it in createEngine({ scenes })\\\"\\ntools/game/template/AGENTS.md.tmpl:24:4. See it without a screen: `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts` (the hash and the events), `node x shot labs/game`\\ntools/cmd/engine.ts:129:      ['sim', process.execPath, ['x', 'sim', 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts', '--steps', '600']],\\ndocs/API.md:8338:### [`labs/game/best.ts`](../labs/game/best.ts)\\ndocs/API.md:8344:### [`labs/game/bot.ts`](../labs/game/bot.ts)\\ndocs/API.md:8354:### [`labs/game/cast/player.ts`](../labs/game/cast/player.ts)\\ndocs/API.md:8361:### [`labs/game/scenes/play.ts`](../labs/game/scenes/play.ts)\\ndocs/API.md:8449:### [`labs/playground/cast/player.ts`](../labs/playground/cast/player.ts)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\\\" && rm -f labs/game/scenes/play.ts labs/game/scenes/play.test.ts labs/game/best.ts labs/game/best.test.ts labs/game/bot.ts labs/game/cast/player.ts labs/game/replays/bot.replay.json && ls labs/game/scenes/bot.ts && echo \\\"DELETED\\\" && ls labs/game/replays 2>&1; echo \\\"---GREP PLAY---\\\"; rg -n \\\"scenes/play|labs/game/best|labs/game/bot|cast/player\\\" --glob '!node_modules' --glob '!engine/**' -g '!**/dist/**' | head -40\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Delete starter gem files; find leftover imports\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/call-504177d9-d9e7-4bff-8971-24f773c6f84c-2.log\",\"total_bytes\":3897}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"443fa6bd-c916-4f23-91b5-efd882c6cc18"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_455","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`x engine test` builds a fresh game from the template, so deleting `play.ts` won't break `npm run check` if the check command doesn't invoke the engine test with the play scene.\n\nI need to check package.json and checkAll.ts to see if `npm run check` invokes `x engine test`, which would fail without `play.ts`. Engine docs should not be rewritten; only the game README needs updating for hand-in.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fb715c7a-4e1a-48af-b476-5dcf7e6ceae5-3","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"from ['\\\"].*/(play|best|bot)['\\\"]|scenes/play|labs/game/best|labs/game/bot['\\\"]","glob":"*.{ts,mjs,json}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fb715c7a-4e1a-48af-b476-5dcf7e6ceae5-4","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\"check\"|\"test\"","glob":"package.json","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1659,"output_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":37120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"25c3264a-bd42-4d6b-9820-3c78da22cbec"}
