{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_465","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The dev folder is inside the cc-matrix git repository, not a separate one.\n\n`x check` runs `git ls-files` from the game directory. If that directory is not a git root, git walks up to the parent cc-matrix repository and lists files relative to it.\n\n`git ls-files` lists paths relative to the repository root, not the current working directory. The engine expects to be its own git repository. Without `git init` in the dev folder, `x check` may scan the parent cc-matrix repository or fail.\n\n`git ls-files` returns paths relative to the repository root even when run from a subdirectory. The engine then checks `existsSync(join(root, file))`, which looks inside the game folder. Most of those paths do not exist there, so they are filtered out.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0466491c-10ca-4002-97e0-d398c02a5a75-19","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\" && npx prettier --write labs/game/ui/snap.ts labs/game/ui/hub.ts labs/game/ui/menus.ts labs/game/ui/stage.ts labs/game/main.ts labs/game/scenes/events/group.ts labs/game/scenes/round.ts labs/game/index.html labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs >/dev/null && npx tsc -b tsconfig.check.json --pretty false --pretty false 2>&1 | rg -n \"labs/game/(ui|main|scenes/events/group|scenes/round|hub)\" | head -80; echo \"TSC_EXIT:${PIPESTATUS[0]}\"","description":"Format page files and typecheck game errors"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1185,"output_tokens":1199,"cache_read_input_tokens":51456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"58fe1d53-779d-4067-840a-40eeb482ae27"}
