{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_475","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The import path is wrong.\n\nTests importing these modules somehow passed despite the incorrect paths. The test runner's module resolution might be unusual.\n\nThe tests were likely passing before the import paths broke. I will fix them by replacing `../../../engine/sim-api` with `../../../../engine/sim-api` in all event files, leaving other relative imports untouched.\n\nI will also fix the Act cast in driver.ts, the mark text in round.ts, and the hidden flag in main.ts. Then I will run eslint and a targeted vitest.\n\nThe `act` field in driver.ts needs an explicit cast to `Record<string, unknown>`. Changing the `Act` interface itself to include that index signature is another option, though it might break other assignments.\n\nI decided against changing the `Act` interface. Adding an intersection with `Record<string, unknown>` would break other assignments where specific objects are used. I will keep the cast at the spawn site in driver.ts.\n\nOnly `emptyAct()` needs the `act` cast. Other spawn sites use object literals that TypeScript accepts. The boot flow object is fine because `Partial` allows missing fields. Stage.ts and menus typecheck correctly. I will fix imports first, then run eslint on the UI files.\n\nI will also check group.ts for the `fed` rename and any lint issues. Max-lines warnings are harmless because eslint exits 0 on them. I will run eslint after fixing imports to catch sim-side bans like Math.random. Only the nine event files need import fixes; no other labs/game files have the wrong depth.\n\nquerySelector<HTMLElement> correctly exposes the hidden property. I will apply all fixes now, run eslint and a targeted vitest, then continue building verify.mjs, tests, onefile, browser, and hand-in docs.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Event modules import the engine one directory too high, so the typecheck fails. I'll fix that and the other type errors."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fa21b8b-452a-44a4-a727-62eff3752798-41","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\" && python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nroot = Path('labs/game/scenes/events')\nfor p in root.glob('*.ts'):\n    text = p.read_text()\n    new = text.replace(\"from '../../../engine/sim-api'\", \"from '../../../../engine/sim-api'\")\n    if new != text:\n        p.write_text(new)\n        print('updated', p)\n    else:\n        print('unchanged', p)\nPY","description":"Fix event module engine import depth"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fa21b8b-452a-44a4-a727-62eff3752798-42","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","old_string":"    act: emptyAct(),","new_string":"    act: emptyAct() as Record<string, unknown>,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fa21b8b-452a-44a4-a727-62eff3752798-43","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/round.ts","old_string":"  mark?: { x: number; z: number; y: number };","new_string":"  mark?: { x: number; z: number; y: number; text: string };"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0fa21b8b-452a-44a4-a727-62eff3752798-44","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts","old_string":"const msg = document.querySelector('#msg');","new_string":"const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6