{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-10da1b83-51d2-4f55-91d6-002c0097e330-74","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-10da1b83-51d2-4f55-91d6-002c0097e330-75","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The replay test of the box scene `box:{{name}}` ({{id}}.ts): 600 steps give the same hash three times, the\\n * run's recording replays to the same hashes at every checkpoint (as `x replay` checks a replay file), and its\\n * setting changes the run.\\n *\\n * Keep a replay with its goldens too (labs/box/README.md, \\\"Adding a scene or a variant\\\"):\\n * 1. `node x sim {{id}}.ts --steps 600`;\\n * 2. copy out/sim/box-{{name}}/run.replay.json to tests/replays/box-<stage>-{{name}}.replay.json;\\n * 3. `node x replay <file> --browser sim --update` records its goldens, in Node and Chromium;\\n10→ * 4. `node x replay <file> --browser page` checks them while the page renders;\\n * 5. list the scene and its replay in labs/box/README.md;\\n * 6. when it belongs to a stage, add it to `STAGES` in tests/e2e/parity-stages.ts: T2 plays only the replays named there.\\n * @see {{id}}.ts\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\\nimport { {{name}} } from './{{name}}';\\n\\ndescribe('box:{{name}}', () => {\\n20→  it('gives the same hash three times, and its recording replays to the same hashes', async () => {\\n    const live = async () => {\\n      const engine = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n      const hashes: Record<string, string> = { 0: engine.hash() };\\n      for (let k = 60; k <= 600; k += 60) hashes[k] = (engine.step(60), engine.hash());\\n      return { engine, hashes };\\n    };\\n    const runs = [await live(), await live(), await live()];\\n    expect(runs[1].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n    expect(runs[2].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n30→    const recorded = (runs[0].engine.input as { record(): object }).record();\\n    const replay = JSON.stringify({ ...recorded, hashes: { [`${process.platform}-${process.arch}`]: runs[0].hashes } });\\n    const again = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const played = await (again.replay as (text: string) => Promise<{ hashes: object }>)(replay);\\n    expect(played.hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('is tuned by box.{{name}}.speed', async () => {\\n    const slow = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const fast = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}}, settings: { 'box.{{name}}.speed': 3 } });\\n40→    slow.step(60);\\n    fast.step(60);\\n    expect(fast.hash()).not.toBe(slow.hash());\\n  });\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The replay test of the box scene `box:{{name}}` ({{id}}.ts): 600 steps give the same hash three times, the\\n * run's recording replays to the same hashes at every checkpoint (as `x replay` checks a replay file), and its\\n * setting changes the run.\\n *\\n * Keep a replay with its goldens too (labs/box/README.md, \\\"Adding a scene or a variant\\\"):\\n * 1. `node x sim {{id}}.ts --steps 600`;\\n * 2. copy out/sim/box-{{name}}/run.replay.json to tests/replays/box-<stage>-{{name}}.replay.json;\\n * 3. `node x replay <file> --browser sim --update` records its goldens, in Node and Chromium;\\n10→ * 4. `node x replay <file> --browser page` checks them while the page renders;\\n * 5. list the scene and its replay in labs/box/README.md;\\n * 6. when it belongs to a stage, add it to `STAGES` in tests/e2e/parity-stages.ts: T2 plays only the replays named there.\\n * @see {{id}}.ts\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\\nimport { {{name}} } from './{{name}}';\\n\\ndescribe('box:{{name}}', () => {\\n20→  it('gives the same hash three times, and its recording replays to the same hashes', async () => {\\n    const live = async () => {\\n      const engine = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n      const hashes: Record<string, string> = { 0: engine.hash() };\\n      for (let k = 60; k <= 600; k += 60) hashes[k] = (engine.step(60), engine.hash());\\n      return { engine, hashes };\\n    };\\n    const runs = [await live(), await live(), await live()];\\n    expect(runs[1].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n    expect(runs[2].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n30→    const recorded = (runs[0].engine.input as { record(): object }).record();\\n    const replay = JSON.stringify({ ...recorded, hashes: { [`${process.platform}-${process.arch}`]: runs[0].hashes } });\\n    const again = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const played = await (again.replay as (text: string) => Promise<{ hashes: object }>)(replay);\\n    expect(played.hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('is tuned by box.{{name}}.speed', async () => {\\n    const slow = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const fast = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}}, settings: { 'box.{{name}}.speed': 3 } });\\n40→    slow.step(60);\\n    fast.step(60);\\n    expect(fast.hash()).not.toBe(slow.hash());\\n  });\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/templates/scene/scene.test.ts.tmpl\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The replay test of the box scene `box:{{name}}` ({{id}}.ts): 600 steps give the same hash three times, the\\n * run's recording replays to the same hashes at every checkpoint (as `x replay` checks a replay file), and its\\n * setting changes the run.\\n *\\n * Keep a replay with its goldens too (labs/box/README.md, \\\"Adding a scene or a variant\\\"):\\n * 1. `node x sim {{id}}.ts --steps 600`;\\n * 2. copy out/sim/box-{{name}}/run.replay.json to tests/replays/box-<stage>-{{name}}.replay.json;\\n * 3. `node x replay <file> --browser sim --update` records its goldens, in Node and Chromium;\\n * 4. `node x replay <file> --browser page` checks them while the page renders;\\n * 5. list the scene and its replay in labs/box/README.md;\\n * 6. when it belongs to a stage, add it to `STAGES` in tests/e2e/parity-stages.ts: T2 plays only the replays named there.\\n * @see {{id}}.ts\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport { createHeadless } from '../../../engine';\\nimport { {{name}} } from './{{name}}';\\n\\ndescribe('box:{{name}}', () => {\\n  it('gives the same hash three times, and its recording replays to the same hashes', async () => {\\n    const live = async () => {\\n      const engine = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n      const hashes: Record<string, string> = { 0: engine.hash() };\\n      for (let k = 60; k <= 600; k += 60) hashes[k] = (engine.step(60), engine.hash());\\n      return { engine, hashes };\\n    };\\n    const runs = [await live(), await live(), await live()];\\n    expect(runs[1].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n    expect(runs[2].hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n    const recorded = (runs[0].engine.input as { record(): object }).record();\\n    const replay = JSON.stringify({ ...recorded, hashes: { [`${process.platform}-${process.arch}`]: runs[0].hashes } });\\n    const again = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const played = await (again.replay as (text: string) => Promise<{ hashes: object }>)(replay);\\n    expect(played.hashes).toEqual(runs[0].hashes);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('is tuned by box.{{name}}.speed', async () => {\\n    const slow = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}} });\\n    const fast = await createHeadless({ scene: {{name}}, settings: { 'box.{{name}}.speed': 3 } });\\n    slow.step(60);\\n    fast.step(60);\\n    expect(fast.hash()).not.toBe(slow.hash());\\n  });\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":44}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ee306dac-4b48-4034-bf72-2156cc2c8dbd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_492","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Replay goldens might be located in tests/replays.\n\nNo goldens were found in tests/replays. I will create one and run `node x replay` on it. The plan calls for browser simulation, so I will launch Chromium.\n\nI will run `node x sim` on bench.ts to generate a replay file. I will copy it to labs/game/replays/still.replay.json and update it with `node x replay --browser sim`. I also need to check the capture/restore API so verify can run in node if browser simulation is too slow.\n\nI will capture the replay exit code and print a clean pass or fail message. A short replay should run quickly even with Chromium. I also need to fix ESLint @file tags in the hub JS files.\n\nI will run Prettier on the modified JS files. I will run island and retreat tests to verify imports. I will review menus.ts for title flow, dev slider, and about screen logic. I will also check for an audio test.\n\nonefile.mjs passed ESLint. I will re-run ESLint on garden and stage. I will also verify snap.ts songFor and readSnap. A group band test will be included.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b59b3ac-37b9-42fb-84ad-2e5f940ca944-76","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"credits|director|describe\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b59b3ac-37b9-42fb-84ad-2e5f940ca944-77","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"describe\\(|it\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.test.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1006,"output_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":104960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ad550af1-3b12-4123-a20d-2bb668fa3632"}
