{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-834c6903-0dfd-4d99-87ed-1b9ff7016e01-89","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"120→\\n/** No touch controls: off touch screens. */\\nconst NO_CIRCLES = { buttons: [] as number[][], menu: null };\\n\\n/** The overlay's stylesheet (see the file comment). */\\nconst STYLE = `\\n.ui-overlay { position: fixed; left: 0; top: 0; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; contain: strict;\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n  font: 600 16px/1.2 system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #f0e3c6;\\n  -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none; }\\n130→.touch .ui-overlay { font-size: calc(var(--touch-k, 1) * 16px); }\\n.ui-overlay [hidden] { display: none !important; }\\n.touch .ui-overlay [data-keyboard] { display: none !important; }\\n.ui-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\\n.ui-at { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; white-space: nowrap;\\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px)); }\\n.ui-label { padding: 0.1em 0.4em; border-radius: 0.3em; background: rgba(11, 8, 20, 0.55); font-size: 0.8125em;\\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 1px #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage { transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% - var(--ui-slot, 0) * 100%))\\n  translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px));\\n140→  font-size: calc(var(--ui-scale, 1) * 1.25em); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: #fff2c4;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #0b0814, 1px -1px 0 #0b0814, -1px 1px 0 #0b0814,\\n  1px 1px 0 #0b0814, 0 2px 0 #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage > span { display: inline-block; animation-name: ui-damage-pop, ui-damage-blink;\\n  animation-duration: calc(var(--ui-life, 0.8) * 1s); animation-timing-function: ease-out, step-end;\\n  animation-delay: calc(var(--ui-age, 0) * -1s); animation-fill-mode: both; animation-play-state: paused; }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-pop { 0% { transform: scale(1.45); } 18%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-blink { 0% { opacity: 1; } 75% { opacity: 0; } 81.25% { opacity: 1; } 87.5% { opacity: 0; }\\n  93.75%, 100% { opacity: 1; } }\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ui-damage > span { animation-name: none; } }\",\"content_concise\":\"120→\\n/** No touch controls: off touch screens. */\\nconst NO_CIRCLES = { buttons: [] as number[][], menu: null };\\n\\n/** The overlay's stylesheet (see the file comment). */\\nconst STYLE = `\\n.ui-overlay { position: fixed; left: 0; top: 0; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; contain: strict;\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n  font: 600 16px/1.2 system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #f0e3c6;\\n  -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none; }\\n130→.touch .ui-overlay { font-size: calc(var(--touch-k, 1) * 16px); }\\n.ui-overlay [hidden] { display: none !important; }\\n.touch .ui-overlay [data-keyboard] { display: none !important; }\\n.ui-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\\n.ui-at { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; white-space: nowrap;\\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px)); }\\n.ui-label { padding: 0.1em 0.4em; border-radius: 0.3em; background: rgba(11, 8, 20, 0.55); font-size: 0.8125em;\\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 1px #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage { transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% - var(--ui-slot, 0) * 100%))\\n  translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px));\\n140→  font-size: calc(var(--ui-scale, 1) * 1.25em); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: #fff2c4;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #0b0814, 1px -1px 0 #0b0814, -1px 1px 0 #0b0814,\\n  1px 1px 0 #0b0814, 0 2px 0 #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage > span { display: inline-block; animation-name: ui-damage-pop, ui-damage-blink;\\n  animation-duration: calc(var(--ui-life, 0.8) * 1s); animation-timing-function: ease-out, step-end;\\n  animation-delay: calc(var(--ui-age, 0) * -1s); animation-fill-mode: both; animation-play-state: paused; }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-pop { 0% { transform: scale(1.45); } 18%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-blink { 0% { opacity: 1; } 75% { opacity: 0; } 81.25% { opacity: 1; } 87.5% { opacity: 0; }\\n  93.75%, 100% { opacity: 1; } }\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ui-damage > span { animation-name: none; } }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/ui/overlay.ts\",\"offset\":120,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"\\n/** No touch controls: off touch screens. */\\nconst NO_CIRCLES = { buttons: [] as number[][], menu: null };\\n\\n/** The overlay's stylesheet (see the file comment). */\\nconst STYLE = `\\n.ui-overlay { position: fixed; left: 0; top: 0; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; contain: strict;\\n  pointer-events: none;\\n  font: 600 16px/1.2 system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; color: #f0e3c6;\\n  -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none; }\\n.touch .ui-overlay { font-size: calc(var(--touch-k, 1) * 16px); }\\n.ui-overlay [hidden] { display: none !important; }\\n.touch .ui-overlay [data-keyboard] { display: none !important; }\\n.ui-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\\n.ui-at { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; white-space: nowrap;\\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px)); }\\n.ui-label { padding: 0.1em 0.4em; border-radius: 0.3em; background: rgba(11, 8, 20, 0.55); font-size: 0.8125em;\\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 1px #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage { transform: translate(-50%, calc(-50% - var(--ui-slot, 0) * 100%))\\n  translate(calc(var(--ui-x, 0) * 1px), calc(var(--ui-y, 0) * 1px));\\n  font-size: calc(var(--ui-scale, 1) * 1.25em); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: #fff2c4;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #0b0814, 1px -1px 0 #0b0814, -1px 1px 0 #0b0814,\\n  1px 1px 0 #0b0814, 0 2px 0 #0b0814; }\\n.ui-damage > span { display: inline-block; animation-name: ui-damage-pop, ui-damage-blink;\\n  animation-duration: calc(var(--ui-life, 0.8) * 1s); animation-timing-function: ease-out, step-end;\\n  animation-delay: calc(var(--ui-age, 0) * -1s); animation-fill-mode: both; animation-play-state: paused; }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-pop { 0% { transform: scale(1.45); } 18%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } }\\n@keyframes ui-damage-blink { 0% { opacity: 1; } 75% { opacity: 0; } 81.25% { opacity: 1; } 87.5% { opacity: 0; }\\n  93.75%, 100% { opacity: 1; } }\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ui-damage > span { animation-name: none; } }\\n\",\"total_lines\":309}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"4d3a2645-d1b7-49c2-be9b-e30609606beb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_500","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The overlay uses a 16px font weight 600.\n\nThe overlay's `font` shorthand sets font-size. The `[data-ui]` rule with `!important` overrides it on matching elements. Menu items get 28px.\n\n`.ui-label` elements without `data-ui` inherit 13px from the overlay. The test requires every visible text node to be at least 28px. I need to check what text the engine draws by default, such as FPS or debug info. The HUD may be empty in single player. A touch stick might still appear even with `touch=off`.\n\nThe plan confirms touch=off removes the stick. The canvas likely has no text. Hidden elements like #msg are not visible and will be skipped by the test. Shell text is already 28px. A watermark might appear during testing. If any text node under `.ui-overlay` lacks `data-ui`, a broader CSS rule may be needed.\n\nA broader rule targeting `.ui-overlay` and all descendants with `!important` will ensure every text node meets the 28px minimum. Engine styles injected after ours could otherwise override the smaller font sizes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c489adb3-0520-489a-b7dc-32f7b93103d7-90","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"touch-stick|data-touch|ui-stick|circles","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/ui","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c489adb3-0520-489a-b7dc-32f7b93103d7-91","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/glyphs.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c489adb3-0520-489a-b7dc-32f7b93103d7-92","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/about-data.ts","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1038,"output_tokens":1021,"cache_read_input_tokens":120832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d28c010a-07c8-4945-b895-6783e1de5cd7"}
