evel (0 to 1) while the gate is open, `i` samples in. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/audio/data/song.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":308,\"content\":\" * One pass of the song as mono samples (engine/audio/dsp/render.ts): at least the pass's length, so passes played\"},{\"line_number\":312,\"content\":\"export function renderSong(song: string | Song, options: SongRenderOptions = {}): Float32Array {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/audio/dsp/pluck.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * line whose loop averages neighbouring samples, so it rings like a plucked string and darkens as it decays. The\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" * Invariants: the loop delay is rate / freq samples: the whole-sample line, plus half a sample for the two-point\"},{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * drawn from the `Rng` handed in and has no DC. The pitch is fixed. The line is at least two samples long, so a pitch\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/audio/dsp/synth.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file One voice rendered into samples (PLAN.md WP 9.1): the pitch path (an exponential sweep, the arpeggio's steps,\"},{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * the stream named `noise`/`pluck` and the voice's index, so adding a voice never changes another's samples. `Math`\"},{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\"/** The voice's length in samples, without its echo. */\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"/** Where the voice ends in the sound, in samples, its echo included. */\"},{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"/** The pitch in Hz at each of the voice's `n` samples. */\"},{\"line_number\":104,\"content\":\"/** Filters `samples` in place with the voice's filter, if it has one. */\"},{\"line_number\":105,\"content\":\"function filtered(voice: NormalVoice, samples: Float64Array, pitch: Float64Array, rate: number): void {\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"  const freq = spec.freq > 0 ? sweep(spec.freq, spec.to, samples.length) : pitch;\"},{\"line_number\":110,\"content\":\"  for (let i = 0; i < samples.length; i++) {\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"    samples[i] = biquad.process(samples[i]);\"},{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"  const samples = source(voice, pitch, streams, rate);\"},{\"line_number\":122,\"content\":\"  filtered(voice, samples, pitch, rate);\"},{\"line_number\":124,\"content\":\"  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) samples[i] *= gain[i];\"},{\"line_number\":125,\"content\":\"  const done = voice.delay ? echo(samples, voice.delay, rate) : samples;\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"4bf93ba9-1fa8-448e-95f0-14a2fb1b3ad0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_505","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Adding a non-zero sample check.\n\nImplementing small fixes and writing verify.mjs. Silent songs will fail the test. Considering how to handle replay recording, either via node capture or Chromium-based update.\n\nWill generate a short replay file and run `node x replay` with the sim browser to compare goldens. The replay JSON format is being checked against the template test.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ae769976-bbe3-4a92-a6c5-5212ad37361a-100","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export interface Replay|scene:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/replay.ts","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ae769976-bbe3-4a92-a6c5-5212ad37361a-101","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/bench.ts","limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1886,"output_tokens":540,"cache_read_input_tokens":130688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"74352f6b-c118-4a23-9bcb-4663fb9a45e0"}
