{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_513","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"hub.ts compiled successfully despite a possible missing HUD module.\n\nThe HUD type is confirmed valid. Next steps are implementing code changes, writing verify.mjs and a Python browser script, updating testing feedback, director logs, audio checks, prompts, CSS, and the hub file header. Island and audio tests will start while verify is being written.\n\nEvaluating how to run the replay test via `node x sim` or a headless recorder. Will check if the bench simulation runs quickly with 30 steps. Also starting batch file edits, including a promptLine change in glyphs.ts.\n\nThe promptLine function now returns a two-sentence string for PlayStation and Xbox controllers. It maps each glyph set to its specific button labels.\n\nThe promptLine function now returns a two-sentence string for PlayStation and Xbox controllers. It maps each glyph set to its specific button labels. Keys and mouse keep the second form which mentions WASD, Q and E, Space, Click, and Mouse.\n\nstage.ts paint logic now shows the controller prompt in menu screens. The note element displays the prompt line for open menus and the attract sentence otherwise. This ensures the glyph test on the title menu renders the correct prompt immediately.\n\nThe glyphSet state updates immediately on keydown, before the next frame. The note element will also be updated directly in noteDevice so the DOM text changes in the same event.\n\napplyPrefs now sets the glyphSet and updates the note element to show the prompt line when preferences are applied.\n\nThe settings menu is a menu screen, so showing the controller prompt there is acceptable even during play. At boot, applyPrefs sets the prompt before showTitle opens the menu. For the dev slider test, changing a slider triggers inspector.set and reset restores defaults; the test will likely read the setting through a debug hook.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6fed7e59-29ae-4a33-a923-a1f862f2a491-112","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"__engine","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app","glob":"**/*.ts","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":509,"output_tokens":1434,"cache_read_input_tokens":146432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"7f432601-ce31-47b7-ab24-cffca555337f"}
