put/devices/inspector'; // registers `__engine.input` too\"},{\"line_number\":66,\"content\":\"import '../dev/eye'; // the agent eye's member: __engine.eye in a page and headless alike\"},{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"import '../dev/galleryShoot'; // the gallery's members: __engine.gallery in a page and headless alike\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"/** A headless engine: `__engine`'s members, over a scene running in this process. */\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"  /** The renderer's counts for `__engine.stats()`, null before it started. */\"},{\"line_number\":278,\"content\":\"        // No intents: what the virtual device holds (`__engine.input`), taken each step as the page's input is.\"},{\"line_number\":340,\"content\":\" * Starts a scene headless, in this process, and returns its inspector: the members a page's `window.__engine` has\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/lookMember.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * // __engine.set('post.combine', '[{\\\"look\\\":\\\"look:cinematic\\\"}]');\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\" * // __engine.look().filters.letterbox; // { scope: 'all', amount: 1, aspect: 2.39, color: '#000000' }\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/animMember.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" * engine/app/feelMember.ts is), so `createHeadless` and `window.__engine` both list it.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/routes.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" *   and `__engine.set` reach the same settings the same way. `routeQuery` writes a query back.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/viewMembers.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * kind `inspectorMember` (engine/dev/members.ts), so `window.__engine` in a page and `createHeadless` in Node list the\"},{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\" * // __engine.camera.set('cam=topdown').describe; // what the camera shows, in words\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\" * // __engine.scene.dump({ filter: 'wall', depth: 2 }); // the walls, one line each\"},{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\" * // await __engine.replay(text, { every: true }); // { hashes, hash, steps, frames, scene }\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/view.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\" * view state: switching one (`setCamera(code)`, `__engine.camera.set`; `{ blend: true }` blends it in), moving it on\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/drawing.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"  /** The value setting `key` has now, view settings among them (`x set`, `__engine.set`, the URL). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/engine.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\" * as `window.__engine`, starts the renderer (WebGPU or nothing, engine/gfx/renderer.ts) and the post-processing chain\"},{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\" * into intents (engine/input/input.ts; `__engine.input` drives the same session), fixed steps from the clock, the\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\" * Ready or error (§8.3): `__engine.ready` turns true once the first frame is done on the GPU, never after a startup\"},{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * error; every failure (a frame that throws stops the loop) is one record in `__engine.errors` (the log's), shown as\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * (`GFX_NO_WEBGPU`) the sim still runs, and `__engine` still steps it; only `render` and `shot` throw.\"},{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\" * Every frame drawn is timed by the run's stats meter, which reads the renderer's counts (`__engine.stats()`,\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"    fix: 'the console names the cause; reload the page to start again, or read __engine.state() to see where the run stands',\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"    fix: 'read __engine.errors for GFX_WARMUP_FAILED; node x shot <page> reports it headless',\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"  /** The inspector, also `window.__engine`; null when the scene could not start. */\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"f76574c2-80ba-43cb-a680-da5f765ca334"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_514","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation still runs even when `GFX_NO_WEBGPU` is set.\n\n`engine.ready` becomes true only after the first GPU frame. It never turns true after a startup error. If WebGPU fails, ready stays false and the engine does not downgrade.\n\nThe engine must not auto-downgrade to WebGL. The test script will verify dev slider behavior by reading and setting `game.wobble.gain` through the engine API.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2bfbd759-31a3-4811-9f70-622663720af9-113","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"uiDown|uiAccept|ArrowDown","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input","glob":"**/*bind*"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3130,"output_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":146816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"483f4208-2891-4125-95c3-901296d28e26"}
