{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_518","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default mode might be 'balanced', which halves the buffer.\n\nThe drawing buffer may be half the viewport if the default mode is 'balanced'. Setting `gfx.resolution=full` in the search parameters will make the buffer match the CSS view.\n\nThe phrase \"requested view\" is ambiguous. I will set the viewport to 1280x720 or 1920x1080 at dpr 1 and record the canvas dimensions.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0a0a6abc-d561-4982-a7b9-1f6970996628-117","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gfx.resolution","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"**/*quality*"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1383,"output_tokens":446,"cache_read_input_tokens":153344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e00cbe11-037e-4f94-a388-f9afe0140d64"}
