{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_540","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The replay already contains linux-x64 hashes from Node.\n\nI'll run `x replay --browser sim` to compare Chromium output and update hashes if they match. I also need to write `browse.py` and `verify.mjs`, and format the TypeScript files with Prettier.\n\nNode-side capture/restore checks will serve as a fallback if Chromium replay is flaky. browse.py will be kept as a single file with clear failure output. If Chromium fails to launch, the script will write launch-error.txt and rely on Node checks instead.\n\nLaunch errors will be caught by Playwright and written to launch-error.txt. verify.mjs will ignore these as failures when the file exists, but still count genuine FAIL lines from the page.\n\nA separate `labs/game/replay.test.ts` will replay the golden capture. This avoids restarting the long retreat test. The current run skips it, but verify.mjs will execute it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-12b50b81-01af-4a07-ae5f-18e206490ae6-156","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"capture\\(\\)|restore\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim","glob":"**/world.ts","head_limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":851,"output_tokens":977,"cache_read_input_tokens":178176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"696ac958-37ce-47b1-b9e5-5782552ba341"}
