- `labs/game/README.md` says what the game is and the calls you made. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` is honest and specific.\"},{\"line_number\":1023,\"content\":\"**Keep a running tally as you go** of the issues testing catches, and which were critical: you will be asked for both, and for your most and least helpful test. Note engine surprises in `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` when they happen.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-0149bb0a-3af8-4147-b07b-e3ac1b868534-8","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,52,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,116,111,111,108,115,47,98,114,111,119,115,101,46,112,121,10,49,58,34,34,34,68,114,105,118,101,32,116,104,101,32,98,117,105,108,116,32,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,32,112,97,103,101,46,32,80,114,105,110,116,115,32,70,65,73,76,32,108,105,110,101,115,44,32,111,114,32,110,111,116,104,105,110,103,32,119,104,101,110,32,116,104,101,32,99,104,101,99,107,115,32,104,111,108,100,46,10,54,53,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,112,114,105,110,116,40,34,76,65,85