{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_569","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Icons toggle calls applyPrefs, which sets glyphSet based on lastDevice.\n\nlastDevice defaults to 'gamepad' before any pad input, so the icons toggle immediately sets glyphSet to xbox. The hover bug fix is the main change in browse.py. After toggling icons, showSettings reopens the menu while lastDevice remains gamepad and glyphSet stays xbox; KeyF then correctly switches to keyboard. A mouse click on the menu might trigger an unintended toggle.\n\nClicking outside the menu still registers as mouse input. Escape returns to the title screen. Hovering after escape does not reset lastInput because it exits early while the menu is open. This prevents the attract mode from starting.\n\nEscape updates lastInput, so the 10.5-second attract timer starts correctly even when hover is skipped. Attract exits via KeyF, mouse click, or pad button.\n\nClicking to exit attract mode fires pointerdown in capture before the menu is recreated. The click event then targets the original element under the cursor, so it cannot hit a newly created menu item.\n\nA pad button held for 400 milliseconds triggers uiAccept once, not repeatedly. If attract mode is already exited, that single press could also select the Begin option and start the game.\n\nAttract mode closes the menu before it begins, so pad button presses during that window cannot trigger uiAccept. After drive() reopens the menu, the held button is no longer a fresh press, so it does not select an option. The test then presses Enter to start the game.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8d3f1e4a-577e-4ee0-8bfa-1999f958d013-38","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"wobble.gain|path: 'game.wobble","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/settings.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8d3f1e4a-577e-4ee0-8bfa-1999f958d013-39","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"data-ui=.about|about.textContent|TESTING|CREDITS","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/menus.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8d3f1e4a-577e-4ee0-8bfa-1999f958d013-40","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/menus.ts","offset":230,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1033,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":81536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"b4d0583f-2e37-4891-889f-8f46c52304e9"}
