{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_571","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"main.ts registers both island and round scenes, which is a critical hub issue.\n\nChecking if createEngine initializes both scenes or only the active one. If it starts just the round scene, island terrain won't load and the hub boot may miss its deadline.\n\nNeed to verify in createEngine whether both scenes initialize or only the active one.\n\nCalling ready() at 14 seconds before engine.ready could fail the harness check. The watchdog uses this early call to cover slow boots, but the verification requires every frame after ready to show engine.ready as true with zero errors.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ed2f651-f286-4d5d-a1b0-6cdbdb689eb8-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ready|__engine|complete|function check","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/harness.html","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6ed2f651-f286-4d5d-a1b0-6cdbdb689eb8-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"setup\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app","glob":"**/*.ts","head_limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3916,"output_tokens":504,"cache_read_input_tokens":84608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"95cc0f62-a69a-4066-9e95-1c76e02c5f50"}
