{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_577","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"docs/PROGRESS.md is missing. npm run check will fail on the DOCS_PROGRESS step.\n\nI'll write a brief docs/PROGRESS.md for the Thumb Yoga game. It will state the engine is unchanged and stay under 40 lines. I also need to watch for checkPaths failures from deleted file references.\n\nDOCS_STALE could fail if generateDocs scans labs/game and finds new public APIs. I'll wait to see when npm run check runs.\n\nI'll run npm run check before verify to avoid memory pressure. Verify launches Chromium and runs many vitest workers, so running both in parallel could OOM. I'll fix browse.py first, then write the remaining docs, and start verify in the background.\n\nI'll write the exit interview and remaining hand-in docs now, before verify's HTML build. Verify will run first; npm test must wait until it finishes to avoid memory pressure. I'll flip the goal plan checkboxes only after each task is truly done.\n\nI'll fix browse.py to correct hover order, log browser output, and update hub-client.sha. I also need to change shell() KeyF to \"f\" and ensure browser.log is written even if shell throws by using a finally block.\n\nI noticed the attract save comparison might fail because opening settings and toggling icons calls persist() before the attract test runs, writing a save that wasn't there on a fresh page.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c09c4821-ee84-4aba-80fd-b79a33506a0c-57","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":450,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1525,"output_tokens":883,"cache_read_input_tokens":97920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f1