{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_602","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The time-up handler calls finish(true) to send the result if it has not already been reported.\n\nEnd stops the engine. Progress is sent in maybeGo when time() is non-negative. The initial lastSend value needs verification. sendLean sends at 10/s, well below the 20/s limit, and the client throttles progress. Math.random is not called by the game. There may be a risk if multiple sends overlap.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The full verifier is running. It covers the balance bands, the three-seed walk to the credits, the golden replay, the one-file page, and the browser and hub checks.\n\nTwo page bugs were fixed before that run. Leaving attract no longer writes the save on the exit frame, and a touch-only screen keeps the controller message while the demo plays. The pad script now holds each button until the menu actually moves, so a slow frame cannot skip a press."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":763,"output_tokens":377,"cache_read_input_tokens":147328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c0bcf788-6623-45cf-987c-4b79eb3d0d70"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_603","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the verifier status.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The verifier should be far enough along to show whether the bands and the page checks are holding. I'll read its log and finish whatever is still open."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e9e211d4-24ab-48c1-83d8-883ed26f77b6-113","name":"get_command_or_subagent_output","input":{"task_ids":["b9b28ce3-65d3-4479-b2c3-4ac73842ece8","5b335a9c-c55e-4843-9e37-764afbe4bba5"],"timeout_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":138408,"output_tokens":156,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"94634ea8-5cf3-49a3-856b-8bcc6d37b767"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e9e211d4-24ab-48c1-83d8-883ed26f77b6-113","content":"{\"type\":\"TaskOutput\",\"MultiResult\":{\"mode\":\"poll\",\"results\":[{\"task_id\":\"b9b28ce3-65d3-4479-b2c3-4ac73842ece8\",\"command\":\"SCRATCH=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\\\"\\nDEV=\\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\\\"\\necho $$ > \\\"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\\\"\\ncd \\\"$DEV\\\"\\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\\nexport VERIFY_OUT=\\\"$SCRATCH\\\"\\nnode labs/game/tools/verify.mjs > \\\"$SCRATCH/verify.log\\\" 2>&1\\necho \\\"EXIT:$?\\\" >> \\\"$SCRATCH/verify.log\\\"\",\"status\":\"running\",\"exit_code\":null,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T08:19:14Z\",\"ended\":null,\"duration_secs\":64.893279532,\"output\":\"\\n\\nUse timeout_ms to wait for completion. Unless the user specified, do not kill this task just because this wait returned. It is still working. You will be notified automatically when it completes. Do other work, or wait again with a longer timeout_ms.\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/call-4cff0aae-f208-4abf-8e67-81af648dd37e-98.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":0},{\"task_id\":\"5b335a9c-c55e-4843-9e37-764afbe4bba5\",\"command\":\"[monitor] Watch verifier until it exits\",\"status\":\"running\",\"exit_code\":null,\"started\":\"2026-11-05T08:19:14Z\",\"ended\":null,\"duration_secs\":64.879650531,\"output\":\"\\n\\nUse timeout_ms to wait for completion. Unless the user specified, do not kill this task just because this wait returned. It is still working. You will be notified automatically when it completes. Do other work, or wait again with a longer timeout_ms.\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/monitor-call-4cff0aae-f208-4abf-8e67-81af648dd37e-99.log\",\"truncated\":false,\"truncation_hint\":\"[truncated - use read_file on output_file for full content]\",\"raw_output_bytes\":0}],\"summary\":\"0/2 tasks completed (poll)\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"96014b28-f3c3-4761-870f-bdf90a776ec1"}
