{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_626","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The monitor confirmed the failure already observed.\n\nI will write a Python script to debug the boot. It will load the HTML and capture console errors and engine state after short waits and after 25 seconds. The large HTML module might throw during parsing. WebGPU initialization could also hang without error. I will dump __engine.errors, ready status, and console output to find the cause.\n\nWebGPU is likely not the cause since the same flags worked in a prior smoke test. The hang probably comes from terrain generation for the 60x60 island heightfield, which may exceed the 60-second ready timeout. The node test showed this step is fast.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b17501c7-1419-4380-bc3e-7711e2818ab4-143","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/boot-debug.py","old_string":"","new_string":"\"\"\"One boot of the handed-in page. Prints console lines and when ready flips.\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nHTML = Path(\n    \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\"\n)\nCHROME = os.path.expanduser(\n    \"~/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\"\n)\nFLAGS = [\n    \"--no-sandbox\",\n    \"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\n    \"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\n    \"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\n    \"--use-angle=swiftshader\",\n]\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=CHROME, args=FLAGS)\n    page = browser.new_page(viewport={\"width\": 1920, \"height\": 1080}, device_scale_factor=1)\n    logs: list[str] = []\n    page.on(\"console\", lambda msg: logs.append(f\"{msg.type}: {msg.text}\"))\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda err: logs.append(f\"pageerror: {err}\"))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri())\n    for second in range(1, 91):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(1000)\n        state = page.evaluate(\n            \"\"\"() => {\n              const eng = window.__engine || {};\n              const canvas = document.querySelector('canvas');\n              return {\n                ready: eng.ready === true,\n                errors: eng.errors || [],\n                help: typeof eng.help,\n                title: document.title,\n                msg: (document.querySelector('#msg') || {}).textContent || '',\n                canvas: canvas ? [canvas.width, canvas.height] : null,\n                game: window.__game || null,\n              };\n            }\"\"\"\n        )\n        if second in (3, 8, 15, 30, 45, 60, 90) or state[\"ready\"]:\n            print(f\"t={second} {json.dumps(state)[:800]}\")\n            print(\"LOGS\", len(logs))\n            for line in logs[-12:]:\n                print(\" \", line[:300])\n        if state[\"ready\"]:\n            break\n    browser.close()\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2083,"output_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":177536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"bb08e718-4229-457c-9f59-8260150ea120"}
