{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_630","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking stage.ts for PadL2 references in comments or seat reading.\n\nGamepads 6/7 map directly to L2/R2 for extra seats. Action codes apply only to seat 0. Glyphs display L2/R2 as text. Binding codes will change from PadL2 to PadLeftTrigger. Other invalid codes appear only in comments.\n\nRebind menus and reserved codes are valid. Breathe uses Space only. The actions.ts fixes use PadLeftTrigger and PadRightTrigger. Need to grep tests for any PadL2 assertions. Stage.ts trigger indices remain independent of code names.\n\nA full verify.mjs run is required for the official log. The previous attempt failed at boot after roughly 120 seconds. A successful run will add attract waits, touch, and hub checks. Total time could be 8 to 12 minutes.\n\nRunning browse.py alone first will confirm boot and shell before the full verify. This avoids another six-minute failure. The fix must be in source before the full verify rebuilds HTML. A quick node check of defineActionMap is also planned.\n\nBoot-debug will confirm the fix is live before the long verify run. The engine maps gamepad button 6 to PadLeftTrigger, while menu navigation uses buttons 0 and 13.\n\nNeed to grep the dev game folder for PadL2 snapshots in tests. Will run eslint and prettier on actions.ts. The page boot itself serves as the test, so no separate module import is required.\n\nOnly three invalid codes exist in the schema. No other bad codes were found. The Space key for breathe does not conflict with other bindings.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d14578f6-384c-4c0f-b153-1a2c01006178-150","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/actions.ts","old_string":"    footl: ['KeyQ', 'PadL2', 'MouseLeft'],\n    footr