{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_636","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The process completed successfully rather than timing out.\n\nThe 10-second timeout means Enter reached the title screen but failed to start play. The keypress may be swallowed by a handler, or the game state may not transition to play correctly.\n\nThe failure is consistent across both boots. The engine likely requires the canvas to be focused before it will accept Enter, since boot-debug never pressed Enter while browse does after ready.\n\nThe engine's keyboard listener target is unclear. If it only listens on the canvas, Playwright's Enter press may not reach it. The modal() function drops all input when the menu is open, but UI input uses engine input rather than intents.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-29fd41e3-828a-4f70-bb2a-e76e4a693cb1-157","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"modal","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/engine.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-29fd41e3-828a-4f70-bb2a-e76e4a693cb1-158","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"modal|uiAccept","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/input.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":810,"output_tokens":650,"cache_read_input_tokens":189568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e7147ac3-4a4e-4e6f-be9e-82376fd60199"}
