{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a924944b-66c7-43ae-b378-06c75f3dc2eb-167","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"270→    const act = actOf(w);\\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    act.wait += 1;\\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n      else sleep(w);\\n280→    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\\nexport const retreatActions = {\\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    applySave(w, given);\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n290→    applyLean(w, flow.day);\\n    if (flow.credits) {\\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\\n      flow.event = '';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n  },\\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\\n300→    if (!event) return;\\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n    else startEvent(w, event);\\n  },\\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\\n310→  },\\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n  },\\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\",\"content_concise\":\"270→    const act = actOf(w);\\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    act.wait += 1;\\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n      else sleep(w);\\n280→    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\\nexport const retreatActions = {\\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    applySave(w, given);\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n290→    applyLean(w, flow.day);\\n    if (flow.credits) {\\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\\n      flow.event = '';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n  },\\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\\n300→    if (!event) return;\\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n    else startEvent(w, event);\\n  },\\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\\n310→  },\\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n  },\\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts\",\"offset\":270,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    const act = actOf(w);\\n    if (act.done === 1 || (auto === 'attract' && act.tick >= SLICE)) finishEvent(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if ((flow.mode === 'results' || flow.mode === 'evening') && (auto === 'director' || auto === 'attract')) {\\n    const act = actOf(w);\\n    act.wait += 1;\\n    if (act.wait >= BEAT) {\\n      if (flow.mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n      else sleep(w);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Menu picks. Each one runs between steps. */\\nexport const retreatActions = {\\n  'game.begin': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n    applySave(w, given);\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    applyLean(w, flow.day);\\n    if (flow.credits) {\\n      flow.mode = 'roam';\\n      flow.event = '';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    openItem(w, programme()[flow.cursor]);\\n  },\\n  'game.start': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const event = strArg(rec(args), 'event');\\n    if (!event) return;\\n    if (event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n    else if (event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n    else startEvent(w, event);\\n  },\\n  'game.carry': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') advance(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.sleep': (w: World) => {\\n    if (flowOf(w).mode === 'evening') sleep(w);\\n  },\\n  'game.leave': (w: World) => {\\n    const flow = flowOf(w);\\n    const activity = findActivity(flow.event);\\n    if (activity && flow.mode === 'event') activity.teardown(w);\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n  },\\n  'game.jump': (w: World, args: unknown) => {\\n    const given = rec(args);\\n\",\"total_lines\":345}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"6fdbbdb9-93b7-4b39-9dd7-e193b64a2a6c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_644","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"game.begin is working correctly. The Enter key is not selecting.\n\nThe Enter key is being swallowed by the window's capture-phase keydown listener. A focused input element is unlikely since sliders are hidden.\n\nThe menu exists and receives input. The key press likely occurs between frames, so the engine never samples it as a pressed button.\n\nThe engine sink should retain a key press even if it occurs between samples. The next step is to write a debug script that presses Enter, waits two seconds, and logs the screen state and focus. A manual KeyboardEvent will also be dispatched on the window to test if the event reaches the game. Any overlay capturing keys will be checked.\n\nThe gamepad initialization script was ruled out as the cause of the Enter key failure. The exact sequence in browse.py is now being re-examined: it waits for the engine to be ready, pauses briefly, evaluates the page state, presses Enter, and then waits for the screen to change to play.\n\nThe timeout confirms the engine is ready. The failure occurs when waiting for the screen to change to play after pressing Enter. The menu's pickTitle function may not be firing for the begin screen. Enter is mapped to both act and uiAccept, so the engine might be treating it as a breathe action instead of a menu selection.\n\nThe menu update order and frame loop are being checked to confirm the game loop is running. A short interactive debug script will log focus changes, screen state, and console output after pressing Enter. Clicking the Begin button directly will be tested as a control to isolate whether the failure is an input focus issue. The task requires the real menu path via keyboard, so Enter must work.\n\nThe keydown listener does not block the event, so the engine should receive it. The menu is active and the title list contains six items, with Begin as the first one.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5525a579-294c-4de2-9332-89d4f8c7c581-168","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/boot-1.log","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":673,"output_tokens":1180,"cache_read_input_tokens":195584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d1dbacac-f0ac-44b5-bf04-807269be9b5c"}
