{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_656","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Chrome processes belong to other agents in different run folders.\n\nNo verify.mjs is running. Rebuilding HTML and writing a short play-debug to verify the loop keeps going. Memory is tight, so only one short Chrome will be used. Prettier and eslint will run on stage.ts. The onefile invocation timing and browse.py wait logic are also being checked.\n\nThe 10-second wait failed even though the screen was published as play. The throw may have landed before a later publish, or Playwright missed a one-frame state change. The page might also have crashed, causing evaluate to fail.\n\nThe timeout means the predicate stayed false, not that evaluate threw. Enter-debug also held a gamepad stub and saw screen play, so the gamepad is not the cause. Browse's exact sequence before Enter is being compared.\n\nThe timeout occurs at the final Enter in a long script, not the first one. The failure is the second wait_for_function for screen==='play' inside once().","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Other agents' browsers stay up. I'll rebuild the page and check that Begin no longer stops the frame loop."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-871c0dde-23bb-4276-a1ed-866d38052fb1-10","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"wait_for_function|timeout=10000|screen === .play","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/browse.py"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-871c0dde-23bb-4276-a1ed-866d38052fb1-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":370,"limit":15}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7407,"output_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":38272,