{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_668","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The play screen was reached. Errors are empty. No APP_FRAME is present.\n\nThe event string remains empty after 1.5 seconds. The focus label is still \"Begin\" because it only updates when the menu is non-null after an update.\n\nThe empty event string may be expected during the morning intro or title transition. The game.begin action applies the save and opens the programme item, so the mode should not remain title if it executed. The event variable is set from snap.event each frame before menu updates.\n\nThe empty event is caused by a stale snapshot. `live.event` is captured at the start of the frame before `game.begin` executes inside `menu.update`. The publish calls then use that old empty value. The next frame should show the new event.\n\nThe empty event persists across frames. The loop may have stopped without recording an error. The morning intro might be a mode rather than an event, leaving snap.event blank. The first programme item could also have an empty event.\n\nThe empty event and unchanged focus match a stale publish from the begin frame. If the loop were still running, the next frame would read the new event. The persistent blank event therefore means either the simulation event is genuinely empty or the loop died without recording an error. A throw inside menu.update might have been caught by the guard and silently swallowed.\n\nThe empty errors confirm no exception occurred, so the loop is still running. The blank event may be correct for the morning title state after begin. I will inspect readSnap and the first programme item to verify snap.event. The visible text is the control prompt because paint() falls back to promptLine when the menu is closed and no sentence is active.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d2298738-c57e-4687-95c0-4ff1433f871d-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"return \\{|get ready|inspector","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/engine.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d2298738-c57e-4687-95c0-4ff1433f871d-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"event:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d2298738-c57e-4687-95c0-4ff1433f871d-30","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"game\\.begin|openItem|mode === 'title'","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":611,"output_tokens":1185,"cache_read_input_tokens":63232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"fd071def-86e0-49eb-81f9-9ce552a155f6"}
