home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/lib/scenes.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"/** Where scene modules live: `fixtures/scenes/` and every `labs/<name>/scenes/` (tests/pages/replay.ts globs the same). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/lib/replayState.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The state a replay reaches, for `x replay --state` and `--until n` (tools/cmd/replay.ts; gate G7's review):\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/audio.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":15,\"content\":\" * `--replay` plays a replay (engine/sim/replay.ts) in Node, step by step, against its goldens, and reads its sound\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/engine.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"      ['sim', process.execPath, ['x', 'sim', 'labs/game/scenes/play.ts', '--steps', '600']],\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/replay.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\" * same player (engine/sim/replay.ts). Every run must give the goldens of this platform (`linux-x64`): one set, valid\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\" * and loads after the animation library, as there (tools/anim/library.ts; the page: tests/pages/replay.ts).\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"/** Where two runs part: the step, the runs, and what differs there (engine/sim/replay.ts `partingOf`). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/intents.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"    doc: 'Raised by `normalizeIntents`, `applyIntents` and the replay checks (engine/input/intents.ts, engine/sim/replay.ts) for an unknown key (named with the closest), a non-finite or misshapen number, a button that is not a non-empty string, or a custom value that is not plain data. Every problem is listed at once.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/sim.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\" * records it, so `run.replay.json` replays it (engine/sim/replay.ts), golden hashes for this platform included (copy\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/AGENTS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"4. See it without a screen: `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts` (the hash and the events), `node x shot labs/game`\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/playback.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * to a session exactly as engine/sim/replay.ts's `playReplay` does (its `set` values, then its dev action, then its\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/GAME-GUIDE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":88,\"content\":\"| labs/game/scenes/play.ts     | The rules: a level as text, settings, components (`gem`, `round`), systems, a random stream, events |\"},{\"line_number\":103,\"content\":\"| A level                        | A text map in a scene module; `compileLevel`, glyphs (`#` wall, `.` floor, `@` spawn, `w` low wall, `P` pillar, `^` stairs, `=` gallery, `o` dais, `t` brazier), `defineGlyph` for your own; `addLevelBodies`; the page registers the text (`createEngine({ levels })`); a building of storeys: `node x new level`; buildings on a terrain: `defineSite`, `addSiteBodies` | labs/game/scenes/play.ts, labs/box/levels/hall.txt, labs/playground/levels/site.ts |\"},{\"line_number\":119,\"content\":\"| A new entry of a kind          | `node x new <kind> labs/game/<dir>/<name>`: the module and its test from a template (`node x new` lists the kinds, tools/templates/README.md says where each goes; a new scene starts as a copy of play.ts instead) | tools/templates/                    |\"},{\"line_number\":152,\"content\":\"| `node x sim labs/game/scenes/play.ts [--steps n] [--seed s] [--set k=v] [--feel]` | Runs a scene in Node: its hash, events, entities; `--feel` measures the player |\"},{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"| `node x eye labs/game/scenes/play.ts [--cam code] [--steps n]` | What a camera sees of the bodies, in Node with no GPU: a text picture and its legend (`__engine.eye()` in a page) |\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/API.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5444,\"content\":\"### [`engine/gfx/post/shaders/display.ts`](../engine/gfx/post/shaders/display.ts)\"},{\"line_number\":7246,\"content\":\"### [`engine/sim/replay.ts`](../engine/sim/replay.ts)\"},{\"line_number\":8361,\"content\":\"### [`labs/game/scenes/play.ts`](../labs/game/scenes/play.ts)\"},{\"line_number\":8791,\"content\":\"- `TourReplay` (interface): A replay as the tour reads and writes it (engine/sim/replay.ts's format, goldens aside).\"},{\"line_number\":9905,\"content\":\"### [`tools/cmd/replay.ts`](../tools/cmd/replay.ts)\"},{\"line_number\":9919,\"content\":\"- `RunParting` (interface): Where two runs part: the step, the runs, and what differs there (engine/sim/replay.ts `partingOf`).\"},{\"line_number\":10495,\"content\":\"- `sceneRoots` (function): Where scene modules live: `fixtures/scenes/` and every `labs/<name>/scenes/` (tests/pages/replay.ts globs the same).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/replay.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"    doc: \\\"Raised by `checkReplay` and `playReplay` (engine/sim/replay.ts) before a step runs: an unknown key (named with the closest), a wrong format tag, a seed that is not a whole number from 0, a change-point out of order or at or past `steps`, a bad intent, setting or dev action, a platform key that is not `<os>-<arch>` as Node names them (named with the closest), goldens that do not cover the run (none, or none for the last step), a step key not written plainly, a hash that is not 16 hex digits, a step rate other than the world's, or a view setting.\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/box/library.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" * tests/pages/replay.ts calls it too, so clip mode's replays play in the sim page as here; Node registers the same\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/scene.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\" * `createHeadless` (WP 1.6) all start scenes here, so no scene imports `app/`; engine/sim/replay.ts plays them.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/session.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * The kernel fixture, the box's scenes and `createHeadless` (WP 1.6) all record through it; engine/sim/replay.ts plays\"},{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\" * Invariants: the recording is plain data, from step 0, and replays to the same hashes (engine/sim/replay.ts); view\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tests/pages/replay.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * and plays replays through the very player Node runs (engine/sim/replay.ts), then signals ready through\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/feel/course.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * such as a scene's `place` among them, engine/sim/replay.ts), and the numbers to measure on the run, each against its\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"    description: 'Change-points [step, change], as a replay’s (engine/sim/replay.ts): after that many steps, before the next.', // prettier-ignore\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/feel/run.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * as a replay plays (engine/sim/replay.ts: setting values, dev actions, then intents, at each change-point), samples\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine-lock.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1647,\"content\":\"    \\\"engine/gfx/post/shaders/display.ts\\\": \\\"sha256:0b1bef1a12588e8a1a07390809be57a62199aea27c5c0a0e10183e3b723aaf6e\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":1816,\"content\":\"    \\\"engine/sim/replay.ts\\\": \\\"sha256:f9c0d2c4b1e6fac7dc30c31cb5aecfa03c53d6e6ff8e421118b44e2c30da6241\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":1970,\"content\":\"    \\\"tests/pages/replay.ts\\\": \\\"sha256:66450aad25a5fddc04f7e0324d45be24890bf4e7e7f03db4aa0daad949812c0f\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":2025,\