{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_692","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The monitor fired with a failure already known.\n\nInvestigating why Enter reaches play-debug but not browse. Checking actions.ts for pause bindings. Searching more precisely for the guard comment in HTML. Will reproduce the once() failure and dump state at timeout. Also checking if another handler consumes Enter.\n\nThe menu may require the gamepad as the active device. The HTML should be identical since play-debug succeeded before verify rebuilt it. A different bundle or environment is unlikely.\n\nRuled out flakiness and slow frames as causes. The screenshot step in browse is unlikely to interfere with key input. The focus is now on the gamepad stub.\n\nThe gamepad stub always reports a connected pad, but keyboard Enter should still reach the menu. The screenshot step in browse might leave the page unfocused, though Playwright usually refocuses automatically. The engine maps Enter to uiAccept, so both keys should work.\n\nThe input system may only detect keys that are held during a sample, not brief keypresses between frames. A 60 fps frame lasts about 16 ms, so the Enter press could be missed if it lands between samples.\n\nThe WATCH init script does not block input. The key difference between the two flows is timing: browse waits 300 ms after ready, then runs a synchronous evaluate and a screenshot that may take 100–500 ms before pressing Enter. Play-debug presses immediately after the same 300 ms wait. This extra delay in browse could let the keypress fall outside the engine’s sample window.\n\nWill read keyboard.ts to see how key presses are sampled. Considering a change to browse: hold Enter until the screen changes, like the pad hold, to make input more reliable and test the real menu path.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1bf45a53-5451-40ed-9c3c-9b1b8e4b7fa9-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/actions.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1bf45a53-5451-40ed-9c3c-9b1b8e4b7fa9-75","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"keydown|pressed|justDown|edges","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/devices/keyboard.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3394,"output_tokens":1168,"cache_read_input_tokens":110592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5921107f-e426-4f9e-b500-3983d906d166"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1bf45a53-5451-40ed-9c3c-9b1b8e4b7fa9-74","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The balance map. Lean is the stick and the keys. The feet are triggers, Q and E, and the mouse buttons.\\n * Space breathes. It is not the act button. The pointer stays free on menus.\\n */\\nimport { defineActionMap } from '../../../engine';\\n\\ndefineActionMap('actionMap:retreat', {\\n  description: 'Lean with the left stick, WASD or the arrows. The feet are L2 and R2, Q and E, or the mouse buttons.',\\n  lock: false,\\n10→  actions: {\\n    forward: ['KeyW', 'ArrowUp', 'PadLeftStickUp'],\\n    back: ['KeyS', 'ArrowDown', 'PadLeftStickDown'],\\n    left: ['KeyA', 'ArrowLeft', 'PadLeftStickLeft'],\\n    right: ['KeyD', 'ArrowRight', 'PadLeftStickRight'],\\n    footl: ['KeyQ', 'PadLeftTrigger', 'MouseLeft'],\\n    footr: ['KeyE', 'PadRightTrigger', 'MouseRight'],\\n    breathe: ['Space'],\\n    act: ['KeyF', 'Enter', 'NumpadEnter', 'PadSouth'],\\n    gentle: ['ShiftLeft', 'PadLeftShoulder'],\\n20→  },\\n  move: ['forward', 'back', 'left', 'right'],\\n  values: {\\n    'game:f': 'forward',\\n    'game:b': 'back',\\n    'game:l': 'left',\\n    'game:r': 'right',\\n    'game:fl': 'footl',\\n    'game:fr': 'footr',\\n    'game:g': 'gentle',\\n30→  },\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The balance map. Lean is the stick and the keys. The feet are triggers, Q and E, and the mouse buttons.\\n * Space breathes. It is not the act button. The pointer stays free on menus.\\n */\\nimport { defineActionMap } from '../../../engine';\\n\\ndefineActionMap('actionMap:retreat', {\\n  description: 'Lean with the left stick, WASD or the arrows. The feet are L2 and R2, Q and E, or the mouse buttons.',\\n  lock: false,\\n10→  actions: {\\n    forward: ['KeyW', 'ArrowUp', 'PadLeftStickUp'],\\n    back: ['KeyS', 'ArrowDown', 'PadLeftStickDown'],\\n    left: ['Ke