t.pressed('pause')`),\"},{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\" * pause buttons, and keys the browser or system keeps) and a map's own `reserved` codes are refused by rebinding.\"},{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\" * SYSTEM_ACTIONS.pause; // ['Escape', 'PadStart']\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"  pause: ['Escape', 'PadStart'],\"},{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"/** Codes no action map binds: the pause buttons, and keys the browser or the system keeps. */\"},{\"line_number\":104,\"content\":\"      'True when the mouse turns the view: a click on the game takes the pointer lock, which pause and Escape give back.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/bindings.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":27,\"content\":\" * bindings.rebind('jump', 'Escape').ok; // false: reserved for pause\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/input.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":13,\"content\":\" * `view` actions and the system layer (pause, menus) are never buttons in it: `held`, `pressed` and `strength` give\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e8a4b5ca-c91c-4550-8901-1ae947b35fef"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_695","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pause key is Escape and PadStart, not Enter.\n\nWriting a script to gather empirical evidence. It will press Enter, poll the game screen every 500ms for 10 seconds, and log state, errors, and console output.\n\nThe script will also inject a keydown listener to confirm Enter reached the page. If Enter is logged but the screen remains on the title, the game ignored the input.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de2baaec-d18b-4aed-830e-36b5f8b3fd7d-79","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/enter-trace.py","content":"\"\"\"Mirror browse.once and record the screen after Enter.\"\"\"\n\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nHTML = Path(\n    \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\"\n)\nCHROME = os.path.expanduser(\n    \"~/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\"\n)\nFLAGS = [\n    \"--no-sandbox\",\n    \"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\",\n    \"--enable-features=Vulkan\",\n    \"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\",\n    \"--use-angle=swiftshader\",\n]\nPAD = \"\"\"\nwindow.__buttons = new Array(16).fill(0);\nwindow.__axes = [0, 0, 0, 0];\nwindow.__keys = [];\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => window.__keys.push(event.code), true);\nnavigator.getGamepads = () => [{\n  id: 'Scripted Pad (STANDARD GAMEPAD)',\n  index: 0,\n  connected: true,\n  mapping: 'standard',\n  timestamp: performance.now(),\n  axes: window.__axes.slice(),\n  buttons: window.__buttons.map((value) => ({ pressed: value > 0.5, touched: value > 0, value })),\n}];\n\"\"\"\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=CHROME, args=FLAGS)\n    page = browser.new_page(viewport={\"width\": 1920, \"height\": 1080}, device_scale_factor=1)\n    page.add_init_script(PAD)\n    logs = []\n    page.on(\"console\", lambda msg: logs.append(f\"{msg.type}: {msg.text[:300]}\"))\n    page.on(\"pageerror\", lambda err: logs.append(f\"pageerror: {err}\"))\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri())\n    page.wait_for_function(\"() => window.__engine && window.__engine.ready === true\", timeout=60000)\n    page.wait_for_timeout(300)\n    page.screenshot(path=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/enter-before.png\")\n    page.keyboard.press(\"Enter\")\n    for i in range(12):\n        page.wait_for_timeout(500)\n        state = page.evaluate(\n            \"\"\"() => ({\n              screen: window.__game && window.__game.screen,\n              focus: window.__game && window.__game.focus,\n              event: window.__game && window.__game.event,\n              attract: window.__game && window.__game.attract,\n              errors: (window.__engine && window.__engine.errors || []).map((row) => row.message || row.code || row),\n              keys: window.__keys,\n            })\"\"\"\n        )\n        print(i, state)\n        if state[\"screen\"] == \"play\" and not state[\"errors\"]:\n            break\n    print(\"LOGS\")\n    for line in logs[-15:]:\n        print(line)\n    browser.close()\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-de2baaec-d18b-4aed-830e-36b5f8b3fd7d-80","name":"kill_command_or_subagent","input":{"task_id":"027b5874-ef02-4a90-a2d2-8abd90702912"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":715,"output_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":118272,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"54bedd69-9bb5-4b3a-9125-667bc4569d77"}
