{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_701","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The keydown listener is present in the bundle.\n\nThe keydown listener uses a comma operator after the alt/ctrl/meta check. It should fire for Enter and T keys. Playwright may be injecting metaKey or ctrlKey into synthetic events.\n\nThe UI function sets lastInput and glyphSet before publishing. If the keydown handler throws inside it, those state changes would still occur.\n\nThe init script registers its listener before the page module. Both are window capture listeners, so they should both fire for a window keydown. Playwright may dispatch synthetic events on the focused element instead of the window, though capture phase starts at the window regardless. The page is top-level, so an iframe is unlikely.\n\nMonkeypatching the existing listener is not possible. I will dispatch a synthetic KeyboardEvent via evaluate and log glyphSet before and after the Playwright press to trace the state change.\n\nI will monkeypatch the window keydown listener to log event flags and target. If glyphSet remains playstation after the Playwright press, noteDevice did not run. I am also checking whether UI(\"keyboard\") throws inside promptLine, since lastInput is set before that call.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2ef802af-135b-453e-bbff-200541767d98-87","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\").read_text()\n# find definition of UI near the key handler. The handler is around 6839662\n# search backwards for \"function UI\" or \"UI=\" \nidx = text.rfind(\"function UI(\", 0, 6840000)\nprint(\"function UI\", idx)\nidx2 = text.rfind(\"UI=\", 0, 6840000)\nprint(\"last UI= before handler\", idx2)\nprint(text[idx2-80:idx2+500] if idx2>0 else \"none\")\nPY","description":"Find the bundled noteDevice function"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":733,"output_tokens":1086,"cache_read_input_tokens":126336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"8ad7fe8e-447b-484f-a11c-1db082944b6b"}
