{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_702","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The UI sets U to performance.now(), which is lastInput.\n\nI'll check if the UI actually ran by logging performance timestamps and printing glyphSet every sample. If the UI executed, glyphSet should show keys immediately at sample 0; otherwise it remains playstation.\n\nThe glyphSet check is a cleaner signal than attract timing. I'll update the script and log time from ready. I suspect the per-frame drive() loop resets the glyph to playstation because it reads the gamepad every frame, overriding the UI's keys assignment.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5dc58a6e-3328-4a88-9a39-e8fcccdb6c13-88","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gamepad|noteDevice","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1459,"output_tokens":482,"cache_read_input_tokens":126976,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d2f57fac-86b2-4968-8746-6b8ecadb3ddc"}
