{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_717","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Three keydown listeners fired.\n\nsink.press('Enter') fired during the engine bubble phase, but the screen remained on title. The menu likely did not register the input, or the screen was reset afterward.\n\nThe bubble listener may not be the engine sink. The sink might have missed the key, or sample() failed to map Enter to uiAccept. The menu could also see a stale input, or the press was consumed by repeat logic before menu.update ran.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-96da0fdf-c0e0-4d17-83bf-998dddb6edf0-108","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/input/input.ts","offset":340,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":649,"output_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":148992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ce0e2b87-425a-4dcf-b434-1abb39c0d6e7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-96da0fdf-c0e0-4d17-83bf-998dddb6edf0-108","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"340→      if (axes[0] !== 0 || axes[1] !== 0) out.move = fromCamera(yaw ?? 0, axes);\\n      if (yaw !== undefined) out.cam = yaw;\\n      if (own.axes.look) out.look = own.axes.look;\\n      else if (map.look && camera && yaw !== undefined) out.look = [yaw, camera.pose?.().pitch ?? 0];\\n      if (own.axes.aim) out.aim = own.axes.aim;\\n      else if (map.aimWith !== 'none' && camera?.aim) {\\n        const at = camera.aim(map.aimWith, aimDevices());\\n        if (at?.every(Number.isFinite)) out.aim = [...at];\\n      }\\n      const buttons = bindings\\n350→        .actions()\\n        .filter((action) => !map.move.includes(action) && !map.view.includes(action))\\n        .sort();\\n      const b = buttons.filter((action) => heldNow.has(action));\\n      const p = buttons.filter((action) => pressedNow.has(action));\\n      if (b.length) out.b = b;\\n      if (p.length) out.p = p;\\n      for (const [key, action] of Object.entries(map.values)) if (level(action) > 0) out[key] = level(action);\\n      for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(own.axes)) if (key.includes(':')) out[key] = value;\\n      return out;\\n360→    },\\n    held: (action) => heldNow.has(action),\\n    pressed: (action) => pressedNow.has(action),\\n    strength: (action) => strengths.get(action) ?? 0,\\n    camera() {\\n      const twin = bindings.map.aimWith === 'pointer'; // the right stick aims (twin sticks), not the camera\\n      const stick: [number, number] = twin ? [0, 0] : pads.rightStick();\\n      const raw = { counts: mouse?.takeLook() ?? [0, 0], stick } as const;\\n      const { look, turn } = scaleLook(raw, options.look?.() ?? DEFAULT_LOOK, heldNow.has('aim'));\\n      return { look, turn, zoom: mouse?.takeZoom() ?? 0 };\\n370→    },\\n    prompt(action) {\\n      const device = last === 'gamepad' || last === 'mouse' ? last : 'keyboard';\\n      return pickLabel(codesOf(action), device, { layout: options.layout, pad: pads.style });\\n    },\\n    listen(device) {\\n      hear(null);\\n      return new Promise((resolve) => (listening = { family: device, resolve }));\\n    },\\n    clear,\\n380→    dispose() {\\n      hear(null);\\n      detachKeyboard();\\n      mouse?.detach();\\n      touch?.detach();\\n      win?.removeEventListener('blur', clear);\\n      win?.removeEventListener('gamepaddisconnected', unplugged);\\n      doc?.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', hidden);\\n    },\\n  };\",\"content_concise\":\"340→      if (axes[0] !== 0 || axes[1] !== 0) out.move = fromCamera(yaw ?? 0, axes);\\n      if (yaw !== undefined) out.cam = yaw;\\n      if (own.axes.look) out.look = own.axes.look;\\n      else if (map.look && camera && yaw !== undefined) out.look = [yaw, camera.pose?.().pitch ?? 0];\\n      if (own.axes.aim) out.aim = own.axes.aim;\\n      else if (map.aimWith !== 'none' && camera?.aim) {\\n        const at = camera.aim(map.aimWith, aimDevices());\\n        if (at?.every(Number.isFinite)) out.aim = [...at];\\n      }\\n      const buttons = bindings\\n350→        .actions()\\n        .filter((action) => !map.move.includes(action) && !map.view.includes(action))\\n        .sort();\\n      const b = buttons.filter((action) => heldNow.has(action));\\n      const p = buttons.filter((action) => pressedNow.has(action));\\n      if (b.length) out.b = b;\\n      if (p.length) out.p = p;\\n      for (const [key, action] of Object.entries(map.values)) if (level(action) > 0) out[key] = level(action);\\n      for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(own.axes)) if (key.includes(':')) out[key] = value;\\n      return out;\\n360→    },\\n    held: (action) => heldNow.has(action),\\n    pressed: (action) => pressedNow.has(action),\\n    strength: (action) => strengths.get(action) ?? 0,\\n    camera() {\\n      const twin = bindings.map.aimWith