{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_718","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Re-examining the sample() function at lines 317-326.\n\n`uiAccept` is pressed when Enter is held or tapped, since `codesOf('uiAccept')` returns Enter and Space.\n\n`sink.press` adds Enter to `down` and `taps`. The first sample registers `uiAccept` as pressed. Subsequent samples do not repeat it because `taps` is cleared after the first frame. The press lasts exactly one frame. `menu.update` should see this single frame and call `pick()`. If the selection still fails, the cause may be a skipped update, bad delta time, or an untriggered pick.\n\nDelta time is ruled out because errors is empty. If pick() runs, the screen becomes play and publishes. The next poll should show play unless something resets it before publish.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c69c3517-2c63-4ea8-8709-bc0d51c93421-109","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"screen =","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1181,"output_tokens":605,"cache_read_input_tokens":149632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"37832430-90fc-443c-990c-93e4eb02ebbe"}
