00,105,117,109,58,32,51,32,115,32,117,110,100,101,114,32,53,48,32,102,114,97,109,101,115,32,97,32,115,101,99,111,110,100,58,32,110,111,116,104,105,110,103,32,116,111,32,100,111,32,102,111,114,32,112,108,97,121,59,32,115,101,116,32,113,117,97,108,105,116,121,32,116,111,32,97,32,116,105,101,114,32,40,108,111,119,44,32,109,101,100,105,117,109,44,32,104,105,103,104,41,32,116,111,32,104,111,108,100,32,111,110,101,44,32,111,114,32,103,102,120,46,103,111,118,101,114,110,111,114,32,116,111,32,102,97,108,115,101,10],\"output_for_prompt\":\"exit: 0\\n(node:286079) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n0 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\n1 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\n2 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\n3 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\n4 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\n5 {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'glyph': 'keys', 'attract': False, 'errors': 0, 'listeners': ['win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase1:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse']}\\nmanual listeners ['win:Enter:phase3:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase2:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase2:repeatfalse', 'win:Enter:phase2:repeatfalse']\\nafter manual {'screen': 'title', 'focus': 'Begin', 'errors': 0}\\nLOGS\\nwarning: [GFX_GOVERNOR] the frame rate moved quality auto to medium: 3 s under 50 frames a second: nothing to do for play; set quality to a tier (low, medium, high) to hold one, or gfx.governor to false\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\\npython3 \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/enter-trace.py\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Check whether Enter keydown is marked as a repeat\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/call-43171ffe-46ee-460f-857c-ebe0fe3e7822-115.log\",\"total_bytes\":1777}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"694a3a89-0ed4-4780-89e5-00b9862725bd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_723","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A manual dispatchEvent on the window object stands out.\n\nThe manual event fired at the target phase on window. It bypassed capture and bubble phases. The slice only captured the last four listeners, which were all phase 2.\n\nThe engine sink fired for both events, yet the menu still refused uiAccept. The menu is not seeing the input state. I need to expose input.pressed.\n\nI'll add debug assignments to the frame loop. I'll expose `input.pressed('uiAccept')` and menu state on the window object. I'll also record frames in a ring buffer.\n\nThe ring buffer will only record frames where uiAccept is pressed or held. An empty array means the input system never saw the key. A menu:true trace with a title screen means the pick failed. A play screen means something reverts before publish. I'll keep the last eight entries to avoid bloating the array. Then I'll rebuild and run a short trace.\n\nThe ring buffer will keep the last 20 frames. It records screen state, menu flag, and uiAccept pressed or held status.\n\nThe debug code will be inserted immediately after `const input = engine?.input` in the frame loop. It is temporary and will be removed afterward.\n\nA swallowed exception inside menu.update is unlikely because the errors array was empty. A different menu object is also improbable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6d73ab4a-d492-4fb5-8b95-88c78eb8a786-116","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/enter-before.png"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":776,"output_tokens":1081,"cache_read_input_tokens":157056,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d08a8556-fe0a-4b18-a1c8-8a20b4a6df11"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6d73ab4a-d492-4fb5-8b95-88c78eb8a786-116","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"ImageContent\":{\"data\":\"\",\"mime_type\":\"image/jpeg\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"432da8ac-d780-44f9-96cc-7efde3379836"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_724","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The menu is visible and Begin is selected.\n\nThe world is rendering. The title menu appears to overlay the island scene. Enter does not activate Begin. I will add a frame trace to debug the input.\n\nI will test clicking Begin to see if the click path works. If it does, only uiAccept is broken. Keyboard events entered the sink, so uiAccept should work for both keyboard and pad. I will add a debug line.\n\nThe rebuild is worthwhile. A dialog consuming uiAccept seems unlikely. The input sampling logic is sound: pressedNow updates before the modal check, and the menu reads pressed() rather than intents.\n\nThe title screen does not pause the clock, so frames continue to draw. A duplicate frame callback is unlikely. The debug line in the stage frame will log input.pressed directly.\n\nI will add a frame trace logging the screen state, menu status, and uiAccept pressed or held flags. I will rebuild and run a short test with Enter to inspect the output.\n\nI ruled out the simulation consuming Enter before the menu. Because the modal check returns empty intents, the simulation never sees the button and pressedNow stays intact. I will now search the minified bundle to confirm that menu.update is actually present in the running frame function.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b3d4d333-5110-4e8b-929f-95ee98d66f80-117","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\").read_text()\nidx = text.find('window.addEventListener(\"keydown\"')\n# search backwards for frame(\nstart = text.rfind(\"frame(\", 0, idx)\nprint(\"frame at\", start)\nprint(text[start:start+1800])\nPY","description":"Extract the bundled frame function that updates the menu"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2230,"output_tokens":954,"cache_read_input_tokens":157824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"1dce36ce-dbab-4e12-991d-e6d86adef92e"}
