{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_733","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`kTA` returns true for trusted keydown events unless the key is Escape.\n\n`fTA` calls `A()` on trusted keydowns to unlock audio. The key still reaches the sink. The menu still misses Enter. I am checking the sink's `A.press` to see if Enter is gated or swallowed.\n\nThe sink's `press` method swallows keyboard keys when `listening` is active. Enter is caught by `hear()` and never added to the `down` set, so `pressed()` returns false.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36f8c342-afcb-4175-8c4c-a278e2031630-127","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.listen\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-36f8c342-afcb-4175-8c4c-a278e2031630-128","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"listen\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":983,"output_tokens":551,"cache_read_input_tokens":171648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c86d4f3e-f390-4a2e-ac0c-8b8ac6383f67"}
