: 0, 'age': 0, 'pebbles': 0, 'rank': '', 'prior': 0}, 'errors': []}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\\npython3 \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/hold-debug.py\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Read sim flow after holding Cross on Begin\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/call-6e84fe4f-02a9-4cfe-a1ef-c95141bd474d-153.log\",\"total_bytes\":414}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"b39c96f7-6de9-4ba9-ac72-db07ccccdcf0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_750","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The simulation is in the morning. The flow event is morning, mode event, line ask.\n\nThe empty event is expected. The next frame will copy the morning flow event into live.event and publish it.\n\nThe loop order is sample, step, then draw. If an action runs during draw, it queues for the next step. The current draw publishes the old snap, and the next iteration applies the action and publishes morning.\n\nThe empty event after 1.2 seconds suggests draws stopped after the begin frame. The action did apply, so at least one step ran. It may have executed immediately during draw because draw occurs between steps.\n\nThe empty event is expected because readSnap captured the old world at the start of the begin frame. The next frame should update it.\n\nIf subsequent frames never run, the simulation state was updated during that frame but the loop then stopped.\n\nA normal return from the frame should continue the loop. Something like engine.stop() or clock.pause() may have been called instead.\n\nshowPause pauses the inspector, but begin does not. The activity setup is unlikely to stop the renderer loop. A new possibility is that readSnap reads from a frozen recording rather than the live world.\n\nThe view's query may be stale. readSnap could keep reading the old title flow while __engine.state() reads the live morning world. This would explain why the event stays empty despite the engine state updating correctly. The loop is still running and errors are empty.\n\nThe HUD might be broken for the entire game. The note and disc both use readSnap, so a stale view world would prevent the activity line from appearing and the disc from moving. This could be a pre-existing bug or the frames may have truly stopped. If the view never refreshes, the game is broken on screen.\n\nI will wait longer to see if __game.event updates. I will also check the note text and sample the event twice. The 1.2 second hold was long enough for a normal step cycle, so the empty event is not just a timing issue. A comment in view.ts:309 says that restores and dev actions keep their trace read, which suggests readSnap may be permanently stale.\n\nThe page frame's world query may not see dev action changes until the next full world sync, and that sync might never happen. This could be a pre-existing bug that only affects the browser page while node tests still pass. The browse check only verifies screen state, not event state, so the shell continues. I will inspect how the page receives frame.world.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d749cb3-d143-4335-9165-0fda2cd9854d-154","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"frame\\(|onFrame|world","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1d749cb3-d143-4335-9165-0fda2cd9854d-155","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/view.ts","offset":290,"limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":356,"output_tokens":1491,"cache_read_input_tokens":193920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"86b18701-ed1e-4796-83a6-f175f74f83e7"}
