{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_759","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing from the previous conversation.\n\nThe Thumb Yoga game's Begin command runs but the page HUD stays stuck on the pre-game view. The engine state updates correctly, yet the page presentation does not follow. I need to fix this in the game code only.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The page reaches play, but the HUD stays on the title prompt while the sim is already in the morning check. I'll trace how the page reads the live flow and fix that before another full verify."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d172e562-4b3f-4981-84d5-a6ed0b05165a-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"ac1","content":"Hand-in records: PROGRESS, exit-interview, HTML, title","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"ac4","content":"10-foot shell: prove pad, attract, touch, and WebGPU fallback","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"ac5","content":"Group Class and AI Hub harness runs","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"Official verify, npm test, and npm run check","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"hud","content":"Fix page HUD so it follows live flow after Begin","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d172e562-4b3f-4981-84d5-a6ed0b05165a-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d172e562-4b3f-4981-84d5-a6ed0b05165a-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function readSnap|publish\\(|onFrame|frame\\.world|__game","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,mjs}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":19151,"output_tokens":661,"cache_read_input_tokens":10240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-7