{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_761","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"After Begin, the engine state shows morning/event flow, but readSnap from the drawn frame still shows title mode with an empty event and the PlayStation control prompt.\n\nThe inspector seed() call replaces the session and invalidates cached world handles. The first post-begin frame should show the new flow, but hold-debug waited 1200ms and still saw an empty event. Later frames are not reflecting the new flow either.\n\nThe drawing loop may be holding an old world snapshot from before game.begin. I will inspect how drawing.ts passes the world to onFrame and whether the loop stops after begin.\n\nThe hold-debug output comes from two separate sources: the inspector world via __engine.state() and the live page state via readSnap(drawn). If frames stopped after begin, the screen would remain play but the event would stay empty from the pre-begin snapshot. If frames continued, frame.world might be stale because it was captured before the session replacement.\n\nI am investigating why the drawing loop might stop after begin without throwing an error. The hold() state and live play flag look correct, and no page frame errors were recorded. A reseed during begin could be pausing the loop, or onFrame might be failing silently.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8290f15d-d5e8-44aa-bb36-4a772f086ed9-6","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"begin|seed|applySave|startEvent","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8290f15d-d5e8-44aa-bb36-4a772f086ed9-7","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"onFrame|session\\.world|function frame","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3721,"output_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":34048,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"bf90489f-a685-40a3-b8bb-77bcf4beb3fa"}
