{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_763","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `onFrame` function receives a session object from `parts.run!`.\n\nThe live world is mutated via `session.act` during `game.begin`. The current frame's snapshot is stale because it was captured before `pick()`. The next frame should read the updated state. However, the event remained empty after a 1200ms hold. Frames may have stopped after the begin frame. Alternatively, `readSnap` might not detect the flow component that `state()` sees. Another possibility is that `live.event` is overwritten back to its previous value.\n\nThe `frame()` function captures a snapshot before `pick()` runs. `pick()` mutates the world via `game.begin`. The subsequent `paint()` call uses that pre-mutation snapshot. This means `live.event` is set from stale data.\n\nThe frame loop might have stopped because `onFrame` is no longer being called. `game.begin` completed successfully, so an exception during the action is unlikely. The loop's error handler did not fire. A backgrounded page could also be halting `requestAnimationFrame`.\n\nPlaywright should keep the page foregrounded, so headless throttling is unlikely. The hold-debug waited for the play screen and then 1200ms, yet no updates appeared. If the animation loop were still running, later frames would have changed the note text from the title. I need to inspect paint() and check whether a silent error after the first successful begin is clearing the errors array.\n\nThe ECS engine may use a double buffer. Mutations during `game.begin` could be written to the back buffer, so `readSnap` sees stale data while `__engine.state()` reads the write buffer directly. This would explain why `state()` reports morning while the snapshot stays empty.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2c308051-abe0-44ce-9ffc-bca2bbd79445-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"act\\(|function state|publish|commands","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"*.ts","head_limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2c308051-abe0-44ce-9ffc-bca2bbd79445-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":470,"limit":200}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3819,"output_tokens":941,"cache_read_input_tokens":42240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"bbf0f5d4-14f3-4ff7-991d-bc5f7ae4d445"}
