{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_765","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"modal() returns true when the screen is 'title' or a menu is active.\n\nChecking whether modal pauses simulation stepping. The game.begin action already mutates the world during onFrame, so the next step should see the new flow. session.act calls sync() before and after world.run.\n\nThe live session world is passed to onFrame, so mutations should be visible immediately. However, readSnap runs before menu.pick() calls game.begin, meaning the first frame still reads the old snapshot. The next frames should see the new state, but they may not be executing.\n\nAn exception in loop.frame after the draw that set screen to play could have stopped the loop. The errors array was empty, so the exception may have been swallowed inside draw before reaching onError. Another possibility is that something resets flow back to title every step before drawing. I will examine the title mode step.\n\nThe flow component contains mode 'event' and other fields. The query shape appears correct.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af890452-e1f5-43b0-9fb6-dcff5cc80316-16","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":100,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-af890452-e1f5-43b0-9fb6-dcff5cc80316-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"modal","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2406,"output_tokens":865,"cache_read_input_tokens":51456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"4af5fa5d-1bf0-4af6-a1d9-64f492fa1