{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_766","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found something important in `applyPrefs` and `noteDevice`.\n\n`applyPrefs` sets the note to the prompt before `game.begin` runs. Then `paint()` uses an old snapshot from title mode with an empty line, so the sentence ends up blank.\n\nThe note correctly shows the prompt on the begin frame. The next frame should update it from the new snapshot. But frames might be stopping. `padDown` calls `noteDevice('gamepad')` after `pick()`. This resets the note to the prompt and publishes.\n\n`drive()` runs before `paint()`, so `noteDevice` resets the note to the prompt first. But `paint()` executes afterward and should overwrite it with the sentence if the snapshot contains a line. The sequence appears correct, so the blank note must have another cause.\n\n`noteDevice` is not the culprit. The real question is why the next frame's snapshot still lacks the morning event. I am now investigating whether `world.run` mutations are visible to queries immediately, and whether `startEvent` spawns a new flow entity while the old title flow remains first in the query.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d21e47d3-0390-4868-b7d1-fa76027a0ab9-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","offset":1,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d21e47d3-0390-4868-b7d1-fa76027a0ab9-19","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/hold-debug.py","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2768,"output_tokens":811,"cache_read_input_tokens":53760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"4e2738e9-276b-49d5-a846-fa877aa3c8ab"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d21e47d3-0390-4868-b7d1-fa76027a0ab9-18","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport './settings';\\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\\n10→import { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\\nconst BEAT = 45;\\n\\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\\n\\n20→/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\\n\\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 0,\\n  Adequate: 300,\\n  Composed: 550,\\n  Serene: 750,\\n  Unsettling: 900,\\n30→};\\n\\n/** The island lean. */\\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\\n}\\n\\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\\n40→  return {};\\n}\\n\\n/** A finite number argument. */\\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** A string argument. */\\n50→function strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** Who is driving this step. */\\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\\n  const island = islandOf(w);\\n  const base = leanFor(day);\\n  island.base = base;\\n70→  island.tiltX = base;\\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(id);\\n80→  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  flow.mode = 'event';\\n  flow.event = id;\\n  visit(flow, id);\\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n}\\n90→\\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n  let value = activity.score(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\\n  value = clampScore(value);\\n  flow.result = value;\\n100→  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\\n  }\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  act.done = 0;\\n  act.wait = 0;\\n110→  if (auto === 'attract') {\\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.mode = 'results';\\n}\\n\\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\\n120→  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.cursor += 1;\\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\\n130→}\\n\\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!item) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n140→  flow.day = item.day;\\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n150→  resetAct(act);\\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\\n  flow.event = 'evening';\\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\\n}\\n\\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n160→  resetAct(actOf(w));\\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\\n  flow.event = 'credits';\\n  flow.credits = 1;\\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\\n}\\n\\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\\n170→  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!next) {\\n    openCredits(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = next.day;\\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\\n180→  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport './settings';\\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\\n10→import { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\\nconst BEAT = 45;\\n\\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\\n\\n20→/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\\n\\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 0,\\n  Adequate: 300,\\n  Composed: 550,\\n  Serene: 750,\\n  Unsettling: 900,\\n30→};\\n\\n/** The island lean. */\\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\\n}\\n\\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\\n40→  return {};\\n}\\n\\n/** A finite number argument. */\\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** A string argument. */\\n50→function strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** Who is driving this step. */\\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\\n  const island = islandOf(w);\\n  const base = leanFor(day);\\n  island.base = base;\\n70→  island.tiltX = base;\\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(id);\\n80→  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  flow.mode = 'event';\\n  flow.event = id;\\n  visit(flow, id);\\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n}\\n90→\\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n  let value = activity.score(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\\n  value = clampScore(value);\\n  flow.result = value;\\n100→  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\\n  }\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  act.done = 0;\\n  act.wait = 0;\\n110→  if (auto === 'attract') {\\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.mode = 'results';\\n}\\n\\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\\n120→  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.cursor += 1;\\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\\n130→}\\n\\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!item) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n140→  flow.day = item.day;\\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n150→  resetAct(act);\\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\\n  flow.event = 'evening';\\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\\n}\\n\\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n160→  resetAct(actOf(w));\\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\\n  flow.event = 'credits';\\n  flow.credits = 1;\\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\\n}\\n\\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\\n170→  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!next) {\\n    openCredits(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = next.day;\\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\\n180→  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":180,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The day. Boot puts a seat and a programme on the world. Each step runs the activity, or the thumb\\n * that stands in for a player when `game.auto` is director or attract. Menus arrive as scene actions.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport './settings';\\nimport { activityById, findActivity } from './catalog';\\nimport { programme, type ProgrammeItem } from './data/days';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf, rowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';\\nimport { type Act, type Flow, type Island, emptyAct, part, resetAct, visit } from './state';\\nimport { drawSway, resetBalance } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** How long a result or an evening stays up when the director is walking. */\\nconst BEAT = 45;\\n\\n/** Attract shows each slice for about fifteen seconds, then the next. */\\nconst SLICE = 15 * 60;\\n\\n/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\\nconst SLICES = ['pose-a', 'pond', 'line', 'paddle', 'garden', 'tilt'];\\n\\n/** A rank a dev jump can stamp without playing the hold. */\\nconst RANK_SCORE: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 0,\\n  Adequate: 300,\\n  Composed: 550,\\n  Serene: 750,\\n  Unsettling: 900,\\n};\\n\\n/** The island lean. */\\nfunction islandOf(w: World): Island {\\n  return part<Island>(w, 'island');\\n}\\n\\n/** A plain object of action arguments, or an empty one. */\\nfunction rec(args: unknown): Record<string, unknown> {\\n  if (typeof args === 'object' && args !== null && !Array.isArray(args)) return args as Record<string, unknown>;\\n  return {};\\n}\\n\\n/** A finite number argument. */\\nfunction numArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): number | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** A string argument. */\\nfunction strArg(args: Record<string, unknown>, key: string): string | undefined {\\n  const value = args[key];\\n  return typeof value === 'string' ? value : undefined;\\n}\\n\\n/** Who is driving this step. */\\nfunction autoOf(w: World): string {\\n  return String(w.settings.get('game.auto'));\\n}\\n\\n/** Story lean for a residency day. Day 1 is 0.4 degrees, and each day adds half a degree. */\\nfunction leanFor(day: number): number {\\n  return 0.4 + 0.5 * (day - 1);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the day's lean onto the island. The mesh does not move. */\\nfunction applyLean(w: World, day: number): void {\\n  const island = islandOf(w);\\n  const base = leanFor(day);\\n  island.base = base;\\n  island.tiltX = base;\\n  island.tiltZ = 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** Starts one activity. Setup runs now, so its spawned guests exist before the next step. */\\nexport function startEvent(w: World, id: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const previous = findActivity(flow.event);\\n  if (previous && flow.mode === 'event') previous.teardown(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(id);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  flow.mode = 'event';\\n  flow.event = id;\\n  visit(flow, id);\\n  if (id.startsWith('pose')) visit(flow, 'pose');\\n  activity.setup(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** Scores the activity that just ended, then results, the next demo slice, or nothing for attract pebbles. */\\nfunction finishEvent(w: World, rank?: string): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const activity = activityById(flow.event);\\n  let value = activity.score(w);\\n  activity.teardown(w);\\n  if (rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank)) value = RANK_SCORE[rank] ?? value;\\n  value = clampScore(value);\\n  flow.result = value;\\n  flow.rank = rank !== undefined && Object.hasOwn(RANK_SCORE, rank) ? rank : rankOf(value);\\n  const auto = autoOf(w);\\n  if (auto !== 'attract') flow.pebbles += pebblesOf(flow.rank, Number(w.settings.get('game.pebbles.mult')));\\n  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\\n  }\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  act.done = 0;\\n  act.wait = 0;\\n  if (auto === 'attract') {\\n    const at = SLICES.indexOf(flow.event);\\n    startEvent(w, SLICES[(at + 1) % SLICES.length] ?? 'pose-a');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.mode = 'results';\\n}\\n\\n/** The next programme row, when the one that just finished is the row the cursor is on. */\\nfunction advance(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  const here = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!here || here.event !== flow.event) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.cursor += 1;\\n  openItem(w, list[flow.cursor]);\\n}\\n\\n/** Opens a programme row: an activity, the evening, or the credits. */\\nfunction openItem(w: World, item: ProgrammeItem | undefined): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!item) {\\n    flow.mode = 'roam';\\n    flow.event = '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = item.day;\\n  if (item.event === 'evening') openEvening(w);\\n  else if (item.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n  else startEvent(w, item.event);\\n}\\n\\n/** The stamp at the end of a day. */\\nfunction openEvening(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  flow.mode = 'evening';\\n  flow.event = 'evening';\\n  flow.line = 'evening.close';\\n  visit(flow, 'evening');\\n}\\n\\n/** The credits. The ferry does not come back. Free play stays available. */\\nfunction openCredits(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  resetAct(actOf(w));\\n  flow.mode = 'credits';\\n  flow.event = 'credits';\\n  flow.credits = 1;\\n  flow.line = 'credits.roll';\\n  visit(flow, 'credits');\\n}\\n\\n/** Leaves the evening for the next morning, and leans the island a little more. */\\nfunction sleep(w: World): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const list = programme();\\n  if (list[flow.cursor]?.event === 'evening') flow.cursor += 1;\\n  const next = list[flow.cursor];\\n  if (!next) {\\n    openCredits(w);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  flow.day = next.day;\\n  applyLean(w, next.day);\\n  if (next.event === 'credits') openCredits(w);\\n\",\"total_lines\":345}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d21e47d3-0390-4868-b7d1-fa76027a0ab9-19","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→\\\"\\\"\\\"Hold Cross until Begin, then confirm the loop is still drawing.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\\n\\nHTML = Path(\\n    \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\\\"\\n10→)\\nCHROME = os.path.expanduser(\\n    \\\"~/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\\\"\\n)\\nFLAGS = [\\n    \\\"--no-sandbox\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-unsafe-webgpu\\\",\\n    \\\"--enable-features=Vulkan\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-vulkan=swiftshader\\\",\\n    \\\"--use-angle=swiftshader\\\",\\n20→]\\nPAD = \\\"\\\"\\\"\\nwindow.__buttons = new Array(16).fill(0);\\nwindow.__axes = [0, 0, 0, 0];\\nnavigator.getGamepads = () => [{\\n  id: 'Scripted Pad (STANDARD GAMEPAD)',\\n  index: 0, connected: true, mapping: 'standard', timestamp: performance.now(),\\n  axes: window.__axes.slice(),\\n  buttons: window.__buttons.map((value) => ({ pressed: value > 0.5, touched: value > 0, value })),\\n}];\\n30→\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=CHROME, args=FLAGS)\\n    page = browser.new_page(viewport={\\\"width\\\": 1920, \\\"height\\\": 1080}, device_scale_factor=1)\\n    page.add_init_script(PAD)\\n    logs = []\\n    page.on(\\\"console\\\", lambda msg: logs.append(msg.text[:240]))\\n    page.on(\\\"pageerror\\\", lambda err: logs.append(f\\\"pageerror {err}\\\"))\\n    page.goto(HTML.as_uri())\\n40→    page.wait_for_function(\\\"() => window.__engine && window.__engine.ready === true\\\", timeout=60000)\\n    page.wait_for_timeout(300)\\n    page.evaluate(\\\"() => { window.__buttons[0] = 1; }\\\")\\n    page.wait_for_function(\\\"() => window.__game && window.__game.screen === 'play'\\\", timeout=8000)\\n    page.evaluate(\\\"() => { window.__buttons[0] = 0; }\\\")\\n    page.wait_for_timeout(1200)\\n    state = page.evaluate(\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"() => {\\n          const entities = (window.__engine.state() && window.__engine.state().entities) || [];\\n          const flow = entities.map((entity) => entity.flow).find(Boolean);\\n50→          return {\\n            screen: window.__game.screen,\\n            event: window.__game.event,\\n            focus: window.__game.focus,\\n            note: document.querySelector('[data-ui=note]') && document.querySelector('[data-ui=note]').textContent,\\n            