{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_767","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The current state shows morning with a line ask.\n\nThe live event is still empty across frames. I suspect world.query returns a frozen snapshot while state() shows live components. I need to check what sync() does after act().\n\nDrawing passes the world object directly, not a copy. readSnap runs after act() in the next frame. If sync() makes mutations visible, query should see them. I suspect components are buffered in a command buffer that state() flushes but query reads from an older generation until step(). Steps may also be skipped while modal is true.\n\nModal is false in the play screen, so steps should run. The loop may have stopped. I am checking engine.ts for step logic and whether draw errors are caught inside gfx.frame.\n\nNo frame errors were recorded, so the loop likely did not crash. The browser may be throttling rAF to zero in headless mode despite the visible page.\n\nI am now investigating whether world.query returns a render snapshot captured at the start of the frame in view.ts, separate from session.world. I will also check if query has a generation lag.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1437257-11eb-41c8-a3ed-7633a1385e95-20","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"query\\(|state\\(\\)|run\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim","glob":"world*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1437257-11eb-41c8-a3ed-7633a1385e95-21","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/engine.ts","offset":280,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3472,"output_tokens":859,"cache_read_input_tokens":56448,"cache_creation_in