{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_775","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A dev action's restarted() preserves the world and re-reads entities.\n\nI'll write a debug script to count animation frames and inspect tick state. The screen is set after run(), not game.begin.\n\nThe debug script confirmed that game.begin succeeded and the screen was set to play. Paint completed without errors, so the frame loop finished normally. The empty live.event is expected because the snap was read before begin.\n\nI'll add a quick probe to stage.ts to count frames and log snap state. Rebuilding the bundled HTML is slow, so I'm weighing whether to serve dev modules directly instead.\n\nI cannot serve dev modules directly because port 5173 is unavailable. I will add the frame probe to stage.ts and rebuild the bundled HTML to run the diagnosis.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-84bcb57d-6582-42d4-9c48-8de6a778abe9-37","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"get frames|steps:|paused","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/members.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-84bcb57d-6582-42d4-9c48-8de6a778abe9-38","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":369,"limit":55}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2659,"output_tokens":795,"cache_read_input_tokens":74752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"fa3b03bc-9e4c-4755-97b5-786b1ace202e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-84bcb57d-6582-42d4-9c48-8de6a778abe9-37","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-84bcb57d-6582-42d4-9c48-8de6a778abe9-38","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"369→    frame(drawn) {\\n370→      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const snap = readSnap(drawn);\\n      follow = snap.guest ? [snap.wx, snap.wy + 1.2, snap.wz] : [0, 1.4, 2];\\n      live.event = snap.event;\\n      live.mode = snap.mode;\\n      live.result = snap.mode === 'results' ? snap.result : runningScore(snap);\\n      live.calm = snap.calm;\\n      live.rank = snap.rank || live.rank;\\n      live.age = snap.age;\\n      live.pebbles = snap.pebbles;\\n380→      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\\n      if (menu && cancel && !cancelHeld && !input?.pressed('uiCancel')) menuCancel?.();\\n      acceptHeld = accept;\\n      cancelHeld = cancel;\\n      if (menu) {\\n        menu.update(drawn.dt);\\n390→        // Begin closes the menu inside update. Reading selected after that throws and stops the loop.\\n        if (menu) focus = labelOf(menu.selected);\\n      }\\n      if (input && !ended) drive(input, snap);\\n      if (\\n        engine &&\\n        !attract &&\\n        !hub &&\\n        front(screen) &&\\n        snap.mode === 'title' &&\\n400→        performance.now() - lastInput >= 10000\\n      )\\n        startAttract();\\n      if (!menu && !hub) openBeat(snap);\\n      if (\\n        attract &&\\n        screen !== 'settings' &&\\n        screen !== 'about' &&\\n        screen !== 'controls' &&\\n        screen !== 'programme' &&\\n410→        screen !== 'touch'\\n      )\\n        screen = 'attract';\\n      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\\n      setLook(snap);\\n      remember(snap);\\n      finishExit();\\n      paint(snap, drawn);\\n      hubView?.paint(screen, snap);\\n420→      publish();\\n    },\\n  };\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"369→    frame(drawn) {\\n370→      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const snap = readSnap(drawn);\\n      follow = snap.guest ? [snap.wx, snap.wy + 1.2, snap.wz] : [0, 1.4, 2];\\n      live.event = snap.event;\\n      live.mode = snap.mode;\\n      live.result = snap.mode === 'results' ? snap.result : runningScore(snap);\\n      live.calm = snap.calm;\\n      live.rank = snap.rank || live.rank;\\n      live.age = snap.age;\\n      live.pebbles = snap.pebbles;\\n380→      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\\n      if (menu && cancel && !cancelHeld && !input?.pressed('uiCancel')) menuCancel?.();\\n      acceptHeld = accept;\\n      cancelHeld = cancel;\\n      if (menu) {\\n        menu.update(drawn.dt);\\n390→        // Begin closes the menu inside update. Reading selected after that throws and stops the loop.\\n        if (menu) focus = labelOf(menu.selected);\\n      }\\n      if (input && !ended) drive(input, snap);\\n      if (\\n        engine &&\\n        !attract &&\\n        !hub &&\\n        front(screen) &&\\n        snap.mode === 'title' &&\\n400→        performance.now() - lastInput >= 10000\\n      )\\n        startAttract();\\n      if (!menu && !hub) openBeat(snap);\\n      if (\\n        attract &&\\n        screen !== 'settings' &&\\n        screen !== 'about' &&\\n        screen !== 'controls' &&\\n        screen !== 'programme' &&\\n410→        screen !== 'touch'\\n      )\\n        screen = 'attract';\\n      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\\n      setLook(snap);\\n      remember(snap);\\n      finishExit();\\n      paint(snap, drawn);\\n      hubView?.paint(screen, snap);\\n420→      publish();\\n    },\\n  };\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"offset\":369,\"limit\":55,\"raw_output\":\"    frame(drawn) {\\n      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const snap = readSnap(drawn);\\n      follow = snap.guest ? [snap.wx, snap.wy + 1.2, snap.wz] : [0, 1.4, 2];\\n      live.event = snap.event;\\n      live.mode = snap.mode;\\n      live.result = snap.mode === 'results' ? snap.result : runningScore(snap);\\n      live.calm = snap.calm;\\n      live.rank = snap.rank || live.rank;\\n      live.age = snap.age;\\n      live.pebbles = snap.pebbles;\\n      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\\n      if (menu && cancel && !cancelHeld && !input?.pressed('uiCancel')) menuCancel?.();\\n      acceptHeld = accept;\\n      cancelHeld = cancel;\\n      if (menu) {\\n        menu.update(drawn.dt);\\n        // Begin closes the menu inside update. Reading selected after that throws and stops the loop.\\n        if (menu) focus = labelOf(menu.selected);\\n      }\\n      if (input && !ended) drive(input, snap);\\n      if (\\n        engine &&\\n        !attract &&\\n        !hub &&\\n        front(screen) &&\\n        snap.mode === 'title' &&\\n        performance.now() - lastInput >= 10000\\n      )\\n        startAttract();\\n      if (!menu && !hub) openBeat(snap);\\n      if (\\n        attract &&\\n        screen !== 'settings' &&\\n        screen !== 'about' &&\\n        screen !== 'controls' &&\\n        screen !== 'programme' &&\\n        screen !== 'touch'\\n      )\\n        screen = 'attract';\\n      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\\n      setLook(snap);\\n      remember(snap);\\n      finishExit();\\n      paint(snap, drawn);\\n      hubView?.paint(screen, snap);\\n      publish();\\n    },\\n  };\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":592}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"47d0c7c5-6370-4ffa-8d32-5eceeff1bffc"}
