{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_779","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`recordedRun`'s `query` returns a frozen result from `world.query`.\n\nThe frozen copies are safe for reading current state. The page world queries the live world at call time, so it should see the morning state after begin. A diagnostic will run next.\n\nConfirmed `parts.run.session` is the live `run.recorded` world. The frozen snapshot should update correctly on the next frame.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63d073c8-e071-4e96-8f15-c9c5bb0fae5a-44","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pause|resume|clock","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-63d073c8-e071-4e96-8f15-c9c5bb0fae5a-45","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.pause\\(|\\.resume\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1220,"output_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":81280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"83819419-e677-480c-bb83-62fdd92e2f54"}
