{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_797","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HUD does update. The previous hold-debug test only waited 1200ms, but the frames are extremely slow.\n\nThe HUD catches up within 400–800 ms. The earlier 1200 ms test likely failed because the machine was overloaded or stalled.\n\nThe 1200 ms wait likely returned on the begin frame before the next draw. The event was still empty at +400 ms and only updated at +800 ms.\n\nThe frozen HUD was just one-frame lag under SwiftShader. The game is tracking the simulation correctly.\n\nRe-reading the snap in the same frame would show the morning line immediately, but that is not a blocker.\n\nThis probe confirms screen play, no errors, the note leaving the title prompt, and the event becoming morning.\n\nSim ticks advance from 8 to 26 and act ticks from 0 to 18. The loop is alive despite the low frame rate.\n\nThe single remaining menu element is the settings button, not an open menu. The title screen also had one menu element.\n\nFocus remains on \"Begin\" because the menu close does not clear it. This is cosmetic and not required for verify.\n\nProceeding to the official full verify now.\n\nThe full suite includes vitest checks, browser replay, onefile, browse.py with multiple boots and shell tests, touch, webkit, and four hub harnesses. The extremely slow frames will make this run very long.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The HUD does catch the morning line once the next frame draws. Frames are slow under SwiftShader, so the earlier 1.2s sample landed before that draw. Next I’ll check what the browser script asserts, then run the full verifier."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b7cd736-0633-4c4b-8ce2-55bab3863240-70","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"def once|def shell|def hold|wait_for|screen ===|note|FAIL|about","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/browse.py"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b7cd736-0633-4c4b-8ce2-55bab3863240-71","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Verification plan|verify.mjs|0 failures|npm test|npm run check","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/goal/plan.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1195,"output_tokens":1167,"cache_read_input_tokens":109824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ec4402d7-daf3-4db6-87e6-ef17a897c6fb"}
