{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eee25955-cf8a-443f-91f0-41bd951c0eb3-82","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"125→  const showSettings = (page: number) => {\\n    const items: MenuItem[] =\\n      page === 0\\n        ? [\\n            { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\\n130→            { label: `Effects ${pct(host.prefs.effects)}`, id: 'effects' },\\n            { label: `Voices ${pct(host.prefs.voices)}`, id: 'voices' },\\n            { label: host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'Icons Xbox' : 'Icons PlayStation', id: 'icons' },\\n            { label: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 'Steadier hands' : 'Hands as they are', id: 'assist' },\\n            { label: 'More', id: 'more' },\\n          ]\\n        : [\\n            { label: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 'Empty mats borrow staff' : 'Empty mats stay empty', id: 'cpu' },\\n            { label: 'Erase the save', id: 'erase' },\\n            { label: 'Controls', id: 'controls' },\\n140→            { label: 'Back', id: 'back' },\\n          ];\\n    host.open(\\n      items,\\n      'Settings',\\n      'settings',\\n      (id) => {\\n        const cycle = (key: 'music' | 'effects' | 'voices') => {\\n          const steps = [0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.6, 1];\\n          const at = steps.findIndex((step) => step >= host.prefs[key] - 0.001);\\n150→          host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, [key]: steps[(at + 1) % steps.length] ?? 0.1 };\\n        };\\n        if (id === 'music' || id === 'effects' || id === 'voices') cycle(id);\\n        if (id === 'icons') host.icons = host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'playstation' : 'xbox';\\n        if (id === 'assist') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, assist: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        if (id === 'cpu') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, cpu: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, icons: host.icons };\\n        host.applyPrefs();\\n        if (!host.attract && !host.hub) host.persist();\\n        if (id === 'more') showSettings(1);\\n160→        else if (id === 'erase') showErase();\\n        else if (id === 'controls') showControls();\\n        else if (id === 'back') backFromSettings();\\n        else showSettings(page);\\n      },\\n      backFromSettings,\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const backFromSettings = () => {\\n170→    if (host.hub) showHubPause();\\n    else if (host.live.mode === 'event' || host.live.mode === 'roam' || host.live.mode === 'results')\\n      showPause(host.pausePage);\\n    else showTitle();\\n  };\",\"content_concise\":\"125→  const showSettings = (page: number) => {\\n    const items: MenuItem[] =\\n      page === 0\\n        ? [\\n            { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\\n130→            { label: `Effects ${pct(host.prefs.effects)}`, id: 'effects' },\\n            { label: `Voices ${pct(host.prefs.voices)}`, id: 'voices' },\\n            { label: host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'Icons Xbox' : 'Icons PlayStation', id: 'icons' },\\n            { label: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 'Steadier hands' : 'Hands as they are', id: 'assist' },\\n            { label: 'More', id: 'more' },\\n          ]\\n        : [\\n            { label: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 'Empty mats borrow staff' : 'Empty mats stay empty', id: 'cpu' },\\n            { label: 'Erase the save', id: 'erase' },\\n            { label: 'Controls', id: 'controls' },\\n140→            { label: 'Back', id: 'back' },\\n          ];\\n    host.open(\\n      items,\\n      'Settings',\\n      'settings',\\n      (id) => {\\n        const cycle = (key: 'music' | 'effects' | 'voices') => {\\n          const steps = [0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.6, 1];\\n          const at = steps.findIndex((step) => step >= host.prefs[key] - 0.001);\\n150→          host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, [key]: steps[(at + 1) % steps.length] ?? 0.1 };\\n        };\\n        if (id === 'music' || id === 'effects' || id === 'voices') cycle(id);\\n        if (id === 'icons') host.icons = host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'playstation' : 'xbox';\\n        if (id === 'assist') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, assist: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        if (id === 'cpu') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, cpu: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, icons: host.icons };\\n        host.applyPrefs();\\n        if (!host.attract && !host.hub) host.persist();\\n        if (id === 'more') showSettings(1);\\n160→        else if (id === 'erase') showErase();\\n        else if (id === 'controls') showControls();\\n        else if (id === 'back') backFromSettings();\\n        else showSettings(page);\\n      },\\n      backFromSettings,\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const backFromSettings = () => {\\n170→    if (host.hub) showHubPause();\\n    else if (host.live.mode === 'event' || host.live.mode === 'roam' || host.live.mode === 'results')\\n      showPause(host.pausePage);\\n    else showTitle();\\n  };\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/menus.ts\",\"offset\":125,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"  const showSettings = (page: number) => {\\n    const items: MenuItem[] =\\n      page === 0\\n        ? [\\n            { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\\n            { label: `Effects ${pct(host.prefs.effects)}`, id: 'effects' },\\n            { label: `Voices ${pct(host.prefs.voices)}`, id: 'voices' },\\n            { label: host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'Icons Xbox' : 'Icons PlayStation', id: 'icons' },\\n            { label: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 'Steadier hands' : 'Hands as they are', id: 'assist' },\\n            { label: 'More', id: 'more' },\\n          ]\\n        : [\\n            { label: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 'Empty mats borrow staff' : 'Empty mats stay empty', id: 'cpu' },\\n            { label: 'Erase the save', id: 'erase' },\\n            { label: 'Controls', id: 'controls' },\\n            { label: 'Back', id: 'back' },\\n          ];\\n    host.open(\\n      items,\\n      'Settings',\\n      'settings',\\n      (id) => {\\n        const cycle = (key: 'music' | 'effects' | 'voices') => {\\n          const steps = [0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.6, 1];\\n          const at = steps.findIndex((step) => step >= host.prefs[key] - 0.001);\\n          host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, [key]: steps[(at + 1) % steps.length] ?? 0.1 };\\n        };\\n        if (id === 'music' || id === 'effects' || id === 'voices') cycle(id);\\n        if (id === 'icons') host.icons = host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'playstation' : 'xbox';\\n        if (id === 'assist') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, assist: host.prefs.assist > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        if (id === 'cpu') host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, cpu: host.prefs.cpu > 0.5 ? 0 : 1 };\\n        host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, icons: host.icons };\\n        host.applyPrefs();\\n        if (!host.attract && !host.hub) host.persist();\\n        if (id === 'more') showSettings(1);\\n        else if (id === 'erase') showErase();\\n        else if (id === 'controls') showControls();\\n        else if (id === 'back') backFromSettings();\\n        else showSettings(page);\\n      },\\n      backFromSettings,\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const backFromSettings = () => {\\n    if (host.hub) showHubPause();\\n    else if (host.live.mode === 'event' || host.live.mode === 'roam' || host.live.mode === 'results')\\n      showPause(host.pausePage);\\n    else showTitle();\\n  };\\n\",\"total_lines\":545}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"10feb60d-3c28-4eb2-94fd-d39e31e7f80b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_807","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"applyPrefs sets the glyph set and note text and publishes synchronously.\n\nXbox checks need no extra frame. Pad-down focus repeats after 0.35s if the edge is eaten; hold waits up to 8s. Hover focus will use onMove to update in the same event. Attract key and click should wait for a function in browse.py. After exiting attract mode, finishExit calls seed() and showTitle, but tests only check that attract is false.\n\nClick exit also needs the same wait_for_function fix, since pointerdown sets exitPending and finishExit runs on the next frame. A potential hold-to-exit bug was noted: button 0 is uiAccept, so hold may trigger menu acceptance before attract exits.\n\nThe hold-to-exit bug is harmless. The menu is closed when the button is first held, so the acceptance check runs before exitAttract. Once finishExit opens the menu, acceptHeld prevents the same button press from firing again.\n\nThe hold-to-exit sequence is confirmed safe. The button releases once attract mode ends, and the next test correctly holds Cross to Begin. Save-unchanged logic also works: remember skips while exitPending is true, then skips again in title mode after finishExit reseeds.\n\nThe pause hold-edge fires inside drive() on the same frame the button is held. showPause is synchronous, so the hold wait_for_function sees the pause screen immediately. It does not depend on a later frame.\n\nDev mode clicks are synchronous. The click handler calls pick immediately, so showPause and dev opening happen before the click returns. A 300ms wait is sufficient.\n\nThe slider uses a synchronous input event. It was likely tested in design; if verification fails, it will be fixed.\n\nAbout clicks are also synchronous. The text should appear in the DOM immediately when showAbout runs, so the 300ms wait for inner_text is fine.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-934053c5-be43-435a-bfb4-fe2256177d30-83","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/browse.py","offset":490,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":866,"output_tokens":1015,"cache_read_input_tokens":137600,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"825c15c9-99ea-475f-acdd-7e09941015c3"}
