{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_816","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"PLAY immediately displays the morning event and the sleep note.\n\nThe fix works. The next step is launching the official full verify. A monitor will watch the process PID to report completion, since verify.mjs only prints at the end.\n\nThe background command returns a task ID rather than the shell PID. The verify script will write its own PID to a file so the monitor can poll it directly.\n\nThe monitor will poll every 30 seconds. It will print DONE only if the log ends with zero failures and EXIT:0; otherwise it will print FAILED and the tail. The shell PID is sufficient because the child node process exits with it.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-911a713d-4a87-4011-afd0-fcdab1e1cfd2-95","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/watch-verify.sh","content":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Silent until the official verify process exits, or until it has run 25 minutes.\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\nPIDFILE=\"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\"\nLOG=\"$SCRATCH/verify.log\"\nTRACE=\"$SCRATCH/watch-verify.trace\"\nfor _ in $(seq 1 60); do\n  [ -f \"$PIDFILE\" ] && break\n  sleep 1\ndone\nif [ ! -f \"$PIDFILE\" ]; then\n  echo \"FAILED: verify.pid never appeared\"\n  exit 1\nfi\nPID=$(cat \"$PIDFILE\")\necho \"pid $PID start $(date -Is)\" >>\"$TRACE\"\nstart=$(date +%s)\nwarned=0\nwhile kill -0 \"$PID\" 2>/dev/null; do\n  now=$(date +%s)\n  if [ \"$warned\" -eq 0 ] && [ $((now - start)) -ge 1500 ]; then\n    warned=1\n    echo \"ACTION_REQUIRED: verify pid $PID still running after 25m\"\n  fi\n  sleep 30\ndone\nsleep 1\ntail=$(tail -n 8 \"$LOG\" 2>/dev/null | tr '\\n' ' | ')\necho \"exit $(date -Is) $tail\" >>\"$TRACE\"\nif grep -qx '0 failures' \"$LOG\" && grep -qx 'EXIT:0' \"$LOG\"; then\n  echo \"DONE: $tail\"\n  exit 0\nfi\necho \"FAILED: $tail\"\nexit 1\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-911a713d-4a87-4011-afd0-fcdab1e1cfd2-96","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\"\ncd \"$DEV\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=\"$HOME/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\"\nexport VERIFY_OUT=\"$SCRATCH\"\necho $$ > \"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\"\nnode labs/game/tools/verify.mjs > \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\" 2>&1\necho EXIT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\"","description":"Run official full verify to scratch log","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1581,"output_tokens":2045,"cache_read_input_tokens":148224,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5d9ea250-54c9-479d-af4e-cc3ae5b1ee37"}
