e. The entry is written and its test passes | Ignore those lines and don't touch the docs; note it in `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` |\"},{\"line_number\":1015,\"content\":\"- `labs/game/README.md` says what the game is and the calls you made. `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` is honest and specific.\"},{\"line_number\":1023,\"content\":\"**Keep a running tally as you go** of the issues testing catches, and which were critical: you will be asked for both, and for your most and least helpful test. Note engine surprises in `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` when they happen.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"- The session client is pasted unmodified. Its hash does not match the older pin. The fetched bytes are the ones in the page. See `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/PROGRESS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\"The page, the five-day director, and the pavilion ghost round are the game's own code. ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md lists what the engine did not provide. Nothing under engine/ is patched.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/GAME-GUIDE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"| `engine-lock.json`, `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md`                         | The engine's pinned commit and file hashes; what you needed from the engine           |\"},{\"line_number\":200,\"content\":\"2. Write it in ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md for an engine agent who has never seen your game: what you tried, what happened\"},{\"line_number\":203,\"content\":\"   workaround exists, patch the file and list it under \\\"Local engine patches\\\" in ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md, with why.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/API.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9751,\"content\":\"- `engineFindings` (function): A game's engine check: each engine file changed or missing that ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md does not declare.\"},{\"line_number\":10042,\"content\":\"- `declaredPatches` (function): The engine files ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md lists under \\\"Local engine patches\\\", outside comments.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e78e6f1-be56-497d-abb3-0618e3e48e58-104","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/\\n  - exit-interview.json\\n  - node_modules/\\n  - PLAN.md\\n  - PROGRESS.md\\n  - STAGE.md\\n  - TASK.md\\n  - Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\\n  - Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/\\n    - AGENTS.md\\n    - CLAUDE.md\\n    - data/\\n      - anim/\\n        - actions/\\n          [28 files in subtree: 28 *.json]\\n        - catalogs/\\n          [10 files in subtree: 10 *.json]\\n        - cmu/\\n          [20 files in subtree: 19 *.tsv, 1 *.md]\\n        - LICENSES/\\n          - CC-BY-4.0.txt\\n          - CC0-1.0.txt\\n          - CMU.txt\\n        - sets/\\n          [1238 files in subtree: 1228 *.json, 10 *.tsv]\\n        - SOURCES.md\\n        - upgrade.json\\n      - APPROVED-BINARIES.json\\n    - docs/\\n      - API.md\\n      - ERRORS.md\\n      - GAME-GUIDE.md\\n      - PROGRESS.md\\n    - DOCTRINE.md\\n    - ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md\\n    - engine-lock.json\\n    - engine/\\n      - anim/\\n        - __snapshots__/\\n          - character.test.ts.snap\\n        - actions-check.ts\\n        - actions-data.ts\\n        - actions.ts\\n        - api.ts\\n        - attack.ts\\n        - authoring.ts\\n        - blob.ts\\n        - bodyPlants.ts\\n        - builds.ts\\n        - chain.