{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_828","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A frame cannot execute an unbounded number of steps. The maximum likely falls between 5 and 8.\n\nBoot 2 passed within 8 seconds. Boot 1 failed due to cold GPU and shader initialization. A 30-second timeout should cover slow first frames but not a missed input. I suspect Playwright's init script and the engine's later getGamepads patch may overwrite the gamepad stub.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-dc450693-7850-46d2-9e58-7a10f2fc2239-121","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"getGamepads\\s*=","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656","glob":"*.{ts,js}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2728,"output_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":171776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5c6ea32e-98db-4dfc-9f7a-9a02b4003260"}
