{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_833","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boots passed with no boot failures.\n\nShell tests likely passed. Failures remain on iPhone 13 and iPad: both drew a touch stick, and the iPhone 13 attract mode did not run. Hub issues include a card failing to respond ready, ghost copies sending zero progress, and round-end failures for two or four players.\n\nGhosts are confirmed present. The engine ready flag is False after the round. Ready without a key press fails only for four players. The touch stick may still appear on phone profiles despite touch=off in main.ts. The attract screen shows a controller prompt instead of running.\n\nThe ready() call succeeded for two and three players within the deadline. The card-ready failure likely stems from the harness auto-pressing Enter while the attract flag remains false, perhaps because the controller prompt or settings screen blocks it. I will inspect main.ts touch handling and hub client code for card ready, player send, and progress.\n\nThe log shows players sent ready before the card arrived. The card likely never registered as listening, so the harness's Enter press on the card had no effect.\n\nThe card screen in stage.ts does map Enter and pointerdown to client.answer('ready'). The card-ready failure is therefore not caused by missing input handling.\n\nThe card-ready failure may be caused by the harness pressing Enter before the iframe gains focus or the card screen is active, or by an incorrect answer API. Zero player uploads suggest the round scene is not emitting seat state events, or the send logic is gated incorrectly. The engine ready flag being False at the end of the check is unexpected because fail() does not reset it.\n\nThe engine object still exists because ghosts remain readable, so the iframe was not destroyed. The ready flag is likely false because the page reloaded or a new engine replaced the old one after the round ended.\n\nThe `window.__engine` object is the inspector, not the Engine. The inspector's `ready()` getter returns `drawing.ready()`, which in turn returns `parts.ready`. That flag is set to true once and should remain true. This means the engine ready flag being false at the end of the check is unexpected.\n\nThe early signals object assigned to `window.__engine` before boot completes may still be present at the end of the check. That object hardcodes `ready()` to return false, which would explain why the engine ready flag is False even though the client sent a ready signal earlier.\n\nThe engine likely never finished booting because WebGPU is too slow with four iframes. The inspector's ready flag stays false while the simulation world still exists, since state() can read ghost entities even when the engine is not ready.\n\nThe scene boots before the renderer, so the simulation world exists even when the graphics layer fails. The ready flag stays false because the renderer never finishes initializing. With multiple iframes, SwiftShader may fail to warm up WebGPU for some engines before the harness ends. The check requires every iframe engine.ready to be true.\n\nThe watchdog calls AIHub.ready() at 14 seconds to meet the hub deadline, but the engine ready flag stays false. Even with two players and 45 seconds, the flag never flipped. The simulation world is clearly running because ghosts exist and zero scores were sent, yet the renderer never completes initialization.\n\nThe simulation loop starts only after renderer initialization, so a failed renderer would prevent the loop from running. Ghosts remain because they spawn during world creation before the loop begins. Zero scores may be sent by the page's time-up handler without any active simulation.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Boots and the retreat checks passed. Phone pages still draw a touch stick, and the hub iframes never report the engine ready or send player updates. I'll trace those two paths."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-457cd19c-d877-4af0-a0c5-106bdd1b5780-127","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-457cd19c-d877-4af0-a0c5-106bdd1b5780-128","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"touch-stick|touch=off|touch:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-457cd19c-d877-4af0-a0c5-106bdd1b5780-129","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ready\\(|answer\\(|progress|sendPlayer|player\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/hub.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5071,"output_tokens":2173,"cache_read_input_tokens":176768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"639d8d86-d983-4e39-8734-c2141641026c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-457cd19c-d877-4af0-a0c5-106bdd1b5780-127","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Thumb Yoga in a page. The island is the week. A hub session uses the pavilion instead.\\n * The hub's own query keys are stripped before the engine sees them. Music starts at a tenth.\\n */\\nimport { createAudio, createEngine, createStore } from '../../engine';\\nimport './audio/voice';\\nimport './looks/retreat';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\n10→import './sounds/songs';\\nimport './ui/actions';\\nimport type { HubClient } from './ui/hub';\\nimport { LINES } from './ui/lines/book';\\nimport { createPage } from './ui/stage';\\n\\n/** The session client, when the page was pasted into a hub build. */\\nconst hubClient = (window as unknown as { AIHub?: HubClient }).AIHub;\\n\\n/** The status line, shown until the first frame or a missing GPU. */\\n20→const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\\n\\n/** Starts the retreat, or says which browser can draw it. */\\nasync function boot(): Promise<void> {\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) {\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    if (hubClient?.active) hubClient.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const search = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\n30→  for (const key of [...search.keys()]) if (key.startsWith('aihub')) search.delete(key);\\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\\n  search.set('gfx.resolution', 'full');\\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:retreat');\\n  if (!search.has('cam') && !search.has('cam3')) search.set('cam3', 'chase');\\n  const info = hubClient?.active ? await hubClient.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\\n  if (info) {\\n    search.set('scene', round.id);\\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n  }\\n40→  const session = info !== null;\\n  const watchdog = session ? setTimeout(() => hubClient?.ready(), 14000) : 0;\\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'thumb-yoga:', mode: session || search.has('replay') ? 'demo' : 'play' });\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  audio.volume('music', 0.1);\\n  const touch = window.matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches;\\n  const page = createPage({ audio, store, hub: session, touch });\\n  const canvas = document.querySelector('canvas');\\n  if (!canvas) return;\\n  const engine = await createEngine({\\n50→    canvas,\\n    scenes: [island.id, round.id],\\n    search: `?${search}`,\\n    store,\\n    actionMap: 'actionMap:retreat',\\n    modal: () => page.modal(),\\n    cameraInput: () => ({ follow: page.follow() }),\\n    onFrame: (frame) => page.frame(frame),\\n  });\\n  if (session) clearTimeout(watchdog);\\n60→  if (!engine.ready) {\\n    if (session) hubClient?.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session) hubClient?.ready();\\n  page.bind(engine);\\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\\n}\\n\\n70→void boot();\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Thumb Yoga in a page. The island is the week. A hub session uses the pavilion instead.\\n * The hub's own query keys are stripped before the engine sees them. Music starts at a tenth.\\n */\\nimport { createAudio, createEngine, createStore } from '../../engine';\\nimport './audio/voice';\\nimport './looks/retreat';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\n10→import './sounds/songs';\\nimport './ui/actions';\\nimport type { HubClient } from './ui/hub';\\nimport { LINES } from './ui/lines/book';\\nimport { createPage } from './ui/stage';\\n\\n/** The session client, when the page was pasted into a hub build. */\\nconst hubClient = (window as unknown as { AIHub?: HubClient }).AIHub;\\n\\n/** The status line, shown until the first frame or a missing GPU. */\\n20→const msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\\n\\n/** Starts the retreat, or says which browser can draw it. */\\nasync function boot(): Promise<void> {\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) {\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    if (hubClient?.active) hubClient.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const search = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\n30→  for (const key of [...search.keys()]) if (key.startsWith('aihub')) search.delete(key);\\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\\n  search.set('gfx.resolution', 'full');\\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:retreat');\\n  if (!search.has('cam') && !search.has('cam3')) search.set('cam3', 'chase');\\n  const info = hubClient?.active ? await hubClient.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\\n  if (info) {\\n    search.set('scene', round.id);\\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n  }\\n40→  const session = info !== null;\\n  const watchdog = session ? setTimeout(() => hubClient?.ready(), 14000) : 0;\\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'thumb-yoga:', mode: session || search.has('replay') ? 'demo' : 'play' });\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  audio.volume('music', 0.1);\\n  const touch = window.matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches;\\n  const page = createPage({ audio, store, hub: session, touch });\\n  const canvas = document.querySelector('canvas');\\n  if (!canvas) return;\\n  const engine = await createEngine({\\n50→    canvas,\\n    scenes: [island.id, round.id],\\n    search: `?${search}`,\\n    store,\\n    actionMap: 'actionMap:retreat',\\n    modal: () => page.modal(),\\n    cameraInput: () => ({ follow: page.follow() }),\\n    onFrame: (frame) => page.frame(frame),\\n  });\\n  if (session) clearTimeout(watchdog);\\n60→  if (!engine.ready) {\\n    if (session) hubClient?.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session) hubClient?.ready();\\n  page.bind(engine);\\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\\n}\\n\\n70→void boot();\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file Thumb Yoga in a page. The island is the week. A hub session uses the pavilion instead.\\n * The hub's own query keys are stripped before the engine sees them. Music starts at a tenth.\\n */\\nimport { createAudio, createEngine, createStore } from '../../engine';\\nimport './audio/voice';\\nimport './looks/retreat';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport './sounds/songs';\\nimport './ui/actions';\\nimport type { HubClient } from './ui/hub';\\nimport { LINES } from './ui/lines/book';\\nimport { createPage } from './ui/stage';\\n\\n/** The session client, when the page was pasted into a hub build. */\\nconst hubClient = (window as unknown as { AIHub?: HubClient }).AIHub;\\n\\n/** The status line, shown until the first frame or a missing GPU. */\\nconst msg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#msg');\\n\\n/** Starts the retreat, or says which browser can draw it. */\\nasync function boot(): Promise<void> {\\n  if (!navigator.gpu) {\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    if (hubClient?.active) hubClient.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const search = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\\n  for (const key of [...search.keys()]) if (key.startsWith('aihub')) search.delete(key);\\n  search.set('touch', 'off');\\n  search.set('gfx.resolution', 'full');\\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:retreat');\\n  if (!search.has('cam') && !search.has('cam3')) search.set('cam3', 'chase');\\n  const info = hubClient?.active ? await hubClient.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }) : null;\\n  if (info) {\\n    search.set('scene', round.id);\\n    search.set('seed', String(info.seed));\\n  }\\n  const session = info !== null;\\n  const watchdog = session ? setTimeout(() => hubClient?.ready(), 14000) : 0;\\n  const store = createStore({ prefix: 'thumb-yoga:', mode: session || search.has('replay') ? 'demo' : 'play' });\\n  const audio = createAudio();\\n  audio.volume('music', 0.1);\\n  const touch = window.matchMedia('(hover: none) and (pointer: coarse)').matches;\\n  const page = createPage({ audio, store, hub: session, touch });\\n  const canvas = document.querySelector('canvas');\\n  if (!canvas) return;\\n  const engine = await createEngine({\\n    canvas,\\n    scenes: [island.id, round.id],\\n    search: `?${search}`,\\n    store,\\n    actionMap: 'actionMap:retreat',\\n    modal: () => page.modal(),\\n    cameraInput: () => ({ follow: page.follow() }),\\n    onFrame: (frame) => page.frame(frame),\\n  });\\n  if (session) clearTimeout(watchdog);\\n  if (!engine.ready) {\\n    if (session) hubClient?.fail('WebGPU required');\\n    if (msg) msg.textContent = LINES['no.gpu'] ?? '';\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session) hubClient?.ready();\\n  page.bind(engine);\\n  if (msg) msg.hidden = true;\\n}\\n\\nvoid boot();\\n\",\"total_lines\":70}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-457cd19c-d877-4af0-a0c5-106bdd1b5780-128","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95