ontent\":\" * (`?post.look=…`) joins before its first warm-up. With `gfx.warmUp: asked` (`asked`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts) the set\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\" * first (engine/gfx/warmup.ts); the style set joins the warm-up once and stays.\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\" * // const look = createPageLook({ post, styles, warmup: gfx.warmup, resolution: gfx.resolution, library: styles.library,\"},{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\" * //   quality: () => qualityBudget('auto', false) });\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"import type { QualityBudget } from '../gfx/quality';\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"import type { Warmup } from '../gfx/warmup';\"},{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"  /** The quality tier's budget now. */\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"  quality: () => Pick<QualityBudget, 'shadowCasters'>;\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"  /** Whether warm-ups compile only what the page draws (`gfx.warmUp: asked`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts); false if absent. */\"},{\"line_number\":88,\"content\":\"      stage.sky.budget(options.quality());\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/headless.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":232,\"content\":\"    // The replay holds the run's play; the page keeps its view (its look, quality, resolution, speed…), none of which\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/drawing.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * renderer is up. `createPageDrawing(parts, options)` gives the page's frame (`frame`: touch mode and the quality\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"import { qualityBudget, type QualitySetting } from '../gfx/quality';\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"import { warmsAsked } from '../gfx/warmup';\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\" * The cameras a warm-up compiles for (`gfx.warmUp`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts): every one of the view's in `all`, else\"},{\"line_number\":110,\"content\":\"  /** The current run's settings (`quality`). */\"},{\"line_number\":137,\"content\":\"  /** Touch mode this frame: the page's class and layer, and the quality tier's pixel caps. */\"},{\"line_number\":145,\"content\":\"    const quality = settings.get<QualitySetting>('quality');\"},{\"line_number\":146,\"content\":\"    parts.gfx!.resolution.cap(parts.governor ? parts.governor.budget(quality, on) : qualityBudget(quality, on));\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-979894f4-6ac8-4dd7-ab39-b04a785f9168-145","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The retreat look. High-key daylight, a dawn, a dusk, and a drained storm.\\n * Materials for the lawn, the shore, and the sea are defined here so the view can find them.\\n */\\nimport { defineLook, defineMaterial, defineSky } from '../../../engine';\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sand', {\\n  description: 'Shore sand and the mats.',\\n  color: '#F4E8C8',\\n10→  roughness: 0.9,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:lawn', {\\n  description: 'The upland lawn.',\\n  color: '#A9D98A',\\n  roughness: 0.85,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sea', {\\n20→  description: 'The sea around the island. The texture is drifted by moving the prop.',\\n  color: '#6FD0E8',\\n  map: { texture: 'texture:water', seed: 2, params: { base: '#6fd0e8' } },\\n});\\n\\nconst day = {\\n  dome: { show: true, turbidity: 2, rayleigh: 1, mieCoefficient: 0.005, mieDirectionalG: 0.8, exposure: 0.5 },\\n  sun: { color: '#fff0d8', intensity: 2.6, azimuth: 0.4, elevation: 1.05 },\\n  ambient: { sky: '#BFE9FF', ground: '#F4E8C8', intensity: 1.5 },\\n  fog: { color: '#c8eaf8', start: 50, end: 240, amount: 0.35 },\\n30→  backdrop: { haze: '#BFE9FF', tint: '#ffffff', layers: [] as [] },\\n};\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreat', {\\n  description: 'Brochure noon over an empty sea horizon.',\\n  background: '#BFE9FF',\\n  ...day,\\n});\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreatDawn', {\\n40→  description: 'The last morning. The sun is low and the sea is pale.',\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The retreat look. High-key daylight, a dawn, a dusk, and a drained storm.\\n * Materials for the lawn, the shore, and the sea are defined here so the view can find them.\\n */\\nimport { defineLook, defineMaterial, defineSky } from '../../../engine';\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sand', {\\n  description: 'Shore sand and the mats.',\\n  color: '#F4E8C8',\\n10→  roughness: 0.9,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:lawn', {\\n  description: 'The upland lawn.',\\n  color: '#A9D98A',\\n  roughness: 0.85,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sea', {\\n20→  description: 'The sea around the island. The texture is drifted by moving the prop.',\\n  color: '#6FD0E8',\\n  map: { texture: 'texture:water', seed: 2, params: { base: '#6fd0e8' } },\\n});\\n\\nconst day = {\\n  dome: { show: true, turbidity: 2, rayleigh: 1, mieCoefficient: 0.005, mieDirectionalG: 0.8, exposure: 0.5 },\\n  sun: { color: '#fff0d8', intensity: 2.6, azimuth: 0.4, elevation: 1.05 },\\n  ambient: { sky: '#BFE9FF', ground: '#F4E8C8', intensity: 1.5 },\\n  fog: { color: '#c8eaf8', start: 50, end: 240, amount: 0.35 },\\n30→  backdrop: { haze: '#BFE9FF', tint: '#ffffff', layers: [] as [] },\\n};\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreat', {\\n  description: 'Brochure noon over an empty sea horizon.',\\n  background: '#BFE9FF',\\n  ...day,\\n});\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreatDawn', {\\n40→  description: 'The last morning. The sun is low and the sea is pale.',\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/looks/retreat.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The retreat look. High-key daylight, a dawn, a dusk, and a drained storm.\\n * Materials for the lawn, the shore, and the sea are defined here so the view can find them.\\n */\\nimport { defineLook, defineMaterial, defineSky } from '../../../engine';\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sand', {\\n  description: 'Shore sand and the mats.',\\n  color: '#F4E8C8',\\n  roughness: 0.9,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:lawn', {\\n  description: 'The upland lawn.',\\n  color: '#A9D98A',\\n  roughness: 0.85,\\n});\\n\\ndefineMaterial('material:sea', {\\n  description: 'The sea around the island. The texture is drifted by moving the prop.',\\n  color: '#6FD0E8',\\n  map: { texture: 'texture:water', seed: 2, params: { base: '#6fd0e8' } },\\n});\\n\\nconst day = {\\n  dome: { show: true, turbidity: 2, rayleigh: 1, mieCoefficient: 0.005, mieDirectionalG: 0.8, exposure: 0.5 },\\n  sun: { color: '#fff0d8', intensity: 2.6, azimuth: 0.4, elevation: 1.05 },\\n  ambient: { sky: '#BFE9FF', ground: '#F4E8C8', intensity: 1.5 },\\n  fog: { color: '#c8eaf8', start: 50, end: 240, amount: 0.35 },\\n  backdrop: { haze: '#BFE9FF', tint: '#ffffff', layers: [] as [] },\\n};\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreat', {\\n  description: 'Brochure noon over an empty sea horizon.',\\n  background: '#BFE9FF',\\n  ...day,\\n});\\n\\ndefineSky('sky:retreatDawn', {\\n  description: 'The last morning. The sun is low and the sea is pale.',\\n\",\"total_lines\":100}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"3726611b-de70-473a-846a-037feecbcaf7"}
