{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_842","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I will complete the tasks in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer. I will ensure all items from TASK.md are present in this folder.\n\nThe last Thumb Yoga verification failed with 16 issues. These include touch stick visibility on iPhone 13 and iPad, missing attract on iPhone 13, and hub harness errors. I will fix the game code and rerun the verifier.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The last full verify still fails on the phone touch stick, iPhone attract, and every hub harness. I’ll fix those in the game page, then rerun the official verifier."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c540b07-0f78-411c-9041-908a7eb977ea-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"ac1","content":"ac1: Hand-in records: PROGRESS, exit-interview, HTML, title","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"ac4","content":"ac4: 10-foot shell: prove pad, attract, touch, and WebGPU fallback","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"ac5","content":"ac5: Group Class and AI Hub harness runs","status":"pending"},{"id":"verify","content":"verify: Official verify, npm test, and npm run check","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"fix-touch-hub","content":"Fix touch stick, phone attract, and hub ready/card in game code","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c540b07-0f78-411c-9041-908a7eb977ea-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c540b07-0f78-411c-9041-908a7eb977ea-2","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function createPage|screen =|hub:|touch:","glob":"**/labs/game/ui/stage.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8c540b07-0f78-411c-9041-908a7eb977ea-3","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"gfx\\.(resolution|quality|warm)","glob":"**/*.{ts,md}","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use"