 with (`drawn`), in the view's order.\"},{\"line_number\":5699,\"content\":\"- `createResolution` (function): Keeps `renderer`'s drawing buffer fitted to `canvas` and the `gfx.resolution` setting.\"},{\"line_number\":5713,\"content\":\"- `ResolutionSetting` (type): What `gfx.resolution` takes: `auto` (the look's mode, else `pixels`), or a mode held whatever the look asks.\"},{\"line_number\":6126,\"content\":\"- `warmsAsked` (const): Whether `settings` ask a page's warm-ups to compile only what it has drawn (`gfx.warmUp: asked`).\"},{\"line_number\":6129,\"content\":\"- `WARMUP_SETTINGS` (const): Its view setting `gfx.warmUp` (ADR-0008 amendment 11): what a page's warm-ups compile.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/engine.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" * `post.show`; the look's sky and style, engine/app/look.ts), warms up every pipeline the view needs (`gfx.warmUp`,\"},{\"line_number\":343,\"content\":\"    parts.look = createPageLook({ post, styles, warmup: gfx.warmup, resolution: gfx.resolution, library: materials!, quality: budget, asked: () => warmsAsked(settingsNow) }); // prettier-ignore\"},{\"line_number\":344,\"content\":\"    post.attach(gfx.warmup);\"},{\"line_number\":345,\"content\":\"    viewNow().stage.register(gfx.warmup, gfx.features);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/playback.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":37,\"content\":\"    fix: \\\"change only settings marked view during a replay (gfx.resolution, time.scale…); a setting that changes play belongs in the replay's own inputs\\\",\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/routes.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" *   `?gfx.resolution=full`): the settings schema checks each (engine/core/settings.ts), so `x set`, URL parameters\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/look.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":9,\"content\":\" * - **its resolution and textures** (WP 13.30): the mode its `resolution` asks for, drawn while `gfx.resolution` is\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\" * (`?post.look=…`) joins before its first warm-up. With `gfx.warmUp: asked` (`asked`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts) the set\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\" * // const look = createPageLook({ post, styles, warmup: gfx.warmup, resolution: gfx.resolution, library: styles.library,\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"  /** Whether warm-ups compile only what the page draws (`gfx.warmUp: asked`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts); false if absent. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/drawing.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\" * key now: both of the view's, so switching projection later builds nothing, or, with `gfx.warmUp: asked`, those\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\" * The cameras a warm-up compiles for (`gfx.warmUp`, engine/gfx/warmup.ts): every one of the view's in `all`, else\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"      gfx.resolution.update();\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/ERRORS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":313,\"content\":\"- Fix: change only settings marked view during a replay (gfx.resolution, time.scale…); a setting that changes play belongs in the replay's own inputs\"},{\"line_number\":719,\"content\":\"- Fix: register what the frame drew for the first time with gfx.warmup.register(id, { objects }), or add what changed to the shader key with gfx.warmup.keyPart(name, part), so the warm-up builds it first\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/warmup.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\" * idea for a registry. What a page's warm-ups compile is the view setting `gfx.warmUp` (`WARMUP_SETTINGS`).\"},{\"line_number\":65,\"content\":\" * Its view setting `gfx.warmUp` (ADR-0008 amendment 11): what a page's warm-ups compile. r182 builds a shader for each\"},{\"line_number\":74,\"content\":\"  'gfx.warmUp': {\"},{\"line_number\":85,\"content\":\"/** Whether `settings` ask a page's warm-ups to compile only what it has drawn (`gfx.warmUp: asked`). */\"},{\"line_number\":86,\"content\":\"export const warmsAsked = (settings: { get(path: string): unknown }): boolean => settings.get('gfx.warmUp') === 'asked';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/cutaway.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":32,\"content\":\" * // cutaway.register(gfx.warmup);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/set.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\" * // node x set gfx.resolution full\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/level/meshes.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\" * // meshes.register(gfx.warmup);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/terrain.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\" * // meshes.register(gfx.warmup);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-