{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_846","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Investigating warmCameras and settle to understand the stall. Also checking harness poke and the ready-without-a-key condition.\n\nChecking hub iframe size and gfx.governor settings. Reviewing round.ts scene complexity. The diagnosis is solid enough to implement. main.ts will set gfx.resolution, quality, and warmUp based on session type. Touch controls will be removed after engine creation even if the engine fails.\n\nTouch controls must be removed whenever the nodes exist, even if the engine is not ready. The touch test waits for ready, so removal after successful engine creation is sufficient. If the engine fails to become ready, the stick should still be removed before returning.\n\nConfirmed that removing the touch-stick and touch-knob nodes is safe. The touch layer's update() only toggles visibility and transforms, so detached nodes can still have properties set without throwing errors.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b3b56df-de97-4bdb-a733-ee4db57cd4db-17","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/ui/touch.ts","offset":170,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b3b56df-de97-4bdb-a733-ee4db57cd4db-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/harness.html","offset":370,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b3b56df-de97-4bdb-a733-ee4db57cd4db-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"async function warmCameras|function settle|warmUp","glob":"**/engine/app/engine.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1b3b56df-de97-4bdb-a733-ee4db57cd4db-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-x