{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_852","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking fitResolution for pixels mode to determine buffer size.\n\nChecking if low quality caps maxPixels even at full resolution. The desktop boot at 1920x1080 finished successfully, so the hub iframe at 1280x720 should not hang indefinitely.\n\nFour concurrent 1280x720 contexts likely deadlock under GPU contention. Cheaper settings may not prevent a WebGPU initialization deadlock. Using `gfx.warmUp=asked` to warm only one camera could avoid the bug.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22660774-f6bd-4f25-a178-31f99dcf7c89-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"defineLook\\(","glob":"**/*.{ts,js}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-22660774-f6bd-4f25-a178-31f99dcf7c89-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/resolution.ts","offset":90,"limit":70}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5879,"output_tokens":601,"cache_read_input_tokens":75776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"632fa852-6586-4183-8d3b-b48a1af86a92"}
