l;\\n  let menu: Menu | null = null;\\n\",\"context_after\":\"  let attract = false;\\n  let exitPending = false;\\n  let acceptHeld = false;\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8a0bcf0b-2708-40a0-b11e-3cb67c245ef0-45","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\",\"new_string\":\"      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\\n      else if (hub && hubView?.playing && screen === 'card') screen = 'play';\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\",\"old_line\":418,\"new_string\":\"      if (hub && hubView && !hubView.playing && screen !== 'pause' && screen !== 'about' && screen !== 'settings')\\n        screen = 'card';\\n      else if (hub && hubView?.playing && screen === 'card') screen = 'play';\",\"new_line\":418,\"context_before\":\"        screen !== 'touch'\\n      )\\n        screen = 'attract';\\n\",\"context_after\":\"      setLook(snap);\\n      remember(snap);\\n      finishExit();\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8a0bcf0b-2708-40a0-b11e-3cb67c245ef0-46","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"- The touch stick is drawn unless the page sets `touch=off`. A 10-foot game that must refuse touch play has to know that secret. A `createEngine` flag would be the obvious place.\",\"new_string\":\"- `touch=off` hides the touch layer but `createTouchLayer` still appends `.touch-stick`. A count of that class is 1 on a page that never draws a stick. The page removes `.touch-layer` after `createEngine`. A flag on `createEngine`, or skipping the node when touch is off, would match the setting.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"- The touch stick is drawn unless the page sets `touch=off`. A 10-foot game that must refuse touch play has to know that secret. A `createEngine` flag would be the obvious place.\",\"old_line\":17,\"new_string\":\"- `touch=off` hides the touch layer but `createTouchLayer` still appends `.touch-stick`. A count of that class is 1 on a page that never draws a stick. The page removes `.touch-layer` after `createEngine`. A flag on `createEngine`, or skipping the node when touch is off, would match the setting.\",\"new_line\":17,\"context_before\":\"- `headlessHost(engine).session.world` is a frozen recording. The live world is `createAppHost(...).session.world`, and `inspector.seed()` replaces that session, so a cached world goes stale. The frozen view should be named as a recording, and `seed` should say that old handles die.\\n- Query keys the engine does not know fail the boot. An AI Hub page arrives with `?aihub=1` and friends. Those keys have to be stripped from the string passed to `createEngine` or the page never starts. Unknown keys could be ignored.\\n- `input.prompt` is Xbox. A game whose default glyphs are PlayStation cannot use it. The prompt should follow the pad the browser reported, or the page should be able to set the family.\\n\",\"context_after\":\"- `gfx.resolution=auto`, when the look names no resolution, becomes `pixels` and caps the buffer around 330 lines. A check that the drawing buffer matches the view then fails on a correct page. `full` has to be set by hand.\\n- There is no `inspector.reset`. Live sliders put the defaults back by reading `describe('setting', path)` and calling `set`. A reset that restores every `game.*` default would match the dev-mode job.\\n- `node x new` prints `NEW_DOCS` lines about `labs/playground/…` even when the entry is written and its test passes. The docs check is tripping over its own guide. Those lines should not look like a failed command.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"9cce46b6-d073-4e7c-bb79-6b696257769b"}
