{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_862","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can import browse from a scratch script.\n\nThe script will add the tools directory to the path and import browse. It needs the HTML built first. Then it will probe touch() and a two-player hub in one browser, followed by iPhone in the same browser.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f897447-0a2d-467c-9c4b-7ee58cfc2539-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs","offset":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":708,"output_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":102144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"9c404199-e333-43cb-b3da-9c6b43b736b5"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-8f897447-0a2d-467c-9c4b-7ee58cfc2539-56","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"40→const inlined = html.replace(LOADED, (_tag, script, style) => {\\n  if (style) return `<style>${find(style)}</style>`;\\n  const code = find(script).replaceAll('</script', '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\n  if (code.includes('<!--')) throw new Error(`${script} holds \\\"<!--\\\": write it apart in the source`);\\n  return `<script type=\\\"module\\\">${code}</script>`;\\n});\\nconst client = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/session-client.txt', 'utf8');\\nconst tags = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/tags.html', 'utf8');\\nwriteFileSync(\\n  resolve(process.argv[2]),\\n50→  inlined.replace('<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />', () => `<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\\\n<script>\\\\n${client}</script>\\\\n${tags}`),\\n);\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"40→const inlined = html.replace(LOADED, (_tag, script, style) => {\\n  if (style) return `<style>${find(style)}</style>`;\\n  const code = find(script).replaceAll('</script', '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\n  if (code.includes('<!--')) throw new Error(`${script} holds \\\"<!--\\\": write it apart in the source`);\\n  return `<script type=\\\"module\\\">${code}</script>`;\\n});\\nconst client = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/session-client.txt', 'utf8');\\nconst tags = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/tags.html', 'utf8');\\nwriteFileSync(\\n  resolve(process.argv[2]),\\n50→  inlined.replace('<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />', () => `<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\\\n<script>\\\\n${client}</script>\\\\n${tags}`),\\n);\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs\",\"offset\":40,\"raw_output\":\"const inlined = html.replace(LOADED, (_tag, script, style) => {\\n  if (style) return `<style>${find(style)}</style>`;\\n  const code = find(script).replaceAll('</script', '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\n  if (code.includes('<!--')) throw new Error(`${script} holds \\\"<!--\\\": write it apart in the source`);\\n  return `<script type=\\\"module\\\">${code}</script>`;\\n});\\nconst client = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/session-client.txt', 'utf8');\\nconst tags = readFileSync('labs/game/hub/tags.html', 'utf8');\\nwriteFileSync(\\n  resolve(process.argv[2]),\\n  inlined.replace('<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />', () => `<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\\\n<script>\\\\n${client}</script>\\\\n${tags}`),\\n);\\n\",\"total_lines\":51}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"3b78ceb8-f0b5-4878-8aa5-ab987de73763"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_863","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Starting the one-file build. I'll write the probe script while it compiles.\n\nThe probe script will be placed in scratch. Verified that removing the touch layer element won't break the engine's touch updates. Also considering the hub screen state before publish and engine initialization.\n\nConfirmed the keydown listener is registered before the engine starts. The harness sends Enter only after ready() fires, so early answers are impossible. The card screen state only applies when hub is true.\n\nDesktop boot keeps full warmUp. Phone quality low shrinks resolution pixels but attract frames remain. The settings button is HTML and stays tappable. Desktop font size tests are unchanged.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The phone and hub pages were drawing too much for SwiftShader, and the hub said it was ready before any frame ran. I’m rebuilding the page and checking the iPhone and a two-player hub before the full verifier."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58d28b4f-b06b-4afa-817f-be42d9871b6e-57","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/probe-touch-hub.py","content":"\"\"\"One browser: iPhone stick/attract, then a 2-player hub. Drives the built HTML.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport sys\nfrom http.server import ThreadingHTTPServer\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\n\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parents[4] / \"work\" / \"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\" / \"labs\" / \"game\" / \"tools\"))\n\nimport browse  # noqa: E402\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright  # noqa: E402\n\nHTML = Path(\n    \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\"\n)\nOUT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    fails: list[str] = []\n    lines: list[str] = []\n    with sync_playwright() as p:\n        browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=browse.CHROME, args=browse.FLAGS)\n        try:\n            browse.touch(browser, p, HTML, fails)\n            print(\"TOUCH\", fails or \"ok\", flush=True)\n            root = HTML.parent\n            server = ThreadingHTTPServer((\"127.0.0.1\", 0), browse.handler(root))\n            port = server.server_address[1]\n            thread_target = __import__(\"threading\").Thread(target=server.serve_forever, daemon=True)\n            thread_target.start()\n            game = \"/\" + quote(HTML.name)\n            dev = next(path for path in root.iterdir() if path.is_dir() and (path / \"labs/game/hub/harness.html\").exists())\n            harness = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}/{quote(dev.name)}/labs/game/hub/harness.html\"\n            query = \"players=2&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=8000\"\n            browse.run_hub(browser, f\"{harness}?game={quote(game, safe='/')}&{query}\", query, lines, fails)\n            server.shutdown()\n        finally:\n            browser.close()\n    (OUT / \"probe-touch-hub.log\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    for item in fails:\n        print(f\"FAIL {item}\", flush=True)\n    print(\"0 failures\" if not fails else f\"{len(fails)} failures\", flush=True)\n    return 1 if fails else 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58d28b4f-b06b-4afa-817f-be42d9871b6e-58","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\" && node labs/game/tools/onefile.mjs \"../Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\"","description":"Rebuild the one-file game page","block_until_ms":120000}}],"stop_reas