{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_872","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The two-player hub passed completely.\n\nReady without key works. Touch input passes on both devices. The four-player hub still fails to ready despite the watchdog. A probe with four concurrent contexts is needed before full verification. Memory is 10Gi but other Chrome processes are running.\n\nThe prior four-player run completed without OOM, so memory is not the issue. I will probe with exactly four players first. If that passes, full verification follows; if it fails, I will fix before the long run.\n\nI will run the four-player probe via a quick inline Python one-liner rather than editing the script. I also need to verify that the previous browser session is fully closed before starting this test.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The two-player hub and both phone checks passed. Next I’ll stress four players, which was the case that never became ready."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0af2d9ab-16b7-49be-bb9d-eb148521fe42-67","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\npython3 - << 'PY' > \"$SCRATCH/probe-hub4.out\" 2>&1\nimport sys\nfrom http.server import ThreadingHTTPServer\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import quote\nimport threading\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools\")\nimport browse\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nHTML = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\")\nfails = []\nlines = []\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=browse.CHROME, args=browse.FLAGS)\n    try:\n        root = HTML.parent\n        server = ThreadingHTTPServer((\"127.0.0.1\", 0), browse.handler(root))\n        threading.Thread(target=server.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()\n        game = \"/\" + quote(HTML.name)\n        dev = next(path for path in root.iterdir() if path.is_dir() and (path / \"labs/game/hub/harness.html\").exists())\n        harness = f\"http://127.0.0.1:{server.server_address[1]}/{quote(dev.name)}/labs/game/hub/harness.html\"\n        query = \"players=4&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=8000\"\n        browse.run_hub(browser, f\"{harness}?game={quote(game, safe='/')}&{query}\", query, lines, fails)\n        server.shutdown()\n    finally:\n        browser.close()\nPath(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/probe-hub4.log\").write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines)+\"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\nfor item in fails:\n    print(\"FAIL\", item[:500])\nprint(\"0 failures\" if not fails else f\"{len(fails)} failures\")\nPY\necho EXIT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/probe-hub4.out\"","description":"Probe the 4-player hub harness","block_until_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1403,"output_tokens":1238,"cache_read_input_tokens":111616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"a3f5fffe-f620-4ce6-bb86-1410a29aeb52"}
