:\\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(executable_path=browse.CHROME, args=browse.FLAGS)\\n    page = browser.new_page(viewport={\\\"width\\\": 1280, \\\"height\\\": 720})\\n    page.goto(url)\\n    for i in range(45):\\n        page.wait_for_timeout(1000)\\n        rows = page.evaluate(\\\"\\\"\\\"() => [...document.querySelectorAll('iframe')].map((frame) => {\\n          const win = frame.contentWindow;\\n          const eng = win && win.__engine;\\n          return {\\n            ready: !!(eng && eng.ready),\\n            errors: (eng && eng.errors && eng.errors.length) || 0,\\n            client: !!(win && win.AIHub && win.AIHub.active),\\n          };\\n        })\\\"\\\"\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"t={i+1}\\\", rows, flush=True)\\n        if rows and all(r[\\\"ready\\\"] for r in rows):\\n            break\\n    browser.close()\\nserver.shutdown()\\nPY\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Time when each 4-player iframe becomes ready\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc%2Fwork/01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc/terminal/call-46a791ca-0367-4e31-8b2e-9d1054fd40dc-79.log\",\"total_bytes\":3246}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"599e13d8-cbb8-49bd-b9b7-5042fe9735a7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_883","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All four engines were ready by 16 seconds.\n\nThe harness failed to detect p1, p2, and p3 as ready within 20 seconds. Engine readiness at t=16 should have triggered client.ready() immediately, so the delay is puzzling. The timing probe and conformance probe may differ, or client.ready() might not map to the harness's readiness check.\n\nThe 20-second window starts at hello, not page load. Engines ready by t=16 should still fit within it. Both probes use the same URL and run conformance, so the discrepancy is puzzling.\n\nThe 20-second readiness window begins after hello, which runs during connect() before createEngine. This timing gap likely explains why the harness missed p1, p2, and p3.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d98f951e-9df0-4046-978d-fba6fd93b4e3-80","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"\\.ready|ready:","glob":"**/labs/game/hub/{harness.html,bridge.js,round.js}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2679,"output_tokens":651,"cache_read_input_tokens":124544,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"07cf2ed1-e0a7-49c2-8b67-f2871454a49c"}
