{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5df39a46-80d9-4ab4-b7f3-d648e28f8736-88","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"300→      return promise;\\n    }\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    root.addEventListener('message', onMessage);\\n    var started = now();\\n    var hello = function () {\\n      if (welcomed) return;\\n      if (now() - started > HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS) {\\n        standAlone();\\n        warn('no hub answered; playing normally');\\n310→        done(null);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      post('hello', { v: 1, client: VERSION, mode: opts.mode || null, seats: opts.seats || null, card: opts.card === true });\\n      setTimeout(hello, HELLO_EVERY_MS);\\n    };\\n    hello();\\n    return promise;\\n  };\\n\\n320→  /** Everything is loaded: at once when info.splash, otherwise from the player's ready gesture. */\\n  hub.ready = function () {\\n    if (!welcomed || sentReady || ended) return;\\n    sentReady = true;\\n    post('ready', {});\\n  };\\n\\n  /** On the game's own card (connect({ card: true })): this player is 'ready', or asks for 'more' time (again takes it back). */\\n  hub.answer = function (what) {\\n    if (!welcomed || ended || goAt !== null) return;\\n330→    if (what !== 'ready' && what !== 'more') return warn('answer is ready or more');\\n    post('answer', { answer: what });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on = function (type, fn) {\\n    (handlers[type] = handlers[type] || []).push(fn);\\n    if (pending[type] && !pending[type].flushing) {\\n      pending[type].flushing = true;\\n      setTimeout(function () {\\n        var queued = pending[type];\\n340→        delete pending[type];\\n        for (var i = 0; i < queued.length; i++) emit(type, queued[i]);\\n      });\\n    }\\n    return function () {\\n      var list = handlers[type] || [];\\n      var at = list.indexOf(fn);\\n      if (at !== -1) list.splice(at, 1);\\n    };\\n  };\",\"content_concise\":\"300→      return promise;\\n    }\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    root.addEventListener('message', onMessage);\\n    var started = now();\\n    var hello = function () {\\n      if (welcomed) return;\\n      if (now() - started > HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS) {\\n        standAlone();\\n        warn('no hub answered; playing normally');\\n310→        done(null);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      post('hello', { v: 1, client: VERSION, mode: opts.mode || null, seats: opts.seats || null, card: opts.card === true });\\n      setTimeout(hello, HELLO_EVERY_MS);\\n    };\\n    hello();\\n    return promise;\\n  };\\n\\n320→  /** Everything is loaded: at once when info.splash, otherwise from the player's ready gesture. */\\n  hub.ready = function () {\\n    if (!welcomed || sentReady || ended) return;\\n    sentReady = true;\\n    post('ready', {});\\n  };\\n\\n  /** On the game's own card (connect({ card: true })): this player is 'ready', or asks for 'more' time (again takes it back). */\\n  hub.answer = function (what) {\\n    if (!welcomed || ended || goAt !== null) return;\\n330→    if (what !== 'ready' && what !== 'more') return warn('answer is ready or more');\\n    post('answer', { answer: what });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on = function (type, fn) {\\n    (handlers[type] = handlers[type] || []).push(fn);\\n    if (pending[type] && !pending[type].flushing) {\\n      pending[type].flushing = true;\\n      setTimeout(function () {\\n        var queued = pending[type];\\n340→        delete pending[type];\\n        for (var i = 0; i < queued.length; i++) emit(type, queued[i]);\\n      });\\n    }\\n    return function () {\\n      var list = handlers[type] || [];\\n      var at = list.indexOf(fn);\\n      if (at !== -1) list.splice(at, 1);\\n    };\\n  };\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt\",\"offset\":300,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"      return promise;\\n    }\\n    opts = opts || {};\\n    root.addEventListener('message', onMessage);\\n    var started = now();\\n    var hello = function () {\\n      if (welcomed) return;\\n      if (now() - started > HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS) {\\n        standAlone();\\n        warn('no hub answered; playing normally');\\n        done(null);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      post('hello', { v: 1, client: VERSION, mode: opts.mode || null, seats: opts.seats || null, card: opts.card === true });\\n      setTimeout(hello, HELLO_EVERY_MS);\\n    };\\n    hello();\\n    return promise;\\n  };\\n\\n  /** Everything is loaded: at once when info.splash, otherwise from the player's ready gesture. */\\n  hub.ready = function () {\\n    if (!welcomed || sentReady || ended) return;\\n    sentReady = true;\\n    post('ready', {});\\n  };\\n\\n  /** On the game's own card (connect({ card: true })): this player is 'ready', or asks for 'more' time (again takes it back). */\\n  hub.answer = function (what) {\\n    if (!welcomed || ended || goAt !== null) return;\\n    if (what !== 'ready' && what !== 'more') return warn('answer is ready or more');\\n    post('answer', { answer: what });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on = function (type, fn) {\\n    (handlers[type] = handlers[type] || []).push(fn);\\n    if (pending[type] && !pending[type].flushing) {\\n      pending[type].flushing = true;\\n      setTimeout(function () {\\n        var queued = pending[type];\\n        delete pending[type];\\n        for (var i = 0; i < queued.length; i++) emit(type, queued[i]);\\n      });\\n    }\\n    return function () {\\n      var list = handlers[type] || [];\\n      var at = list.indexOf(fn);\\n      if (at !== -1) list.splice(at, 1);\\n    };\\n  };\\n\",\"total_lines\":488}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"d3440acc-51d9-4cce-8072-72c84b28d67d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_890","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ready() posts once. Lost posts are never retried.\n\nThree of four players failed in the four-player test. That is too many for random 5% loss. The cause is likely a systematic bug. The main thread was ruled out because ready() runs after createEngine returns.\n\nThe harness main thread is unlikely to be blocked. The 20-second timeout begins only after every player finishes its hello handshake, not immediately when the engine starts.\n\nThe 20-second window should cover engine startup. The timing probe finished by t=16, well inside the limit. The failures may have been caused by machine load or slower browsers in that specific run.\n\nThe official four-player run failed before cheap graphics were applied. The timing probe succeeded with less contention. This confirms the 20-second window is tight and easily missed under load.\n\nCalling ready() immediately after connect would pass the 20-second check, but engines are not ready until t=10–16. The send check would run at t=12.5 before engines finish starting.\n\nThe current code calls ready() once every engine is ready, which happens before the 20-second limit. The timing probe passed because its last engine finished at 16 seconds. The conformance failures likely came from variance or message loss rather than a systematic bug.\n\nThe client code cannot be changed because its hash must match the HTML. The next step is to inspect the network simulator's loss implementation.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-51742393-6f78-4b0c-9979-d38924ec6c18-89","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"loss|function send|drop","glob":"**/labs/game/hub/{harness.html,net.js,bridge.js}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":659,"output_tokens":1182,"cache_read_input_tokens":135808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c54a1f8c-7ccb-47c2-88db-f573c8bbac38"}
