{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9b6bf6f1-a995-4322-ba15-b8c4a74feb85-92","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"100→  };\\n\\n  function fromGame(msg) {\\n    if (!msg || msg.aihub !== 1) return;\\n    if (!FROM_GAME.has(msg.type)) return issue(`unknown message type ${JSON.stringify(msg.type)}`);\\n    if (msg.type === 'fullscreen') return onFullscreen(msg.on === true);\\n    if (ended && msg.type !== 'error') return;\\n    switch (msg.type) {\\n      case 'hello':\\n        if (helloSent) return;\\n110→        helloSent = true;\\n        ownsCard = msg.card === true;\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'hello',\\n          v: msg.v,\\n          client: String(msg.client || ''),\\n          mode: msg.mode ?? null,\\n          seats: msg.seats ?? null,\\n          card: ownsCard,\\n        });\\n120→      case 'ready':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('ready before welcome');\\n        readySent = true;\\n        return toHub({ type: 'ready' });\\n      case 'answer':\\n        if (!ownsCard) return issue('answer without its own card: connect({ card: true })');\\n        if (!welcomed || started) return;\\n        if (msg.answer !== 'ready' && msg.answer !== 'more')\\n          return issue(`answer ${JSON.stringify(msg.answer)} is not ready or more`);\\n        return onAnswer(msg.answer);\\n130→      case 'result':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('result before welcome');\\n        return toHub({ type: 'result', time: msg.time, score: msg.score, stats: msg.stats, awards: msg.awards });\\n      case 'finish':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('finish before welcome');\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'finish',\\n          standings: msg.standings,\\n          scores: msg.scores,\\n          won: msg.won,\\n140→          stats: msg.stats,\\n          awards: msg.awards,\\n        });\\n      case 'error':\\n        return toHub({ type: 'error', message: String(msg.message || '').slice(0, 500), fatal: msg.fatal === true });\\n      case 'send':\\n        return sendGame(msg);\\n      case 'progress':\\n        return sendProgress(msg);\\n    }\\n150→  }\\n\\n  /** Progress goes to this hub's scoreboard and to every other player's, never to a game. */\\n  function sendProgress(msg) {\\n    if (!welcomed) return issue('progress before welcome');\\n    const p = cleanProgress(msg);\\n    if (!p) return issue('progress needs a finite score');\\n    const now = clock.now();\\n    if (now - progressAt < LIMITS.progressMs) {\\n      stats.dropped++;\",\"content_concise\":\"100→  };\\n\\n  function fromGame(msg) {\\n    if (!msg || msg.aihub !== 1) return;\\n    if (!FROM_GAME.has(msg.type)) return issue(`unknown message type ${JSON.stringify(msg.type)}`);\\n    if (msg.type === 'fullscreen') return onFullscreen(msg.on === true);\\n    if (ended && msg.type !== 'error') return;\\n    switch (msg.type) {\\n      case 'hello':\\n        if (helloSent) return;\\n110→        helloSent = true;\\n        ownsCard = msg.card === true;\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'hello',\\n          v: msg.v,\\n          client: String(msg.client || ''),\\n          mode: msg.mode ?? null,\\n          seats: msg.seats ?? null,\\n          card: ownsCard,\\n        });\\n120→      case 'ready':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('ready before welcome');\\n        readySent = true;\\n        return toHub({ type: 'ready' });\\n      case 'answer':\\n        if (!ownsCard) return issue('answer without its own card: connect({ card: true })');\\n        if (!welcomed || started) return;\\n        if (msg.answer !== 'ready' && msg.answer !== 'more')\\n          return issue(`answer ${JSON.stringify(msg.answer)} is not ready or more`);\\n        return onAnswer(msg.answer);\\n130→      case 'result':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('result before welcome');\\n        return toHub({ type: 'result', time: msg.time, score: msg.score, stats: msg.stats, awards: msg.awards });\\n      case 'finish':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('finish before welcome');\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'finish',\\n          standings: msg.standings,\\n          scores: msg.scores,\\n          won: msg.won,\\n140→          stats: msg.stats,\\n          awards: msg.awards,\\n        });\\n      case 'error':\\n        return toHub({ type: 'error', message: String(msg.message || '').slice(0, 500), fatal: msg.fatal === true });\\n      case 'send':\\n        return sendGame(msg);\\n      case 'progress':\\n        return sendProgress(msg);\\n    }\\n150→  }\\n\\n  /** Progress goes to this hub's scoreboard and to every other player's, never to a game. */\\n  function sendProgress(msg) {\\n    if (!welcomed) return issue('progress before welcome');\\n    const p = cleanProgress(msg);\\n    if (!p) return issue('progress needs a finite score');\\n    const now = clock.now();\\n    if (now - progressAt < LIMITS.progressMs) {\\n      stats.dropped++;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/bridge.js\",\"offset\":100,\"limit\":60,\"raw_output\":\"  };\\n\\n  function fromGame(msg) {\\n    if (!msg || msg.aihub !== 1) return;\\n    if (!FROM_GAME.has(msg.type)) return issue(`unknown message type ${JSON.stringify(msg.type)}`);\\n    if (msg.type === 'fullscreen') return onFullscreen(msg.on === true);\\n    if (ended && msg.type !== 'error') return;\\n    switch (msg.type) {\\n      case 'hello':\\n        if (helloSent) return;\\n        helloSent = true;\\n        ownsCard = msg.card === true;\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'hello',\\n          v: msg.v,\\n          client: String(msg.client || ''),\\n          mode: msg.mode ?? null,\\n          seats: msg.seats ?? null,\\n          card: ownsCard,\\n        });\\n      case 'ready':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('ready before welcome');\\n        readySent = true;\\n        return toHub({ type: 'ready' });\\n      case 'answer':\\n        if (!ownsCard) return issue('answer without its own card: connect({ card: true })');\\n        if (!welcomed || started) return;\\n        if (msg.answer !== 'ready' && msg.answer !== 'more')\\n          return issue(`answer ${JSON.stringify(msg.answer)} is not ready or more`);\\n        return onAnswer(msg.answer);\\n      case 'result':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('result before welcome');\\n        return toHub({ type: 'result', time: msg.time, score: msg.score, stats: msg.stats, awards: msg.awards });\\n      case 'finish':\\n        if (!welcomed) return issue('finish before welcome');\\n        return toHub({\\n          type: 'finish',\\n          standings: msg.standings,\\n          scores: msg.scores,\\n          won: msg.won,\\n          stats: msg.stats,\\n          awards: msg.awards,\\n        });\\n      case 'error':\\n        return toHub({ type: 'error', message: String(msg.message || '').slice(0, 500), fatal: msg.fatal === true });\\n      case 'send':\\n        return sendGame(msg);\\n      case 'progress':\\n        return sendProgress(msg);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  /** Progress goes to this hub's scoreboard and to every other player's, never to a game. */\\n  function sendProgress(msg) {\\n    if (!welcomed) return issue('progress before welcome');\\n    const p = cleanProgress(msg);\\n    if (!p) return issue('progress needs a finite score');\\n    const now = clock.now();\\n    if (now - progressAt < LIMITS.progressMs) {\\n      stats.dropped++;\\n\",\"total_lines\":377}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-9b6bf6f1-a995-4322-ba15-b8c4a74feb85-93","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"190→  /** A plain JSON copy, or undefined when it is not JSON. */\\n  function json(value) {\\n    try {\\n      var text = JSON.stringify(value);\\n      return text === undefined ? undefined : JSON.parse(text);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n200→  function post(type, fields) {\\n    var msg = { aihub: 1, type: type };\\n    for (var key in fields) if (own(fields, key)) msg[key] = fields[key];\\n    try {\\n      root.parent.postMessage(msg, origin);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      warn('could not reach the hub: ' + e.message);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n210→  function emit(type, args) {\\n    var list = handlers[type];\\n    if (!list || !list.length || pending[type]) {\\n      (pending[type] = pending[type] || []).push(args);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\\n      try {\\n        list[i].apply(null, args);\\n      } catch (e) {\",\"content_concise\":\"190→  /** A plain JSON copy, or undefined when it is not JSON. */\\n  function json(value) {\\n    try {\\n      var text = JSON.stringify(value);\\n      return text === undefined ? undefined : JSON.parse(text);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n200→  function post(type, fields) {\\n    var msg = { aihub: 1, type: type };\\n    for (var key in fields) if (own(fields, key)) msg[key] = fields[key];\\n    try {\\n      root.parent.postMessage(msg, origin);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      warn('could not reach the hub: ' + e.message);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n210→  function emit(type, args) {\\n    var list = handlers[type];\\n    if (!list || !list.length || pending[type]) {\\n      (pending[type] = pending[type] || []).push(args);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\\n      try {\\n        list[i].apply(null, args);\\n      } catch (e) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt\",\"offset\":190,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"  /** A plain JSON copy, or undefined when it is not JSON. */\\n  function json(value) {\\n    try {\\n      var text = JSON.stringify(value);\\n      return text === undefined ? undefined : JSON.parse(text);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      return undefined;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function post(type, fields) {\\n    var msg = { aihub: 1, type: type };\\n    for (var key in fields) if (own(fields, key)) msg[key] = fields[key];\\n    try {\\n      root.parent.postMessage(msg, origin);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      warn('could not reach the hub: ' + e.message);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  function emit(type, args) {\\n    var list = handlers[type];\\n    if (!list || !list.length || pending[type]) {\\n      (pending[type] = pending[type] || []).push(args);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {\\n      try {\\n        list[i].apply(null, args);\\n      } catch (e) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":488}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c88f6cdf-4f5f-4791-8faa-40ea252abf8e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_893","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bridge ready case is being prepared.\n\nThe bridge ready case returns an error if called before welcome. The client boot order ensures connect() resolves before createEngine(), so the client is already welcomed when ready() is called.\n\nThe bridge's welcome state is confirmed correct. The cause of the three failures in the four-player probe must be elsewhere, so the hub logs need closer inspection.\n\nThe protocol check passed, so no \"ready before welcome\" errors were logged. The ready messages for p1, p2, and p3 never arrived within 20 seconds. No error was recorded.\n\nThe timing probe showed engine.ready at 16 seconds. The conformance probe likely failed because createEngine was slower there, perhaps from machine busyness after the previous probe. The timing probe used the same URL and would have passed. engine.ready being true does not guarantee client.ready() has been called.\n\nThe synchronous call to client.ready() happens immediately after createEngine returns, so engine.ready at t=16 means the ready message was already sent before the browser poll could see it. The coordinator should have received it within milliseconds. The earlier confusion about timing windows is resolved.\n\nThe message may not be updating seat.ready. The copies() logic and phase gating look correct. I will re-run the four-player conformance probe now that engine startup is confirmed to finish by 16 seconds.\n\nIf the re-run passes, the earlier failure was just variance. I should still make init faster or call ready earlier to add margin. Calling ready() at the start of createEngine would give maximum margin but send the check too early at t≈12. To pass both checks, engines must loop for roughly eight seconds after the last ready(). The current approach lets the final engine trigger until() at t=16.\n\nThe send check should pass at t=24 if ready messages arrive. The hub4 failure confirms engines were not ready by the 20-second mark. Faster initialization is the only viable fix; delaying the harness is not possible.\n\nA robust fix is to call ready() immediately after connect, before createEngine. The screen is already 'card', so Enter answers instantly. This guarantees the 20-second check passes without waiting for engine startup.\n\nA lightweight sender outside the frame loop is impossible because sendLean depends on a snap inside hub.ts tick, which requires the engine. The slowest engine takes 16 seconds to start, so the 20-second check is already missed by 4 seconds. Early ready would only work if initialization could be cut by that same 4 seconds. A simpler look might achieve that.\n\nEarly ready alone would start the round too soon. The send check needs the engine by roughly t=11.5, but it currently takes t=16. That gap requires about a 30% speedup, which is uncertain. The better path is to skip early ready.\n\nThe timing probe already finishes engines at 16 seconds, so a plain look should push the slowest engine under 18 seconds with margin. The hub probe runs after boot, shell, and touch in the same browser, which warms the GPU but may fragment memory and slow startup. The fresh-browser timing run still hit 16 seconds, so the failure is likely variance rather than a systematic bottleneck.\n\nThe hub4 failure may be variance rather than a real bug. In the failing run, sends actually passed because engines became ready after the 20-second check and sent during play. The round started despite the ready check failing, and release() gives slow copies an extra 20 seconds.\n\nThe only bug is the 20-second ready window being shorter than the slowest engine boot. The failing run hit 25 seconds, which is inside the 45-second loadGrace window. Engines became ready after the ready check but before release, so sends worked fine. The timing probe at 16 seconds would have passed.\n\nCalling ready() immediately would break the fast run. The send check would fire at t≈12, but engines are not ready until t≈16. The current code only fails on slow runs.\n\nA plain look should cut shader time. If it halves the 16-second startup to 8 seconds, slow runs will finish under 20 seconds with margin.\n\nSerialization is impossible and pixel work is already minimal.\n\nThe sky dome is expensive. A flat-color sky without dome.show would be much cheaper.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1eabb10a-a6ef-4211-b5e1-acf3040a838a-94","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"defineSky\\('sky:","glob":"**/*.ts","head_limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1eabb10a-a6ef-4211-b5e1-acf3040a838a-95","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/sky.ts","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1125,"output_tokens":2443,"cache_read_input_tokens":139392,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"8fa43ad2-f667-454a-8abb-7f55e9f4cc2f"}
