,111,115,116,45,108,101,97,118,101,96,46,32,80,97,115,115,32,109,101,97,110,115,32,96,119,105,110,100,111,119,46,95,95,104,117,98,67,104,101,99,107,46,112,97,115,115,96,44,32,119,105,116,104,32,96,98,111,100,121,91,100,97,116,97,45,99,111,109,112,108,101,116,101,61,34,116,114,117,101,34,93,96,32,97,116,32,116,104,101,32,101,110,100,46,32,42,42,65,108,115,111,32,97,115,115,101,114,116,32,105,110,32,101,97,99,104,32,102,114,97,109,101,42,42,32,96,95,95,101,110,103,105,110,101,46,114,101,97,100,121,32,61,61,61,32,116,114,117,101,96,44,32,122,101,114,111,32,101,110,103,105,110,101,32,101,114,114,111,114,115,44,32,97,32,96,103,104,111,115,116,96,32,101,110,116,105,116,121,32,97,116,32,50,32,112,108,97,121,101,114,115,59,32,110,111,32,99,111,110,115,111,108,101,32,108,105,110,101,32,115,116,97,114,116,105,110,103,32,96,91,65,73,72,117,98,93,96,59,32,97,110,100,32,116,104,97,116,32,116,104,101,32,112,97,115,116,101,100,32,99,108,105,101,110,116,39,115,32,83,72,65,45,50,53,54,32,102,114,111,109,32,98,97,110,110,101,114,32,116,111,32,108,97,115,116,32,108,105,110,101,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,96,53,50,57,101,97,99,55,56,99,53,52,99,102,102,102,48,101,54,48,100,51,55,53,97,57,99,54,51,102,54,54,100,49,97,53,57,52,51,50,55,100,100,99,99,50,54,50,97,50,98,100,102,57,98,49,102,50,102,98,54,53,56,50,97,96,32,40,99,108,105,101,110,116,32,49,46,52,46,48,59,32,99,111,109,112,97,114,101,32,119,104,97,116,32,121,111,117,32,102,101,116,99,104,101,100,32,102,105,114,115,116,44,32,116,104,101,32,104,117,98,32,109,97,121,32,104,97,118,101,32,109,111,118,101,100,32,111,110,41,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":5,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":603,\"content\":\"answering while the game is dead. Strip those keys, and make your test assert, inside every frame, `__engine.ready === true` and\"},{\"line_number\":623,\"content\":\"- If `engine.ready` is false (no WebGPU): `AIHub.fail('WebGPU required')`.\"},{\"line_number\":926,\"content\":\"| Hub's `?aihub=…` in the query | `CORE_BAD_SETTING`, engine dead, harness still passes | Strip them; assert `__engine.ready` in every frame |\"},{\"line_number\":971,\"content\":\"- **Boot:** `__engine.ready`, zero errors, no WebGPU downgrade errors.\"},{\"line_number\":981,\"content\":\"- **Hub harness:** serve the built file beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` (Node `http` server or `python3 -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, read the port it prints, confirm the page is your game, stop only that PID: never `pkill`, `killall` or `fuser -k`). Run `harness.html?game=<file>&players=N&latency=150&jitter=50&loss=5&auto=1&play=8000` for N = 2, 3, 4, then `players=3&…&scenario=host-leave`. Pass means `window.__hubCheck.pass`, with `body[data-complete=\\\"true\\\"]` at the end. **Also assert in each frame** `__engine.ready === true`, zero engine errors, a `ghost` entity at 2 players; no console line starting `[AIHub]`; and that the pasted client's SHA-256 from banner to last line matches `529eac78c54cfff0e60d375a9c63f66d1a594327ddcc262a2bdf9b1f2fb6582a` (client 1.4.0; compare what you fetched first, the hub may have moved on).\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"b33b4782-4ee1-413a-bdbe-a51ab50fea0b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_897","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan requires asserting `__engine` in each frame.\n\nThe engine can become ready late. The harness only fails if ready is false at the end or errors appear after it turns true. The strategy is to call ready() after the engine is actually ready so the round waits for that copy.\n\nThe 20-second harness timeout is the actual failure point. A fresh browser took about 16 seconds with roughly 5 seconds of variance. The target is to bring typical boot time down to around 10 seconds so the p95 stays under 20.\n\nA pavilion look with no sky dome and no filters should cut shader compile time. The next step is to rebuild, time the four iframes again, and run conformance. If boot drops to about eight seconds, the twenty-second check passes and ready() can wait until the engine is fully ready. Calling ready() at twelve seconds before the engine is not viable because the round timer would start too early.\n\nA 12-second ready() call would start the round too early for engines that need 25 seconds to finish. The plan is to measure the plain look first, then add a 15-second ready() call and pump as a backup if boot still exceeds 18 seconds. I also need to check whether four iframes compile shaders serially.\n\nA plain look should warm up in about eight seconds total. The pavilion sky spec will use a flat noon background with the dome disabled so four hub copies can start without shader delays. A minimal spec will be used, and any engine errors will surface during probing.\n\nThe pavilion sky spec is now complete with a flat noon background, disabled dome, and no bloom or toon line. The hub will use this look while phones and desktops keep retreat. Next step is to rebuild and time the four iframes.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Four hub copies still miss the 20-second ready window when they all compile the full look. The pavilion will use a flat sky so those copies can start in time."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-327fe8a5-c269-4dc7-9b74-c0ffb267a089-99","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/looks/retreat.ts","old_string":"defineLook('look:retreat', {","new_string":"defineSky('sky:pavilion', {\n  description: 'Flat noon for a hub copy. The dome stays off so four of these can start together.',\n  background: '#BFE9FF',\n  dome: { show: false },\n  sun: { color: '#fff0d8', intensity: 2.2, azimuth: 0.4, elevation: 1.05 },\n  ambient: { sky: '#BFE9FF', ground: '#F4E8C8', intensity: 1.4 },\n  fog: { color: '#c8eaf8', start: 40, end: 180, amount: 0.2 },\n  backdrop: { haze: '#BFE9FF', layers: [] },\n});\n\ndefineLook('look:pavilion', {\n  description: 'Group Class on a hub mat. The same noon, without the toon line or the bloom.',\n  sky: 'sky:pavilion',\n});\n\ndefineLook('look:retreat', {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-327fe8a5-c269-4dc7-9b74-c0ffb267a089-100","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts","old_string":"  search.set('touch', 'off');\n  search.set('post.look', 'look:retreat');","new_string":"  search.set('touch', 'off');\n  search.set('post.look', info ? 'look:pavilion' : 'look:retreat');"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2186,"output_tokens":1541,"cache_read_input_tokens":145920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"f58444cd-3592-475f-9acd-d5ada42c9c07"}
