s, Morning Check, four bots, dev sliders, and the score-band tests.\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"- [ ] Scrubbed clips, Guest and Plumb, Pose Class, code voices, island, flow, saves, results.\"},{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"- [ ] Still Pond, The Line, Paddle Glide, Sand Garden, any later activities not cut, Great Tilt, and the 3-seed auto path to credits.\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"- [ ] Same-screen Group Class and hub ghosts; harness 2, 3, 4, and host-leave.\"},{\"line_number\":51,\"content\":\"- [ ] Attract, settings, controls, About, touch-only and no-WebGPU pages, songs, and 200+ lines.\"},{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"- [ ] `exit-interview.json`, HTML copied to the work root, full verify, and two consistent boots with logs under `{SCRATCH}`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"dc8a03bf-e0b8-430f-b008-8895d8e22f82"}
