{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_911","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Almost all verification passed. Only the players=4 check failed.\n\nThe 20-second window starts after all hellos finish. p3's card and ready arrive at 25.21, well past the limit. p0, p1, and p2 were ready within 20 seconds.\n\np2 was ready at 20.80, well inside the ~22.35 deadline. p3 missed by about three seconds. The card-sent check also failed because the ready check timed out first.\n\nThe isolated probe passed because the machine was less loaded. During verification, vitest, replay browser, boot, shell, touch, and hub all run together, heating the CPU and GPU and slowing p3. The 20-second ready window therefore expires before p3 can respond.\n\nTwo fixes are under consideration. One is to call ready() before createEngine finishes, though that risks starting the round before frames are ready. The other is to reduce initialization time by about four seconds under load.\n\nIn this run, p3 was removed by the harness at 30.72 seconds because n>=3 drops the last cell. The send check ran after p3 left, and the remaining players sent successfully.\n\nThe log shows cards are sent at the exact moment each player calls ready(). This means calling ready() earlier would not only pass the 20-second window, but also trigger card delivery immediately.\n\nThe card ticker sends cards to any cell with showsCard set, not only when a player calls ready(). Since showsCard is set during hello, cards should start at t=2. The 15.06 timestamp means the ticker was likely paused or blocked until ready() triggered it.\n\nThe 250ms ticker should run from the start, yet cards only appear at 15.06. The bridge likely delays sending until something else triggers it, or `bridge.card` does not log every tick. I am now reading the `post` function to find the exact send condition.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5b713971-b5ad-4e51-9eb4-8b8df830ae3e-120","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"showsCard|card\\(","glob":"**/labs/game/hub/bridge.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1937,"output_tokens":1490,"cache_read_input_tokens":163584,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"92d54117-895b-4c86-b029-0b293960c4c2"}
