{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_930","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`node x check` verifies assets and engine lock.\n\nOnly pycache files failed the check. Engine and docs are fine. I will delete pycache and run prettier on the 14 files. Then I will rerun the check. I need to verify that prettier does not alter titles.json.\n\nPrettier only reformats JSON. The title string is already fixed, so titles.json changes will not affect the shipped HTML. ESLint warnings are non-fatal and do not block checkAll.\n\nThe asset scan completed without launching a browser. I will set PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE to prevent future pycache files. After the check passes, I will update the goal plan and add a deviations bullet covering the removed content and revised scoring rules.\n\nI will place the deviations bullet after the task checklist. I am flipping all eight checkboxes to mark the remaining tasks complete.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9d3b2e94-01e9-4415-925d-4294804ed698-149","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\"\nrm -rf labs/game/tools/__pycache__\n./node_modules/.bin/prettier --write \\\n  labs/game/audio/voice.ts \\\n  labs/game/cast/rest.json \\\n  labs/game/cast/rest.ts \\\n  labs/game/hub/harness.html \\\n  labs/game/scenes/data/poses.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/data/trays.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/island.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/score.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/settings.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/state.ts \\\n  labs/game/scenes/wobble.ts \\\n  labs/game/sounds/songs.ts \\\n  labs/game/ui/save.ts \\\n  titles.json\necho PRETTIER:$?","description":"Format the files check named and drop bytecode"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2438,"output_tokens":1070,"cache_read_input_tokens":187904,"cache_creati