{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_937","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I will complete all tasks in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer. I will ensure all items from TASK.md are present in the folder.\n\nI need to re-run the hub harness for 2, 3, and 4 players, plus a 3-player host-leave test with latency 150, jitter 50, and loss 5. I must confirm each __hubCheck.pass. The one-file HTML was built during the prior verify before prettier ran, but the ready-signal fix was already present in that build.\n\nThe prior verify built the HTML with the ready-signal fix. Prettier reformatted bundled game sources afterward without rebuilding the HTML. I must rebuild the one-file HTML into the work root to include those changes.\n\nThe HTML from the prior verify already includes the ready-signal fix, so it does not predate that change. Prettier only reformatted source files afterward. I will re-run the hub harness on the current build and rebuild the one-file HTML if it predates the ready-signal fix.\n\nPrettier only reformatted code, so behavior is unchanged. I will rebuild the one-file HTML from current source to match the tree, then run all four hub harness scenarios against that rebuilt file. I will also update the todos and keep browser usage to two or fewer.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The last full verify passed, but the hub runs need to be repeated on the page that is actually in the work root. I’ll confirm that file includes the ready-signal fix, rebuild it if it does not, and run all four harnesses."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-227aec59-2c9b-4ceb-98a2-7e90c85f2d75-156","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"hub-rerun","content":"Re-run hub harness 2/3/4/host-leave on the shipped HTML","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"rebuild-html","content":"Rebuild one-file HTML if it predates the ready-signal fix","status":"in_progress"}],