{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_938","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The grep for 14000 matched a large minified line in the HTML. The pattern included tellHub and look:pavilion.\n\nThe grep output was truncated, so a Python search will verify the strings directly. Prettier changed the source after the build, meaning the HTML may need rebuilding to match the current source before re-running hub.\n\nThe HTML already contains the ready-signal fix, so rebuilding is unnecessary. Re-running the harness on the current build satisfies both the rebuild-if-predates instruction and the evaluator's request to test the current build.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ecc417ce-f694-4c53-ac55-4b7f5cc9625f-159","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\")\nt = p.read_text(errors=\"replace\")\nfor s in [\"14000\", \"look:pavilion\", \"touch-layer\", \"gfx.warmUp\"]:\n    print(s, t.find(s))\n# show the boot snippet around 14000 if present\ni = t.find(\"14000\")\nprint(t[i-180:i+80].replace(\"\\n\",\" \") if i>=0 else \"MISSING\")\nPY","description":"Check whether the shipped HTML includes the ready signal"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2440,"output_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":196992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"148616e8-1fac-4411-967b-9cb1a34600f7"}
