{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_939","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HTML contains \"look:pavilion\" but not \"14000\".\n\nThe HTML likely predates the watchdog. The pavilion look was added first and passed without it. Then the full verify failed on p3 because that HTML lacked the watchdog. The watchdog was added later, rebuilt, and now passes.\n\nThe HTML timestamp is 03:29. The onefile build passed, so the missing 14000 is unexpected. I will search the source near tellHub for setTimeout patterns.\n\nThe HTML may have been overwritten after the successful verify by an older build. I will check file timestamps against edit times. I also suspect esbuild may have inlined 14000 as 14e3 or 1.4e4, so I will search for those variants.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-798a6393-8ed0-4fa6-b04b-80d00f95686d-160","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nt = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html\").read_text(errors=\"replace\")\ni = t.find(\"look:pavilion\")\nprint(\"idx\", i)\nprint(t[i-500:i+700])\nprint(\"--- setTimeout count near ready ---\")\n# find .ready() calls in the last part of the file (game code is near the end)\n# search setTimeout(\nidx = 0\nn = 0\nwhile n < 15:\n    j = t.find(\"setTimeout\", idx)\n    if j < 0: break\n    if j > 6_500_000:\n        print(j, t[j:j+80].replace(\"\\n\",\" \"))\n        n += 1\n    idx = j+1\nPY","description":"Locate the hub boot sequence inside the shipped HTML"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":623,"output_tokens":720,"cache_read_input_tokens":199424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"fa80c889-5951-4dc8-844d-697778ddc50b"}
