{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_951","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine is assigned in bind(), which occurs after createEngine returns.\n\nThe pump before the loop runs while engine is null, so round.go waits but send and progress still proceed. Once tick starts, maybeGo reruns once the engine exists. I need to ensure `began` is only set true after a successful run when the engine exists. I also need to handle the case where engine() returns non-null but the inspector is not yet ready.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1bfa0b95-5499-4b55-a153-3f6028a500b8-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":340,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1bfa0b95-5499-4b55-a153-3f6028a500b8-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|FIXME|placeholder|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,js,mjs,py,md}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4665,"output_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":58240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"54a6225b-80fb-4ff6-9a62-c4acc46423b8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1bfa0b95-5499-4b55-a153-3f6028a500b8-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"340→  window.addEventListener(\\n    'pointermove',\\n    (event) => {\\n      if (event.pointerType === 'touch') return;\\n      if (Math.abs(event.movementX) + Math.abs(event.movementY) < 2) return;\\n      mouseDx += event.movementX;\\n      mouseDy += event.movementY;\\n      if (menu) return;\\n      if (performance.now() - touchAt > 700) {\\n        noteDevice('mouse');\\n350→        if (attract) exitAttract();\\n      }\\n    },\\n    true,\\n  );\\n\\n  applyPrefs();\\n  publish();\\n\\n  return {\\n360→    client: hub ? client : null,\\n    modal: () => menu !== null || screen === 'title' || screen === 'touch' || screen === 'card' || screen === 'about',\\n    follow: () => follow,\\n    bind(next) {\\n      engine = next;\\n      lastInput = performance.now();\\n      applyPrefs();\\n      if (!hub) {\\n        if (armed) menus.showTitle();\\n        else screen = 'touch';\\n370→      } else screen = 'card';\\n      publish();\\n    },\\n    frame(drawn) {\\n      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\",\"content_concise\":\"340→  window.addEventListener(\\n    'pointermove',\\n    (event) => {\\n      if (event.pointerType === 'touch') return;\\n      if (Math.abs(event.movementX) + Math.abs(event.movementY) < 2) return;\\n      mouseDx += event.movementX;\\n      mouseDy += event.movementY;\\n      if (menu) return;\\n      if (performance.now() - touchAt > 700) {\\n        noteDevice('mouse');\\n350→        if (attract) exitAttract();\\n      }\\n    },\\n    true,\\n  );\\n\\n  applyPrefs();\\n  publish();\\n\\n  return {\\n360→    client: hub ? client : null,\\n    modal: () => menu !== null || screen === 'title' || screen === 'touch' || screen === 'card' || screen === 'about',\\n    follow: () => follow,\\n    bind(next) {\\n      engine = next;\\n      lastInput = performance.now();\\n      applyPrefs();\\n      if (!hub) {\\n        if (armed) menus.showTitle();\\n        else screen = 'touch';\\n370→      } else screen = 'card';\\n      publish();\\n    },\\n    frame(drawn) {\\n      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"offset\":340,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  window.addEventListener(\\n    'pointermove',\\n    (event) => {\\n      if (event.pointerType === 'touch') return;\\n      if (Math.abs(event.movementX) + Math.abs(event.movementY) < 2) return;\\n      mouseDx += event.movementX;\\n      mouseDy += event.movementY;\\n      if (menu) return;\\n      if (performance.now() - touchAt > 700) {\\n        noteDevice('mouse');\\n        if (attract) exitAttract();\\n      }\\n    },\\n    true,\\n  );\\n\\n  applyPrefs();\\n  publish();\\n\\n  return {\\n    client: hub ? client : null,\\n    modal: () => menu !== null || screen === 'title' || screen === 'touch' || screen === 'card' || screen === 'about',\\n    follow: () => follow,\\n    bind(next) {\\n      engine = next;\\n      lastInput = performance.now();\\n      applyPrefs();\\n      if (!hub) {\\n        if (armed) menus.showTitle();\\n        else screen = 'touch';\\n      } else screen = 'card';\\n      publish();\\n    },\\n    frame(drawn) {\\n      shownFrame = drawn;\\n      const input = engine?.input;\\n      // A catch-up step can sample a press and drop it before this draw. A hold still shows here.\\n      const accept = input?.held('uiAccept') ?? false;\\n      const cancel = input?.held('uiCancel') ?? false;\\n      if (menu && accept && !acceptHeld && !input?.pressed('uiAccept')) menu.pick();\\n\",\"total_lines\":598}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1bfa0b95-5499-4b55-a153-3f6028a500b8-23","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"0f821245-0bfb-4453-be24-41383a977034"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_952","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Implementing the pump. Stopping the interval to prevent leaks and duplicate sends after completion.\n\nRate limits and duplicate sends are being avoided. The interval will be cleared on client end and at the start of each beat. Progress labels are fine.\n\nThe `start` handler sets up the pump interval and calls `beat` immediately. The beat function checks for completion before sending. A closure issue with `maybeGo` is noted.\n\nThe `maybeGo` function is being rewritten to check `going`, `reported`, and `env.ended()` before sending, and to trigger the round start only once via `began`. It will also report an initial score of zero while breathing in.\n\nThe `lastScore < 0` guard ensures \"Breathing in\" is reported exactly once. After that, the label switches to the class score.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5755187-b7fd-4976-9929-fe63e2722d4d-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt","offset":150,"limit":30}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":926,"output_tokens":973,"cache_read_input_tokens":62848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"bccb3801-6fff-4a62-8da1-2a41b9b0d9da"}
