{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_970","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All four harnesses passed, including the players=4 test.\n\nThe hub-rerun-2.out log is being checked for __hubCheck.pass and errors. A full official verify is needed because the HTML changed after the previous green run, making verify.log stale. The evaluator's instructions have been followed.\n\nThe rebuilt HTML includes the ready-signal fix. A full verify is required to re-test boots, seeds, replay, phones, and hubs against the updated file.\n\nThe hub harness already passed on the shipped HTML. The next step is to re-run npm test and npm run check after the browsers finish, then execute the full verify. The source changed after the last npm check, so the verification must be rerun against the updated bundle.\n\nThe hub log will be checked first. Then the full verify will run with a monitor. npm test and npm run check will follow only after the browsers finish. The verify will include the hub again for official proof. PROGRESS.md may be updated with a brief note about the hub clock.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-090190f7-bad9-49e0-9b5a-11789a97e1af-56","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/hub-rerun-2.out\").read_text()\nblocks = text.strip().split(\"\\n\")\ni = 0\nwhile i < len(blocks):\n    line = blocks[i]\n    if line.startswith(\"{\") or line.startswith(\"players\") or \"scenario\" in line:\n        print(\"QUERY\", line[:120])\n        if i+1 < len(blocks) and blocks[i+1].startswith(\"{\"):\n            data = json.loads(blocks[i+1])\n            print(\" pass\", data.get(\"pass\"))\n            checks = data.get(\"checks\") or []\n            bad = [c for c in checks if not c.get(\"pass\", c.get(\"ok\", True))]\n            # print structure of one check\n            if checks:\n                print(\" check0 keys\", checks[0].keys() if isinstance(checks[0], dict) else type(checks[0]))\n            print(\" ghosts\", data.get(\"ghosts\"))\n            print(\" aihub\", data.get(\"aihub\"))\n            # show failing checks if any\n            if isinstance(checks, list):\n                for c in checks:\n                    if isinstance(c, dict):\n                        ok = c.get(\"pass\")\n                        if ok is False or c.get(\"ok\") is False:\n                            print(\" BAD\", c)\n                    elif isinstance(c, (list, tuple)) and len(c) > 1 and c[1] is False:\n                        print(\" BAD\", c)\n            i += 2\n            continue\n    i += 1\nPY","description":"Summarize the four hub harness results"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":798,"output_tokens":1031,"cache_read_input_tokens":88960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"9b58829c-d681-4e28-8f86-faa693a93945"}
