{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_974","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"npm test passed with 22 tests. Seeds 1-3 credits were applied. Exit code was 0.\n\nOfficial verification is launching in the background. It will take about nine minutes and use browsers. The PROGRESS file will be updated only after it completes. No deviation needs to be added; this pump fix is a bugfix, not a design change.\n\nThe old verify.log will be copied to verify-before-pump.log before the new run overwrites it. This preserves evidence if the new verification fails.\n\nA monitor script in scratch will watch the verify log for the EXIT marker. It will print DONE or FAILED once verification finishes.\n\nThe verification will run with a ten-minute timeout. This keeps the current turn active until it finishes. Afterward, npm check and documentation updates can proceed.\n\nThe verification command will launch with block_until_ms 0 so it backgrounds immediately. A log monitor will poll the verify log until it sees the EXIT marker. The current turn ends while the job runs, and I will be notified when it finishes.\n\nCHROMIUM_PATH is exported to prevent a hang if the browser binary is missing. The verify script will rewrite HTML files even though the source already matches, which is harmless. Python bytecode cache files must be avoided because the previous run created browse.cpython-314.pyc.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9512b832-e73a-442a-81ad-6c286edd097f-60","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\"\nif [ -f \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\" ]; then cp \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\" \"$SCRATCH/verify-before-pump.log\"; fi\nrm -f \"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\"\ncd \"$DEV\"\nexport PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=\"$HOME/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\"\nexport PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1\nexport VERIFY_OUT=\"$SCRATCH\"\necho $$ > \"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\"\nnode labs/game/tools/verify.mjs > \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\" 2>&1\necho EXIT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/verify.log\"","description":"Run official verify against the pumped build","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9512b832-e73a-442a-81ad-6c286edd097f-61","name":"monitor","input":{"command":"SCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\nPIDFILE=\"$SCRATCH/verify.pid\"\nLOG=\"$SCRATCH/verify.log\"\nfor _ in $(seq 1 30); do [ -s \"$PIDFILE\" ] && break; sleep 2; done\nPID=$(cat \"$PIDFILE\" 2>/dev/null || true)\nif [ -z \"$PID\" ]; then echo \"FAILED: no verify pid\"; exit 1; fi\nwhile kill -0 \"$PID\" 2>/dev/null; do sleep 30; done\nif grep -qx '0 failures' \"$LOG\" && grep -qx 'EXIT:0' \"$LOG\"; then echo \"DONE: verify 0 failures\"; exit 0; fi\necho \"FAILED: $(tail -c 2000 \"$LOG\" | tr '\\n' ' ')\"\nexit 1","description":"Watch official verify until it exits","persistent":false}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1090,"output_tokens":1721,"cache_read_input_tokens":95744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"86dd4747-06e4-4ee7-b672-75c651d06751"}
