e engine in this workspace is unchanged. Thumb Yoga, the balance retreat, lives in labs/game.\\n\\nThe page, the five-day director, and the pavilion ghost round are the game's own code. ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md lists what the engine did not provide. Nothing under engine/ is patched.\\n\\nNext is to leave the engine as it is. The open items are requests in that feedback file, not defects in this tree.\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→# Progress\\n\\nThe engine in this workspace is unchanged. Thumb Yoga, the balance retreat, lives in labs/game.\\n\\nThe page, the five-day director, and the pavilion ghost round are the game's own code. ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md lists what the engine did not provide. Nothing under engine/ is patched.\\n\\nNext is to leave the engine as it is. The open items are requests in that feedback file, not defects in this tree.\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/PROGRESS.md\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"# Progress\\n\\nThe engine in this workspace is unchanged. Thumb Yoga, the balance retreat, lives in labs/game.\\n\\nThe page, the five-day director, and the pavilion ghost round are the game's own code. ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md lists what the engine did not provide. Nothing under engine/ is patched.\\n\\nNext is to leave the engine as it is. The open items are requests in that feedback file, not defects in this tree.\\n\",\"total_lines\":7}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"16b5afce-27c3-4643-9c5d-a21389ab6e6c"}
