{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_982","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A leftover file remains at `labs/game/tools/verify`.\n\nA different verify.mjs process is still running. It likely belongs to another agent or an adversarial harness, so it must not be killed.\n\nThe leftover verify.mjs is likely the evaluator. A stale `__pycache__/browse.cpython-314.pyc` must be deleted before `npm run check`, since that command rejects `.pyc` files as binary assets. Removing the cache is safe even if another process is currently using it.\n\nThe new verify process must not be killed. Our browsers have already exited, so running `npm run check` is safe and will not compete for resources.\n\nThe prior check predates the pump, so `npm run check` is required. The stale `__pycache__/browse.cpython-314.pyc` will be deleted immediately before that command to avoid a binary asset failure. A brief note about hub sends will be added to PROGRESS.\n\nThe monitor process has already exited. The HTML rebuild preserved the setInterval source. ENGINE-FEEDBACK will not be updated because this is a page-side issue, not an engine one.\n\nThe HTML rebuild timestamp is after the pump. The PROGRESS update and `npm run check` can run in parallel.\n\nThe PROGRESS update will note that a headless screenshot is least useful when the canvas is blank while the simulation runs fine. Before starting `npm run check`, memory will be checked to avoid an out-of-memory crash from the lingering verify process.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a7045f98-68eb-461b-8297-17a81fef72ee-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md","old_string":"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine.","new_string":"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine. A four-player session sends its lean from the hub clock. The fourth copy can still be compiling when the round opens, so the first score does not wait for a drawn frame."}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a7045f98-68eb-461b-8297-17a81fef72ee-78","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64\nexport CHROMIUM_PATH=\"$HOME/.cache/ms-playwright/chromium_headless_shell-1243/chrome-headless-shell-linux64/chrome-headless-shell\"\nexport PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1\nDEV=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656\"\nSCRATCH=\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer\"\nrm -rf \"$DEV/labs/game/tools/__pycache__\"\nfree -h | head -2\ncd \"$DEV\"\nnpm run check > \"$SCRATCH/npm-check.log\" 2>&1\necho EXIT:$? >> \"$SCRATCH/npm-check.log\"\n# a check that imports browse.py can recreate this, and x check rejects it\nrm -rf \"$DEV/labs/game/tools/__pycache__\"\ntail -40 \"$SCRATCH/npm-check.log\"","description":"Re-run npm run check and drop bytecode cache","block_until_ms":180000}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6403,"output_tokens":1650,"cache_read_input_tokens":108928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"8a8472b7-ccb9-4f5f-8a08-b22c8727a1e2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a7045f98-68eb-461b-8297-17a81fef72ee-77","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine.\",\"new_string\":\"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine. A four-player session sends its lean from the hub clock. The fourth copy can still be compiling when the round opens, so the first score does not wait for a drawn frame.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine.\",\"old_line\":9,\"new_string\":\"The four bot bands on ten seeds were the most helpful test. A headless screenshot was the least helpful, because the canvas can be blank while the sim is fine. A four-player session sends its lean from the hub clock. The fourth copy can still be compiling when the round opens, so the first score does not wait for a drawn frame.\",\"new_line\":9,\"context_before\":\"\\nCuts, in the plan's order: Great Tilt's counterweights, expert variants and outfits, Hoop Patrol, Reps Hall, Island Jog's race (the walk stays), Cliff Plunge, and Step Class. Group Class's middle class is Heron only. The group score is the 0–1000 mean of the three classes, so a rank still fits. The plan also described a sum to 3000. The island terrain is a 60 by 60 grid with cell size 4, which is 240 m, so SwiftShader can boot it.\\n\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\\nThe shipped golden is `labs/game/replays/still.replay.json`: 60 steps of `game:bench`, seed 1, platform `linux-x64`. A node test captures, perturbs, restores, and checks the golden hashes. The engine files were not changed.\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"Testing caught six issues before hand-in. Four were critical: the score bands, the island boot, the ghost seat, and event imports one folder too high. The other two were a NaN prop yaw and lines that ran past two sentences. \"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a7045f98-68eb-461b-8297-17a81fef72ee-78","content":"{\"type\":\"Bash\",\"output\":[32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,116,111,116,97,108,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,117,115,101,100,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,102,114,101,101,32,32,32,32,32,32,115,104,97,114,101,100,32,32,98,117,102,102,47,99,97,99,104,101,32,32,32,97,118,97,105,108,97,98,108,101,10,77,101,109,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,49,57,71,105,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,49,49,71,105,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,49,46,57,71,105,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,49,46,52,71,105,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,55,46,55,71,105,32,32,32,32,32,32,32,55,46,56,71,105,10,111,107,32,32,32,116,115,99,32,40,52,46,52,32,115,41,10,40,110,111,100,101,58,54,53,54,52,56,49,41,32,87,97,114,110,105,110,103,58,32,84,104,101,32,39,78,79,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,105,115,32,105,103,110,111,114,101,100,32,100,117,101,32,116,111,32,116,104,101,32,39,70,79,82,67,69,95,67,79,76,79,82,39,32,101,110,118,32,98,101,105,110,103,32,115,101,116,46,10,40,85,115,101,32,96,110,111,100,101,32,45,45,116,114,97,99,101,45,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,115,32,46,46,46,96,32,116,111,32,115,104,111,119,32,119,104,101,114,101,32,116,104,101,32,119,97,114,110,105,110,103,32,119,97,115,32,99,114,101,97,116,10