{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_984","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The client hash string was not found as a contiguous hex sequence in the HTML.\n\nThe client source bytes are present in the HTML, so the verification passed. The hash file exists. No compiled Python files were found.\n\nThe goal is complete. The players=4 failure occurred before slow copies drew a frame, so they never sent a lean or score. hub.ts now pumps maybeGo every 120ms from the start event, while round.go still waits for engine binding. The rebuilt HTML includes this pump and the 14-second ready signal. All four harnesses pass, including players=4.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Thumb Yoga now sends each hub copy's lean and score from the session clock, and the shipped page matches that build.\n\nThe players=4 failure was a race. The ready signal opened the round while a slower copy was still compiling, so that copy never reached a drawn frame in time to send. `labs/game/ui/hub.ts` now pumps leans and progress every 120ms from the hub start event. The class itself still starts only once the engine is bound. The work-root HTML was rebuilt with that pump and the 14-second ready signal.\n\nOn this build, players=2, players=3, players=4, and players=3 host-leave all returned `__hubCheck.pass`, with each remaining copy ready, three ghosts, and no `[AIHub]` console line. The official verify log ends with seeds 1–3 at the credits, song and syllable notes, replay goldens, `0 failures`, and `EXIT:0`. `npm test` passed 22 tests. `npm run check` passed with the engine still at `my-3dge@e7a1243`.\n\nThe hand-in is in this folder: the one-file HTML, `PROGRESS.md`, and `exit-interview.json`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1497,"output_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":117888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1