8,116,32,115,116,101,112,115,32,49,44,32,50,44,32,52,32,97,110,100,32,53,44,32,71,114,111,117,112,32,67,108,97,115,115,44,32,104,117,98,32,103,104,111,115,116,32,114,111,117,110,100,44,32,97,116,116,114,97,99,116,44,32,68,101,118,32,77,111,100,101,44,32,65,98,111,117,116,46,10,49,48,52,50,58,124,32,83,105,110,103,108,101,32,72,84,77,76,59,32,100,111,119,110,108,111,97,100,115,32,111,112,116,105,111,110,97,108,32,124,32,49,52,32,40,101,118,101,114,121,116,104,105,110,103,32,105,110,108,105,110,101,100,41,32,124,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":12,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":74,\"content\":\"| North Cliff | (0, -88), 14 m drop | Cliff Plunge |\"},{\"line_number\":144,\"content\":\"a sloppy thumb (350 ms, gain 0.8) 72%; a no-delay bot 100%. A ring of 0.16 drops the thumb to 65%. Off-centre seats out to\"},{\"line_number\":455,\"content\":\"  so the horizon stays level on screen while the island visibly tips. Use a sky with no silhouette backdrop for this.\"},{\"line_number\":459,\"content\":\"1. **Storm (20 s, cutscene).** The sky darkens, rain falls (`frame.emit`), the ferry horn sounds far away. Close-up: Plumb's\"},{\"line_number\":466,\"content\":\"   Wobble Model: your whole Cairn is on one of them. (First part to cut if the budget runs short.)\"},{\"line_number\":645,\"content\":\"  sky: 'sky:retreat', // start from sky:noon's numbers; replace its mountain backdrop with an empty sea horizon\"},{\"line_number\":862,\"content\":\"  2. Custom intents: `input.virtual.axis('game:mouse', [dx, dy])`. Held until changed, and dropped while `modal()` is true.\"},{\"line_number\":882,\"content\":\"**Key components** (plain data): `flow` (mode: front, roam, event, cutscene, results; event, phase, tick; day), `wobble` (per seat), `seat` (input per seat), `island` (tilt), `round`, `pebble`, `plaque`, `ghost`, plus one per activity. Time in whole steps, randomness from named streams, loops in `w.query` order, `Math.pow` not `**`.\"},{\"line_number\":936,\"content\":\"| `modal()` true **[source]** | Intents dropped, virtual device too | Menu picks go through scene actions |\"},{\"line_number\":969,\"content\":\"**Browser stages (the built file, on `file://` where possible).** Use the workspace's `@playwright/test` with `executablePath: process.env.CHROMIUM_PATH` and flags `--no-sandbox --enable-unsafe-webgpu --enable-features=Vulkan --use-vulkan=swiftshader --use-angle=swiftshader`. Or Python Playwright, already installed. One or two browsers at once; close them. \\\"Target closed\\\" means memory: run fewer, don't retry blindly. Firefox and WebKit have no WebGPU here, so the game can only run in Chromium; use WebKit only to check the \\\"no WebGPU\\\" page.\"},{\"line_number\":1005,\"content\":\"**Cut line, if and only if you run out of budget.** Cut whole things and re-flow `days.ts`, leaving no trace (no greyed-out rows, no mentions), in this order: Great Tilt step 3 → Expert variants and outfits → Hoop Patrol → Reps Hall → Island Jog's race (keep the walk) → Cliff Plunge → Step Class. Never cut: Morning Check, Pose Class, Still Pond, The Line, Sand Garden, Paddle Glide, Great Tilt steps 1, 2, 4 and 5, Group Class, hub ghost round, attract, Dev Mode, About.\"},{\"line_number\":1042,\"content\":\"| Single HTML; downloads optional | 14 (everything inlined) |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2efbdbc9-d546-4ade-9835-a77c91d0620f-26","content":"{\"type\":\"ListDir\",\"Content\":{\"content\":\"- /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/\\n  - audio.test.ts\\n  - audio/\\n    - voice.ts\\n  - cast/\\n    - clips.ts\\n    - rest.json\\n    - rest.ts\\n  - hub/\\n    - bridge.js\\n    - harness.html\\n    - round.js\\n    - session-client.txt\\n    - tags.html\\n  - index.html\\n  - island.test.ts\\n  - looks/\\n    - retreat.ts\\n  - main.ts\\n  - props/\\n  - README.md\\n  - replay.test.ts\\n  - replays/\\n    - still.replay.json\\n  - retreat.test.ts\\n  - scenes/\\n    - bench.ts\\n    - bot.ts\\n    - catalog.ts\\n    - data/\\n      - days.ts\\n      - lures.ts\\n      - poses.ts\\n      - trays.ts\\n    - driver.ts\\n    - events/\\n      - garden.ts\\n      - group.ts\\n      - kit.ts\\n      - line.ts\\n      - morning.ts\\n      - paddle.ts\\n      - pond.ts\\n      - pose.ts\\n      - tilt.ts\\n    - island.ts\\n    - round.ts\\n    - score.ts\\n    - settings.ts\\n    - state.ts\\n    - wobble.ts\\n  - sounds/\\n    - songs.ts\\n  - tools/\\n    - browse.py\\n    - onefile.mjs\\n    - verify.mjs\\n  - ui/\\n    - about-data.ts\\n    - actions.ts\\n    - glyphs.ts\\n    - hub.ts\\n    - lines/\\n      - book.ts\\n    - menus.ts\\n    - save.ts\\n    - screens/\\n    - snap.ts\\n    - stage.ts\",\"absolute_root_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game\"}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"2d79e4ed-4347-45c1-960b-d4701857a660"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_990","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a massive game. I need to hunt for real bugs.\n\nverify.mjs marks \"songs render\" and \"replay capture and restore continue\" unconditionally when vitest exits 0. The tests themselves must assert these behaviors. A hub client hash mismatch is also under review.\n\nThe hub client hash differs from the expected SHA even though the banner still reads 1.4.0. The injected client must be compared against the fetched file.\n\nSeveral content cuts were identified: the Great Tilt counterweights step, expert variants and outfits, Hoop Patrol, Reps Hall, Island Jog race, Cliff Plunge, and Step Class.\n\nThe deviation claims to cut Great Tilt steps 1, 2, 4, and 5. The plan actually forbids cutting those exact steps. Group Class middle class is Heron only. The plan may require three different classes. Group score uses mean rather than sum. This conflicts with the goal plan's 3000 target.\n\nThe group score mean versus sum is likely a documented resolution of an internal contradiction, not a bug.\n\nBoot logs omit pad and key changes to __game. Verification step 3 requires this output.\n\nThe browser log is too brief. It only prints \"font ok\" and \"about ok\". I need to check browse.py to see if it actually validates these or merely reports them.\n\nGhost traces are all zeros. This could mean lean magnitudes are missing or the values are per-frame error counts. hub-four.py must be checked to clarify.\n\nThe four-player test failed earlier but passes in the latest log.\n\nThe HTML pump fix must be verified in the actual markup, not just the passing run. The \"EXIT:0\" line in verify.log is added by a wrapper script, not verify.mjs itself. verify.mjs also runs browse.py during full test runs.\n\nBoot logs match and boot checks passed during verification. The pad and key changes to __game may be in browse.py rather than boot-1.log, so that file needs reading.\n\nI will now inspect retreat.test.ts, wobble.ts, score logic, activities, hub.ts, browse.py, and about-data for bugs. I will also scan labs/game for TODO or FIXME markers and verify the HTML is self-contained and matches the build.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-413a9a4d-b404-4850-9367-2ad09f1e13df-27","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^(describe|test|it)\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.test.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-413a9a4d-b404-4850-9367-2ad09f1e13df-28","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"TODO|FIXME|placeholder|unimplemented|stub","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,js,mjs,py,json,md}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-413a9a4d-b404-4850-9367-2ad09f1e13df-29","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/tools/browse.py","limit":200}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-413a9a4d-b404-4850-9367-2ad09f1e13df-30","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/hub.ts","limit":250}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7728,"output_tokens":1483,"cache_read_input_tokens":60288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"42f4f231-48b6-45d3-8ae6-121427c68d6d"}
