Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/about-data.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"  source: 'Wii Fit',\"},{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"  source: 'Wii Fit',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"A five-day balance retreat at Little Fulcrum, for one player or a couch of four. The only verb is where your weight sits inside a unit disc. Lean with the left stick, WASD, or a pointer-locked mouse. L2 and R2, or Q and E, are the feet. Both feet, or Space, breathe. Toppling recentres you. It is not a game over. Nothing here scores weight, size, or calories.\"},{\"line_number\":18,\"content\":\"`verify.mjs` runs the balance bands, the three-seed walk to the credits, the song and syllable renders, and the golden replay. Without `--quick` it also builds `../Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html` and drives that file. The HTML opens from `file://` and fetches nothing.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/tags.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"<meta name=\\\"hub:source\\\" content=\\\"Wii Fit\\\" />\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a90fff18-8169-43cf-8005-ddf78fcde801-36","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,10