\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\"  'tare.welcome': 'Welcome to Little Fulcrum. I am Tare.',\"},{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\"  'tare.measure': 'I no longer measure weight. Now I only measure how much you wobble.',\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"  'tare.drink': 'If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"  'plumb.meant': 'Good. Now do that again, but as though you meant it.',\"},{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\"  'plumb.knee': 'Your knee is where it should be. I mention it because it is rare.',\"},{\"line_number\":31,\"content\":\"  'plumb.fell': 'You fell. The mat forgives you.',\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"  'plumb.adequate': 'That was adequate. I chose that word carefully.',\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"  'plumb.four': 'Four more. I may be lying.',\"},{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"  'bex.mum': 'My mum says this is good for me. She is not here, which helps.',\"},{\"line_number\":86,\"content\":\"  'evening.close': 'Today you wobbled less than you might have. Goodnight.',\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"  'plaque.want': 'Did you know. The average person leans two degrees toward the things they want.',\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"  'plaque.moved': 'Did you know. This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"  'plaque.flamingo': 'Did you know. A flamingo stands on one leg because it has been told it is being watched.',\"},{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\"  'plaque.gulls': 'Did you know that gulls have no Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\"},{\"line_number\":95,\"content\":\"  'notice.even': 'Notice. Guests are reminded to distribute themselves evenly.',\"},{\"line_number\":96,\"content\":\"  'notice.lawn': 'Notice: the east lawn is fully booked. Please enjoy the east lawn.',\"},{\"line_number\":97,\"content\":\"  'notice.drink': 'Notice. If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"9a55a481-0876-41ef-9e2c-3c351b7a5a8b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_998","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The seed lines are shortened versions, not the full PLAN.md lines.\n\nSeveral PLAN.md seed lines are truncated in the shipped output. The full text includes \"It made people sad, and it made me sad\" and \"I may be lying. We will both find out.\"\n\nThe two-sentence limit forced the truncation. PLAN.md contains a contradiction: its seed lines are longer than two sentences, but the criterion requires them to be no longer than two short sentences. The goal plan notes this conflict in prompt feedback. Truncating to preserve the gist resolves the contradiction.\n\nThe contradiction is not explicitly listed in the goal plan, only in prompt feedback. Shortening lines to fit the two-sentence limit is a reasonable resolution, so this does not constitute a strong refute. The core content remains intact.\n\nSeveral specific seed lines appear to be missing entirely from the shipped output: \"Please step on me...\", \"Your Wobble Age is 61...\", \"That was your best score...\", \"You came back...\", \"Have you been leaning...\", \"Did you sleep...\", \"Please keep to the centre...\", \"Have you ever stood on one foot...\", and \"Everything is fine...\".","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-61","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":220,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-62","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/data/poses.ts","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2918,"output_tokens":822,"cache_read_input_tokens":122112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"41dc0fbc-67e6-43fc-97f8-08017553c9ae"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-60","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file What the retreat says. The sim names an id. The page says the sentence.\\n * None of these is longer than two short sentences. Plumb does not shout.\\n */\\nexport const LINES: Readonly<Record<string, string>> = {\\n  'tare.welcome': 'Welcome to Little Fulcrum. I am Tare.',\\n  'tare.past': 'I used to weigh people. We do not talk about that.',\\n  'tare.measure': 'I no longer measure weight. Now I only measure how much you wobble.',\\n  'tare.step': 'Please step on me. Like that is fine.',\\n10→  'tare.age': 'Your Wobble Age moved. You stood still and the number noticed.',\\n  'tare.only': 'That was your best score so far. It is also your only score so far.',\\n  'tare.back': 'You came back. A lot of people say they will.',\\n  'tare.lean': 'Have you been leaning toward anything lately. A person, or a decision.',\\n  'tare.sleep': 'Did you sleep on your left side. You do not have to answer.',\\n  'tare.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. No reason.',\\n  'tare.foot': 'Have you ever stood on one foot when nobody was looking.',\\n  'tare.know': 'I know. That was the whole answer.',\\n  'tare.fine': 'Everything is fine. If anyone asks, everything was always fine.',\\n  'tare.cairn': 'The pebbles stay on the cairn. They are not for spending.',\\n20→  'tare.ferry': 'The ferry has gone. You may keep the lawn.',\\n  'tare.day': 'This is a day. It will be followed by another, if you sleep.',\\n  'tare.mat': 'The mat is warm because someone stood here. It may have been you.',\\n  'tare.drink': 'If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'tare.quiet': 'The island is quieter when you are. This is not a compliment yet.',\\n  'tare.again': 'We can do that again. The island has nowhere else to be.',\\n  'plumb.meant': 'Good. Now do that again, but as though you meant it.',\\n  'plumb.breath': 'Breathe in, then out. You have been doing this for years, and yet.',\\n  'plumb.knee': 'Your knee is where it should be. I mention it because it is rare.',\\n  'plumb.rest': 'And rest. You may stop wobbling now.',\\n30→  'plumb.thanks': 'Thank you for stopping. The mat noticed before I did.',\\n  'plumb.fell': 'You fell. The mat forgives you.',\\n  'plumb.mat': 'The mat is not me. We have different standards.',\\n  'plumb.adequate': 'That was adequate. I chose that word carefully.',\\n  'plumb.four': 'Four more. I may be lying.',\\n  'plumb.both': 'We will both find out. Please begin.',\\n  'plumb.hold': 'Hold it there. The urge to improve it is the wobble.',\\n  'plumb.still': 'Still is a place. You keep leaving it.',\\n  'plumb.good': 'That was composed. Do not look so surprised.',\\n  'plumb.serene': 'Serene. I will write it down and then pretend I did not.',\\n40→  'plumb.odd': 'Unsettling. The staff have a meeting about people like you.',\\n  'plumb.present': 'Present, which means you attended. The rest is optional, and also not.',\\n  'gerald.morning': 'Morning. That is the whole of it.',\\n  'gerald.again': 'Morning, as I said yesterday. It still applies.',\\n  'gerald.east': 'The east lawn is that way. I have checked.',\\n  'gerald.calf': 'My calves are not part of the lesson. They arrived on their own.',\\n  'gerald.stone': 'I will stand by the stone. Call when the lawn is finished moving.',\\n  'bex.mum': 'My mum says this is good for me. She is not here, which helps.',\\n  'bex.ninety': 'I got a ninety-eight. I was not trying.',\\n  'bex.trying': 'I am trying now. Please do not tell her.',\\n50→  'bex.mat': 'Is this mat yours. I will use it anyway.',\\n  'nan.tuesday': 'I have been standing here since Tuesday. Which Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.yes': 'Yes. That was the answer to the Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.east': 'I am walking east. The storm can come along if it is polite.',\\n  'nan.slow': 'I nod once. It takes the morning.',\\n  'ask.side': 'Did you sleep on your left side. The platform is asking for a friend.',\\n  'ask.person': 'Have you been leaning toward a person. You can say no and still mean yes.',\\n  'ask.foot': 'Have you stood on one foot when nobody was looking. I will know either way.',\\n  'ask.sleep': 'Did you sleep. The number will not check.',\\n  'ask.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. I have already said there is no reason.',\\n60→  'pose.now': 'Enter the pose, which is free. The holding is the class.',\\n  'pose.nothing': 'Seated Nothing. Sit as if the chair forgot its job.',\\n  'pose.chair': 'The Patient Chair. Both feet stay, which is the hard part.',\\n  'pose.heron': 'The Heron asks for one foot. The other foot is a rumour.',\\n  'pose.archer': 'The Archer aims at nothing. Nothing is the target.',\\n  'pose.comma': 'The Sideways Comma has two seats. Visit both.',\\n  'pose.napkin': 'The Folded Napkin allows a gull to land. That is in the pose.',\\n  'pose.bridge': 'The Polite Bridge. Hold the floor in a courteous way.',\\n  'pose.light': 'The Lighthouse. The ring is smaller, on purpose.',\\n  'line.start': 'The line is a path, and your feet take turns. The wind does not.',\\n70→  'line.gust': 'A gust is coming. Lean into it, or do not.',\\n  'line.gull': 'The Gull has opinions. They arrive from the side.',\\n  'line.flick': 'A small flick. It would like you to notice it.',\\n  'line.fall': 'You left the line. The line stayed.',\\n  'line.done': 'You crossed. The cove looks the same from this side.',\\n  'line.close': 'That was the line for today. The gull remains employed.',\\n  'pond.still': 'Only the breath is correct. Everything else is a suggestion.',\\n  'pond.lure': 'A picture is not a pause. The water is still counting.',\\n  'group.mats': 'Take a mat. Empty mats borrow a person if you allow it.',\\n  'group.heron': 'The middle class is the Heron. We all pretend this was a surprise.',\\n80→  'group.pond': 'Last, the pond. Your neighbours wobble on their own time.',\\n  'group.sash': 'Least Wobbly wears an imaginary sash. The feeling is not imaginary.',\\n  'tilt.storm': 'The storm leans the island. Your job is to give it less to do.',\\n  'tilt.east': 'Everyone east, and Old Nan is already going. Try to be worth following.',\\n  'tilt.stone': 'The centre stone. Breathe, and the island listens.',\\n  'tilt.dawn': 'Dawn, and the ferry does not return. You may stay for the light.',\\n  'evening.close': 'Today you wobbled less than you might have. Goodnight.',\\n  'evening.more': 'The stamp is dry. Sleep is the next activity.',\\n  'credits.roll': 'Little Fulcrum keeps your pebbles. The week is over, and the lawn is not.',\\n  'credits.walk': 'You can walk until you are bored. The programme will not chase you.',\\n90→  'find.pebble': 'A pebble was waiting. It has joined the cairn and will not be spent.',\\n  'plaque.want': 'Did you know. The average person leans two degrees toward the things they want.',\\n  'plaque.moved': 'Did you know. This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\\n  'plaque.flamingo': 'Did you know. A flamingo stands on one leg because it has been told it is being watched.',\\n  'plaque.gulls': 'Did you know that gulls have no Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\\n  'notice.even': 'Notice. Guests are reminded to distribute themselves evenly.',\\n  'notice.lawn': 'Notice: the east lawn is fully booked. Please enjoy the east lawn.',\\n  'notice.drink': 'Notice. If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'notice.board': 'The board lists what you may do. Go is a complete instruction.',\\n  'go.morning': 'Morning Check. Stand, reach, and name a foot.',\\n100→  'go.pose-a': 'Pose Class, the early poses. They are not early for long.',\\n  'go.pose-b': 'Pose Class again. The middle of the week has opinions.',\\n  'go.pose-c': 'Pose Class, with fewer poses. They are not easier.',\\n  'go.pond': 'Still Pond asks you to breathe. Decline every other offer.',\\n  'go.garden': 'Sand Garden: tip the tray. The marbles want the holes.',\\n  'go.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, where the cove has gates. You have a board.',\\n  'go.line': 'The Line. One foot, then the other, then the gull.',\\n  'go.group': 'Group Class is three short classes. Your score is only yours.',\\n  'go.tilt': 'The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk, a stone, and dawn.',\\n  'rank.Present': 'Present means you were here. The cairn accepts a pebble.',\\n110→  'rank.Adequate': 'Adequate. Plumb chose the word, and then allowed it.',\\n  'rank.Composed': 'Composed. The dot stayed nearer the middle than the edge.',\\n  'rank.Serene': 'Serene. The staff will mention this only if asked twice.',\\n  'rank.Unsettling': 'Unsettling. Please do not do that near the drinks.',\\n  'result.again': 'Again, if you like. The mat has already forgotten the last one.',\\n  'result.on': 'Carry on. The day has another thing, or it has sleep.',\\n  'lure.press': 'PRESS NOW. It is not a real pause.',\\n  'lure.tare': 'Tare would like a word. The pond would like you to refuse.',\\n  'lure.phone': 'A stone is buzzing. It is a stone.',\\n  'lure.frog': 'The Frog sits on your knee and waits. Waiting is not a button.',\\n120→  'lure.gull': 'The Gull has landed. It does not need a reply.',\\n  'lure.menu': 'That menu is painted on. The water did not stop.',\\n  'lure.disconnect': 'Nothing disconnected. Your hands are still yours.',\\n  'lure.plumb': 'You are doing it wrong. This sentence is also wrong to obey.',\\n  'lure.credits': 'The credits are not ready. Stay with the breath.',\\n  'demo.banner': 'A demonstration. Press anything you trust.',\\n  'demo.back': 'You are back. The demonstration has left the lawn as it found it.',\\n  'touch.need': 'Controller or keyboard required. The lawn will demonstrate itself.',\\n  'touch.settings': 'Settings opens. Play does not, until a real button does.',\\n  'save.erase': 'Erase the save, and the cairn forgets. This asks once, here.',\\n130→  'save.gone': 'The save is gone. The island is on day one again.',\\n  'pause.resume': 'Resume. The dot did not move while you were away.',\\n  'pause.island': 'Back to the island. The activity ends without a stamp.',\\n  'dev.ready': 'Dev Mode keeps the numbers live. Reset puts them back.',\\n  'about.lead': 'Thumb Yoga is a week at Little Fulcrum. You bring your balance and nothing else.',\\n  'hub.card': 'Stay the steadiest across three classes. Your neighbours are real, and separate.',\\n  'hub.ready': 'Ready when you are, and Enter answers. The class starts together.',\\n  'hub.more': 'Three classes. A still ring, the Heron, then the pond.',\\n  'frog.ribbit': 'The Frog has no advice. It has a seat, and it is using yours.',\\n  'gull.cry': 'The Gull files a complaint sideways. You may lean against it.',\\n140→  'sea.note': 'The sea is not deep where you walk. It would like you to stay that way.',\\n  'cove.note': 'The cove keeps the board. You keep the wobble.',\\n  'stone.note': 'The centre stone is a plate. Breathing is how you speak to it.',\\n  'pier.note': 'The pier is empty. The ferry was a rumour with a timetable.',\\n  'hut.note': 'The huts are for shade. Shade is not an activity.',\\n  'palm.note': 'The palms do not wobble. They have tenure.',\\n  'staff.note': 'The staff are few. They are all here, which is the same thing.',\\n  'class.enter': 'Find the seat. The line to it does not score.',\\n  'class.hold': 'Hold, and breathing counts. Improving it does not.',\\n  'class.out': 'Release, and you may wobble on the way out. It is not recorded.',\\n150→  'morning.still': 'Be still. The ring is a suggestion with a memory.',\\n  'morning.reach': 'Reach the mark and stay, six times. They do not wait politely.',\\n  'morning.one': 'One foot, the named one. The other one is a holiday.',\\n  'garden.tip': 'Tip the tray toward a hole. The marble has its own ideas.',\\n  'garden.sunk': 'A marble has gone home. The tray remains your problem.',\\n  'paddle.gate': 'A gate. Pass it with the board under you, not beside you.',\\n  'paddle.wake': 'The wake is a shove, and it ends. You should not.',\\n  'age.first': 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.',\\n  'age.down': 'The number went down. Standing still did that.',\\n  'age.up': 'The number went up. The island has noted the difference.',\\n160→  'age.same': 'The same number as yesterday. Consistency is a kind of wobble.',\\n  'sleep.now': 'Sleep. The lean of the island will be a little ruder tomorrow.',\\n  'day.two': 'Day two, and the garden is open. So is the same morning.',\\n  'day.three': 'Day three is water, then the line. Bring both feet.',\\n  'day.four': 'Day four is a shorter class. Do not mistake that for mercy.',\\n  'day.five': 'Day five is the group, then the storm. Nan is already dressed for it.',\\n  'free.play': 'Free play. The board remembers your best rank and nothing unkind.',\\n  'best.none': 'No best yet, so a first score is also a best. Tare insists.',\\n  'best.kept': 'Your best rank for this is on the card. The cairn has the pebbles.',\\n  'controls.pad': 'The left stick leans, and L2 and R2 are the feet. Both together breathe.',\\n170→  'controls.keys': 'WASD leans, Q and E are the feet, and Space breathes. F or Enter acts.',\\n  'controls.mouse': 'The mouse leans while the cursor is locked. The buttons remain the feet.',\\n  'icons.ps': 'PlayStation marks: Cross agrees. Circle steps back.',\\n  'icons.xbox': 'Xbox marks: A agrees. B steps back.',\\n  'assist.on': 'Steadier hands. The sway is half as interested.',\\n  'assist.off': 'Hands as they are. The sway is back to its full small self.',\\n  'cpu.on': 'Empty mats will borrow Gerald, Bex, and Nan.',\\n  'cpu.off': 'Empty mats stay empty. The class is only who showed up.',\\n  'music.soft': 'The music is a whisper. It was a whisper when you arrived.',\\n  'erase.ask': 'Erase the whole save, including pebbles and bests. Yes or no.',\\n180→  'erase.no': 'Kept. The cairn looks relieved, which is not a thing cairns do.',\\n  'quit.title': 'Back to the title. The lawn stays where you left it.',\\n  'restart.now': 'The activity starts again. The pebbles from last time stay.',\\n  'jump.day': 'The day has been turned to this one. The lean came with it.',\\n  'jump.event': 'You are in it. The programme will catch up when you carry on.',\\n  'finish.now': 'Ended, at the rank you picked. The stamp is real.',\\n  'seed.new': 'A new seed. The reaches and the gusts are strangers again.',\\n  'time.slow': 'Time is a quarter, so the dot is not more patient. You are.',\\n  'time.fast': 'Time is four. The class will be over before the sentence is.',\\n  'time.one': 'Time is itself again.',\\n190→  'orbit.title': 'Thumb Yoga, a balance retreat. Press a button when you have one.',\\n  'begin.go': 'Begin the week. Morning is first, even if you are not.',\\n  'continue.go': 'Continue. The cairn counted while you were away.',\\n  'group.go': 'Group Class takes up to four. The rest of the seats can be staff.',\\n  'about.go': 'About and credits, where the names are long. The lawn is the same.',\\n  'settings.go': 'Settings, where music starts at a tenth. You may make it louder.',\\n  'programme.go': 'Today, in order. Each card can be gone to.',\\n  'near.go': 'You are near a start. Act, and it begins.',\\n  'roam.help': 'Walk, and Act begins what you are standing on. The programme is the other way.',\\n  'credits.free': 'The week is done. A new morning is still on the board.',\\n200→  'ghost.here': 'Someone is on the next mat. Their lean is theirs.',\\n  'ghost.left': 'They left politely. The mat is a mat again.',\\n  'score.pebble': 'A pebble for the rank, and it stacks. It does not buy a thing.',\\n  'wobble.out': 'Outside the ring, which is not angry. It is counting.',\\n  'wobble.in': 'Inside. Stay, if staying was the assignment.',\\n  'breath.in': 'In. The ring grows because you asked it to.',\\n  'breath.out': 'Out. The sway believes you a little more.',\\n  'topple.up': 'You left the disc, so stand back on. The count kept the fall.',\\n  'recover.up': 'Back. The next seconds are a recovery, not a judgement.',\\n  'lighthouse.small': 'A smaller ring for the same body. Fewer places to hide.',\\n210→  'comma.side': 'The other seat, because commas lean. So do you.',\\n  'napkin.bird': 'The gull shifts you. It is in the pose, not in the rules you wanted.',\\n  'chair.feet': 'Both feet, held. A chair is a promise you make with the floor.',\\n  'heron.foot': 'The standing foot is the one you promised. Breath may hold both.',\\n  'storm.call': 'Both feet, then release. The island gives a little lean back.',\\n  'east.call': 'East is a direction. Nan treats it as a personality.',\\n  'dawn.call': 'The light is ordinary. You are still here, which is the ending.',\\n  'hub.wait': 'Waiting for the others. The mat does not start without them.',\\n  'hub.play': 'The class is running. Send them your lean, not your advice.',\\n  'hub.done': 'Your score is in. The pavilion keeps the rest.',\\n220→  'hub.fail': 'This browser cannot draw the pavilion. A current Chrome or Edge can.',\\n  'no.gpu': 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU, such as current Chrome or Edge.',\\n  'loading.now': 'Calibrating. The island is putting its lawn on.',\\n  'attract.pose': 'Pose Class, demonstrated. The thumb is not yours.',\\n  'attract.pond': 'Still Pond, demonstrated. The lures are declined for you.',\\n  'attract.line': 'The Line, demonstrated. The gull is on schedule.',\\n  'attract.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, demonstrated. The gates agree.',\\n  'attract.garden': 'Sand Garden, demonstrated. The marbles are persuaded.',\\n  'attract.tilt': 'The centre stone, demonstrated. The storm has already been spoken to.',\\n  'staff.plumb': 'Plumb teaches without raising her voice. She does not need to.',\\n230→  'staff.tare': 'Tare is a platform with opinions. The opinions used to be a scale.',\\n  'staff.gerald': 'Gerald says morning. On a long day he says it twice.',\\n  'staff.bex': 'Bex is here because someone said it would help. The score helps more.',\\n  'staff.nan': 'Old Nan has been east before. She is willing to be east again.',\\n  'staff.gull': 'The Gull is not enrolled. It attends anyway.',\\n  'staff.frog': 'The Frog sits in the pond. Sitting is its whole qualification.',\\n  'world.name': 'The island is called Little Fulcrum. The week is called Thumb Yoga.',\\n  'world.rule': 'One verb: keep your balance in the circle. The rest is manners.',\\n  'world.no': 'Nothing here is about a body. The wobble is the whole subject.',\\n  'pebble.one': 'One pebble. Present, and counted.',\\n240→  'pebble.five': 'Five pebbles. The cairn is showing off, quietly.',\\n  'menu.more': 'More. The rest of the list is on the next card.',\\n  'menu.back': 'Back. The previous card kept your place.',\\n  'yes.do': 'Yes. It is done.',\\n  'no.keep': 'No. Nothing was erased.',\\n};\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file What the retreat says. The sim names an id. The page says the sentence.\\n * None of these is longer than two short sentences. Plumb does not shout.\\n */\\nexport const LINES: Readonly<Record<string, string>> = {\\n  'tare.welcome': 'Welcome to Little Fulcrum. I am Tare.',\\n  'tare.past': 'I used to weigh people. We do not talk about that.',\\n  'tare.measure': 'I no longer measure weight. Now I only measure how much you wobble.',\\n  'tare.step': 'Please step on me. Like that is fine.',\\n10→  'tare.age': 'Your Wobble Age moved. You stood still and the number noticed.',\\n  'tare.only': 'That was your best score so far. It is also your only score so far.',\\n  'tare.back': 'You came back. A lot of people say they will.',\\n  'tare.lean': 'Have you been leaning toward anything lately. A person, or a decision.',\\n  'tare.sleep': 'Did you sleep on your left side. You do not have to answer.',\\n  'tare.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. No reason.',\\n  'tare.foot': 'Have you ever stood on one foot when nobody was looking.',\\n  'tare.know': 'I know. That was the whole answer.',\\n  'tare.fine': 'Everything is fine. If anyone asks, everything was always fine.',\\n  'tare.cairn': 'The pebbles stay on the cairn. They are not for spending.',\\n20→  'tare.ferry': 'The ferry has gone. You may keep the lawn.',\\n  'tare.day': 'This is a day. It will be followed by another, if you sleep.',\\n  'tare.mat': 'The mat is warm because someone stood here. It may have been you.',\\n  'tare.drink': 'If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'tare.quiet': 'The island is quieter when you are. This is not a compliment yet.',\\n  'tare.again': 'We can do that again. The island has nowhere else to be.',\\n  'plumb.meant': 'Good. Now do that again, but as though you meant it.',\\n  'plumb.breath': 'Breathe in, then out. You have been doing this for years, and yet.',\\n  'plumb.knee': 'Your knee is where it should be. I mention it because it is rare.',\\n  'plumb.rest': 'And rest. You may stop wobbling now.',\\n30→  'plumb.thanks': 'Thank you for stopping. The mat noticed before I did.',\\n  'plumb.fell': 'You fell. The mat forgives you.',\\n  'plumb.mat': 'The mat is not me. We have different standards.',\\n  'plumb.adequate': 'That was adequate. I chose that word carefully.',\\n  'plumb.four': 'Four more. I may be lying.',\\n  'plumb.both': 'We will both find out. Please begin.',\\n  'plumb.hold': 'Hold it there. The urge to improve it is the wobble.',\\n  'plumb.still': 'Still is a place. You keep leaving it.',\\n  'plumb.good': 'That was composed. Do not look so surprised.',\\n  'plumb.serene': 'Serene. I will write it down and then pretend I did not.',\\n40→  'plumb.odd': 'Unsettling. The staff have a meeting about people like you.',\\n  'plumb.present': 'Present, which means you attended. The rest is optional, and also not.',\\n  'gerald.morning': 'Morning. That is the whole of it.',\\n  'gerald.again': 'Morning, as I said yesterday. It still applies.',\\n  'gerald.east': 'The east lawn is that way. I have checked.',\\n  'gerald.calf': 'My calves are not part of the lesson. They arrived on their own.',\\n  'gerald.stone': 'I will stand by the stone. Call when the lawn is finished moving.',\\n  'bex.mum': 'My mum says this is good for me. She is not here, which helps.',\\n  'bex.ninety': 'I got a ninety-eight. I was not trying.',\\n  'bex.trying': 'I am trying now. Please do not tell her.',\\n50→  'bex.mat': 'Is this mat yours. I will use it anyway.',\\n  'nan.tuesday': 'I have been standing here since Tuesday. Which Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.yes': 'Yes. That was the answer to the Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.east': 'I am walking east. The storm can come along if it is polite.',\\n  'nan.slow': 'I nod once. It takes the morning.',\\n  'ask.side': 'Did you sleep on your left side. The platform is asking for a friend.',\\n  'ask.person': 'Have you been leaning toward a person. You can say no and still mean yes.',\\n  'ask.foot': 'Have you stood on one foot when nobody was looking. I will know either way.',\\n  'ask.sleep': 'Did you sleep. The number will not check.',\\n  'ask.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. I have already said there is no reason.',\\n60→  'pose.now': 'Enter the pose, which is free. The holding is the class.',\\n  'pose.nothing': 'Seated Nothing. Sit as if the chair forgot its job.',\\n  'pose.chair': 'The Patient Chair. Both feet stay, which is the hard part.',\\n  'pose.heron': 'The Heron asks for one foot. The other foot is a rumour.',\\n  'pose.archer': 'The Archer aims at nothing. Nothing is the target.',\\n  'pose.comma': 'The Sideways Comma has two seats. Visit both.',\\n  'pose.napkin': 'The Folded Napkin allows a gull to land. That is in the pose.',\\n  'pose.bridge': 'The Polite Bridge. Hold the floor in a courteous way.',\\n  'pose.light': 'The Lighthouse. The ring is smaller, on purpose.',\\n  'line.start': 'The line is a path, and your feet take turns. The wind does not.',\\n70→  'line.gust': 'A gust is coming. Lean into it, or do not.',\\n  'line.gull': 'The Gull has opinions. They arrive from the side.',\\n  'line.flick': 'A small flick. It would like you to notice it.',\\n  'line.fall': 'You left the line. The line stayed.',\\n  'line.done': 'You crossed. The cove looks the same from this side.',\\n  'line.close': 'That was the line for today. The gull remains employed.',\\n  'pond.still': 'Only the breath is correct. Everything else is a suggestion.',\\n  'pond.lure': 'A picture is not a pause. The water is still counting.',\\n  'group.mats': 'Take a mat. Empty mats borrow a person if you allow it.',\\n  'group.heron': 'The middle class is the Heron. We all pretend this was a surprise.',\\n80→  'group.pond': 'Last, the pond. Your neighbours wobble on their own time.',\\n  'group.sash': 'Least Wobbly wears an imaginary sash. The feeling is not imaginary.',\\n  'tilt.storm': 'The storm leans the island. Your job is to give it less to do.',\\n  'tilt.east': 'Everyone east, and Old Nan is already going. Try to be worth following.',\\n  'tilt.stone': 'The centre stone. Breathe, and the island listens.',\\n  'tilt.dawn': 'Dawn, and the ferry does not return. You may stay for the light.',\\n  'evening.close': 'Today you wobbled less than you might have. Goodnight.',\\n  'evening.more': 'The stamp is dry. Sleep is the next activity.',\\n  'credits.roll': 'Little Fulcrum keeps your pebbles. The week is over, and the lawn is not.',\\n  'credits.walk': 'You can walk until you are bored. The programme will not chase you.',\\n90→  'find.pebble': 'A pebble was waiting. It has joined the cairn and will not be spent.',\\n  'plaque.want': 'Did you know. The average person leans two degrees toward the things they want.',\\n  'plaque.moved': 'Did you know. This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\\n  'plaque.flamingo': 'Did you know. A flamingo stands on one leg because it has been told it is being watched.',\\n  'plaque.gulls': 'Did you know that gulls have no Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\\n  'notice.even': 'Notice. Guests are reminded to distribute themselves evenly.',\\n  'notice.lawn': 'Notice: the east lawn is fully booked. Please enjoy the east lawn.',\\n  'notice.drink': 'Notice. If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'notice.board': 'The board lists what you may do. Go is a complete instruction.',\\n  'go.morning': 'Morning Check. Stand, reach, and name a foot.',\\n100→  'go.pose-a': 'Pose Class, the early poses. They are not early for long.',\\n  'go.pose-b': 'Pose Class again. The middle of the week has opinions.',\\n  'go.pose-c': 'Pose Class, with fewer poses. They are not easier.',\\n  'go.pond': 'Still Pond asks you to breathe. Decline every other offer.',\\n  'go.garden': 'Sand Garden: tip the tray. The marbles want the holes.',\\n  'go.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, where the cove has gates. You have a board.',\\n  'go.line': 'The Line. One foot, then the other, then the gull.',\\n  'go.group': 'Group Class is three short classes. Your score is only yours.',\\n  'go.tilt': 'The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk, a stone, and dawn.',\\n  'rank.Present': 'Present means you were here. The cairn accepts a pebble.',\\n110→  'rank.Adequate': 'Adequate. Plumb chose the word, and then allowed it.',\\n  'rank.Composed': 'Composed. The dot stayed nearer the middle than the edge.',\\n  'rank.Serene': 'Serene. The staff will mention this only if asked twice.',\\n  'rank.Unsettling': 'Unsettling. Please do not do that near the drinks.',\\n  'result.again': 'Again, if you like. The mat has already forgotten the last one.',\\n  'result.on': 'Carry on. The day has another thing, or it has sleep.',\\n  'lure.press': 'PRESS NOW. It is not a real pause.',\\n  'lure.tare': 'Tare would like a word. The pond would like you to refuse.',\\n  'lure.phone': 'A stone is buzzing. It is a stone.',\\n  'lure.frog': 'The Frog sits on your knee and waits. Waiting is not a button.',\\n120→  'lure.gull': 'The Gull has landed. It does not need a reply.',\\n  'lure.menu': 'That menu is painted on. The water did not stop.',\\n  'lure.disconnect': 'Nothing disconnected. Your hands are still yours.',\\n  'lure.plumb': 'You are doing it wrong. This sentence is also wrong to obey.',\\n  'lure.credits': 'The credits are not ready. Stay with the breath.',\\n  'demo.banner': 'A demonstration. Press anything you trust.',\\n  'demo.back': 'You are back. The demonstration has left the lawn as it found it.',\\n  'touch.need': 'Controller or keyboard required. The lawn will demonstrate itself.',\\n  'touch.settings': 'Settings opens. Play does not, until a real button does.',\\n  'save.erase': 'Erase the save, and the cairn forgets. This asks once, here.',\\n130→  'save.gone': 'The save is gone. The island is on day one again.',\\n  'pause.resume': 'Resume. The dot did not move while you were away.',\\n  'pause.island': 'Back to the island. The activity ends without a stamp.',\\n  'dev.ready': 'Dev Mode keeps the numbers live. Reset puts them back.',\\n  'about.lead': 'Thumb Yoga is a week at Little Fulcrum. You bring your balance and nothing else.',\\n  'hub.card': 'Stay the steadiest across three classes. Your neighbours are real, and separate.',\\n  'hub.ready': 'Ready when you are, and Enter answers. The class starts together.',\\n  'hub.more': 'Three classes. A still ring, the Heron, then the pond.',\\n  'frog.ribbit': 'The Frog has no advice. It has a seat, and it is using yours.',\\n  'gull.cry': 'The Gull files a complaint sideways. You may lean against it.',\\n140→  'sea.note': 'The sea is not deep where you walk. It would like you to stay that way.',\\n  'cove.note': 'The cove keeps the board. You keep the wobble.',\\n  'stone.note': 'The centre stone is a plate. Breathing is how you speak to it.',\\n  'pier.note': 'The pier is empty. The ferry was a rumour with a timetable.',\\n  'hut.note': 'The huts are for shade. Shade is not an activity.',\\n  'palm.note': 'The palms do not wobble. They have tenure.',\\n  'staff.note': 'The staff are few. They are all here, which is the same thing.',\\n  'class.enter': 'Find the seat. The line to it does not score.',\\n  'class.hold': 'Hold, and breathing counts. Improving it does not.',\\n  'class.out': 'Release, and you may wobble on the way out. It is not recorded.',\\n150→  'morning.still': 'Be still. The ring is a suggestion with a memory.',\\n  'morning.reach': 'Reach the mark and stay, six times. They do not wait politely.',\\n  'morning.one': 'One foot, the named one. The other one is a holiday.',\\n  'garden.tip': 'Tip the tray toward a hole. The marble has its own ideas.',\\n  'garden.sunk': 'A marble has gone home. The tray remains your problem.',\\n  'paddle.gate': 'A gate. Pass it with the board under you, not beside you.',\\n  'paddle.wake': 'The wake is a shove, and it ends. You should not.',\\n  'age.first': 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.',\\n  'age.down': 'The number went down. Standing still did that.',\\n  'age.up': 'The number went up. The island has noted the difference.',\\n160→  'age.same': 'The same number as yesterday. Consistency is a kind of wobble.',\\n  'sleep.now': 'Sleep. The lean of the island will be a little ruder tomorrow.',\\n  'day.two': 'Day two, and the garden is open. So is the same morning.',\\n  'day.three': 'Day three is water, then the line. Bring both feet.',\\n  'day.four': 'Day four is a shorter class. Do not mistake that for mercy.',\\n  'day.five': 'Day five is the group, then the storm. Nan is already dressed for it.',\\n  'free.play': 'Free play. The board remembers your best rank and nothing unkind.',\\n  'best.none': 'No best yet, so a first score is also a best. Tare insists.',\\n  'best.kept': 'Your best rank for this is on the card. The cairn has the pebbles.',\\n  'controls.pad': 'The left stick leans, and L2 and R2 are the feet. Both together breathe.',\\n170→  'controls.keys': 'WASD leans, Q and E are the feet, and Space breathes. F or Enter acts.',\\n  'controls.mouse': 'The mouse leans while the cursor is locked. The buttons remain the feet.',\\n  'icons.ps': 'PlayStation marks: Cross agrees. Circle steps back.',\\n  'icons.xbox': 'Xbox marks: A agrees. B steps back.',\\n  'assist.on': 'Steadier hands. The sway is half as interested.',\\n  'assist.off': 'Hands as they are. The sway is back to its full small self.',\\n  'cpu.on': 'Empty mats will borrow Gerald, Bex, and Nan.',\\n  'cpu.off': 'Empty mats stay empty. The class is only who showed up.',\\n  'music.soft': 'The music is a whisper. It was a whisper when you arrived.',\\n  'erase.ask': 'Erase the whole save, including pebbles and bests. Yes or no.',\\n180→  'erase.no': 'Kept. The cairn looks relieved, which is not a thing cairns do.',\\n  'quit.title': 'Back to the title. The lawn stays where you left it.',\\n  'restart.now': 'The activity starts again. The pebbles from last time stay.',\\n  'jump.day': 'The day has been turned to this one. The lean came with it.',\\n  'jump.event': 'You are in it. The programme will catch up when you carry on.',\\n  'finish.now': 'Ended, at the rank you picked. The stamp is real.',\\n  'seed.new': 'A new seed. The reaches and the gusts are strangers again.',\\n  'time.slow': 'Time is a quarter, so the dot is not more patient. You are.',\\n  'time.fast': 'Time is four. The class will be over before the sentence is.',\\n  'time.one': 'Time is itself again.',\\n190→  'orbit.title': 'Thumb Yoga, a balance retreat. Press a button when you have one.',\\n  'begin.go': 'Begin the week. Morning is first, even if you are not.',\\n  'continue.go': 'Continue. The cairn counted while you were away.',\\n  'group.go': 'Group Class takes up to four. The rest of the seats can be staff.',\\n  'about.go': 'About and credits, where the names are long. The lawn is the same.',\\n  'settings.go': 'Settings, where music starts at a tenth. You may make it louder.',\\n  'programme.go': 'Today, in order. Each card can be gone to.',\\n  'near.go': 'You are near a start. Act, and it begins.',\\n  'roam.help': 'Walk, and Act begins what you are standing on. The programme is the other way.',\\n  'credits.free': 'The week is done. A new morning is still on the board.',\\n200→  'ghost.here': 'Someone is on the next mat. Their lean is theirs.',\\n  'ghost.left': 'They left politely. The mat is a mat again.',\\n  'score.pebble': 'A pebble for the rank, and it stacks. It does not buy a thing.',\\n  'wobble.out': 'Outside the ring, which is not angry. It is counting.',\\n  'wobble.in': 'Inside. Stay, if staying was the assignment.',\\n  'breath.in': 'In. The ring grows because you asked it to.',\\n  'breath.out': 'Out. The sway believes you a little more.',\\n  'topple.up': 'You left the disc, so stand back on. The count kept the fall.',\\n  'recover.up': 'Back. The next seconds are a recovery, not a judgement.',\\n  'lighthouse.small': 'A smaller ring for the same body. Fewer places to hide.',\\n210→  'comma.side': 'The other seat, because commas lean. So do you.',\\n  'napkin.bird': 'The gull shifts you. It is in the pose, not in the rules you wanted.',\\n  'chair.feet': 'Both feet, held. A chair is a promise you make with the floor.',\\n  'heron.foot': 'The standing foot is the one you promised. Breath may hold both.',\\n  'storm.call': 'Both feet, then release. The island gives a little lean back.',\\n  'east.call': 'East is a direction. Nan treats it as a personality.',\\n  'dawn.call': 'The light is ordinary. You are still here, which is the ending.',\\n  'hub.wait': 'Waiting for the others. The mat does not start without them.',\\n  'hub.play': 'The class is running. Send them your lean, not your advice.',\\n  'hub.done': 'Your score is in. The pavilion keeps the rest.',\\n220→  'hub.fail': 'This browser cannot draw the pavilion. A current Chrome or Edge can.',\\n  'no.gpu': 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU, such as current Chrome or Edge.',\\n  'loading.now': 'Calibrating. The island is putting its lawn on.',\\n  'attract.pose': 'Pose Class, demonstrated. The thumb is not yours.',\\n  'attract.pond': 'Still Pond, demonstrated. The lures are declined for you.',\\n  'attract.line': 'The Line, demonstrated. The gull is on schedule.',\\n  'attract.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, demonstrated. The gates agree.',\\n  'attract.garden': 'Sand Garden, demonstrated. The marbles are persuaded.',\\n  'attract.tilt': 'The centre stone, demonstrated. The storm has already been spoken to.',\\n  'staff.plumb': 'Plumb teaches without raising her voice. She does not need to.',\\n230→  'staff.tare': 'Tare is a platform with opinions. The opinions used to be a scale.',\\n  'staff.gerald': 'Gerald says morning. On a long day he says it twice.',\\n  'staff.bex': 'Bex is here because someone said it would help. The score helps more.',\\n  'staff.nan': 'Old Nan has been east before. She is willing to be east again.',\\n  'staff.gull': 'The Gull is not enrolled. It attends anyway.',\\n  'staff.frog': 'The Frog sits in the pond. Sitting is its whole qualification.',\\n  'world.name': 'The island is called Little Fulcrum. The week is called Thumb Yoga.',\\n  'world.rule': 'One verb: keep your balance in the circle. The rest is manners.',\\n  'world.no': 'Nothing here is about a body. The wobble is the whole subject.',\\n  'pebble.one': 'One pebble. Present, and counted.',\\n240→  'pebble.five': 'Five pebbles. The cairn is showing off, quietly.',\\n  'menu.more': 'More. The rest of the list is on the next card.',\\n  'menu.back': 'Back. The previous card kept your place.',\\n  'yes.do': 'Yes. It is done.',\\n  'no.keep': 'No. Nothing was erased.',\\n};\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file What the retreat says. The sim names an id. The page says the sentence.\\n * None of these is longer than two short sentences. Plumb does not shout.\\n */\\nexport const LINES: Readonly<Record<string, string>> = {\\n  'tare.welcome': 'Welcome to Little Fulcrum. I am Tare.',\\n  'tare.past': 'I used to weigh people. We do not talk about that.',\\n  'tare.measure': 'I no longer measure weight. Now I only measure how much you wobble.',\\n  'tare.step': 'Please step on me. Like that is fine.',\\n  'tare.age': 'Your Wobble Age moved. You stood still and the number noticed.',\\n  'tare.only': 'That was your best score so far. It is also your only score so far.',\\n  'tare.back': 'You came back. A lot of people say they will.',\\n  'tare.lean': 'Have you been leaning toward anything lately. A person, or a decision.',\\n  'tare.sleep': 'Did you sleep on your left side. You do not have to answer.',\\n  'tare.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. No reason.',\\n  'tare.foot': 'Have you ever stood on one foot when nobody was looking.',\\n  'tare.know': 'I know. That was the whole answer.',\\n  'tare.fine': 'Everything is fine. If anyone asks, everything was always fine.',\\n  'tare.cairn': 'The pebbles stay on the cairn. They are not for spending.',\\n  'tare.ferry': 'The ferry has gone. You may keep the lawn.',\\n  'tare.day': 'This is a day. It will be followed by another, if you sleep.',\\n  'tare.mat': 'The mat is warm because someone stood here. It may have been you.',\\n  'tare.drink': 'If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'tare.quiet': 'The island is quieter when you are. This is not a compliment yet.',\\n  'tare.again': 'We can do that again. The island has nowhere else to be.',\\n  'plumb.meant': 'Good. Now do that again, but as though you meant it.',\\n  'plumb.breath': 'Breathe in, then out. You have been doing this for years, and yet.',\\n  'plumb.knee': 'Your knee is where it should be. I mention it because it is rare.',\\n  'plumb.rest': 'And rest. You may stop wobbling now.',\\n  'plumb.thanks': 'Thank you for stopping. The mat noticed before I did.',\\n  'plumb.fell': 'You fell. The mat forgives you.',\\n  'plumb.mat': 'The mat is not me. We have different standards.',\\n  'plumb.adequate': 'That was adequate. I chose that word carefully.',\\n  'plumb.four': 'Four more. I may be lying.',\\n  'plumb.both': 'We will both find out. Please begin.',\\n  'plumb.hold': 'Hold it there. The urge to improve it is the wobble.',\\n  'plumb.still': 'Still is a place. You keep leaving it.',\\n  'plumb.good': 'That was composed. Do not look so surprised.',\\n  'plumb.serene': 'Serene. I will write it down and then pretend I did not.',\\n  'plumb.odd': 'Unsettling. The staff have a meeting about people like you.',\\n  'plumb.present': 'Present, which means you attended. The rest is optional, and also not.',\\n  'gerald.morning': 'Morning. That is the whole of it.',\\n  'gerald.again': 'Morning, as I said yesterday. It still applies.',\\n  'gerald.east': 'The east lawn is that way. I have checked.',\\n  'gerald.calf': 'My calves are not part of the lesson. They arrived on their own.',\\n  'gerald.stone': 'I will stand by the stone. Call when the lawn is finished moving.',\\n  'bex.mum': 'My mum says this is good for me. She is not here, which helps.',\\n  'bex.ninety': 'I got a ninety-eight. I was not trying.',\\n  'bex.trying': 'I am trying now. Please do not tell her.',\\n  'bex.mat': 'Is this mat yours. I will use it anyway.',\\n  'nan.tuesday': 'I have been standing here since Tuesday. Which Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.yes': 'Yes. That was the answer to the Tuesday.',\\n  'nan.east': 'I am walking east. The storm can come along if it is polite.',\\n  'nan.slow': 'I nod once. It takes the morning.',\\n  'ask.side': 'Did you sleep on your left side. The platform is asking for a friend.',\\n  'ask.person': 'Have you been leaning toward a person. You can say no and still mean yes.',\\n  'ask.foot': 'Have you stood on one foot when nobody was looking. I will know either way.',\\n  'ask.sleep': 'Did you sleep. The number will not check.',\\n  'ask.centre': 'Please keep to the centre. I have already said there is no reason.',\\n  'pose.now': 'Enter the pose, which is free. The holding is the class.',\\n  'pose.nothing': 'Seated Nothing. Sit as if the chair forgot its job.',\\n  'pose.chair': 'The Patient Chair. Both feet stay, which is the hard part.',\\n  'pose.heron': 'The Heron asks for one foot. The other foot is a rumour.',\\n  'pose.archer': 'The Archer aims at nothing. Nothing is the target.',\\n  'pose.comma': 'The Sideways Comma has two seats. Visit both.',\\n  'pose.napkin': 'The Folded Napkin allows a gull to land. That is in the pose.',\\n  'pose.bridge': 'The Polite Bridge. Hold the floor in a courteous way.',\\n  'pose.light': 'The Lighthouse. The ring is smaller, on purpose.',\\n  'line.start': 'The line is a path, and your feet take turns. The wind does not.',\\n  'line.gust': 'A gust is coming. Lean into it, or do not.',\\n  'line.gull': 'The Gull has opinions. They arrive from the side.',\\n  'line.flick': 'A small flick. It would like you to notice it.',\\n  'line.fall': 'You left the line. The line stayed.',\\n  'line.done': 'You crossed. The cove looks the same from this side.',\\n  'line.close': 'That was the line for today. The gull remains employed.',\\n  'pond.still': 'Only the breath is correct. Everything else is a suggestion.',\\n  'pond.lure': 'A picture is not a pause. The water is still counting.',\\n  'group.mats': 'Take a mat. Empty mats borrow a person if you allow it.',\\n  'group.heron': 'The middle class is the Heron. We all pretend this was a surprise.',\\n  'group.pond': 'Last, the pond. Your neighbours wobble on their own time.',\\n  'group.sash': 'Least Wobbly wears an imaginary sash. The feeling is not imaginary.',\\n  'tilt.storm': 'The storm leans the island. Your job is to give it less to do.',\\n  'tilt.east': 'Everyone east, and Old Nan is already going. Try to be worth following.',\\n  'tilt.stone': 'The centre stone. Breathe, and the island listens.',\\n  'tilt.dawn': 'Dawn, and the ferry does not return. You may stay for the light.',\\n  'evening.close': 'Today you wobbled less than you might have. Goodnight.',\\n  'evening.more': 'The stamp is dry. Sleep is the next activity.',\\n  'credits.roll': 'Little Fulcrum keeps your pebbles. The week is over, and the lawn is not.',\\n  'credits.walk': 'You can walk until you are bored. The programme will not chase you.',\\n  'find.pebble': 'A pebble was waiting. It has joined the cairn and will not be spent.',\\n  'plaque.want': 'Did you know. The average person leans two degrees toward the things they want.',\\n  'plaque.moved': 'Did you know. This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\\n  'plaque.flamingo': 'Did you know. A flamingo stands on one leg because it has been told it is being watched.',\\n  'plaque.gulls': 'Did you know that gulls have no Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\\n  'notice.even': 'Notice. Guests are reminded to distribute themselves evenly.',\\n  'notice.lawn': 'Notice: the east lawn is fully booked. Please enjoy the east lawn.',\\n  'notice.drink': 'Notice. If your drink slides, that is a feature of the drink.',\\n  'notice.board': 'The board lists what you may do. Go is a complete instruction.',\\n  'go.morning': 'Morning Check. Stand, reach, and name a foot.',\\n  'go.pose-a': 'Pose Class, the early poses. They are not early for long.',\\n  'go.pose-b': 'Pose Class again. The middle of the week has opinions.',\\n  'go.pose-c': 'Pose Class, with fewer poses. They are not easier.',\\n  'go.pond': 'Still Pond asks you to breathe. Decline every other offer.',\\n  'go.garden': 'Sand Garden: tip the tray. The marbles want the holes.',\\n  'go.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, where the cove has gates. You have a board.',\\n  'go.line': 'The Line. One foot, then the other, then the gull.',\\n  'go.group': 'Group Class is three short classes. Your score is only yours.',\\n  'go.tilt': 'The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk, a stone, and dawn.',\\n  'rank.Present': 'Present means you were here. The cairn accepts a pebble.',\\n  'rank.Adequate': 'Adequate. Plumb chose the word, and then allowed it.',\\n  'rank.Composed': 'Composed. The dot stayed nearer the middle than the edge.',\\n  'rank.Serene': 'Serene. The staff will mention this only if asked twice.',\\n  'rank.Unsettling': 'Unsettling. Please do not do that near the drinks.',\\n  'result.again': 'Again, if you like. The mat has already forgotten the last one.',\\n  'result.on': 'Carry on. The day has another thing, or it has sleep.',\\n  'lure.press': 'PRESS NOW. It is not a real pause.',\\n  'lure.tare': 'Tare would like a word. The pond would like you to refuse.',\\n  'lure.phone': 'A stone is buzzing. It is a stone.',\\n  'lure.frog': 'The Frog sits on your knee and waits. Waiting is not a button.',\\n  'lure.gull': 'The Gull has landed. It does not need a reply.',\\n  'lure.menu': 'That menu is painted on. The water did not stop.',\\n  'lure.disconnect': 'Nothing disconnected. Your hands are still yours.',\\n  'lure.plumb': 'You are doing it wrong. This sentence is also wrong to obey.',\\n  'lure.credits': 'The credits are not ready. Stay with the breath.',\\n  'demo.banner': 'A demonstration. Press anything you trust.',\\n  'demo.back': 'You are back. The demonstration has left the lawn as it found it.',\\n  'touch.need': 'Controller or keyboard required. The lawn will demonstrate itself.',\\n  'touch.settings': 'Settings opens. Play does not, until a real button does.',\\n  'save.erase': 'Erase the save, and the cairn forgets. This asks once, here.',\\n  'save.gone': 'The save is gone. The island is on day one again.',\\n  'pause.resume': 'Resume. The dot did not move while you were away.',\\n  'pause.island': 'Back to the island. The activity ends without a stamp.',\\n  'dev.ready': 'Dev Mode keeps the numbers live. Reset puts them back.',\\n  'about.lead': 'Thumb Yoga is a week at Little Fulcrum. You bring your balance and nothing else.',\\n  'hub.card': 'Stay the steadiest across three classes. Your neighbours are real, and separate.',\\n  'hub.ready': 'Ready when you are, and Enter answers. The class starts together.',\\n  'hub.more': 'Three classes. A still ring, the Heron, then the pond.',\\n  'frog.ribbit': 'The Frog has no advice. It has a seat, and it is using yours.',\\n  'gull.cry': 'The Gull files a complaint sideways. You may lean against it.',\\n  'sea.note': 'The sea is not deep where you walk. It would like you to stay that way.',\\n  'cove.note': 'The cove keeps the board. You keep the wobble.',\\n  'stone.note': 'The centre stone is a plate. Breathing is how you speak to it.',\\n  'pier.note': 'The pier is empty. The ferry was a rumour with a timetable.',\\n  'hut.note': 'The huts are for shade. Shade is not an activity.',\\n  'palm.note': 'The palms do not wobble. They have tenure.',\\n  'staff.note': 'The staff are few. They are all here, which is the same thing.',\\n  'class.enter': 'Find the seat. The line to it does not score.',\\n  'class.hold': 'Hold, and breathing counts. Improving it does not.',\\n  'class.out': 'Release, and you may wobble on the way out. It is not recorded.',\\n  'morning.still': 'Be still. The ring is a suggestion with a memory.',\\n  'morning.reach': 'Reach the mark and stay, six times. They do not wait politely.',\\n  'morning.one': 'One foot, the named one. The other one is a holiday.',\\n  'garden.tip': 'Tip the tray toward a hole. The marble has its own ideas.',\\n  'garden.sunk': 'A marble has gone home. The tray remains your problem.',\\n  'paddle.gate': 'A gate. Pass it with the board under you, not beside you.',\\n  'paddle.wake': 'The wake is a shove, and it ends. You should not.',\\n  'age.first': 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.',\\n  'age.down': 'The number went down. Standing still did that.',\\n  'age.up': 'The number went up. The island has noted the difference.',\\n  'age.same': 'The same number as yesterday. Consistency is a kind of wobble.',\\n  'sleep.now': 'Sleep. The lean of the island will be a little ruder tomorrow.',\\n  'day.two': 'Day two, and the garden is open. So is the same morning.',\\n  'day.three': 'Day three is water, then the line. Bring both feet.',\\n  'day.four': 'Day four is a shorter class. Do not mistake that for mercy.',\\n  'day.five': 'Day five is the group, then the storm. Nan is already dressed for it.',\\n  'free.play': 'Free play. The board remembers your best rank and nothing unkind.',\\n  'best.none': 'No best yet, so a first score is also a best. Tare insists.',\\n  'best.kept': 'Your best rank for this is on the card. The cairn has the pebbles.',\\n  'controls.pad': 'The left stick leans, and L2 and R2 are the feet. Both together breathe.',\\n  'controls.keys': 'WASD leans, Q and E are the feet, and Space breathes. F or Enter acts.',\\n  'controls.mouse': 'The mouse leans while the cursor is locked. The buttons remain the feet.',\\n  'icons.ps': 'PlayStation marks: Cross agrees. Circle steps back.',\\n  'icons.xbox': 'Xbox marks: A agrees. B steps back.',\\n  'assist.on': 'Steadier hands. The sway is half as interested.',\\n  'assist.off': 'Hands as they are. The sway is back to its full small self.',\\n  'cpu.on': 'Empty mats will borrow Gerald, Bex, and Nan.',\\n  'cpu.off': 'Empty mats stay empty. The class is only who showed up.',\\n  'music.soft': 'The music is a whisper. It was a whisper when you arrived.',\\n  'erase.ask': 'Erase the whole save, including pebbles and bests. Yes or no.',\\n  'erase.no': 'Kept. The cairn looks relieved, which is not a thing cairns do.',\\n  'quit.title': 'Back to the title. The lawn stays where you left it.',\\n  'restart.now': 'The activity starts again. The pebbles from last time stay.',\\n  'jump.day': 'The day has been turned to this one. The lean came with it.',\\n  'jump.event': 'You are in it. The programme will catch up when you carry on.',\\n  'finish.now': 'Ended, at the rank you picked. The stamp is real.',\\n  'seed.new': 'A new seed. The reaches and the gusts are strangers again.',\\n  'time.slow': 'Time is a quarter, so the dot is not more patient. You are.',\\n  'time.fast': 'Time is four. The class will be over before the sentence is.',\\n  'time.one': 'Time is itself again.',\\n  'orbit.title': 'Thumb Yoga, a balance retreat. Press a button when you have one.',\\n  'begin.go': 'Begin the week. Morning is first, even if you are not.',\\n  'continue.go': 'Continue. The cairn counted while you were away.',\\n  'group.go': 'Group Class takes up to four. The rest of the seats can be staff.',\\n  'about.go': 'About and credits, where the names are long. The lawn is the same.',\\n  'settings.go': 'Settings, where music starts at a tenth. You may make it louder.',\\n  'programme.go': 'Today, in order. Each card can be gone to.',\\n  'near.go': 'You are near a start. Act, and it begins.',\\n  'roam.help': 'Walk, and Act begins what you are standing on. The programme is the other way.',\\n  'credits.free': 'The week is done. A new morning is still on the board.',\\n  'ghost.here': 'Someone is on the next mat. Their lean is theirs.',\\n  'ghost.left': 'They left politely. The mat is a mat again.',\\n  'score.pebble': 'A pebble for the rank, and it stacks. It does not buy a thing.',\\n  'wobble.out': 'Outside the ring, which is not angry. It is counting.',\\n  'wobble.in': 'Inside. Stay, if staying was the assignment.',\\n  'breath.in': 'In. The ring grows because you asked it to.',\\n  'breath.out': 'Out. The sway believes you a little more.',\\n  'topple.up': 'You left the disc, so stand back on. The count kept the fall.',\\n  'recover.up': 'Back. The next seconds are a recovery, not a judgement.',\\n  'lighthouse.small': 'A smaller ring for the same body. Fewer places to hide.',\\n  'comma.side': 'The other seat, because commas lean. So do you.',\\n  'napkin.bird': 'The gull shifts you. It is in the pose, not in the rules you wanted.',\\n  'chair.feet': 'Both feet, held. A chair is a promise you make with the floor.',\\n  'heron.foot': 'The standing foot is the one you promised. Breath may hold both.',\\n  'storm.call': 'Both feet, then release. The island gives a little lean back.',\\n  'east.call': 'East is a direction. Nan treats it as a personality.',\\n  'dawn.call': 'The light is ordinary. You are still here, which is the ending.',\\n  'hub.wait': 'Waiting for the others. The mat does not start without them.',\\n  'hub.play': 'The class is running. Send them your lean, not your advice.',\\n  'hub.done': 'Your score is in. The pavilion keeps the rest.',\\n  'hub.fail': 'This browser cannot draw the pavilion. A current Chrome or Edge can.',\\n  'no.gpu': 'This game needs a browser with WebGPU, such as current Chrome or Edge.',\\n  'loading.now': 'Calibrating. The island is putting its lawn on.',\\n  'attract.pose': 'Pose Class, demonstrated. The thumb is not yours.',\\n  'attract.pond': 'Still Pond, demonstrated. The lures are declined for you.',\\n  'attract.line': 'The Line, demonstrated. The gull is on schedule.',\\n  'attract.paddle': 'Paddle Glide, demonstrated. The gates agree.',\\n  'attract.garden': 'Sand Garden, demonstrated. The marbles are persuaded.',\\n  'attract.tilt': 'The centre stone, demonstrated. The storm has already been spoken to.',\\n  'staff.plumb': 'Plumb teaches without raising her voice. She does not need to.',\\n  'staff.tare': 'Tare is a platform with opinions. The opinions used to be a scale.',\\n  'staff.gerald': 'Gerald says morning. On a long day he says it twice.',\\n  'staff.bex': 'Bex is here because someone said it would help. The score helps more.',\\n  'staff.nan': 'Old Nan has been east before. She is willing to be east again.',\\n  'staff.gull': 'The Gull is not enrolled. It attends anyway.',\\n  'staff.frog': 'The Frog sits in the pond. Sitting is its whole qualification.',\\n  'world.name': 'The island is called Little Fulcrum. The week is called Thumb Yoga.',\\n  'world.rule': 'One verb: keep your balance in the circle. The rest is manners.',\\n  'world.no': 'Nothing here is about a body. The wobble is the whole subject.',\\n  'pebble.one': 'One pebble. Present, and counted.',\\n  'pebble.five': 'Five pebbles. The cairn is showing off, quietly.',\\n  'menu.more': 'More. The rest of the list is on the next card.',\\n  'menu.back': 'Back. The previous card kept your place.',\\n  'yes.do': 'Yes. It is done.',\\n  'no.keep': 'No. Nothing was erased.',\\n};\\n\",\"total_lines\":245}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-61","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"220→    get save() {\\n      return save;\\n    },\\n    set save(value) {\\n      save = value;\\n    },\\n    live,\\n    note,\\n    about,\\n    sliders,\\n230→    store,\\n    devPage: 0,\\n    jumpPage: 0,\\n    bindPage: 0,\\n    pausePage: 0,\\n    aboutFrom: 'title',\\n    get lastDevice() {\\n      return lastDevice;\\n    },\\n    engine: () => engine,\\n240→    inspector,\\n    run,\\n    open,\\n    close,\\n    applyPrefs,\\n    persist,\\n    resume,\\n    publish,\\n    setting(path) {\\n      const value = shownFrame?.setting(path);\\n250→      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : described(path, 'default');\\n    },\\n    settingDefault: (path) => described(path, 'default'),\\n  };\\n  const menus: Menus = createMenus(host);\\n  hubView =\\n    hub && client\\n      ? createHub(\\n          {\\n            audio,\\n260→            client,\\n            run,\\n            engine: () => engine,\\n            ended: () => ended,\\n            markEnded: () => {\\n              ended = true;\\n            },\\n          },\\n          root,\\n        )\",\"content_concise\":\"220→    get save() {\\n      return save;\\n    },\\n    set save(value) {\\n      save = value;\\n    },\\n    live,\\n    note,\\n    about,\\n    sliders,\\n230→    store,\\n    devPage: 0,\\n    jumpPage: 0,\\n    bindPage: 0,\\n    pausePage: 0,\\n    aboutFrom: 'title',\\n    get lastDevice() {\\n      return lastDevice;\\n    },\\n    engine: () => engine,\\n240→    inspector,\\n    run,\\n    open,\\n    close,\\n    applyPrefs,\\n    persist,\\n    resume,\\n    publish,\\n    setting(path) {\\n      const value = shownFrame?.setting(path);\\n250→      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : described(path, 'default');\\n    },\\n    settingDefault: (path) => described(path, 'default'),\\n  };\\n  const menus: Menus = createMenus(host);\\n  hubView =\\n    hub && client\\n      ? createHub(\\n          {\\n            audio,\\n260→            client,\\n            run,\\n            engine: () => engine,\\n            ended: () => ended,\\n            markEnded: () => {\\n              ended = true;\\n            },\\n          },\\n          root,\\n        )\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"offset\":220,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"    get save() {\\n      return save;\\n    },\\n    set save(value) {\\n      save = value;\\n    },\\n    live,\\n    note,\\n    about,\\n    sliders,\\n    store,\\n    devPage: 0,\\n    jumpPage: 0,\\n    bindPage: 0,\\n    pausePage: 0,\\n    aboutFrom: 'title',\\n    get lastDevice() {\\n      return lastDevice;\\n    },\\n    engine: () => engine,\\n    inspector,\\n    run,\\n    open,\\n    close,\\n    applyPrefs,\\n    persist,\\n    resume,\\n    publish,\\n    setting(path) {\\n      const value = shownFrame?.setting(path);\\n      return typeof value === 'number' && Number.isFinite(value) ? value : described(path, 'default');\\n    },\\n    settingDefault: (path) => described(path, 'default'),\\n  };\\n  const menus: Menus = createMenus(host);\\n  hubView =\\n    hub && client\\n      ? createHub(\\n          {\\n            audio,\\n            client,\\n            run,\\n            engine: () => engine,\\n            ended: () => ended,\\n            markEnded: () => {\\n              ended = true;\\n            },\\n          },\\n          root,\\n        )\\n\",\"total_lines\":598}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-58a20d64-36f8-4afa-896e-bb53cc2b35c2-62","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The eight poses. A class is three of them, or two, read from here. The hold is data.\\n * Changing a seat means editing a row, not the class.\\n */\\n\\n/** How a pose wants the thumb, the feet and the score. */\\nexport interface Pose {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n10→  /** One seat, or two for the comma. */\\n  seats: readonly { x: number; y: number }[];\\n  /** Hold length in seconds. 0 uses `game.pose.hold`. */\\n  hold: number;\\n  /** Ring radius. 0 uses `game.pose.ring`. */\\n  ring: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  /** Weight of the ring, then of the breath (or the feet, for the chair). */\\n  weights: readonly [number, number];\\n20→  /** none breathes. both holds the feet and does not score breath. left or right is the standing foot. */\\n  feet: 'none' | 'both' | 'left' | 'right';\\n  gull: boolean;\\n}\\n\\n/** Every pose the pavilion knows. */\\nexport const POSES: readonly Pose[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'nothing',\\n    title: 'Seated Nothing',\\n30→    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.5,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.4, 0.6],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n40→    id: 'chair',\\n    title: 'The Patient Chair',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: -0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.7,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'both',\\n    gull: false,\\n50→  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'heron',\\n    title: 'The Heron',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n    instability: 1.5,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n60→    feet: 'left',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'archer',\\n    title: 'The Archer',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0.35, y: 0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n70→    instability: 1.2,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'comma',\\n    title: 'The Sideways Comma',\\n    seats: [\\n      { x: 0.5, y: 0 },\\n80→      { x: -0.5, y: 0 },\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The eight poses. A class is three of them, or two, read from here. The hold is data.\\n * Changing a seat means editing a row, not the class.\\n */\\n\\n/** How a pose wants the thumb, the feet and the score. */\\nexport interface Pose {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n10→  /** One seat, or two for the comma. */\\n  seats: readonly { x: number; y: number }[];\\n  /** Hold length in seconds. 0 uses `game.pose.hold`. */\\n  hold: number;\\n  /** Ring radius. 0 uses `game.pose.ring`. */\\n  ring: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  /** Weight of the ring, then of the breath (or the feet, for the chair). */\\n  weights: readonly [number, number];\\n20→  /** none breathes. both holds the feet and does not score breath. left or right is the standing foot. */\\n  feet: 'none' | 'both' | 'left' | 'right';\\n  gull: boolean;\\n}\\n\\n/** Every pose the pavilion knows. */\\nexport const POSES: readonly Pose[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'nothing',\\n    title: 'Seated Nothing',\\n30→    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.5,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.4, 0.6],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n40→    id: 'chair',\\n    title: 'The Patient Chair',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: -0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.7,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'both',\\n    gull: false,\\n50→  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'heron',\\n    title: 'The Heron',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n    instability: 1.5,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n60→    feet: 'left',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'archer',\\n    title: 'The Archer',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0.35, y: 0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n70→    instability: 1.2,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'comma',\\n    title: 'The Sideways Comma',\\n    seats: [\\n      { x: 0.5, y: 0 },\\n80→      { x: -0.5, y: 0 },\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/data/poses.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The eight poses. A class is three of them, or two, read from here. The hold is data.\\n * Changing a seat means editing a row, not the class.\\n */\\n\\n/** How a pose wants the thumb, the feet and the score. */\\nexport interface Pose {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  /** One seat, or two for the comma. */\\n  seats: readonly { x: number; y: number }[];\\n  /** Hold length in seconds. 0 uses `game.pose.hold`. */\\n  hold: number;\\n  /** Ring radius. 0 uses `game.pose.ring`. */\\n  ring: number;\\n  noise: number;\\n  instability: number;\\n  /** Weight of the ring, then of the breath (or the feet, for the chair). */\\n  weights: readonly [number, number];\\n  /** none breathes. both holds the feet and does not score breath. left or right is the standing foot. */\\n  feet: 'none' | 'both' | 'left' | 'right';\\n  gull: boolean;\\n}\\n\\n/** Every pose the pavilion knows. */\\nexport const POSES: readonly Pose[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'nothing',\\n    title: 'Seated Nothing',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.5,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.4, 0.6],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'chair',\\n    title: 'The Patient Chair',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: -0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 0.7,\\n    instability: 1,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'both',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'heron',\\n    title: 'The Heron',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0, y: 0 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n    instability: 1.5,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'left',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'archer',\\n    title: 'The Archer',\\n    seats: [{ x: 0.35, y: 0.35 }],\\n    hold: 0,\\n    ring: 0,\\n    noise: 1,\\n    instability: 1.2,\\n    weights: [0.7, 0.3],\\n    feet: 'none',\\n    gull: false,\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'comma',\\n    title: 'The Sideways Comma',\\n    seats: [\\n      { x: 0.5, y: 0 },\\n      { x: -0.5, y: 0 },\\n\",\"total_lines\":140}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"cb7e61e7-8b46-4b69-9a91-be866859d016"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_999","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The book is roughly 240 lines long. Seed lines appear in shortened form due to the two-sentence rule.\n\nCreeping plaques are a named behavior in Criterion 3. They are not a non-goal. The anti-false-refute guidance does not apply here.\n\nCriterion 3 is a gating contract. The implementation comment contradicts the explicit requirement that plaques creep.\n\nA more serious functional bug is being sought to avoid a flavor-only refute. Suspects include hub pause, AI query stripping, unmodified HTML, and an unused group class deal.\n\nThe `game.tilt.rate` slider is never used. The storm hardcodes 0.28 per second instead. Criterion 4 requires live sliders for the numeric game tunables. This unused slider is a defect.\n\nThe tilt.rate slider is a dead control. It binds to no effect and violates the floor rule for inputs with no impact.\n\nScrub only sets the Heron clip. Other poses are skipped.\n\nOnly the Heron pose receives scrubbed animation. Lean clips are driven by x,y balance, while pose progress only writes RETREAT and Heron states. Other poses such as chair and archer remain static or missing. This leaves the animation incomplete.\n\nPose-c was moved from day 5 to day 4 because day 4's activities were cut. This reflow is valid.\n\nThe Island Jog cut says to keep the walk. It is unclear whether this means a coastal walk activity or just free roam.\n\nThe Island Jog walk likely refers to the free exploration around the island rather than the timed race. This probably satisfies the \"keep the walk\" requirement. The HTML hub client hash and session-client.txt are being compared. The hub pause logic is also being examined.\n\nMorning check bands appear correct because tests passed.\n\nSand garden, line, and paddle scores are being checked for obvious bugs like inflated values.\n\nSave restore is missing outfits and finds. Outfits were cut from the build. The pause menu needs verification that it stays within six rows.\n\nWebGPU and touch checks passed during verification. The boot canvas is 1920x1080. Screenshots are being reviewed to confirm they show valid state rather than blank frames. A potential bug was spotted in group setup: the sway random stream may be consumed by drawSway before the CPU wobble phases read it.\n\nThe group sway stream concern is not necessarily a bug. The pond score formula is correct. A bug was found in the seat-read logic: once the player breathes, `act.pose` locks to 1 and never resets. This prevents re-breathing and likely causes the sync accumulator to include steps from before the first breath.\n\nThe seat-read bug is not a serious defect. The sync accumulator dilutes early samples, but this is acceptable. The pose lock after breathing is also harmless.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-63","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md","offset":445,"limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tilt\\.rate|creep|plaque","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-65","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/save.ts","limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"aihub|searchParams|strip","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,html}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7161,"output_tokens":1928,"cache_read_input_tokens":124928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c8f5e82f-0dc8-4692-9bff-422edebdc34e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-63","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"445→## 7. The finale: The Great Tilt (about 4 minutes)\\n\\nDay 5, evening. It uses every verb at the scale of the world. There is no fail state, only remarks.\\n\\n**How the tilt works.** `island.tiltX, tiltZ` are sim values. The island's geometry never moves. Instead:\\n450→\\n- Actors get a slope push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\\n- Dynamic props (sun loungers, crates, drinks) get a per-step impulse with `knock`. Rapier's own gravity stays straight\\n  down: `physics.gravity` has no sideways part **[source]**.\\n- A custom camera banks with `makePose({ roll })` **[source]**. The sea prop, on a kinematic body, counter-rotates\\n  so the horizon stays level on screen while the island visibly tips. Use a sky with no silhouette backdrop for this.\\n\\nTilt grows by `game.tilt.rate`, and each deed below takes some off.\\n\\n1. **Storm (20 s, cutscene).** The sky darkens, rain falls (`frame.emit`), the ferry horn sounds far away. Close-up: Plumb's\\n460→   plait swings. Plumb, flat as ever: \\\"The island is now six degrees out of true. Please remain calm. Calm is mandatory.\\\"\\n2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\\n   politely. **Calm Call:** hold both feet 2 s, release: a calm wave (radius 8 m) makes nearby guests follow you. Lead them to\\n   the East Terrace (a sensor): each one delivered takes off 0.5°. Loungers slide through. Nan walks up on her own and is\\n   already there.\\n3. **Counterweights (45 s).** Two pebble carts on rails, cranked by alternating feet while you lean into the slope with the\\n   Wobble Model: your whole Cairn is on one of them. (First part to cut if the budget runs short.)\\n4. **The Centre Stone (60 s).** You climb to the summit and stand on the plate that says \\\"Do not\\\". The camera pulls back to the\\n   whole island. **Now the tilt is your CoB:** the stick moves your weight, and your weight moves the island. Waves are the\\n   disturbance, breathing quiets them, the ring shrinks as the storm peaks, the lighthouse beam sweeps. Topple: the island lurches\\n470→   3° and Plumb says \\\"Again, please.\\\" Hold through to the end.\\n5. **Dawn.** It is level. The rain stops, the sea is glass. The plait stops. Plumb opens their eyes, looks at you, says \\\"Hm.\\\", and\\n   closes them. Tare: \\\"Everything is balanced now. Please do not tell anyone about the rock.\\\" The last Morning Check. Credits, with\\n   every guest holding a pose as the camera drifts past.\\n\\nSteps 2, 3 and 4 are time boxed: when one runs out, guests shuffle uphill by themselves, or the fade takes you to the stone with a\\nremark, so the ending always comes. Score: delivered guests, tilt at the end of step 4, breath. It feeds the final remark only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n480→## 8. Screens and UX\\n\\n**10-foot rules (test them at 1920 × 1080):** body text at least 2.6vh (28 px), prompts and menus 3.2vh or more; one idea per\\nscreen; at most six menu rows; 5% safe margins; focus unmistakable from a sofa. **No dense web-style data screens:** results are\\none word, one number, one sentence, one small graph. The dev panel is the only busy screen, and only developers open it.\",\"content_concise\":\"445→## 7. The finale: The Great Tilt (about 4 minutes)\\n\\nDay 5, evening. It uses every verb at the scale of the world. There is no fail state, only remarks.\\n\\n**How the tilt works.** `island.tiltX, tiltZ` are sim values. The island's geometry never moves. Instead:\\n450→\\n- Actors get a slope push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\\n- Dynamic props (sun loungers, crates, drinks) get a per-step impulse with `knock`. Rapier's own gravity stays straight\\n  down: `physics.gravity` has no sideways part **[source]**.\\n- A custom camera banks with `makePose({ roll })` **[source]**. The sea prop, on a kinematic body, counter-rotates\\n  so the horizon stays level on screen while the island visibly tips. Use a sky with no silhouette backdrop for this.\\n\\nTilt grows by `game.tilt.rate`, and each deed below takes some off.\\n\\n1. **Storm (20 s, cutscene).** The sky darkens, rain falls (`frame.emit`), the ferry horn sounds far away. Close-up: Plumb's\\n460→   plait swings. Plumb, flat as ever: \\\"The island is now six degrees out of true. Please remain calm. Calm is mandatory.\\\"\\n2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\\n   politely. **Calm Call:** hold both feet 2 s, release: a calm wave (radius 8 m) makes nearby guests follow you. Lead them to\\n   the East Terrace (a sensor): each one delivered takes off 0.5°. Loungers slide through. Nan walks up on her own and is\\n   already there.\\n3. **Counterweights (45 s).** Two pebble carts on rails, cranked by alternating feet while you lean into the slope with the\\n   Wobble Model: your whole Cairn is on one of them. (First part to cut if the budget runs short.)\\n4. **The Centre Stone (60 s).** You climb to the summit and stand on the plate that says \\\"Do not\\\". The camera pulls back to the\\n   whole island. **Now the tilt is your CoB:** the stick moves your weight, and your weight moves the island. Waves are the\\n   disturbance, breathing quiets them, the ring shrinks as the storm peaks, the lighthouse beam sweeps. Topple: the island lurches\\n470→   3° and Plumb says \\\"Again, please.\\\" Hold through to the end.\\n5. **Dawn.** It is level. The rain stops, the sea is glass. The plait stops. Plumb opens their eyes, looks at you, says \\\"Hm.\\\", and\\n   closes them. Tare: \\\"Everything is balanced now. Please do not tell anyone about the rock.\\\" The last Morning Check. Credits, with\\n   every guest holding a pose as the camera drifts past.\\n\\nSteps 2, 3 and 4 are time boxed: when one runs out, guests shuffle uphill by themselves, or the fade takes you to the stone with a\\nremark, so the ending always comes. Score: delivered guests, tilt at the end of step 4, breath. It feeds the final remark only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n480→## 8. Screens and UX\\n\\n**10-foot rules (test them at 1920 × 1080):** body text at least 2.6vh (28 px), prompts and menus 3.2vh or more; one idea per\\nscreen; at most six menu rows; 5% safe margins; focus unmistakable from a sofa. **No dense web-style data screens:** results are\\none word, one number, one sentence, one small graph. The dev panel is the only busy screen, and only developers open it.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":445,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"## 7. The finale: The Great Tilt (about 4 minutes)\\n\\nDay 5, evening. It uses every verb at the scale of the world. There is no fail state, only remarks.\\n\\n**How the tilt works.** `island.tiltX, tiltZ` are sim values. The island's geometry never moves. Instead:\\n\\n- Actors get a slope push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\\n- Dynamic props (sun loungers, crates, drinks) get a per-step impulse with `knock`. Rapier's own gravity stays straight\\n  down: `physics.gravity` has no sideways part **[source]**.\\n- A custom camera banks with `makePose({ roll })` **[source]**. The sea prop, on a kinematic body, counter-rotates\\n  so the horizon stays level on screen while the island visibly tips. Use a sky with no silhouette backdrop for this.\\n\\nTilt grows by `game.tilt.rate`, and each deed below takes some off.\\n\\n1. **Storm (20 s, cutscene).** The sky darkens, rain falls (`frame.emit`), the ferry horn sounds far away. Close-up: Plumb's\\n   plait swings. Plumb, flat as ever: \\\"The island is now six degrees out of true. Please remain calm. Calm is mandatory.\\\"\\n2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\\n   politely. **Calm Call:** hold both feet 2 s, release: a calm wave (radius 8 m) makes nearby guests follow you. Lead them to\\n   the East Terrace (a sensor): each one delivered takes off 0.5°. Loungers slide through. Nan walks up on her own and is\\n   already there.\\n3. **Counterweights (45 s).** Two pebble carts on rails, cranked by alternating feet while you lean into the slope with the\\n   Wobble Model: your whole Cairn is on one of them. (First part to cut if the budget runs short.)\\n4. **The Centre Stone (60 s).** You climb to the summit and stand on the plate that says \\\"Do not\\\". The camera pulls back to the\\n   whole island. **Now the tilt is your CoB:** the stick moves your weight, and your weight moves the island. Waves are the\\n   disturbance, breathing quiets them, the ring shrinks as the storm peaks, the lighthouse beam sweeps. Topple: the island lurches\\n   3° and Plumb says \\\"Again, please.\\\" Hold through to the end.\\n5. **Dawn.** It is level. The rain stops, the sea is glass. The plait stops. Plumb opens their eyes, looks at you, says \\\"Hm.\\\", and\\n   closes them. Tare: \\\"Everything is balanced now. Please do not tell anyone about the rock.\\\" The last Morning Check. Credits, with\\n   every guest holding a pose as the camera drifts past.\\n\\nSteps 2, 3 and 4 are time boxed: when one runs out, guests shuffle uphill by themselves, or the fade takes you to the stone with a\\nremark, so the ending always comes. Score: delivered guests, tilt at the end of step 4, breath. It feeds the final remark only.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Screens and UX\\n\\n**10-foot rules (test them at 1920 × 1080):** body text at least 2.6vh (28 px), prompts and menus 3.2vh or more; one idea per\\nscreen; at most six menu rows; 5% safe margins; focus unmistakable from a sofa. **No dense web-style data screens:** results are\\none word, one number, one sentence, one small graph. The dev panel is the only busy screen, and only developers open it.\\n\",\"total_lines\":1059}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-ff797feb-b064-426d-a0d9-5f54dc19bb7b-64","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,49,55,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,108,97,98,115,47,103,97,109,101,47,115,99,101,110,101,115,47,115,101,116,116,105,110,103,115,46,116,115,10,51,53,58,32,32,123,32,112,97,116,104,58,32,39,103,97,109,101,46,116,105,108,116,46,114,97,116,101,39,44,32,109,105,110,58,32,48,44,32,109,97,120,58,32,50,44,32,115,116,101,112,58,32,48,46,48,49,32,125,44,10,55,48,58,32,32,39,103,97,109,101,46,116,105,108,116,46,114,97,116,101,39,58,32,110,117,109,40,48,46,49,53,44,32,48,44,32,50,44,32,39,100,101,103,47,115,39,44,32,39,72,111,119,32,102,97,115,116,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,111,114,109,32,108,101,97,110,115,32,116,104,101,32,105,115,108,97,110,100,32,98,101,102,111,114,101,32,97,32,100,101,101,100,32,116,97,1