23656/labs/game/cast/clips.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file Pose strips for the retreat. Each clip stands, then arrives. The page scrubs the time.\"},{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"/** A two-key strip. The first key is neutral so an additive lean starts at nothing. */\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"function strip(over: object): object {\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"    Nothing: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":62,\"content\":\"    Chair: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":69,\"content\":\"    Heron: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":77,\"content\":\"    Archer: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":85,\"content\":\"    Comma: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"    Napkin: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":100,\"content\":\"    Bridge: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"    Lighthouse: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"    LeanR: strip({ body: [0, 0, 12], chest: [0, 0, 4], hips: [0, 6, 99], armL: [0, 40, -70, 8, 0] }),\"},{\"line_number\":114,\"content\":\"    LeanL: strip({ body: [0, 0, -12], chest: [0, 0, -4], hips: [0, -6, 99], armR: [0, 40, -70, 8, 0] }),\"},{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"    LeanF: strip({ body: [12, 0, 0], chest: [6, 0, 0], hips: [4, 0, 98] }),\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"    LeanB: strip({ body: [-10, 0, 0], chest: [-4, 0, 0], hips: [-3, 0, 98] }),\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"    DeepKnee: strip({ hips: [10, 0, 62], legL: [70, 8, -80, 100, 0], legR: [70, 8, -80, 100, 0] }),\"},{\"line_number\":118,\"content\":\"    Paddling: strip({\"},{\"line_number\":123,\"content\":\"    CalmCall: strip({ armL: [20, 10, -20, 40, 0], armR: [20, 10, -20, 40, 0], chest: [4, 0, 0] }),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/main.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * The hub's own query keys are stripped before the engine sees them. Music starts at a tenth.\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"  for (const key of [...search.keys()]) if (key.startsWith('aihub')) search.delete(key);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/cast/rest.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The retreat puppet's rest measurements, copied from the engine's Mesh2Motion animated rest so pose strips share that body. Mesh2Motion is credited.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/harness.html\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":298,\"content\":\"        url.searchParams.set('aihub', '1');\"},{\"line_number\":299,\"content\":\"        if (seedsRandom(tag)) url.searchParams.set('aihub-seed', String(seed >>> 0));\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"858c4b5f-dd8c-4059-a463-73128892a81e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1000","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`game.tilt.rate` is defined in `settings.ts` with a slider, but `tilt.ts` never reads it.\n\nThe storm phase hardcodes tilt to 0.4 plus a small leftward offset. Phase 1 never reduces tilt when guests are delivered, despite the plan and setting description claiming otherwise. Tilt only changes in phase 0 and phase 2.\n\nThe storm phase is a cutscene, but tilt should still grow by `game.tilt.rate`. East guests drift west via `mark.x -= 0.3 * dt` rather than downhill from slope. The centre stone correctly follows the CoB tilt, and waves apply as a sine disturbance.\n\nBreathing does not quiet the wave disturbance. The code adds `stick.disturbX` after the calm multiplier, so the wave is unaffected by breathing. This is a spec miss, though the calm still reduces sway noise.\n\nThe topple phase does not lurch the island by 3°. It recentres the body via stepBalance, and the island tilt tracks that centre-of-balance position each frame. The acceptance criterion only requires the island tilt to follow the centre of balance, which is already implemented.\n\nThe acceptance criterion is the derived checklist, not PLAN.md itself. The deeper mechanics like slope push and 0.5° per guest are optional extras in PLAN.md. The code-correctness floor only requires that a setting exists as a handler that never changes state.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cc7c8e9c-5bc4-4d43-b1d5-e79e32d196ff-67","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"slope|tiltX|knock|makePose","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cc7c8e9c-5bc4-4d43-b1d5-e79e32d196ff-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","offset":245,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cc7c8e9c-5bc4-4d43-b1d5-e79e32d196ff-69","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"finds|bests|game\\.begin","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5246,"output_tokens":1194,"cache_read_input_tokens":131968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"52715951-dec7-4c3f-9e7e-06d2be1cd6e1"}
