{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1004","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pose scrub bug is confirmed. I am verifying whether the Nothing clip holds at the start or end when hold is true.\n\nSpeed 0 with hold true freezes the clip at t=0, the neutral key. The scrub never advances Nothing's time toward 1. Heron is not in slots, so its slot.t assignment never runs.\n\nLean additives scrub correctly, but poses do not. The scrub formula is also broken: act.hold is 0 during both the enter and scored hold phases. Plaques do not creep, and tilt.rate is dead. I will check hub client bytes next.\n\nI will verify the HTML client bytes match session-client.txt and were not edited. The build should include the pump from hub.ts. I will grep the minified HTML for the new interval or its comment.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f75f6ee-0cee-4556-bb5e-4fc0123bf8e3-79","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"still compiling|setInterval\\(beat, 120\\)|The card can open the round","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f75f6ee-0cee-4556-bb5e-4fc0123bf8e3-80","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"session client 1\\.4\\.0|AI Hub session client","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f75f6ee-0cee-4556-bb5e-4fc0123bf8e3-81","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/hub/session-client.txt","limit":15}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f75f6ee-0cee-4556-bb5e-4fc0123bf8e3-82","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__202