{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1006","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The game initialization spreads the entire Save object, including finds, bests, settings, and outfits.\n\napplySave only copies day, cursor, pebbles, age, prior, credits, result, seen, and rank. It ignores finds, bests, and settings. Bests are kept in page state rather than the simulation. Finds are stored but never applied to pebble marks. remember() spreads the previous save object first, preserving prior, finds, and bests if they exist.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e5199fd-029a-4e7f-8704-a9200e60649c-86","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/snap.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6e5199fd-029a-4e7f-8704-a9200e60649c-87","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"prior","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2565,"output_tokens":434,"cache_read_input_tokens":157696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c7c8e706-e2a4-409c-b0bc-e4b5c8308b6f"}
