ind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts:262\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Pose scrub does not follow the thumb. The guest is spawned on RETREAT/Nothing at speed 0, Heron is never playClip'd, and slot.t is act.hold/(12*60) which stays ~0 (enter hold is 0–1; the scored hold resets hold to 0). Play the pose clip for the current pose and scrub its time from hold progress. Add a test that boots the island, starts a pose, steps the real activity, and asserts that clip's t moves.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts:120\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Centre-stone writes island.tiltX/tiltZ from the centre of balance and nothing in the game reads those fields (no slope push, camera roll, prop knock, or sea counter-rotation). game.tilt.rate is never read; the storm hardcodes 0.28 deg/s and delivering a guest does not take tilt off. Wire tilt into something the player sees and that deeds can change, and test that a non-zero CoB changes that consumed tilt.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts:111\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Plaques are a no-op: the comment says they creep nowhere, and dress() never moves them across days. Make them shift downhill as the day advances, and assert the new positions from the island step.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts:53\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Wobble Age is computed but never shown. ageRemark is never called, the age.* lines are never assigned, results paint only rank/score/sentence (stage.ts:541), and remember() never stores prior so yesterday cannot survive a reload. Show today's age against yesterday on the morning result and persist prior through the save.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"bug\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts:220\\\",\\n      \\\"detail\\\": \\\"applySave ignores finds. Pebble marks respawn untaken, and walking over them adds pebbles again on top of the restored count. Finds are also one generic id, not per spot. Restore each found pebble as taken and do not increment pebbles for it.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"island.ts:262 writes only an unplayed Heron slot from act.hold/720; tilt.ts:120 stores tiltX and grep shows no reader; score.ts ageRemark has no callers; applySave never applies finds. verify.log/npm-test.log do not cover these paths.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"See the skeptic markdown.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-f481ff9c-b279-4b22-9e15-a64605bb1214-99","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic verdict: refuted\\n\\nThe hand-in files, bot-band tests, three-seed credits log, boots, and the later hub runs (players 2/3/4 and host-leave, `__hubCheck.pass`) are real. They do not cover the holes below. `npm test` (22) and `npm run check` (engine `my-3dge@e7a1243`) passing does not exercise them.\\n\\n## Pose clips are not scrubbed\\n\\n`labs/game/scenes/island.ts` spawns the guest on `RETREAT/Nothing` at `speed: 0` (around line 211). `scrub` (line 262) only assigns `RETREAT/Heron`’s `slot.t`, and that clip is never `playClip`’d, so the write hits no slot. The time it would write is `act.hold / (12 * 60)`. During enter, `act.hold` is a 0–1 blend; during the scored hold, `pose.ts` resets `act.hold` to 0. The quotient stays about 0. Chair, Archer, Comma, Napkin, Bridge, and Lighthouse are never selected. That is a frozen clip, not a scrub that follows the thumb (criteria 2 and 3). No test reads clip time.\\n\\n## Great Tilt’s lean is stored and ignored\\n\\n`tilt.ts:120` sets `island.tiltX = body.x * 6` and `tiltZ` from `body.y`. A repo search shows those fields are only written (`driver.ts` day lean, `tilt.ts` storm/stone/dawn). Nothing applies slope push, camera roll, prop knock, or a sea counter-rotation, so the centre stone does not move the island. `game.tilt.rate` is registered and listed in Dev Mode (`settings.ts:70`) and never read; the storm hardcodes `0.28` deg/s (`tilt.ts:73`). Phase 1 scores delivered guests and does not take tilt off.\\n\\n## Plaques do not creep\\n\\n`island.ts:111` says “They creep nowhere.” `dress()` bobs the sea and picks up pebbles; plaque marks stay at their spawn coordinates. Criterion 3 asks for creeping plaques.\\n\\n## Wobble Age never reaches the player\\n\\n`wobbleAge` is tested. `ageRemark` (`score.ts:53`) has no callers. The `age.first` / `age.down` / `age.up` / `age.same` lines are never assigned. The results line (`stage.ts:541`) is rank, score, and a sentence. `remember()` copies `age` but not `prior`, so yesterday’s age cannot be restored. Morning Check’s comparison is dead.\\n\\n## Finds do not restore\\n\\n`applySave` (`driver.ts:220`) copies day, cursor, pebbles, ages, credits, result, seen, and rank. It ignores `finds`. Pebble marks spawn with `taken: 0`, and `dress()` adds `flow.pebbles += 1` on each pickup. A continued save can collect the same spots again. The saved find is also the single id `find.pebble`, not a spot.\\n\\n## What did hold\\n\\n`verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0` with seeds 1–3 at credits. Boot logs agree: title “Thumb Yoga”, music 0.1, canvas 1920×1080, engine ready. `browser.log` shows PlayStation then Xbox glyphs, key and mouse prompts, attract at 10.5 s, and a live gain slider. `hub.log` shows pass for 2, 3, 4, and host-leave, with no `[AIHub]` lines. The session-client hash change is recorded in `PROGRESS.md` and `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` because the fetched 1.4.0 bytes moved. Cut activities match the plan’s cut line.\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/goal-classifier-ed8f613011b3-1-skeptic-0.md has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/goal-classifier-ed8f613011b3-1-skeptic-0.md has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/goal-classifier-ed8f613011b3-1-skeptic-0.md\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"# Skeptic verdict: refuted\\n\\nThe hand-in files, bot-band tests, three-seed credits log, boots, and the later hub runs (players 2/3/4 and host-leave, `__hubCheck.pass`) are real. They do not cover the holes below. `npm test` (22) and `npm run check` (engine `my-3dge@e7a1243`) passing does not exercise them.\\n\\n## Pose clips are not scrubbed\\n\\n`labs/game/scenes/island.ts` spawns the guest on `RETREAT/Nothing` at `speed: 0` (around line 211). `scrub` (line 262) only assigns `RETREAT/Heron`’s `slot.t`, and that clip is never `playClip`’d, so the write hits no slot. The time it would write is `act.hold / (12 * 60)`. During enter, `act.hold` is a 0–1 blend; during the scored hold, `pose.ts` resets `act.hold` to 0. The quotient stays about 0. Chair, Archer, Comma, Napkin, Bridge, and Lighthouse are never selected. That is a frozen clip, not a scrub that follows the thumb (criteria 2 and 3). No test reads clip time.\\n\\n## Great Tilt’s lean is stored and ignored\\n\\n`tilt.ts:120` sets `island.tiltX = body.x * 6` and `tiltZ` from `body.y`. A repo search shows those fields are only written (`driver.ts` day lean, `tilt.ts` storm/stone/dawn). Nothing applies slope push, camera roll, prop knock, or a sea counter-rotation, so the centre stone does not move the island. `game.tilt.rate` is registered and listed in Dev Mode (`settings.ts:70`) and never read; the storm hardcodes `0.28` deg/s (`tilt.ts:73`). Phase 1 scores delivered guests and does not take tilt off.\\n\\n## Plaques do not creep\\n\\n`island.ts:111` says “They creep nowhere.” `dress()` bobs the sea and picks up pebbles; plaque marks stay at their spawn coordinates. Criterion 3 asks for creeping plaques.\\n\\n## Wobble Age never reaches the player\\n\\n`wobbleAge` is tested. `ageRemark` (`score.ts:53`) has no callers. The `age.first` / `age.down` / `age.up` / `age.same` lines are never assigned. The results line (`stage.ts:541`) is rank, score, and a sentence. `remember()` copies `age` but not `prior`, so yesterday’s age cannot be restored. Morning Check’s comparison is dead.\\n\\n## Finds do not restore\\n\\n`applySave` (`driver.ts:220`) copies day, cursor, pebbles, ages, credits, result, seen, and rank. It ignores `finds`. Pebble marks spawn with `taken: 0`, and `dress()` adds `flow.pebbles += 1` on each pickup. A continued save can collect the same spots again. The saved find is also the single id `find.pebble`, not a spot.\\n\\n## What did hold\\n\\n`verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0` with seeds 1–3 at credits. Boot logs agree: title “Thumb Yoga”, music 0.1, canvas 1920×1080, engine ready. `browser.log` shows PlayStation then Xbox glyphs, key and mouse prompts, attract at 10.5 s, and a live gain slider. `hub.log` shows pass for 2, 3, 4, and host-leave, with no `[AIHub]` lines. The session-client hash change is recorded in `PROGRESS.md` and `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` because the fetched 1.4.0 bytes moved. Cut activities match the plan’s cut line.\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,