 stone does not move the island. `game.tilt.rate` is registered and listed in Dev Mode (`settings.ts:70`) and never read; the storm hardcodes `0.28` deg/s (`tilt.ts:73`). Phase 1 scores delivered guests and does not take tilt off.\\n\\n## Plaques do not creep\\n\\n`island.ts:111` says they creep nowhere. `dress()` bobs the sea and picks up pebbles; plaque marks stay at their spawn coordinates. Criterion 3 asks for creeping plaques.\\n\\n## Wobble Age never reaches the player\\n\\n`wobbleAge` is tested. `ageRemark` (`score.ts:53`) has no callers. The `age.first` / `age.down` / `age.up` / `age.same` lines are never assigned. The results line (`stage.ts:541`) is rank, score, and a sentence. `remember()` copies `age` but not `prior`, so yesterday's age cannot be restored. Morning Check's comparison is dead.\\n\\n## Finds do not restore\\n\\n`applySave` (`driver.ts:220`) copies day, cursor, pebbles, ages, credits, result, seen, and rank. It ignores `finds`. Pebble marks spawn with `taken: 0`, and `dress()` adds `flow.pebbles += 1` on each pickup. A continued save can collect the same spots again. The saved find is also the single id `find.pebble`, not a spot.\\n\\n## What did hold\\n\\n`verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0` with seeds 1-3 at credits. Boot logs agree: title Thumb Yoga, music 0.1, canvas 1920x1080, engine ready. `browser.log` shows PlayStation then Xbox glyphs, key and mouse prompts, attract at 10.5 s, and a live gain slider. `hub.log` shows pass for 2, 3, 4, and host-leave, with no `[AIHub]` lines. The session-client hash change is recorded in `PROGRESS.md` and `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` because the fetched 1.4.0 bytes moved. Cut activities match the plan's cut line.\\n\"\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2910,"output_tokens":1143,"cache_read_input_tokens":169344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"76b55c1e-3e4a-4254-98f1-83b636b9671