ine (`stage.ts:541`) is rank, score, and a sentence. `remember()` copies `age` but not `prior`, so yesterday's age cannot be restored. Morning Check's comparison is dead.\\\\n\\\\n## Finds do not restore\\\\n\\\\n`applySave` (`driver.ts:220`) copies day, cursor, pebbles, ages, credits, result, seen, and rank. It ignores `finds`. Pebble marks spawn with `taken: 0`, and `dress()` adds `flow.pebbles += 1` on each pickup. A continued save can collect the same spots again. The saved find is also the single id `find.pebble`, not a spot.\\\\n\\\\n## What did hold\\\\n\\\\n`verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0` with seeds 1-3 at credits. Boot logs agree: title Thumb Yoga, music 0.1, canvas 1920x1080, engine ready. `browser.log` shows PlayStation then Xbox glyphs, key and mouse prompts, attract at 10.5 s, and a live gain slider. `hub.log` shows pass for 2, 3, 4, and host-leave, with no `[AIHub]` lines. The session-client hash change is recorded in `PROGRESS.md` and `ENGINE-FEEDBACK.md` because the fetched 1.4.0 bytes moved. Cut activities match the plan's cut line.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\",\"new_line\":33,\"context_before\":\"  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"island.ts:262 writes only an unplayed Heron slot from act.hold/720; tilt.ts:120 stores tiltX and grep shows no reader; score.ts ageRemark has no callers; applySave never applies finds. verify.log/npm-test.log do not cover these paths.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"  \"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"6cde815f-5d44-4820-be93-a399fc0f7cfc"}
