{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1018","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Continuing the Thumb Yoga goal.\n\nFive bugs from the skeptic panel need fixing. The first is in `island.ts:262`: pose scrubbing does not follow the thumb. The guest spawns at speed zero on RETREAT/Nothing. Heron never plays its pose clip. The hold progress stays near zero. The fix requires playing the current pose clip and scrubbing its time from hold progress.\n\nA test will verify that pose scrubbing moves the clip time when the real activity steps forward.\n\nThe second bug is in `tilt.ts:120`. Centre-stone tilt writes to `island.tiltX` and `tiltZ`, but nothing consumes those values. There is no slope push, camera roll, prop knock, or sea counter-rotation. The storm hardcodes a 0.28 degree per second rate and never reads `game.tilt.rate`. Delivering a guest does not remove tilt either. Tilt must be wired into player-visible effects and deed-driven changes. A test will confirm that a non-zero centre of balance reduces consumed tilt.\n\nThe third bug is at `island.ts:111`: plaques are currently a no-op.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The hub run is green. The panel rejected five gameplay bugs: pose scrub, centre-stone tilt, plaques, Wobble Age, and pebble finds. I’ll read those paths and fix them in the shipped sim."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-81","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"pose-scrub","content":"Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"tilt-read","content":"Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees","status":"pending"},{"id":"plaques","content":"Shift plaques downhill as the day advances","status":"pending"},{"id":"wobble-age","content":"Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior","status":"pending"},{"id":"pebble-finds","content":"Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice","status":"pending"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check","status":"pending"}],"merge":false}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-82","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","limit":350}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-83","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-84","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":110571,"output_tokens":1184,"cache_read_input_tokens":10112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ea7f6e2f-4f62-4757-8312-924e202e46f7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-81","content":"{\"type\":\"Todo\",\"TodosUpdated\":{\"summary_for_prompt\":\"- [in_progress] pose-scrub: Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it\\n- [pending] tilt-read: Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees\\n- [pending] plaques: Shift plaques downhill as the day advances\\n- [pending] wobble-age: Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior\\n- [pending] pebble-finds: Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice\\n- [pending] reverify: Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check\\n\",\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"Shift plaques downhill as the day advances\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"}],\"state\":{\"todos\":{\"pose-scrub\":{\"content\":\"Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},\"tilt-read\":{\"content\":\"Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},\"plaques\":{\"content\":\"Shift plaques downhill as the day advances\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},\"wobble-age\":{\"content\":\"Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},\"pebble-finds\":{\"content\":\"Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},\"reverify\":{\"content\":\"Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"}}}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-82","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Little Fulcrum. A lawn on a sand dome, a pond, a cove, and a guest who can walk.\\n * Activities still run on the balance step. The mesh does not lean. The people do.\\n */\\nimport {\\n  addTerrainBody,\\n  createCharacter,\\n  defineComponent,\\n  defineProp,\\n10→  defineScene,\\n  defineTerrain,\\n  getTerrain,\\n  physicsOf,\\n  playClip,\\n  spawnActor,\\n  spawnProp,\\n  type Intents,\\n  type World,\\n} from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\n20→import '../cast/clips';\\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport type { Act } from './state';\\n\\ndefineTerrain('terrain:fulcrum', {\\n  size: [60, 60],\\n  cell: 4,\\n  origin: [-120, 0, -120],\\n  seed: 4,\\n30→  height: 0,\\n  ridges: 0,\\n  high: 7,\\n  materials: ['material:sand', 'material:sand', 'material:lawn'],\\n  hills: [\\n    { at: [0, 0], radius: 110, height: 11 },\\n    { at: [10, -6], radius: 22, height: 4 },\\n    { at: [24, 18], radius: 16, height: -3.2 },\\n    { at: [0, -78], radius: 30, height: -6 },\\n  ],\\n40→  flats: [\\n    { rect: [-14, -14, 14, 14], height: 9.2, margin: 8 },\\n    { rect: [-34, -2, -16, 16], height: 8.4, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [16, 8, 34, 28], height: 7.6, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [-8, -48, 10, -28], height: 6.2, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [32, 0, 52, 16], height: 8.8, margin: 5 },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:sea', {\\n50→  description: 'The sea. It is flat, and it pretends to breathe.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'water',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\\n      params: { width: 280, height: 0.35, depth: 280 },\\n      material: 'material:sea',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n60→\\ndefineProp('prop:mat', {\\n  description: 'A round mat.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'disc',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:frustum',\\n      params: { radiusTop: 1.15, radiusBottom: 1.2, height: 0.08, radialSegments: 16, smooth: true },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n70→  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:cairn', {\\n  description: 'Pebbles that are not spent.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'a',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.7, height: 0.28, depth: 0.5, radius: 0.08 },\\n80→      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'b',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.5, height: 0.22, depth: 0.38, radius: 0.08 },\\n      material: 'material:lawn',\\n      position: [0.05, 0.28, 0],\\n    },\\n    {\\n90→      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\n100→const STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n];\\n110→\\n/** Plaques. They creep nowhere. They only say they did. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n];\\n120→\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\n130→defineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n  posed?: { on: number };\\n140→  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's drawn position. */\\n150→interface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string };\\n}\\n\\n/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n160→\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\nfunction person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n170→    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n180→  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n190→  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n200→  }\\n  for (const pebble of PEBBLES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: 'find.pebble', taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n210→    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n220→  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea') row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n230→  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n240→    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the lean and the pose onto the clip slots. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  const slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n250→    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n260→  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const pose = flowOf(w).event.startsWith('pose') ? Math.min(1, act.hold / (12 * 60)) : 0;\\n  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/Heron') slot.t = pose;\\n  }\\n270→}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\nfunction roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title') {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n280→  }\\n  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n290→  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n300→    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\\n  terrain: 'terrain:fulcrum',\\n  physics: true,\\n310→  setup(w) {\\n    boot(w);\\n    furnish(w);\\n  },\\n  step(w, intents) {\\n    frame(w, intents);\\n    roam(w, intents);\\n  },\\n  actions: retreatActions,\\n});\\n320→\\nexport default island;\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Little Fulcrum. A lawn on a sand dome, a pond, a cove, and a guest who can walk.\\n * Activities still run on the balance step. The mesh does not lean. The people do.\\n */\\nimport {\\n  addTerrainBody,\\n  createCharacter,\\n  defineComponent,\\n  defineProp,\\n10→  defineScene,\\n  defineTerrain,\\n  getTerrain,\\n  physicsOf,\\n  playClip,\\n  spawnActor,\\n  spawnProp,\\n  type Intents,\\n  type World,\\n} from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\n20→import '../cast/clips';\\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport type { Act } from './state';\\n\\ndefineTerrain('terrain:fulcrum', {\\n  size: [60, 60],\\n  cell: 4,\\n  origin: [-120, 0, -120],\\n  seed: 4,\\n30→  height: 0,\\n  ridges: 0,\\n  high: 7,\\n  materials: ['material:sand', 'material:sand', 'material:lawn'],\\n  hills: [\\n    { at: [0, 0], radius: 110, height: 11 },\\n    { at: [10, -6], radius: 22, height: 4 },\\n    { at: [24, 18], radius: 16, height: -3.2 },\\n    { at: [0, -78], radius: 30, height: -6 },\\n  ],\\n40→  flats: [\\n    { rect: [-14, -14, 14, 14], height: 9.2, margin: 8 },\\n    { rect: [-34, -2, -16, 16], height: 8.4, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [16, 8, 34, 28], height: 7.6, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [-8, -48, 10, -28], height: 6.2, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [32, 0, 52, 16], height: 8.8, margin: 5 },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:sea', {\\n50→  description: 'The sea. It is flat, and it pretends to breathe.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'water',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\\n      params: { width: 280, height: 0.35, depth: 280 },\\n      material: 'material:sea',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n60→\\ndefineProp('prop:mat', {\\n  description: 'A round mat.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'disc',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:frustum',\\n      params: { radiusTop: 1.15, radiusBottom: 1.2, height: 0.08, radialSegments: 16, smooth: true },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n70→  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:cairn', {\\n  description: 'Pebbles that are not spent.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'a',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.7, height: 0.28, depth: 0.5, radius: 0.08 },\\n80→      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'b',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.5, height: 0.22, depth: 0.38, radius: 0.08 },\\n      material: 'material:lawn',\\n      position: [0.05, 0.28, 0],\\n    },\\n    {\\n90→      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\n100→const STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n];\\n110→\\n/** Plaques. They creep nowhere. They only say they did. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n];\\n120→\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\n130→defineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n  posed?: { on: number };\\n140→  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's drawn position. */\\n150→interface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string };\\n}\\n\\n/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n160→\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\nfunction person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n170→    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n180→  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n190→  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n200→  }\\n  for (const pebble of PEBBLES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: 'find.pebble', taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n210→    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n220→  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea') row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n230→  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n240→    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the lean and the pose onto the clip slots. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  const slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n250→    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n260→  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const pose = flowOf(w).event.startsWith('pose') ? Math.min(1, act.hold / (12 * 60)) : 0;\\n  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/Heron') slot.t = pose;\\n  }\\n270→}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\nfunction roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title') {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n280→  }\\n  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n290→  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n300→    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\\n  terrain: 'terrain:fulcrum',\\n  physics: true,\\n310→  setup(w) {\\n    boot(w);\\n    furnish(w);\\n  },\\n  step(w, intents) {\\n    frame(w, intents);\\n    roam(w, intents);\\n  },\\n  actions: retreatActions,\\n});\\n320→\\nexport default island;\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":350,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file Little Fulcrum. A lawn on a sand dome, a pond, a cove, and a guest who can walk.\\n * Activities still run on the balance step. The mesh does not lean. The people do.\\n */\\nimport {\\n  addTerrainBody,\\n  createCharacter,\\n  defineComponent,\\n  defineProp,\\n  defineScene,\\n  defineTerrain,\\n  getTerrain,\\n  physicsOf,\\n  playClip,\\n  spawnActor,\\n  spawnProp,\\n  type Intents,\\n  type World,\\n} from '../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport '../cast/clips';\\nimport { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './events/kit';\\nimport type { Act } from './state';\\n\\ndefineTerrain('terrain:fulcrum', {\\n  size: [60, 60],\\n  cell: 4,\\n  origin: [-120, 0, -120],\\n  seed: 4,\\n  height: 0,\\n  ridges: 0,\\n  high: 7,\\n  materials: ['material:sand', 'material:sand', 'material:lawn'],\\n  hills: [\\n    { at: [0, 0], radius: 110, height: 11 },\\n    { at: [10, -6], radius: 22, height: 4 },\\n    { at: [24, 18], radius: 16, height: -3.2 },\\n    { at: [0, -78], radius: 30, height: -6 },\\n  ],\\n  flats: [\\n    { rect: [-14, -14, 14, 14], height: 9.2, margin: 8 },\\n    { rect: [-34, -2, -16, 16], height: 8.4, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [16, 8, 34, 28], height: 7.6, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [-8, -48, 10, -28], height: 6.2, margin: 6 },\\n    { rect: [32, 0, 52, 16], height: 8.8, margin: 5 },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:sea', {\\n  description: 'The sea. It is flat, and it pretends to breathe.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'water',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:box',\\n      params: { width: 280, height: 0.35, depth: 280 },\\n      material: 'material:sea',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:mat', {\\n  description: 'A round mat.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'disc',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:frustum',\\n      params: { radiusTop: 1.15, radiusBottom: 1.2, height: 0.08, radialSegments: 16, smooth: true },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\ndefineProp('prop:cairn', {\\n  description: 'Pebbles that are not spent.',\\n  parts: [\\n    {\\n      name: 'a',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.7, height: 0.28, depth: 0.5, radius: 0.08 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'b',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.5, height: 0.22, depth: 0.38, radius: 0.08 },\\n      material: 'material:lawn',\\n      position: [0.05, 0.28, 0],\\n    },\\n    {\\n      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\nconst STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n];\\n\\n/** Plaques. They creep nowhere. They only say they did. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n];\\n\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\ndefineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n  posed?: { on: number };\\n  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's drawn position. */\\ninterface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string };\\n}\\n\\n/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\nfunction person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (const pebble of PEBBLES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: 'find.pebble', taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea') row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the lean and the pose onto the clip slots. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  const slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const pose = flowOf(w).event.startsWith('pose') ? Math.min(1, act.hold / (12 * 60)) : 0;\\n  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/Heron') slot.t = pose;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\nfunction roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title') {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  const act: Act = actOf(w);\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\\n  terrain: 'terrain:fulcrum',\\n  physics: true,\\n  setup(w) {\\n    boot(w);\\n    furnish(w);\\n  },\\n  step(w, intents) {\\n    frame(w, intents);\\n    roam(w, intents);\\n  },\\n  actions: retreatActions,\\n});\\n\\nexport default island;\\n\",\"total_lines\":321}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-83","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\n10→import { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n20→  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n30→        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n40→  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n50→\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\n60→export function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n70→  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) tilt.tiltX = 0.4 + (act.left / 60) * 0.28;\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n80→    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n90→    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58) mark.taken = 1;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n100→      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n110→    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) {\\n120→      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n130→        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n}\\n\\n140→/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n150→\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n160→  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n  }\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n170→  return stickIntents(stick, { both: breathe });\\n}\\n\\n/** The crowd markers leave. The island stays. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const tilt = {\\n180→  id: 'tilt',\\n  title: 'The Great Tilt',\\n  seconds: 170,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\\n  teardown,\\n  score,\\n  bot,\\n};\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\n10→import { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n20→  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n30→        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n40→  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n50→\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\n60→export function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n70→  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) tilt.tiltX = 0.4 + (act.left / 60) * 0.28;\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n80→    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n90→    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58) mark.taken = 1;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n100→      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n110→    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) {\\n120→      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n130→        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n}\\n\\n140→/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n150→\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n160→  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n  }\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n170→  return stickIntents(stick, { both: breathe });\\n}\\n\\n/** The crowd markers leave. The island stays. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const tilt = {\\n180→  id: 'tilt',\\n  title: 'The Great Tilt',\\n  seconds: 170,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\\n  teardown,\\n  score,\\n  bot,\\n};\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\nimport { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) tilt.tiltX = 0.4 + (act.left / 60) * 0.28;\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58) mark.taken = 1;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number } }[];\\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n  }\\n  const stick = seek(band, 0, 0, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n  return stickIntents(stick, { both: breathe });\\n}\\n\\n/** The crowd markers leave. The island stays. */\\nexport function teardown(w: World): void {\\n  sweep(w);\\n}\\n\\n/** The activity record. */\\nexport const tilt = {\\n  id: 'tilt',\\n  title: 'The Great Tilt',\\n  seconds: 170,\\n  setup,\\n  step,\\n  teardown,\\n  score,\\n  bot,\\n};\\n\",\"total_lines\":188}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-7ad363c4-ecee-4cde-a9ba-eef9e6a771ea-84","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Ranks, pebbles and Wobble Age. Every activity ends as a number from 0 to 1000. The words and the\\n * pebbles hang off that number. Age is the morning check only, and it never talks about a body.\\n */\\nimport { clamp } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** The rank words, from a quiet morning to a result the staff will not discuss. */\\nexport const RANKS = ['Present', 'Adequate', 'Composed', 'Serene', 'Unsettling'] as const;\\n\\n10→/** Pebbles a rank is worth before the multiplier. One is the least. Five is the most. */\\nconst PEBBLES: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 1,\\n  Adequate: 2,\\n  Composed: 3,\\n  Serene: 4,\\n  Unsettling: 5,\\n};\\n\\n/** A score kept inside 0 to 1000. Anything that is not a finite number becomes 0. */\\n20→export function clampScore(n: number): number {\\n  if (!Number.isFinite(n)) return 0;\\n  return clamp(n, 0, 1000);\\n}\\n\\n/** The rank word for a score. Thresholds are 300, 550, 750 and 900. */\\nexport function rankOf(score: number): string {\\n  const s = clampScore(score);\\n  if (s >= 900) return 'Unsettling';\\n  if (s >= 750) return 'Serene';\\n30→  if (s >= 550) return 'Composed';\\n  if (s >= 300) return 'Adequate';\\n  return 'Present';\\n}\\n\\n/** Pebbles for a rank, scaled, and never fewer than one. They are not spent. */\\nexport function pebblesOf(rank: string, mult: number): number {\\n  const base = PEBBLES[rank] ?? 1;\\n  const m = Number.isFinite(mult) ? mult : 1;\\n  return Math.max(1, Math.round(base * m));\\n40→}\\n\\n/**\\n * Wobble Age from a morning share `s` (0 to 1). `k` is `game.age.k`.\\n * A perfect morning is 18. A morning with no share is 82.\\n */\\nexport function wobbleAge(s: number, k: number): number {\\n  const t = clamp(Number.isFinite(s) ? s : 0, 0, 1);\\n  const exp = Number.isFinite(k) ? k : 1.3;\\n  return Math.round(18 + 64 * Math.pow(1 - t, exp));\\n50→}\\n\\n/** How today's age sits next to yesterday. The same number is still news. */\\nexport function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.';\\n  const d = yesterday - today;\\n  if (d > 0)\\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\\n  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\\n  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\\n60→}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Ranks, pebbles and Wobble Age. Every activity ends as a number from 0 to 1000. The words and the\\n * pebbles hang off that number. Age is the morning check only, and it never talks about a body.\\n */\\nimport { clamp } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** The rank words, from a quiet morning to a result the staff will not discuss. */\\nexport const RANKS = ['Present', 'Adequate', 'Composed', 'Serene', 'Unsettling'] as const;\\n\\n10→/** Pebbles a rank is worth before the multiplier. One is the least. Five is the most. */\\nconst PEBBLES: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 1,\\n  Adequate: 2,\\n  Composed: 3,\\n  Serene: 4,\\n  Unsettling: 5,\\n};\\n\\n/** A score kept inside 0 to 1000. Anything that is not a finite number becomes 0. */\\n20→export function clampScore(n: number): number {\\n  if (!Number.isFinite(n)) return 0;\\n  return clamp(n, 0, 1000);\\n}\\n\\n/** The rank word for a score. Thresholds are 300, 550, 750 and 900. */\\nexport function rankOf(score: number): string {\\n  const s = clampScore(score);\\n  if (s >= 900) return 'Unsettling';\\n  if (s >= 750) return 'Serene';\\n30→  if (s >= 550) return 'Composed';\\n  if (s >= 300) return 'Adequate';\\n  return 'Present';\\n}\\n\\n/** Pebbles for a rank, scaled, and never fewer than one. They are not spent. */\\nexport function pebblesOf(rank: string, mult: number): number {\\n  const base = PEBBLES[rank] ?? 1;\\n  const m = Number.isFinite(mult) ? mult : 1;\\n  return Math.max(1, Math.round(base * m));\\n40→}\\n\\n/**\\n * Wobble Age from a morning share `s` (0 to 1). `k` is `game.age.k`.\\n * A perfect morning is 18. A morning with no share is 82.\\n */\\nexport function wobbleAge(s: number, k: number): number {\\n  const t = clamp(Number.isFinite(s) ? s : 0, 0, 1);\\n  const exp = Number.isFinite(k) ? k : 1.3;\\n  return Math.round(18 + 64 * Math.pow(1 - t, exp));\\n50→}\\n\\n/** How today's age sits next to yesterday. The same number is still news. */\\nexport function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.';\\n  const d = yesterday - today;\\n  if (d > 0)\\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\\n  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\\n  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\\n60→}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file Ranks, pebbles and Wobble Age. Every activity ends as a number from 0 to 1000. The words and the\\n * pebbles hang off that number. Age is the morning check only, and it never talks about a body.\\n */\\nimport { clamp } from './wobble';\\n\\n/** The rank words, from a quiet morning to a result the staff will not discuss. */\\nexport const RANKS = ['Present', 'Adequate', 'Composed', 'Serene', 'Unsettling'] as const;\\n\\n/** Pebbles a rank is worth before the multiplier. One is the least. Five is the most. */\\nconst PEBBLES: Readonly<Record<string, number>> = {\\n  Present: 1,\\n  Adequate: 2,\\n  Composed: 3,\\n  Serene: 4,\\n  Unsettling: 5,\\n};\\n\\n/** A score kept inside 0 to 1000. Anything that is not a finite number becomes 0. */\\nexport function clampScore(n: number): number {\\n  if (!Number.isFinite(n)) return 0;\\n  return clamp(n, 0, 1000);\\n}\\n\\n/** The rank word for a score. Thresholds are 300, 550, 750 and 900. */\\nexport function rankOf(score: number): string {\\n  const s = clampScore(score);\\n  if (s >= 900) return 'Unsettling';\\n  if (s >= 750) return 'Serene';\\n  if (s >= 550) return 'Composed';\\n  if (s >= 300) return 'Adequate';\\n  return 'Present';\\n}\\n\\n/** Pebbles for a rank, scaled, and never fewer than one. They are not spent. */\\nexport function pebblesOf(rank: string, mult: number): number {\\n  const base = PEBBLES[rank] ?? 1;\\n  const m = Number.isFinite(mult) ? mult : 1;\\n  return Math.max(1, Math.round(base * m));\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Wobble Age from a morning share `s` (0 to 1). `k` is `game.age.k`.\\n * A perfect morning is 18. A morning with no share is 82.\\n */\\nexport function wobbleAge(s: number, k: number): number {\\n  const t = clamp(Number.isFinite(s) ? s : 0, 0, 1);\\n  const exp = Number.isFinite(k) ? k : 1.3;\\n  return Math.round(18 + 64 * Math.pow(1 - t, exp));\\n}\\n\\n/** How today's age sits next to yesterday. The same number is still news. */\\nexport function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.';\\n  const d = yesterday - today;\\n  if (d > 0)\\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\\n  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\\n  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":60}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"353b2b32-d0f9-48a9-ba3b-762cc9c38baa"}
