,47,119,111,114,108,100,47,108,101,118,101,108,47,104,101,105,103,104,116,115,46,116,115,10,49,51,48,58,47,42,42,32,87,104,97,116,32,96,117,110,100,101,114,102,111,111,116,96,32,102,105,110,100,115,58,32,116,104,101,32,115,117,114,102,97,99,101,39,115,32,104,101,105,103,104,116,32,97,110,100,32,116,97,103,44,32,97,110,100,32,105,116,115,32,115,116,111,114,101,121,32,40,226,136,146,49,32,102,111,114,32,116,104,101,32,103,114,111,117,110,100,32,115,108,97,98,32,97,110,100,32,97,32,114,111,111,102,41,46,32,42,47,10,49,56,50,58,32,42,32,84,104,101,32,115,116,111,114,101,121,32,111,102,32,116,104,101,32,115,117,114,102,97,99,101,32,96,102,108,111,111,114,66,101,108,111,119,96,32,102,105,110,100,115,32,97,116,32,40,120,44,32,121,44,32,122,41,44,32,97,110,32,105,110,100,101,120,32,105,110,116,111,32,96,108,101,118,101,108,46,115,116,111,114,101,121,115,96,32,40,48,32,105,110,32,97,32,102,111,114,109,97,116,45,49,32,108,101,118,101,108,41,58,32,97,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":144,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PROGRESS.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\"Cuts, in the plan's order: Great Tilt's counterweights, expert variants and outfits, Hoop Patrol, Reps Hall, Island Jog's race (the walk stays), Cliff Plunge, and Step Class. Group Class's middle class is Heron only. The group score is the 0–1000 mean of the three classes, so a rank still fits. The plan also described a sum to 3000. The island terrain is a 60 by 60 grid with cell size 4, which is 240 m, so SwiftShader can boot it.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"verb: keep your centre of balance where it should be. Over five days the deadpan gets stranger. The plaques move.\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"- **Old Nan** (she): 91, Wobble Age 19. Stands where you left her. Nobody has seen her arrive.\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"| 1 Arrival | Ferry leaves. Tare greets you. First Wobble Age is terrible. Sign: \\\"Please keep to the centre.\\\" |\"},{\"line_number\":254,\"content\":\"| 1 | Morning Check (tutorial) · Pose Class A (Seated Nothing, Patient Chair, Heron) · Still Pond · a walk to find the Noticeboard |\"},{\"line_number\":267,\"content\":\"**Wobble Age.** The Morning Check's result, from 18 to 82: `age = round(18 + 64 × (1 − s)^k)`, `k` is `game.age.k` (1.3).\"},{\"line_number\":273,\"content\":\"slightly according to your last Wobble Age and stands true at 18. Thresholds unlock things, shown on the Noticeboard:\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"**Exploration.** 20 pebbles, 12 \\\"Did you know?\\\" plaques, and each cast member has 3–5 new lines each day. Sit on a bench\"},{\"line_number\":282,\"content\":\"**Saves** go in the page store (`createStore`, prefix unique to your game): day, done list, ages, pebbles, finds,\"},{\"line_number\":320,\"content\":\"`s = 0.45A + 0.3B + 0.25C`; score `s × 1000`; Wobble Age as in section 5. Reveal: a large CSS dial spins past 100, \\\"recalibrating\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":338,\"content\":\"| The Heron (`heron`) | One leg, foot on thigh, palms overhead | 0, 0 | Hold the standing foot; instability × 1.5 |\"},{\"line_number\":436,\"content\":\"Score: share of time in the ribbon. Tare hops beside you and talks, the plaques go by. At the end Gerald says: \\\"Nice weather\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"**How the tilt works.** `island.tiltX, tiltZ` are sim values. The island's geometry never moves. Instead:\"},{\"line_number\":457,\"content\":\"Tilt grows by `game.tilt.rate`, and each deed below takes some off.\"},{\"line_number\":551,\"content\":\"**A Round** is three classes dealt from `w.rng('deal')` (same seed, same deal): Still Ring, then one of Heron, Hoop or Step, then Still\"},{\"line_number\":620,\"content\":\"- Finished: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats at most six, names at most 16 characters (\\\"Wobble Age\\\", \\\"Best hold\\\", \\\"Breath\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":667,\"content\":\"**Make these as props** (`node x new prop labs/game/props/<name>`; parts are geometry by id and material by id, with `tint`): mats, Tare's Platform, Noticeboard, plaques, Cairn pebbles (squashed rounded\"},{\"line_number\":687,\"content\":\"**The technique [tested: pictures showed a Heron with continuous two-axis lean, and a seated pose leaning the same way]:**\"},{\"line_number\":700,\"content\":\"       Heron: strip({ hips: [0, 0, 99], legL: [0, 2, -100, 2, 0], legR: [28, 62, -42, 118, 40], footR: [30, 20, 0], armL: [6, 4, 100, 30, 0], armR: [6, 4, 100, 30, 0] }),\"},{\"line_number\":717,\"content\":\"     if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/Heron') slot.t = poseProgress;\"},{\"line_number\":796,\"content\":\"- \\\"Your Wobble Age is 61. Yesterday it was 64. You have become three years younger by standing still. Science.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":821,\"content\":\"- \\\"Did you know? This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":823,\"content\":\"- \\\"Did you know? Gulls do not have a Wobble Age. They have been asked.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":882,\"content\":\"**Key components** (plain data): `flow` (mode: front, roam, event, cutscene, results; event, phase, tick; day), `wobble` (per seat), `seat` (input per seat), `island` (tilt), `round`, `pebble`, `plaque`, `ghost`, plus one per activity. Time in whole steps, randomness from named streams, loops in `w.query` order, `Math.pow` not `**`.\"},{\"line_number\":996,\"content\":\"5. **The joke.** Still Pond. Then Cairn, plaques, day cycle.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":212,\"content\":\"  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/settings.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":35,\"content\":\"  { path: 'game.tilt.rate', min: 0, max: 2, step: 0.01 },\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"  'game.age.k': num(1.3, 0.5, 3, '1', 'How sharply Wobble Age falls as the morning check improves.'),\"},{\"line_number\":70,\"content\":\"  'game.tilt.rate': num(0.15, 0, 2, 'deg/s', 'How fast the storm leans the island before a deed takes some off.'),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\"},{\"line_number\":114,\"content\":\"  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\"},{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\"},{\"line_number\":116,\"content\":\"  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\"},{\"line_number\":198,\"content\":\"  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\"},{\"line_number\":199,\"content\":\"    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\"},{\"line_number\":224,\"content\":\"/** Sea bob, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\"},{\"line_number\":268,\"content\":\"    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/Heron') slot.t = pose;\"},{\"line_number\":307,\"content\":\"  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"/** The demo loop. The Great Tilt slice opens on the centre stone. */\"},{\"line_number\":70,\"content\":\"  island.tiltX = base;\"},{\"line_number\":248,\"content\":\"    island: { tiltX: 0.4, tiltZ: 0, base: 0.4 },\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/data/poses.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"    title: 'The Heron',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/group.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file Group Class. Three short classes on the mats: a still ring, the Heron, then the pond.\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"/** Deals the middle class, then starts the still ring. The middle is the Heron. */\"},{\"line_number\":172,\"content\":\"/** Holds the centre, the Heron, or the breath, depending on the class. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/movement/model.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":167,\"content\":\"    probe: num(0.6096, 0, 10, 'How far ahead of its hull it finds the wall: 24 u.', 'm'),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\"},{\"line_number\":71,\"content\":\"    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\"},{\"line_number\":73,\"content\":\"    if (tilt) tilt.tiltX = 0.4 + (act.left / 60) * 0.28;\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number } }[];\"},{\"line_number\":120,\"content\":\"      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"        tilt.tiltX = 0;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file Ranks, pebbles and Wobble Age. Every activity ends as a number from 0 to 1000. The words and the\"},{\"line_number\":43,\"content\":\" * Wobble Age from a morning share `s` (0 to 1). `k` is `game.age.k`.\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"export function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\"},{\"line_number\":54,\"content\":\"  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.';\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\"},{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/capture.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":8,\"content\":\" *   table and survives a restore. Rapier finds a body by its slot alone, so `liveBody` looks a stored id up: a slot\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/state.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"  tiltX: number;\"},{\"line_number\":80,\"content\":\"    age: num('The last Wobble Age.'),\"},{\"line_number\":83,\"content\":\"    prior: num(\\\"Yesterday's Wobble Age, or 0.\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"    tiltX: num('Lean toward the west, degrees.'),\"},{\"line_number\":159,\"content\":\"/** A guest drifting in the finale, or a plaque, drawn as a small box. */\"},{\"line_number\":161,\"content\":\"  description: 'A placed thing: a hidden pebble, a plaque, a drifting guest or a mat.',\"},{\"line_number\":166,\"content\":\"    kind: str('pebble, plaque, guest, mat or cairn.'),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/binding.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"/** Binds a physics world to a sim world, so `physicsOf(w)` finds it (the scene does this when it starts). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/x.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file The `node x <cmd>` dispatcher (PLAN.md §8.1): finds `tools/cmd/<cmd>.ts`, parses its arguments with\"},{\"line_number\":175,\"content\":\"/** Where `dispatch` finds commands and sends output; tests replace the parts they need. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/stageFx.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\" *   shooter's muzzle as `muzzle(id)` finds it (the stage's puppets' carried gun).\"},{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\" * and a frame that finds it switched reads the entities again first (engine/app/view.ts), so a flying bolt changes\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/eslint/namespaceNames.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" * finds each message; a namespace passed through another variable (`const T = TSL`) is not followed.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/hub.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":182,\"content\":\"        { name: 'Wobble Age', value: String(Math.round(snap.age)) },\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":510,\"content\":\"    if (snap.line === 'find.pebble' && !save.finds.includes('find.pebble')) save.finds = [...save.finds, 'find.pebble'];\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/qa/level.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * `narrowDoor`, `lowHeadroom`, `steepFlight`: engine/world/level/validate.ts finds them, each at its line and column),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/post/mrt.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":103,\"content\":\"/** The first value `read` finds on `object` or its ancestors. */\"},{\"line_number\":207,\"content\":\" * so no filter finds an edge in it: the outline inked the dome's box edges across the sky (WP 13.2's review). That is\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/lines/book.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":10,\"content\":\"  'tare.age': 'Your Wobble Age moved. You stood still and the number noticed.',\"},{\"line_number\":63,\"content\":\"  'pose.heron': 'The Heron asks for one foot. The other foot is a rumour.',\"},{\"line_number\":79,\"content\":\"  'group.heron': 'The middle class is the Heron. We all pretend this was a surprise.',\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"  'tilt.stone': 'The centre stone. Breathe, and the island listens.',\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"  'plaque.want': 'Did you know. The average person leans two degrees toward the things they want.',\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"  'plaque.moved': 'Did you know. This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.',\"},{\"line_number\":93,\"content\":\"  'plaque.flamingo': 'Did you know. A flamingo stands on one leg because it has been told it is being watched.',\"},{\"line_number\":94,\"content\":\"  'plaque.gulls': 'Did you know that gulls have no Wobble Age. They have been asked.',\"},{\"line_number\":137,\"content\":\"  'hub.more': 'Three classes. A still ring, the Heron, then the pond.',\"},{\"line_number\":142,\"content\":\"  'stone.note': 'The centre stone is a plate. Breathing is how you speak to it.',\"},{\"line_number\":157,\"content\":\"  'age.first': 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.',\"},{\"line_number\":228,\"content\":\"  'attract.tilt': 'The centre stone, demonstrated. The storm has already been spoken to.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/save.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":29,\"content\":\"  finds: string[];\"},{\"line_number\":55,\"content\":\"    finds: [],\"},{\"line_number\":72,\"content\":\"    finds: Array.isArray(row.finds) ? row.finds.filter((id) => typeof id === 'string') : [],\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/cast/clips.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":69,\"content\":\"    Heron: strip({\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\"- Group Class is a still hold, Heron, and the pond. Its score is the mean of those three, from 0 to 1000, so the same ranks apply. The plan also described a sum to 3000. The mean is the one that fits a rank.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/replay.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":16,\"content\":\" * compares the runs (\\\"golden: other platform\\\"). Its scene module is found from its `scene` id, as `x sim` finds it,\"},{\"line_number\":26,\"content\":\" * Chromium run, finds the first step where any two part, and replays both to it: the parts, entities and first field\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/perf.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * - **node**: a scene module (`fixtures/scenes/kernel`) or id, found as `x sim` finds it (tools/cmd/sim.ts), run\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/qa.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * A family is `tools/qa/<family>.ts`, whose default export (a `QaFamily`) returns the violations it finds, each\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/proc/gait.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\" *   that step finds it. `plant` stands every foot on its spot (the first step does); `save`, `load`: plain `GaitState`.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/GAME-GUIDE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":153,\"content\":\"| `node x replay labs/game/replays [--browser sim] [--update] [--bisect]` | Checks replays' goldens; `--update` records them; `--bisect` finds where two runs part |\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"  and finds the seeds that softlock.\"},{\"line_number\":309,\"content\":\"**Melee (WP 13.19)**: Apex's punch, kicks and the door kick, a lunge to the target in reach, one hit a swing landing at its moment with its damage and hit-stop; the fan of rays that finds what a strike reaches.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/cmd/check.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":303,\"content\":\"/** The plugins: the asset scan, then each `check` exported by a module in `tools/cmd/` (a text scan finds them). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/footRoll.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\" * the animation bends it (`kneePole`), a held foot keeps its heading (`heading`), and `heelPosition` finds a sole's\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/anim/view.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file One clip of the library, looked at without a browser (PLAN.md §10.3 and §10.4, WP 8.5): `resolveClip` finds\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/core/log.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":160,\"content\":\" * with the other or ending in `.wanted` (`runSpeed` finds `hero.runSpeed`), then those a few edits away (one per\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/templates/README.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":71,\"content\":\"   agent who asks for one finds the skill (tests/unit/hooks/settings.test.ts fails a kind it leaves out).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/footPlant.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"  up: 0.5, // how far above the sole the probe starts: the highest step a foot finds\"},{\"line_number\":76,\"content\":\" * starts inside a body finds no ground, so a sole inside a wall never climbs onto it.\"},{\"line_number\":136,\"content\":\" * Stands the feet on the ground `probe` finds under each sole (the `contact` sockets): each foot keeps its lift above\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/tools/mcp/docs.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" * module; an answer names its files from the repository root, so an agent that can read them finds the rest there.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/botNav.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":125,\"content\":\" * door the bot's way runs into is the one it finds; the bot then presses use (engine/dev/bot.ts).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/app/view.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":12,\"content\":\" * engine/gfx/renderer.ts's `FrameView`). A frame that finds `gfx.effects` switched since the last read reads the\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/dev/bot.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":11,\"content\":\" *   it walks round the scene's props, and held by one its way does not know (a door left open), finds it again.\"},{\"line_number\":98,\"content\":\"/** On a site, held this long (s) it finds its way again, round the props as they stand, at most once in `every` steps. */\"},{\"line_number\":148,\"content\":\"  /** On a site, finds its way again with `blocked` closed: what holds it now (a door left open, a prop moved). */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/docs/API.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":496,\"content\":\"- `footPlant` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): Stands the feet on the ground `probe` finds under each sole (the `contact` sockets): each foot keeps its lift above the floor (`options.floor`) over the ground (over ground below it, as it nears it: lifting, it follows the body) and turns to its normal as it nears it, the pelvis drops (`rootPos.y`) as far as the lower foot needs to reach with the animation's knee bend, and with a `state`, a foot in `stance` stays locked where it landed.\"},{\"line_number\":901,\"content\":\"- `queryGround` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): A `GroundProbe` over the physics ground, through `queries.probe` (the level and props, never an actor): a ray that starts inside a body finds no ground, so a sole inside a wall never climbs onto it.\"},{\"line_number\":1139,\"content\":\"- `storeyBelow` (function from [`engine/world/level/heights.ts`](../engine/world/level/heights.ts)): The storey of the surface `floorBelow` finds at (x, y, z), an index into `level.storeys` (0 in a format-1 level): a flight's tiles are the storey they rise from, all the way to their top, where `storeyAt` already reads the next; −1 on a roof, on the ground slab, or over nothing.\"},{\"line_number\":1610,\"content\":\"- `footPlant` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): Stands the feet on the ground `probe` finds under each sole (the `contact` sockets): each foot keeps its lift above the floor (`options.floor`) over the ground (over ground below it, as it nears it: lifting, it follows the body) and turns to its normal as it nears it, the pelvis drops (`rootPos.y`) as far as the lower foot needs to reach with the animation's knee bend, and with a `state`, a foot in `stance` stays locked where it landed.\"},{\"line_number\":1877,\"content\":\"- `queryGround` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): A `GroundProbe` over the physics ground, through `queries.probe` (the level and props, never an actor): a ray that starts inside a body finds no ground, so a sole inside a wall never climbs onto it.\"},{\"line_number\":2046,\"content\":\"- `storeyBelow` (function from [`engine/world/level/heights.ts`](../engine/world/level/heights.ts)): The storey of the surface `floorBelow` finds at (x, y, z), an index into `level.storeys` (0 in a format-1 level): a flight's tiles are the storey they rise from, all the way to their top, where `storeyAt` already reads the next; −1 on a roof, on the ground slab, or over nothing.\"},{\"line_number\":2331,\"content\":\"- `footPlant` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): Stands the feet on the ground `probe` finds under each sole (the `contact` sockets): each foot keeps its lift above the floor (`options.floor`) over the ground (over ground below it, as it nears it: lifting, it follows the body) and turns to its normal as it nears it, the pelvis drops (`rootPos.y`) as far as the lower foot needs to reach with the animation's knee bend, and with a `state`, a foot in `stance` stays locked where it landed.\"},{\"line_number\":2417,\"content\":\"- `queryGround` (function from [`engine/anim/footPlant.ts`](../engine/anim/footPlant.ts)): A `GroundProbe` over the physics ground, through `queries.probe` (the level and props, never an actor): a ray that starts inside a body finds no ground, so a sole inside a wall never climbs onto it.\"},{\"line_number\":2832,\"content\":\"- `footPlant` (function): Stands the feet on the ground `probe` finds under each sole (the `contact` sockets): each foot keeps its lift above the floor (`options.floor`) over the ground (over ground below it, as it nears it: lifting, it follows the body) and turns to its normal as it nears it, the pelvis drops (`rootPos.y`) as far as the lower foot needs to reach with the animation's knee bend, and with a `state`, a foot in `stance` stays locked where it landed.\"},{\"line_number\":2837,\"content\":\"- `queryGround` (function): A `GroundProbe` over the physics ground, through `queries.probe` (the level and props, never an actor): a ray that starts inside a body finds no ground, so a sole inside a wall never climbs onto it.\"},{\"line_number\":3898,\"content\":\"- `closest` (function): The candidates closest to `wanted`, best first, at most `count`: a case-insensitive match, then names one starts with the other or ending in `.wanted` (`runSpeed` finds `hero.runSpeed`), then those a few edits away (one per three letters, at least one; a swap of neighbours is one edit).\"},{\"line_number\":6387,\"content\":\"- `bindPhysics` (function): Binds a physics world to a sim world, so `physicsOf(w)` finds it (the scene does this when it starts).\"},{\"line_number\":7339,\"content\":\"- `storeyBelow` (function from [`engine/world/level/heights.ts`](../engine/world/level/heights.ts)): The storey of the surface `floorBelow` finds at (x, y, z), an index into `level.storeys` (0 in a format-1 level): a flight's tiles are the storey they rise from, all the way to their top, where `storeyAt` already reads the next; −1 on a roof, on the ground slab, or over nothing.\"},{\"line_number\":7632,\"content\":\"- `storeyBelow` (function): The storey of the surface `floorBelow` finds at (x, y, z), an index into `level.storeys` (0 in a format-1 level): a flight's tiles are the storey they rise from, all the way to their top, where `storeyAt` already reads the next; −1 on a roof, on the ground slab, or over nothing.\"},{\"line_number\":9044,\"content\":\"- `CHROMIUM_NO_ADAPTER` (const): Chromium's own warning when `navigator.gpu.requestAdapter()` finds no adapter.\"},{\"line_number\":9678,\"content\":\"- `discoverPlugins` (function): The plugins: the asset scan, then each `check` exported by a module in `tools/cmd/` (a text scan finds them).\"},{\"line_number\":10743,\"content\":\"- `DispatchOptions` (interface): Where `dispatch` finds commands and sends output; tests replace the parts they need.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/devActions.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":28,\"content\":\" * session finds them). Carried from `my-3d2dge:src/emberdeep/62-developer.js:1-132` (the sandbox's switches, its\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/interact.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * it finds, for every player actor, the usable thing in reach (`USE_REACH`, 2 m from its eye) and in view: along its\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/combatApi.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":121,\"content\":\"// at its moment with its damage and hit-stop; the fan of rays that finds what a strike reaches.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/siteNavGraph.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * `nodeAt(x, y, z)` finds the node under a point: the open tile with the highest floor at or under it, within the\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/spatial.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file A spatial hash on the ground plane (PLAN.md WP 4.3, §5.4): finds what is near a point fast (a crowd's\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/level/rects.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":5,\"content\":\" * `findBlocks` finds the 4-connected blocks of accepted tiles (a pillar's PP over PP, the areas bodies can walk\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/level/validate.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * line and column with its fix in the level's terms. `checkLevel` finds the structural ones, which `compileLevel`\"},{\"line_number\":7,\"content\":\" * (`LEVEL_BAD_RAMP`) and daises that make no octagon (`LEVEL_BAD_DAIS`; shapes.ts finds both), and for a level\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/level/heights.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":130,\"content\":\"/** What `underfoot` finds: the surface's height and tag, and its storey (−1 for the ground slab and a roof). */\"},{\"line_number\":182,\"content\":\" * The storey of the surface `floorBelow` finds at (x, y, z), an index into `level.storeys` (0 in a format-1 level): a\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1bcbc1df-4103-478b-9906-2f7ac28f6d10-86","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110