{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1036","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions. I need to complete all items in PLAN.md that can be done on this computer and ensure everything in TASK.md is present.\n\nI will patch five diagnosed bugs: pose scrub, tilt consumption, plaques creeping downhill, wobble age display and persistence, and pebble restoration per spot.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The five skeptic bugs are still open. I’ll read the pose, tilt, plaque, age, and pebble code, then patch them on the real island path."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f6404e4b-e3cb-45f8-81d1-6c3b0326a330-0","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"pose-scrub","content":"Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"tilt-read","content":"Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees","status":"pending"},{"id":"plaques","content":"Shift plaques downhill as the day advances","status":"pending"},{"id":"wobble-age","content":"Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior","status":"pending"},{"id":"pebble-finds","content":"Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice","status":"pending"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f6404e4b-e3cb-45f8-81d1-6c3b0326a330-1","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/threejs-frame-conventions/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f6404e4b-e3cb-45f8-81d1-6c3b0326a330-2","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23705,"output_tokens":640,"c