{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1044","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking how character movement uses intents.move to ensure the slope sign is correct.\n\nAdding a test to verify positive tiltX during roam makes the guest move west. Also pinning the sea quaternion sign so tiltX > 0 yields q[2] < 0.\n\nThe test will compare sea quaternion q[2] between a zero CoB run and a positive CoB run. It asserts the q[2] value is smaller after the stick tilt. A code comment explains the sign: west lean produces a negative angle, so sin(az/2) is negative.\n\nThe wave offset is identical across both hosts because they share the same seed and step count. The stick input alone should create the divergence. I am checking whether 90 steps of full right stick is enough to move body.x enough to change tiltX.\n\nThe test will assert that the tiltX difference exceeds 0.05 and the q[2] difference exceeds 1e-4.\n\nPhase 2 tilt is set before dress during the same step, so the sea quaternion reads the correct value.\n\nAfter a jump tilt:stone, phase 2 is active immediately, and the first step writes tilt from body.x.\n\nAt t = 1.5 seconds after 90 steps, the wave offset reaches roughly 0.47.\n\nPebbles are spawned in the test world with unique text labels. The driver's `applyFinds` function filters incoming find IDs to a Set of valid strings.\n\nThe `applyFinds` function marks pebbles as taken by matching their text labels. It does not increment the pebble counter. Pickup only works during roam, so stepping over a pebble after `game.begin` will not double count it until the event ends. The test plan starts with booting the island and taking one step so the guest spawns in place while pebbles remain far away.\n\nThe pebble test plan now includes moving a pebble mark onto the guest, stepping to pick it up, and verifying the taken flag and count. It also covers respawning the pebble, calling game.begin with the find already recorded, and confirming that leaving the event and stepping again skips pickup because the pebble remains taken.\n\nThe pebble test plan now includes an unfound pebble: move pebble 1 onto the guest, step, and expect pebbles to become 2. The guest position will be read after each step so marks are placed at the actual physics location.\n\nThe guest drifts by roughly 0.0006 meters per frame from slope, well below the 1.5-meter pickup threshold, so marks placed directly on the guest remain valid. After the first pickup, the mark is repositioned because the guest may have shifted slightly. The pebble test sequence continues with leaving the morning event, returning to roam, placing a mark on the guest again, stepping to confirm the taken pebble is skipped, and then testing an unfound pebble.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85681084-43a0-441d-b3ea-9d4be66d858e-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/morning.ts","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85681084-43a0-441d-b3ea-9d4be66d858e-34","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"max-lines|printWidth","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656","glob":"*eslint*"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85681084-43a0-441d-b3ea-9d4be66d858e-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/state.ts","offset":50,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6238,"output_tokens":1906,"cache_read_input_tokens":67072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"4bdc6626-b421-45bf-9641-5a2bcd42da0b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-85681084-43a0-441d-b3ea-9d4be66d858e-33","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Morning Check. Still ring, six reaches, then one foot. The age is computed from the share.\\n * Doing nothing stays in the ring only some of the time, and never holds a reach or a foot.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct } from '../state';\\nimport { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\n10→import { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst STILL = 12 * 60;\\nconst REACH = 24 * 60;\\nconst FOOT = 8 * 60;\\nconst HOLD = 30;\\n\\nconst QUESTIONS = ['ask.side', 'ask.person', 'ask.foot', 'ask.sleep', 'ask.centre'];\\n\\n/** Clears the board and draws the six reaches and the named foot. */\\n20→export function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const reach = w.rng('reach');\\n  const goals: number[] = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\\n    const ang = reach.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    goals.push(Math.cos(ang) * 0.5, Math.sin(ang) * 0.5);\\n30→  }\\n  act.goals = goals;\\n  act.foot = w.rng('foot').int(0, 1) === 0 ? 1 : 2;\\n  const ask = w.rng('ask').int(0, QUESTIONS.length - 1);\\n  flowOf(w).line = QUESTIONS[ask] ?? 'ask.centre';\\n  act.text = act.foot === 1 ? 'left' : 'right';\\n}\\n\\n/** One step of the three tests. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n40→  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { inst });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (act.phase === 0) {\\n    const ring = act.left > 8 * 60 ? 0.16 : 0.22;\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n50→    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n60→    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n70→        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n80→      act.left = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file Morning Check. Still ring, six reaches, then one foot. The age is computed from the share.\\n * Doing nothing stays in the ring only some of the time, and never holds a reach or a foot.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct } from '../state';\\nimport { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\n10→import { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst STILL = 12 * 60;\\nconst REACH = 24 * 60;\\nconst FOOT = 8 * 60;\\nconst HOLD = 30;\\n\\nconst QUESTIONS = ['ask.side', 'ask.person', 'ask.foot', 'ask.sleep', 'ask.centre'];\\n\\n/** Clears the board and draws the six reaches and the named foot. */\\n20→export function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const reach = w.rng('reach');\\n  const goals: number[] = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\\n    const ang = reach.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    goals.push(Math.cos(ang) * 0.5, Math.sin(ang) * 0.5);\\n30→  }\\n  act.goals = goals;\\n  act.foot = w.rng('foot').int(0, 1) === 0 ? 1 : 2;\\n  const ask = w.rng('ask').int(0, QUESTIONS.length - 1);\\n  flowOf(w).line = QUESTIONS[ask] ?? 'ask.centre';\\n  act.text = act.foot === 1 ? 'left' : 'right';\\n}\\n\\n/** One step of the three tests. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n40→  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { inst });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (act.phase === 0) {\\n    const ring = act.left > 8 * 60 ? 0.16 : 0.22;\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n50→    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n60→    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n70→        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n80→      act.left = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/morning.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file Morning Check. Still ring, six reaches, then one foot. The age is computed from the share.\\n * Doing nothing stays in the ring only some of the time, and never holds a reach or a foot.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct } from '../state';\\nimport { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst STILL = 12 * 60;\\nconst REACH = 24 * 60;\\nconst FOOT = 8 * 60;\\nconst HOLD = 30;\\n\\nconst QUESTIONS = ['ask.side', 'ask.person', 'ask.foot', 'ask.sleep', 'ask.centre'];\\n\\n/** Clears the board and draws the six reaches and the named foot. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const reach = w.rng('reach');\\n  const goals: number[] = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\\n    const ang = reach.range(0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    goals.push(Math.cos(ang) * 0.5, Math.sin(ang) * 0.5);\\n  }\\n  act.goals = goals;\\n  act.foot = w.rng('foot').int(0, 1) === 0 ? 1 : 2;\\n  const ask = w.rng('ask').int(0, QUESTIONS.length - 1);\\n  flowOf(w).line = QUESTIONS[ask] ?? 'ask.centre';\\n  act.text = act.foot === 1 ? 'left' : 'right';\\n}\\n\\n/** One step of the three tests. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const inst = act.phase === 2 ? 1.6 : 1;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { inst });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (act.phase === 0) {\\n    const ring = act.left > 8 * 60 ? 0.16 : 0.22;\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    if (act.left >= STILL) {\\n      act.a = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      act.flags = 0;\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const gx = act.goals[act.flags * 2] ?? 0;\\n    const gy = act.goals[act.flags * 2 + 1] ?? 0;\\n    act.gx = gx;\\n    act.gy = gy;\\n    const inside = Math.hypot(body.x - gx, body.y - gy) <= 0.16;\\n    act.hold = inside ? act.hold + 1 : 0;\\n    if (act.hold >= HOLD) {\\n      act.flags += 1;\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n      if (act.flags >= 6) {\\n        act.b = 1 - act.left / 60 / 24;\\n        act.phase = 2;\\n        act.left = 0;\\n        act.samples = 0;\\n        act.acc = 0;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.phase === 1 && act.left >= REACH) {\\n      act.b = 0;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":133}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-85681084-43a0-441d-b3ea-9d4be66d858e-34","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,101,115,108,105,110,116,46,99,111,110,102,105,103,46,106,115,10,55,49,58,32,32,32,32,32,32,112,108,117,103,105,110,115,58,32,123,32,106,115,100,111,99,44,32,39,104,97,114,100,45,99,97,112,39,58,32,102,97,109,105,108,105,10