{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1066","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The rules section is near the end. It covers spawns, despawns, and events.\n\nThe clips step runs before rules, so the slot.t write survives. Timer interference is unlikely. The write wins over any anim step that might set t afterward. Both observations are post-dress, and the test compares across steps. During pose.step in frame(), act.left becomes 1 before dress, setting t to 1/240.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The pose clip never advances, and tilt, plaques, age, and pebble finds are written but not used. I’ll wire those through the island step and cover them with tests that boot the real scene."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-65","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","old_string":"/**\n * @file Little Fulcrum. A lawn on a sand dome, a pond, a cove, and a guest who can walk.\n * Activities still run on the balance step. The mesh does not lean. The people do.\n */","new_string":"/**\n * @file Little Fulcrum. A lawn on a sand dome, a pond, a cove, and a guest who can walk.\n * Activities still run on the balance step. The ground mesh stays put. The sea tips against the lean,\n * plaques creep west, and the guest walks downhill.\n */"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-66","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","old_string":"import { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './events/kit';\nimport type { Act } from './state';","new_string":"import { boot, frame, retreatActions } from './driver';\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './events/kit';\nimport { posesFor } from './events/pose';\nimport type { Act } from './state';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-67","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","old_string":"/** Plaques. They creep nowhere. They only say they did. */","new_string":"/** Plaques. Each day past the first they sit four centimetres further west. */"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-68","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","old_string":"/** The sea's drawn position. */\ninterface Sea {\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string };\n}","new_string":"/** The sea's drawn position. `q` is the counter-rotation the dress writes. */\ninterface Sea {\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string; q: [number, number, number, number] };\n}\n\n/** The island lean the sea and the slope both read. */\ninterface Lean {\n  island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number };\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-69","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","old_string":"  for (const pebble of PEBBLES) {\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: 'find.pebble', taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\n  }","new_string":"  for (let i = 0; i < PEBBLES.length; i += 1) {\n    const pebble = PEBBLES[i];\n    if (!pebble) continue;\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: `pebble:${i}`, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-70","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts","old_string":"/** How today's age sits next to yesterday. The same number is still news. */\nexport function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.';\n  const d = yesterday - today;\n  if (d > 0)\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\n  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\n  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\n}","new_string":"/** How today's age sits next to yesterday. The same number is still news. Today's number is always in the sentence. */\nexport function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) {\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Your first Wobble Age. We will pretend to be surprised tomorrow.`;\n  }\n  const d = yesterday - today;\n  if (d > 0)\n    return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. You stood still and time went backwards.`;\n  if (d < 0) return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${yesterday}. The island has noted the difference.`;\n  return `Your Wobble Age is ${today}. Yesterday it was ${today}. Consistency is a kind of wobble.`;\n}\n\n/** The book id for today's age beside yesterday. The page says the words. The number lives in `ageRemark`. */\nexport function ageLine(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\n  if (!(yesterday > 0)) return 'age.first';\n  if (yesterday > today) return 'age.down';\n  if (yesterday < today) return 'age.up';\n  return 'age.same';\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-71","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","old_string":"import { clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';","new_string":"import { ageLine, clampScore, pebblesOf, rankOf, wobbleAge } from './score';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-72","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","old_string":"  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\n  }","new_string":"  if (flow.event === 'morning') {\n    flow.prior = flow.age;\n    flow.age = wobbleAge(value / 1000, Number(w.settings.get('game.age.k')));\n    flow.line = ageLine(flow.age, flow.prior);\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-73","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","old_string":"/** Copies a save the page handed in. The sim never reads the store itself. */\nfunction applySave(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {","new_string":"/** Marks pebbles the save already found. The count is restored separately, so this does not add any. */\nfunction applyFinds(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {\n  const raw = args.finds;\n  if (!Array.isArray(raw)) return;\n  const found = new Set(raw.filter((id) => typeof id === 'string'));\n  if (found.size === 0) return;\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; text: string; taken: number } }[]) {\n    if (row.mark.kind === 'pebble' && found.has(row.mark.text)) row.mark.taken = 1;\n  }\n}\n\n/** Copies a save the page handed in. The sim never reads the store itself. */\nfunction applySave(w: World, args: Record<string, unknown>): void {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-74","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","old_string":"  if (seen !== undefined) flow.seen = seen;\n  if (rank !== undefined) flow.rank = rank;\n}","new_string":"  if (seen !== undefined) flow.seen = seen;\n  if (rank !== undefined) flow.rank = rank;\n  applyFinds(w, args);\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","old_string":"function delivered(w: World): number {","new_string":"/** The lean the storm, the deeds and the centre stone all write. */\nfunction islandTilt(w: World): { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } | undefined {\n  const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } }[];\n  return island[0]?.island;\n}\n\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-76","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","old_string":"  if (phase === 0) {\n    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;\n    if (tilt) tilt.tiltX = 0.4 + (act.left / 60) * 0.28;","new_string":"  if (phase === 0) {\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\n    if (tilt) {\n      const rate = Number(w.settings.get('game.tilt.rate'));\n      const speed = Number.isFinite(rate) ? rate : 0.15;\n      tilt.tiltX = tilt.base + (act.left / 60) * speed;\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-77","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","old_string":"    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\n    }[]) {\n      const mark = row.mark;\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\n      if (mark.x > 58) mark.taken = 1;\n    }","new_string":"    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\n    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\n    }[]) {\n      const mark = row.mark;\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\n      if (mark.x > 58 && mark.taken < 0.5) {\n        mark.taken = 1;\n        if (tilt) tilt.tiltX -= 0.5;\n      }\n    }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4e7f462f-cdb0-4a64-9675-46427cc563e0-78","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","old_string":"    const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number } }[];\n    const tilt = island[0]?.island;","new_string":"    const tilt = islandTilt(w);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":450,"output_tokens":3648,"cache_read_input_tokens":110464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ed304764-2389-4648-aca9-34136566dc22"}
