{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1083","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 7 tests passed in 1.24 seconds.\n\nESLint flagged only a pre-existing max-lines warning. I will update the todos and run the official verify.\n\nThe replay test might be affected by bench hash changes. I will run it before the long verify to confirm.\n\nI will run replay.test.ts and the full island.test.ts to confirm the boot still works. Then I will read the long-running skill and start the official verify.\n\nThe bench scene does not import island components, so the replay hash should remain stable. The vitest report will be overwritten by the official verify. I will run the replay test first, then read the long-running skill and start the verify.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8587efd9-4401-4170-a2ca-cd6f7f281abc-114","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"pose-scrub","content":"Scrub the pose clip from hold progress and test it","status":"completed"},{"id":"tilt-read","content":"Consume centre-stone tilt so CoB and deeds change what the player sees","status":"completed"},{"id":"plaques","content":"Shift plaques downhill as the day advances","status":"completed"},{"id":"wobble-age","content":"Show Wobble Age against yesterday and persist prior","status":"completed"},{"id":"pebble-finds","content":"Restore each found pebble as taken so it is not counted twice","status":"completed"},{"id":"reverify","content":"Re-run targeted tests, then official verify, npm test, and npm check","status":"in_progress"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8587efd9-4401-4170-a2ca-cd6f7f281abc-115","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/.grok/bundled/skills/long-running-background-tasks/SKILL.md","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8587efd9-4401-4170-a2ca-cd6f7f281abc-116","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__2026110