{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1098","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The five skeptic bugs are fixed, and the hand-in in this folder matches that build.\n\n- Pose class now plays the clip for the pose the guest is in and scrubs its time from the enter and the scored hold. A real pose-a run moves `RETREAT/Nothing`, then `RETREAT/Chair`.\n- The sea counter-rotates with the island lean, so a stick on the centre stone changes that turn. The storm uses `game.tilt.rate`, and each guest delivered to the east terrace takes half a degree off once. On the lawn and on that walk, the guest is pushed downhill.\n- Plaques sit four centimetres further west for each day after the first.\n- Morning results state today's Wobble Age, and yesterday's when there is one. That prior is stored in the save.\n- Each pebble has its own id. Loading a save marks those pebbles found and does not count them again.\n\nOfficial verify ended with `0 failures` and `EXIT:0`, including seeds 1–3, songs, syllables, and the replay golden. `npm test` passed 28 tests. `npm run check` passed on `my-3dge@e7a1243`. The work-root HTML, `PROGRESS.md`, and `exit-interview.json` are in place."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":865,"output_tokens":893,"cache_read_input_tokens":156928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"32e4e1bc-d2ba-43ff-a11b-dddf97f71f50"}
