ent means you were here. The cairn accepts a pebble.',\"},{\"line_number\":168,\"content\":\"  'best.kept': 'Your best rank for this is on the card. The cairn has the pebbles.',\"},{\"line_number\":179,\"content\":\"  'erase.ask': 'Erase the whole save, including pebbles and bests. Yes or no.',\"},{\"line_number\":182,\"content\":\"  'restart.now': 'The activity starts again. The pebbles from last time stay.',\"},{\"line_number\":202,\"content\":\"  'score.pebble': 'A pebble for the rank, and it stacks. It does not buy a thing.',\"},{\"line_number\":239,\"content\":\"  'pebble.one': 'One pebble. Present, and counted.',\"},{\"line_number\":240,\"content\":\"  'pebble.five': 'Five pebbles. The cairn is showing off, quietly.',\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/score.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":2,\"content\":\" * @file Ranks, pebbles and Wobble Age. Every activity ends as a number from 0 to 1000. The words and the\"},{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\" * pebbles hang off that number. Age is the morning check only, and it never talks about a body.\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"export function pebblesOf(rank: string, mult: number): number {\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"export function ageRemark(today: number, yesterday: number): string {\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"/** The book id for today's age beside yesterday. The page says the words. The number lives in `ageRemark`. */\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":52,\"content\":\"function islandTilt(w: World): { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } | undefined {\"},{\"line_number\":53,\"content\":\"  const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } }[];\"},{\"line_number\":79,\"content\":\"      const rate = Number(w.settings.get('game.tilt.rate'));\"},{\"line_number\":81,\"content\":\"      tilt.tiltX = tilt.base + (act.left / 60) * speed;\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"        if (tilt) tilt.tiltX -= 0.5;\"},{\"line_number\":132,\"content\":\"      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\"},{\"line_number\":141,\"content\":\"        tilt.tiltX = 0;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/save.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"  pebbles: number;\"},{\"line_number\":24,\"content\":\"  prior: number;\"},{\"line_number\":30,\"content\":\"  finds: string[];\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"    pebbles: 0,\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"    prior: 0,\"},{\"line_number\":56,\"content\":\"    finds: [],\"},{\"line_number\":73,\"content\":\"    finds: Array.isArray(row.finds) ? row.finds.filter((id) => typeof id === 'string') : [],\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"/** Copies the day, yesterday's age and each found pebble onto the save. A worse result does not replace a best. */\"},{\"line_number\":90,\"content\":\"    pebbles: snap.pebbles,\"},{\"line_number\":92,\"content\":\"    prior: snap.prior,\"},{\"line_number\":97,\"content\":\"    finds: [...save.finds],\"},{\"line_number\":100,\"content\":\"  for (const id of snap.finds) {\"},{\"line_number\":101,\"content\":\"    if (!next.finds.includes(id)) next.finds.push(id);\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5a40f442-db2a-4696-9ebc-4665d40fd317-104","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,1