e_number\":231,\"content\":\"  it('shows today against yesterday and keeps that prior', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":237,\"content\":\"      { ...emptySnap(), event: 'morning', age: 82, prior: 0, rank: 'Present', result: 0 },\"},{\"line_number\":248,\"content\":\"      prior: 82,\"},{\"line_number\":251,\"content\":\"    expect(next.prior).toBe(82);\"},{\"line_number\":261,\"content\":\"      prior: 40,\"},{\"line_number\":266,\"content\":\"    expect(kept.prior).toBe(40);\"},{\"line_number\":271,\"content\":\"    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).prior).toBe(0);\"},{\"line_number\":279,\"content\":\"    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\"},{\"line_number\":286,\"content\":\"    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), again).prior).toBe(82);\"},{\"line_number\":287,\"content\":\"    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, age: 40, prior: 82 });\"},{\"line_number\":289,\"content\":\"    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/snap.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"  prior: number;\"},{\"line_number\":63,\"content\":\"    prior: 0,\"},{\"line_number\":117,\"content\":\"    snap.prior = num(flow, 'prior');\"},{\"line_number\":167,\"content\":\"  return `${ageRemark(snap.age, snap.prior)} ${score}`;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":499,\"content\":\"    const key = [snap.mode, snap.event, snap.result, snap.pebbles, snap.cursor, snap.credits, snap.prior, finds].join(\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/island.test.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":90,\"content\":\"  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":163,\"content\":\"  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":177,\"content\":\"  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\"},{\"line_number\":210,\"content\":\"  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/state.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":20,\"content\":\"  prior: number;\"},{\"line_number\":83,\"content\":\"    prior: num(\\\"Yesterday's Wobble Age, or 0.\\\"),\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":104,\"content\":\"    flow.prior = flow.age;\"},{\"line_number\":106,\"content\":\"    flow.line = ageLine(flow.age, flow.prior);\"},{\"line_number\":238,\"content\":\"  const prior = numArg(args, 'prior');\"},{\"line_number\":247,\"content\":\"  if (prior !== undefined) flow.prior = prior;\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * plaques creep west, and the guest walks downhill.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e830bbb3-daa0-4ba3-aefd-8b5ad70576d0"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1104","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A potential bug in `finishEvent` ordering has been identified.\n\nThe `finishEvent` morning logic copies `flow.age` into `prior` before updating `age`. On day one, both values start at zero, so the prior remains zero and the age line reads \"first\" rather than \"yesterday\". This is a bug.\n\nReloading after the morning save corrupts the next morning's prior age. The save stores today's age as prior, so the restored state treats today as yesterday.\n\nThe prior age overwrite is actually correct for the next morning. The first-day \"first age\" display is also fine. I need to check whether the retreat test exercises finishEvent or merely calls resultCopy with a hand-built snapshot.\n\nReloading mid-results screen does not restore the mode, so the player boots to title. The saved prior and age persist, and the next morning can still compare them correctly. The test at line 287 uses game.begin with a prior of 82. I need to verify whether that test is honest. Numeric ages are rendered by ageRemark into copy.textContent on the results screen.\n\nThe spoken note omits numeric ages. The gap requires showing today's age against yesterday on the morning result. `resultCopy` handles this on the results copy element. It is only invoked by stage paint at line 526. A direct test call to `resultCopy` is therefore an honest check of the real display string builder. It suffices to assert that the returned string contains both ages.\n\nThe test file retreat.test.ts around lines 220–320 needs to be read to confirm the test actually exercises the morning finish path. Pose scrub, tilt, plaques, pebbles, and HTML rebuild still need verification against the current source rather than the summary alone. A concrete edge case has been identified: if age is not restored from save but prior is, `finishEvent` overwrites prior with zero on the next morning.\n\nPose scrub logic in island.ts and its interaction with the pose phase still need review.\n\nThe engine may write `sceneProp.q` without reading it, so sea counter-rotation could be a no-op. I must verify whether scene props consume that field.\n\nPlaque meshes appear to be placed once at spawn and never repositioned. If `mark.x` shifts but the visible mesh stays fixed, the downhill shift requirement will fail.\n\nThe prior gap required dress() to move plaques and assert island-step positions. If the mesh updates from mark each frame, the shift is real. Otherwise it is invisible.\n\nPebble double-counting must be verified. applyFinds sets taken=1. Pickup checks taken. begin() must call applySave after pebbles spawn.\n\nA concrete pebble ordering bug has been found. If `applySave` runs before pebbles exist, the save is ignored and `begin()` must apply the save after furnishing the island so finds are not missed.\n\nThe real bug in `finishEvent` is now clearer. On a continued save, `flow.prior` may hold an age from two days ago while `flow.age` holds yesterday's restored age. The morning result then compares today against that stale prior instead of against yesterday.\n\nThe prior age overwrite is actually correct. When the restored age is yesterday, discarding the stale prior and comparing today against that restored value is the intended behavior.\n\nA fabricated test snapshot calling resultCopy directly would only validate the formatter, not the finishEvent and stage paint wiring.\n\nfinishEvent is confirmed correct. The retreat test may still be weaker than needed if it only exercises resultCopy with a hand-built snapshot rather than a real morning finish.\n\nThe retreat tests must be read to confirm they exercise the shipped behavior. A bug in pose scrub is now clear: `poseScrub` divides `act.left` by 240, but `pose.ts` only increments `act.left` during the enter phase. The scrub timing therefore never advances.\n\nThe pose scrub timing logic is correct. Enter and hold phases advance the clip position properly. The remaining concern is that `playClip` may reset the scrubbed time every frame, which would overwrite the manually set value.\n\nPose clip names must exist for the RETREAT/Nothing and RETREAT/Chair mappings. The scrub() function still needs to be read to confirm whether playClip resets the clip time each frame. Tilt quaternion rotation, storm rate, delivery offset, and slope drift are all covered by existing tests.\n\nThe sea rotation direction is still unverified. The engine may ignore the quaternion field.\n\nPlaque drift must be checked against the island's lean direction. If the island tilts west but plaques shift east, the downhill requirement fails.\n\nThe implementer described the plaque shift as \"four centimetres further west,\" but the gap may require downhill specifically. Cell size and gravity direction also need verification.\n\nI will read island.ts, tilt.ts, the retreat test age section, PLAN snippets, and island.test.ts to confirm the exact requirements.\n\nA bug candidate has emerged in `remember()`: its save key includes `prior` but not `age`. On the first morning, `prior` stays zero while `age` changes from zero to N, so the save key never updates and the restored state may be stale.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts","offset":90,"limit":280}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts","offset":1,"limit":180}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts","offset":200,"limit":130}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/island.test.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5421,"output_tokens":2808,"cache_read_input_tokens":49536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"614b501b-7edf-4f6c-8211-60ec097cd758"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-12","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"90→    {\\n      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n100→/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\nconst STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n110→];\\n\\n/** Plaques. Each day past the first they sit four centimetres further west. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n120→];\\n\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n130→/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\ndefineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n140→  posed?: { on: number };\\n  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n150→/** The sea's drawn position. `q` is the counter-rotation the dress writes. */\\ninterface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string; q: [number, number, number, number] };\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea and the slope both read. */\\ninterface Lean {\\n  island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number };\\n}\\n\\n160→/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean, if the day has spawned. */\\nfunction leanOf(w: World): Lean['island'] | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as Lean[];\\n170→  return rows[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Sea quaternion for a lean in degrees. tiltX rotates about Z (west), tiltZ about X.\\n * q = qz * qx. tiltX > 0 and tiltZ = 0 leaves q[2] negative.\\n */\\nfunction seaTurn(tiltX: number, tiltZ: number): [number, number, number, number] {\\n  const ax = (-tiltZ * Math.PI) / 180;\\n  const az = (-tiltX * Math.PI) / 180;\\n180→  const sx = Math.sin(ax / 2);\\n  const cx = Math.cos(ax / 2);\\n  const sz = Math.sin(az / 2);\\n  const cz = Math.cos(az / 2);\\n  return [cz * sx, sz * sx, sz * cx, cz * cx];\\n}\\n\\n/** The pose clip and how far through it the class is. Enter and the scored hold both move `t`. */\\nfunction poseScrub(w: World): { clip: string; t: number } | undefined {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n190→  if (!flow.event.startsWith('pose')) return undefined;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const poses = posesFor(act.text || flow.event);\\n  const pose = poses[act.pose] ?? poses[0];\\n  if (!pose) return undefined;\\n  const clip = `RETREAT/${pose.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase()}${pose.id.slice(1)}`;\\n  if (act.phase >= 2) return { clip, t: 1 };\\n  if (act.phase === 0) return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / (4 * 60)) };\\n  const seconds = pose.hold || Number(w.settings.get('game.pose.hold')) || 12;\\n  const steps = Math.max(1, Math.round(seconds * 60));\\n200→  return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / steps) };\\n}\\n\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\n210→function person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n220→/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n230→  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n240→  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < PEBBLES.length; i += 1) {\\n    const pebble = PEBBLES[i];\\n    if (!pebble) continue;\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: `pebble:${i}`, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n250→    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n260→  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, plaque creep, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n270→  const lean = leanOf(w);\\n  const q = seaTurn(lean?.tiltX ?? 0, lean?.tiltZ ?? 0);\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop !== 'prop:sea') continue;\\n    row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n    row.sceneProp.q = q;\\n  }\\n  const day = Math.max(1, flowOf(w).day);\\n  const west = (day - 1) * 0.04;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n280→    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'plaque') continue;\\n    const home = PLAQUES.find((plaque) => plaque.text === spot.mark.text);\\n    if (home) spot.mark.x = home.x - west;\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n290→      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n300→/** Writes the lean and the current pose onto the clip slots. The scored hold lives in `left`, not `hold`. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n  }\\n  const pose = poseScrub(w);\\n310→  let slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (pose && !slots?.some((slot) => slot.clip === pose.clip)) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, pose.clip, { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false });\\n    slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n320→  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (pose && slot.clip === pose.clip) slot.t = pose.t;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\n330→function roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const onTerrace = flow.event === 'tilt' && act.phase === 1;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title' && !onTerrace) {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n  }\\n340→  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam' || onTerrace) {\\n    const tiltX = leanOf(w)?.tiltX ?? 0;\\n    mx -= Math.sin((tiltX * Math.PI) / 180);\\n  }\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n350→    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n360→      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\",\"content_concise\":\"90→    {\\n      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n100→/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\nconst STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n110→];\\n\\n/** Plaques. Each day past the first they sit four centimetres further west. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n120→];\\n\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n130→/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\ndefineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n140→  posed?: { on: number };\\n  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n150→/** The sea's drawn position. `q` is the counter-rotation the dress writes. */\\ninterface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string; q: [number, number, number, number] };\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea and the slope both read. */\\ninterface Lean {\\n  island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number };\\n}\\n\\n160→/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean, if the day has spawned. */\\nfunction leanOf(w: World): Lean['island'] | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as Lean[];\\n170→  return rows[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Sea quaternion for a lean in degrees. tiltX rotates about Z (west), tiltZ about X.\\n * q = qz * qx. tiltX > 0 and tiltZ = 0 leaves q[2] negative.\\n */\\nfunction seaTurn(tiltX: number, tiltZ: number): [number, number, number, number] {\\n  const ax = (-tiltZ * Math.PI) / 180;\\n  const az = (-tiltX * Math.PI) / 180;\\n180→  const sx = Math.sin(ax / 2);\\n  const cx = Math.cos(ax / 2);\\n  const sz = Math.sin(az / 2);\\n  const cz = Math.cos(az / 2);\\n  return [cz * sx, sz * sx, sz * cx, cz * cx];\\n}\\n\\n/** The pose clip and how far through it the class is. Enter and the scored hold both move `t`. */\\nfunction poseScrub(w: World): { clip: string; t: number } | undefined {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n190→  if (!flow.event.startsWith('pose')) return undefined;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const poses = posesFor(act.text || flow.event);\\n  const pose = poses[act.pose] ?? poses[0];\\n  if (!pose) return undefined;\\n  const clip = `RETREAT/${pose.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase()}${pose.id.slice(1)}`;\\n  if (act.phase >= 2) return { clip, t: 1 };\\n  if (act.phase === 0) return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / (4 * 60)) };\\n  const seconds = pose.hold || Number(w.settings.get('game.pose.hold')) || 12;\\n  const steps = Math.max(1, Math.round(seconds * 60));\\n200→  return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / steps) };\\n}\\n\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\n210→function person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n220→/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n230→  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n240→  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < PEBBLES.length; i += 1) {\\n    const pebble = PEBBLES[i];\\n    if (!pebble) continue;\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: `pebble:${i}`, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n250→    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n260→  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, plaque creep, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n270→  const lean = leanOf(w);\\n  const q = seaTurn(lean?.tiltX ?? 0, lean?.tiltZ ?? 0);\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop !== 'prop:sea') continue;\\n    row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n    row.sceneProp.q = q;\\n  }\\n  const day = Math.max(1, flowOf(w).day);\\n  const west = (day - 1) * 0.04;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n280→    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'plaque') continue;\\n    const home = PLAQUES.find((plaque) => plaque.text === spot.mark.text);\\n    if (home) spot.mark.x = home.x - west;\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n290→      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n300→/** Writes the lean and the current pose onto the clip slots. The scored hold lives in `left`, not `hold`. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n  }\\n  const pose = poseScrub(w);\\n310→  let slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (pose && !slots?.some((slot) => slot.clip === pose.clip)) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, pose.clip, { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false });\\n    slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n320→  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (pose && slot.clip === pose.clip) slot.t = pose.t;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\n330→function roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const onTerrace = flow.event === 'tilt' && act.phase === 1;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title' && !onTerrace) {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n  }\\n340→  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam' || onTerrace) {\\n    const tiltX = leanOf(w)?.tiltX ?? 0;\\n    mx -= Math.sin((tiltX * Math.PI) / 180);\\n  }\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n350→    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n360→      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/island.ts\",\"offset\":90,\"limit\":280,\"raw_output\":\"    {\\n      name: 'c',\\n      geometry: 'geometry:roundedBox',\\n      params: { width: 0.32, height: 0.18, depth: 0.26, radius: 0.06 },\\n      material: 'material:sand',\\n      position: [-0.02, 0.48, 0.02],\\n    },\\n  ],\\n});\\n\\n/** A place a guest can walk up to and begin. */\\nconst STATIONS: readonly { id: string; x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { id: 'morning', x: 0, z: 8 },\\n  { id: 'pose-a', x: 10, z: 2 },\\n  { id: 'pond', x: 24, z: 16 },\\n  { id: 'garden', x: -18, z: 12 },\\n  { id: 'paddle', x: 0, z: -36 },\\n  { id: 'line', x: -26, z: 6 },\\n  { id: 'group', x: -8, z: -6 },\\n  { id: 'tilt', x: 40, z: 8 },\\n];\\n\\n/** Plaques. Each day past the first they sit four centimetres further west. */\\nconst PLAQUES: readonly { x: number; z: number; text: string }[] = [\\n  { x: 6, z: -4, text: 'plaque.want' },\\n  { x: -6, z: 14, text: 'plaque.moved' },\\n  { x: 16, z: -8, text: 'plaque.flamingo' },\\n  { x: -12, z: -12, text: 'plaque.gulls' },\\n  { x: 8, z: 12, text: 'notice.even' },\\n  { x: -4, z: -16, text: 'notice.lawn' },\\n];\\n\\n/** Hidden pebbles. They join the cairn. They are not a shop. */\\nconst PEBBLES: readonly { x: number; z: number }[] = [\\n  { x: 18, z: -14 },\\n  { x: -22, z: -8 },\\n  { x: 8, z: 22 },\\n  { x: -30, z: 18 },\\n];\\n\\n/** An actor row the pilot can push. */\\ndefineComponent('posed', {\\n  description: '1 once the guest is wearing the lean clips.',\\n  fields: { on: { type: 'number', default: 0, description: '1 after the leans are playing.' } },\\n});\\n\\ninterface Body {\\n  id: number;\\n  actor: { x: number; y: number; z: number; intents: { move?: readonly [number, number] } };\\n  role?: { who: string };\\n  posed?: { on: number };\\n  clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n}\\n\\n/** A placed thing. */\\ninterface Spot {\\n  id: number;\\n  mark: { x: number; y: number; z: number; kind: string; text: string; taken: number; follow: number };\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's drawn position. `q` is the counter-rotation the dress writes. */\\ninterface Sea {\\n  sceneProp: { x: number; y: number; z: number; prop: string; q: [number, number, number, number] };\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea and the slope both read. */\\ninterface Lean {\\n  island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number };\\n}\\n\\n/** Distance on the lawn. */\\nfunction flat(ax: number, az: number, bx: number, bz: number): number {\\n  const dx = ax - bx;\\n  const dz = az - bz;\\n  return Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dz * dz);\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean, if the day has spawned. */\\nfunction leanOf(w: World): Lean['island'] | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as Lean[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Sea quaternion for a lean in degrees. tiltX rotates about Z (west), tiltZ about X.\\n * q = qz * qx. tiltX > 0 and tiltZ = 0 leaves q[2] negative.\\n */\\nfunction seaTurn(tiltX: number, tiltZ: number): [number, number, number, number] {\\n  const ax = (-tiltZ * Math.PI) / 180;\\n  const az = (-tiltX * Math.PI) / 180;\\n  const sx = Math.sin(ax / 2);\\n  const cx = Math.cos(ax / 2);\\n  const sz = Math.sin(az / 2);\\n  const cz = Math.cos(az / 2);\\n  return [cz * sx, sz * sx, sz * cx, cz * cx];\\n}\\n\\n/** The pose clip and how far through it the class is. Enter and the scored hold both move `t`. */\\nfunction poseScrub(w: World): { clip: string; t: number } | undefined {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (!flow.event.startsWith('pose')) return undefined;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const poses = posesFor(act.text || flow.event);\\n  const pose = poses[act.pose] ?? poses[0];\\n  if (!pose) return undefined;\\n  const clip = `RETREAT/${pose.id.charAt(0).toUpperCase()}${pose.id.slice(1)}`;\\n  if (act.phase >= 2) return { clip, t: 1 };\\n  if (act.phase === 0) return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / (4 * 60)) };\\n  const seconds = pose.hold || Number(w.settings.get('game.pose.hold')) || 12;\\n  const steps = Math.max(1, Math.round(seconds * 60));\\n  return { clip, t: Math.min(1, act.left / steps) };\\n}\\n\\n/** The guest, if the cast has spawned. */\\nfunction guest(w: World): Body | undefined {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as Body[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n}\\n\\n/** Stands one still person. No clips. The mat is the performance. */\\nfunction person(w: World, who: string, x: number, z: number, yaw: number): void {\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [x, 40, z],\\n    yaw,\\n    player: false,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 0 }),\\n    components: { role: { who } },\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n/** Puts the island, the sea, the cast and the hidden pebbles into the world. */\\nfunction furnish(w: World): void {\\n  addTerrainBody(physicsOf(w), getTerrain('terrain:fulcrum'));\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:sea', at: [0, 2, 0], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:cairn', at: [-3, 0, 3], yaw: 0 });\\n  for (const spot of [\\n    [0, 2],\\n    [3, 2],\\n    [-3, 2],\\n    [0, 5],\\n  ] as const) {\\n    spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:mat', at: [spot[0], 0, spot[1]], yaw: 0 });\\n  }\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [-6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:pillar', at: [6, 0, -4], yaw: 0 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [4, 0, -8], yaw: 0.2 });\\n  spawnProp(w, { prop: 'prop:bench', at: [-4, 0, 14], yaw: -0.2 });\\n  for (const station of STATIONS) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: station.x, y: 1.2, z: station.z, kind: 'station', text: station.id, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (const plaque of PLAQUES) {\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: plaque.x, y: 1.1, z: plaque.z, kind: 'plaque', text: plaque.text, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < PEBBLES.length; i += 1) {\\n    const pebble = PEBBLES[i];\\n    if (!pebble) continue;\\n    w.spawn({ mark: { x: pebble.x, y: 0.3, z: pebble.z, kind: 'pebble', text: `pebble:${i}`, taken: 0, follow: 0 } });\\n  }\\n  spawnActor(w, {\\n    at: [0, 40, 6],\\n    player: false,\\n    yaw: Math.PI,\\n    character: createCharacter({ speed: 5.5 }),\\n    anim: { build: 'build:retreat' },\\n    clips: {\\n      sets: ['clipset:retreat'],\\n      play: { clip: 'RETREAT/Nothing', speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false },\\n    },\\n    components: { role: { who: 'guest' }, posed: { on: 0 } },\\n  });\\n  person(w, 'plumb', 2.2, 4, Math.PI);\\n  person(w, 'tare', -2.2, 5, 0);\\n  person(w, 'gerald', 8, -2, 1);\\n  person(w, 'bex', -8, 0, 0.4);\\n  person(w, 'nan', 5, 10, 2);\\n  w.systems.add('retreat.dress', dress, { phase: 'rules' });\\n}\\n\\n/** Sea bob, plaque creep, pebble pickup, and the pose scrub. Runs after the clips have stepped. */\\nfunction dress(w: World): void {\\n  const lean = leanOf(w);\\n  const q = seaTurn(lean?.tiltX ?? 0, lean?.tiltZ ?? 0);\\n  for (const row of w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as Sea[]) {\\n    if (row.sceneProp.prop !== 'prop:sea') continue;\\n    row.sceneProp.y = 2 + 0.06 * Math.sin(w.time * 0.35);\\n    row.sceneProp.q = q;\\n  }\\n  const day = Math.max(1, flowOf(w).day);\\n  const west = (day - 1) * 0.04;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'plaque') continue;\\n    const home = PLAQUES.find((plaque) => plaque.text === spot.mark.text);\\n    if (home) spot.mark.x = home.x - west;\\n  }\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam') {\\n    for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n      if (spot.mark.kind !== 'pebble' || spot.mark.taken) continue;\\n      if (flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z) < 1.5) {\\n        spot.mark.taken = 1;\\n        flow.pebbles += 1;\\n        flow.line = 'find.pebble';\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  scrub(w, who);\\n}\\n\\n/** Writes the lean and the current pose onto the clip slots. The scored hold lives in `left`, not `hold`. */\\nfunction scrub(w: World, who: Body): void {\\n  if (!who.posed?.on) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanR', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanL', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanF', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    playClip(w, who.id, 'RETREAT/LeanB', { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, additive: true, loop: false });\\n    if (who.posed) who.posed.on = 1;\\n  }\\n  const pose = poseScrub(w);\\n  let slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  if (pose && !slots?.some((slot) => slot.clip === pose.clip)) {\\n    playClip(w, who.id, pose.clip, { speed: 0, hold: true, walk: true, loop: false });\\n    slots = who.clips?.state?.slots;\\n  }\\n  if (!slots) return;\\n  const rows = w.query('wobble') as unknown as { wobble: { x: number; y: number; seat: number } }[];\\n  const body = rows.find((row) => row.wobble.seat === 0)?.wobble;\\n  const x = body?.x ?? 0;\\n  const y = body?.y ?? 0;\\n  for (const slot of slots) {\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanR') slot.t = Math.max(0, x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanL') slot.t = Math.max(0, -x);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanF') slot.t = Math.max(0, y);\\n    if (slot.clip === 'RETREAT/LeanB') slot.t = Math.max(0, -y);\\n    if (pose && slot.clip === pose.clip) slot.t = pose.t;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** Walks the guest while the day is open, and names the station underfoot. */\\nfunction roam(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const who = guest(w);\\n  if (!who) return;\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const onTerrace = flow.event === 'tilt' && act.phase === 1;\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam' && flow.mode !== 'title' && !onTerrace) {\\n    who.actor.intents = { move: [0, 0] };\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const move = intents.move;\\n  let mx = move?.[0] ?? 0;\\n  let my = move?.[1] ?? 0;\\n  if (flow.mode === 'roam' || onTerrace) {\\n    const tiltX = leanOf(w)?.tiltX ?? 0;\\n    mx -= Math.sin((tiltX * Math.PI) / 180);\\n  }\\n  const reach = Math.hypot(who.actor.x, who.actor.z);\\n  if (reach > 78) {\\n    mx = -who.actor.x / reach;\\n    my = -who.actor.z / reach;\\n  }\\n  who.actor.intents = { move: [mx, my] };\\n  if (flow.mode !== 'roam') return;\\n  let near = '';\\n  let best = 3.2;\\n  for (const spot of w.query('mark') as unknown as Spot[]) {\\n    if (spot.mark.kind !== 'station') continue;\\n    const d = flat(who.actor.x, who.actor.z, spot.mark.x, spot.mark.z);\\n    if (d < best) {\\n      best = d;\\n      near = spot.mark.text;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  act.text = near;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island scene. The page boots this. Tests that score the week boot the bench instead. */\\nexport const island = defineScene('game:island', {\\n  description: 'Little Fulcrum. Walk the lawn. Begin the day from a mat, a plaque, or the programme.',\\n\",\"total_lines\":383}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-13","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\n10→import { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n20→  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n30→        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n40→  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n50→\\n/** The lean the storm, the deeds and the centre stone all write. */\\nfunction islandTilt(w: World): { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } | undefined {\\n  const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } }[];\\n  return island[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n60→    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n70→  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      const rate = Number(w.settings.get('game.tilt.rate'));\\n80→      const speed = Number.isFinite(rate) ? rate : 0.15;\\n      tilt.tiltX = tilt.base + (act.left / 60) * speed;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    }\\n90→    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n100→    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58 && mark.taken < 0.5) {\\n        mark.taken = 1;\\n        if (tilt) tilt.tiltX -= 0.5;\\n110→      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n120→      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n130→    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n140→      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n150→}\\n\\n/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n160→  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\n170→export function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n180→  }\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\n10→import { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n20→  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n30→        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n40→  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n50→\\n/** The lean the storm, the deeds and the centre stone all write. */\\nfunction islandTilt(w: World): { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } | undefined {\\n  const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } }[];\\n  return island[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n60→    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n70→  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      const rate = Number(w.settings.get('game.tilt.rate'));\\n80→      const speed = Number.isFinite(rate) ? rate : 0.15;\\n      tilt.tiltX = tilt.base + (act.left / 60) * speed;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    }\\n90→    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n100→    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58 && mark.taken < 0.5) {\\n        mark.taken = 1;\\n        if (tilt) tilt.tiltX -= 0.5;\\n110→      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n120→      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n130→    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n140→      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n150→}\\n\\n/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n160→  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\n170→export function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n180→  }\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/tilt.ts\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":180,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The Great Tilt. A storm, a walk to the east terrace, the centre stone, then dawn.\\n * The island's geometry stays put. Your centre of balance is what leans it, once you are on the stone.\\n * There is no fail state. The clock moves every part on.\\n */\\nimport type { Intents, World } from '../../../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { type Band, seek, stickIntents, wantBreath } from '../bot';\\nimport { clampScore } from '../score';\\nimport { resetAct, visit } from '../state';\\nimport { resetBalance } from '../wobble';\\nimport { actOf, apply, cfgOf, flowOf, rowOf, sweep } from './kit';\\n\\nconst NAMES = ['Nan', 'Gerald', 'Bex', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'E', 'F', 'G', 'H', 'I'];\\n\\n/** Guests, the storm, and a still balance. Attract begins on the stone. */\\nexport function setup(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  resetAct(act);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  resetBalance(row.wobble, row.hist);\\n  const attract = String(w.settings.get('game.auto')) === 'attract';\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    const nan = i === 0;\\n    const col = (i - 1) % 4;\\n    const row = Math.floor((i - 1) / 4);\\n    w.spawn({\\n      made: { tag: 'guest' },\\n      mark: {\\n        x: nan ? 64 : 1 + col * 2.2,\\n        y: 0,\\n        z: nan ? 8 : (row - 1) * 2.2,\\n        kind: 'guest',\\n        text: NAMES[i] ?? 'guest',\\n        taken: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n        follow: nan ? 1 : 0,\\n      },\\n    });\\n  }\\n  flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.storm';\\n  visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:storm');\\n  if (attract) {\\n    act.phase = 2;\\n    act.a = 1;\\n    act.b = 1;\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:east');\\n    visit(flowOf(w), 'tilt:stone');\\n    flowOf(w).line = 'tilt.stone';\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/** The lean the storm, the deeds and the centre stone all write. */\\nfunction islandTilt(w: World): { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } | undefined {\\n  const island = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number; tiltZ: number; base: number } }[];\\n  return island[0]?.island;\\n}\\n\\nfunction delivered(w: World): number {\\n  let n = 0;\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; taken: number } }[]) {\\n    if (row.mark.kind === 'guest' && row.mark.taken > 0.5) n += 1;\\n  }\\n  return n;\\n}\\n\\n/** The four parts. Each one ends itself. */\\nexport function step(w: World, intents: Intents): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  if (act.done) return;\\n  const flow = flowOf(w);\\n  const phase = act.phase;\\n  const inst = phase === 2 ? 1 : 1;\\n  const wave = phase === 2 ? Math.sin(w.time * 1.4) * 0.55 : 0;\\n  const { body, seat } = apply(w, intents, { dx: wave, inst, noise: phase === 2 ? 1 : 0.4 });\\n  act.tick += 1;\\n  act.left += 1;\\n  if (phase === 0) {\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      const rate = Number(w.settings.get('game.tilt.rate'));\\n      const speed = Number.isFinite(rate) ? rate : 0.15;\\n      tilt.tiltX = tilt.base + (act.left / 60) * speed;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 20 * 60) {\\n      act.a = 1;\\n      act.phase = 1;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.east';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:east');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 1) {\\n    act.px += Math.max(0, body.y) * 6 * w.dt;\\n    if (seat.both) act.hold += 1;\\n    else {\\n      if (act.hold >= 50) pulse(w);\\n      act.hold = 0;\\n    }\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n      mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number; taken: number };\\n    }[]) {\\n      const mark = row.mark;\\n      if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n      if (mark.follow > 0.5) mark.x += (act.px - mark.x) * Math.min(1, 4 * w.dt);\\n      else mark.x -= 0.3 * w.dt;\\n      if (mark.x > 58 && mark.taken < 0.5) {\\n        mark.taken = 1;\\n        if (tilt) tilt.tiltX -= 0.5;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 75 * 60) {\\n      act.b = delivered(w) / 12;\\n      act.phase = 2;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      act.samples = 0;\\n      act.acc = 0;\\n      act.acc2 = 0;\\n      resetBalance(rowOf(w, 0).wobble, rowOf(w, 0).hist);\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.stone';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:stone');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (phase === 2) {\\n    const ring = 0.3 - 0.14 * Math.min(1, act.left / (60 * 60));\\n    act.samples += 1;\\n    if (Math.hypot(body.x, body.y) <= ring) act.acc += 1;\\n    act.acc2 += body.sync;\\n    const tilt = islandTilt(w);\\n    if (tilt) {\\n      tilt.tiltX = body.x * 6;\\n      tilt.tiltZ = body.y * 6;\\n    }\\n    if (act.left >= 60 * 60) {\\n      act.c = act.samples ? act.acc / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.hz = act.samples ? act.acc2 / act.samples : 0;\\n      act.phase = 3;\\n      act.left = 0;\\n      if (tilt) {\\n        tilt.tiltX = 0;\\n        tilt.tiltZ = 0;\\n      }\\n      flow.line = 'tilt.dawn';\\n      visit(flow, 'tilt:dawn');\\n    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (act.left >= 15 * 60) act.done = 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** A calm wave. Guests close enough come with you. Nan is already there. */\\nfunction pulse(w: World): void {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  for (const row of w.query('mark') as unknown as { mark: { kind: string; x: number; z: number; follow: number } }[]) {\\n    const mark = row.mark;\\n    if (mark.kind !== 'guest') continue;\\n    if (Math.hypot(mark.x - act.px, mark.z) < 8) mark.follow = 1;\\n  }\\n  act.falls += 1;\\n}\\n\\n/** Storm, guests, the stone, and the breath on it. */\\nexport function score(w: World): number {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  return clampScore(1000 * (0.15 * act.a + 0.35 * act.b + 0.4 * act.c + 0.1 * act.hz));\\n}\\n\\n/** Breathes in the storm, walks east, then holds the stone. */\\nexport function bot(w: World, band: Band): Intents {\\n  const act = actOf(w);\\n  const row = rowOf(w, 0);\\n  const cfg = cfgOf(w);\\n  const breathe = wantBreath(band, w.time, cfg.period);\\n  if (band === 'idle') return stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {});\\n  if (act.phase === 1) {\\n    const stick = seek(band, 0, 0.55, row.wobble, row.hist, cfg, w.tick);\\n    const call = act.left % 240 < 100;\\n    return stickIntents(stick, { both: call });\\n  }\\n\",\"total_lines\":200}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-14","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→      threw = true;\\n    }\\n    expect(threw).toBe(false);\\n    expect(flowOf(mashed.w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(mashed.w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle'));\\n210→    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { run, w, menu } = open(2);\\n    const morning = ACTIVITIES[0];\\n220→    if (!morning) throw new Error('no morning');\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      run.stepOnce(morning.bot(w, 'human'));\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n230→\\n  it('shows today against yesterday and keeps that prior', () => {\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 0)).toBe('age.first');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 82)).toBe('age.down');\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 40)).toBe('age.up');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 40)).toBe('age.same');\\n    const first = resultCopy(\\n      { ...emptySnap(), event: 'morning', age: 82, prior: 0, rank: 'Present', result: 0 },\\n      'Here.',\\n    );\\n240→    expect(first).toContain('82');\\n    expect(first).toContain('Present');\\n    const next = noteProgress(freshSave(), {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 400,\\n      age: 40,\\n      prior: 82,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1'],\\n250→    });\\n    expect(next.prior).toBe(82);\\n    expect(next.age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(next.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1']);\\n    expect(next.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    const kept = noteProgress(next, {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 100,\\n260→      age: 82,\\n      prior: 40,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1', 'pebble:2'],\\n    });\\n    expect(kept.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    expect(kept.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1', 'pebble:2']);\\n    expect(kept.prior).toBe(40);\\n\\n    const { w, menu } = open(2);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n270→    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.first');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    expect(resultCopy(snap, 'Here.')).toContain('82');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).prior).toBe(0);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n280→    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.same');\\n    const again = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    const said = resultCopy(again, 'Here.');\\n    expect(said).toContain('82');\\n    expect(said).toContain('Yesterday');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), again).prior).toBe(82);\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, age: 40, prior: 82 });\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n290→  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of programme()) {\\n        const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((entry) => entry.id === item.event);\\n300→        guard += activity ? (activity.seconds + 2) * 60 : 60 * 60;\\n      }\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed}`).toBe(1);\\n      console.log(`seed ${seed} credits`);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n310→      for (const id of SEEN) expect(got, `seed ${seed} saw ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"200→      threw = true;\\n    }\\n    expect(threw).toBe(false);\\n    expect(flowOf(mashed.w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(mashed.w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle'));\\n210→    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { run, w, menu } = open(2);\\n    const morning = ACTIVITIES[0];\\n220→    if (!morning) throw new Error('no morning');\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      run.stepOnce(morning.bot(w, 'human'));\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n230→\\n  it('shows today against yesterday and keeps that prior', () => {\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 0)).toBe('age.first');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 82)).toBe('age.down');\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 40)).toBe('age.up');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 40)).toBe('age.same');\\n    const first = resultCopy(\\n      { ...emptySnap(), event: 'morning', age: 82, prior: 0, rank: 'Present', result: 0 },\\n      'Here.',\\n    );\\n240→    expect(first).toContain('82');\\n    expect(first).toContain('Present');\\n    const next = noteProgress(freshSave(), {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 400,\\n      age: 40,\\n      prior: 82,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1'],\\n250→    });\\n    expect(next.prior).toBe(82);\\n    expect(next.age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(next.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1']);\\n    expect(next.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    const kept = noteProgress(next, {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 100,\\n260→      age: 82,\\n      prior: 40,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1', 'pebble:2'],\\n    });\\n    expect(kept.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    expect(kept.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1', 'pebble:2']);\\n    expect(kept.prior).toBe(40);\\n\\n    const { w, menu } = open(2);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n270→    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.first');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    expect(resultCopy(snap, 'Here.')).toContain('82');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).prior).toBe(0);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n280→    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.same');\\n    const again = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    const said = resultCopy(again, 'Here.');\\n    expect(said).toContain('82');\\n    expect(said).toContain('Yesterday');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), again).prior).toBe(82);\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, age: 40, prior: 82 });\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n290→  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of programme()) {\\n        const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((entry) => entry.id === item.event);\\n300→        guard += activity ? (activity.seconds + 2) * 60 : 60 * 60;\\n      }\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed}`).toBe(1);\\n      console.log(`seed ${seed} credits`);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n310→      for (const id of SEEN) expect(got, `seed ${seed} saw ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":130,\"raw_output\":\"      threw = true;\\n    }\\n    expect(threw).toBe(false);\\n    expect(flowOf(mashed.w).mode).toBe('results');\\n    expect(Number.isFinite(flowOf(mashed.w).result)).toBe(true);\\n    const idle = open(4);\\n    idle.menu('game.start', { event: 'pond' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < pond.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(idle.w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      idle.run.stepOnce(pond.bot(idle.w, 'idle'));\\n    }\\n    expect(pond.score(idle.w)).toBe(500);\\n    expect(actOf(idle.w).pose).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('bounds Wobble Age', () => {\\n    expect(wobbleAge(1, 1.3)).toBe(18);\\n    expect(wobbleAge(0, 1.3)).toBe(82);\\n    const { run, w, menu } = open(2);\\n    const morning = ACTIVITIES[0];\\n    if (!morning) throw new Error('no morning');\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < morning.seconds * 60 + 5; i++) {\\n      if (flowOf(w).mode === 'results') break;\\n      run.stepOnce(morning.bot(w, 'human'));\\n    }\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(18);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBeLessThanOrEqual(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('shows today against yesterday and keeps that prior', () => {\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 0)).toBe('age.first');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 82)).toBe('age.down');\\n    expect(ageLine(82, 40)).toBe('age.up');\\n    expect(ageLine(40, 40)).toBe('age.same');\\n    const first = resultCopy(\\n      { ...emptySnap(), event: 'morning', age: 82, prior: 0, rank: 'Present', result: 0 },\\n      'Here.',\\n    );\\n    expect(first).toContain('82');\\n    expect(first).toContain('Present');\\n    const next = noteProgress(freshSave(), {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 400,\\n      age: 40,\\n      prior: 82,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1'],\\n    });\\n    expect(next.prior).toBe(82);\\n    expect(next.age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(next.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1']);\\n    expect(next.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    const kept = noteProgress(next, {\\n      ...emptySnap(),\\n      mode: 'results',\\n      event: 'morning',\\n      result: 100,\\n      age: 82,\\n      prior: 40,\\n      finds: ['pebble:1', 'pebble:2'],\\n    });\\n    expect(kept.bests.morning).toBe(400);\\n    expect(kept.finds).toEqual(['pebble:1', 'pebble:2']);\\n    expect(kept.prior).toBe(40);\\n\\n    const { w, menu } = open(2);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(0);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.first');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    expect(resultCopy(snap, 'Here.')).toContain('82');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).prior).toBe(0);\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n    menu('game.finish');\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(82);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('age.same');\\n    const again = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    const said = resultCopy(again, 'Here.');\\n    expect(said).toContain('82');\\n    expect(said).toContain('Yesterday');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), again).prior).toBe(82);\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, age: 40, prior: 82 });\\n    expect(flowOf(w).age).toBe(40);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).prior).toBe(82);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('director', () => {\\n  it('walks three seeds to the credits', () => {\\n    for (const seed of [1, 2, 3]) {\\n      const { run, w } = open(seed, { 'game.auto': 'director' });\\n      let guard = 0;\\n      for (const item of programme()) {\\n        const activity = ACTIVITIES.find((entry) => entry.id === item.event);\\n        guard += activity ? (activity.seconds + 2) * 60 : 60 * 60;\\n      }\\n      for (let i = 0; i < guard; i++) {\\n        run.stepOnce({});\\n        if (flowOf(w).mode === 'credits') break;\\n      }\\n      const flow = flowOf(w);\\n      expect(flow.credits, `seed ${seed}`).toBe(1);\\n      console.log(`seed ${seed} credits`);\\n      const got = flow.seen.split(',');\\n      for (const id of SEEN) expect(got, `seed ${seed} saw ${id}`).toContain(id);\\n      expect(flow.pebbles).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    }\\n  }, 600_000);\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":314}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1e6ecb6e-5efc-4326-ada7-ef89b28114f9-15","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\n10→import { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n20→  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n30→    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n40→  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n50→/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n70→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n80→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n90→  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n100→    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n110→  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n120→      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n130→    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n140→    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n150→    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n160→    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n170→    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n180→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n190→    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n200→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n210→  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n220→    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n230→    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\n10→import { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n20→  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n30→    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n40→  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n50→/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n70→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n80→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n90→  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n100→    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n110→  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n120→      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n130→    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n140→    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n150→    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n160→    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n170→    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n180→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n190→    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n200→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n210→  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n220→    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n230→    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/island.test.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":232}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"8a1e8098-87ec-4525-90de-3c91b8e16c77"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1105","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will hunt for real bugs and regressions by carefully re-examining each gap.\n\nThe pose scrub logic appears correct. A potential bug remains: the clips system may run after the rules phase and overwrite the scrubbed time if it advances t based on speed.\n\nThe passing tests suggest the clip system does not overwrite scrubbed time. If it did, the pose scrub test would fail.\n\nGap 1 is confirmed fixed. The pose scrub test passes. I still need to verify that multi-word pose ids like \"lighthouse\" map correctly to clip names such as \"Lighthouse\". The phase timing math checks out: after one step, t equals 0.00416.\n\nThe phase timing holds up. After 21 steps the bot has not reached the seat, so phase remains 0. The chair clip test passed, confirming the second pose is chair. A bug was spotted: playClip only triggers when a slot is missing, which means scrubbed time may not be restored if the slot already exists.\n\nThe slot.t movement bug is fixed. The engine now correctly updates the clip sampler's time as the scrub advances.\n\nGap 2 is under review. Sea q derives from tilt, which stone phase sets from CoB. The storm phase uses rate instead.\n\nA potential bug was spotted in the sea q field. The renderer may ignore a `q` property if the sceneProp component schema does not declare it. If the engine uses `yaw` or `rotation` instead, the player would never see the sea counter-rotation.\n\nThe passing test only checks the q field the dress writes, so it cannot prove the renderer actually applies it. I still need to verify that the engine sceneProp component declares q and the renderer consumes it for orientation. The slope push is confirmed as real movement: the guest walks downhill via actor intents, and tests assert position changes.\n\nThe downhill push is visible even if the renderer ignores sea q, so gap 2 is satisfied. The downhill direction math checks out: a positive tiltX decreases x movement, matching the test expectation that tipped drift is smaller than flat drift.\n\nThe storm tilt formula is verified. After sixty steps, tiltX reaches exactly 1.4, matching the test expectation.\n\nThe delivery bug is also confirmed. Only guests at x greater than 58 with taken below 0.5 reduce tilt by 0.5. The Nan guest spawns at x=64 with taken already set to 1, so she is excluded. Gerald is teleported to x=59 with follow=1 and taken=0, ensuring he qualifies.\n\nGerald's movement toward the east terrace is confirmed. After one step he reaches x=59.7 and qualifies for the tilt reduction. Other guests start too far west to reach the 58 threshold without following. The stone center-of-balance formula is also verified: tiltX equals body.x multiplied by six.\n\nThe stone phase reaches the required lean gap within two seconds. The sea orientation changes because the base tilt of 0.4 produces a nonzero q value. The default tilt rate is now 0.15 instead of the old hardcoded 0.28, and deeds can adjust it. Dawn zeroing tilt is an end-state behavior, not a defect. A one-frame lag between dress sea and tilt steps is not a bug.\n\nThe prior gap about camera bank and prop knock is resolved. Tilt is now wired into visible effects like sea counter-rotation, slope push, and delivery adjustments, so deeds can change them.\n\nGap 3 is also fixed. Plaque positions are recalculated from the home position each day rather than accumulating offsets, matching the test expectation.\n\nPlaques may be invisible data marks without meshes. If they have no visible geometry, the downhill shift is not a visible effect. The original gap required plaques to shift downhill and assert new positions from the island step.\n\nI am checking whether plaques render from their mark positions. If they do, the downhill shift is visible; if not, they remain invisible data points.\n\nThe review has moved to Gap 4: Wobble Age.\n\nThe Wobble Age logic is being traced through the morning finish flow. The first finish sets prior to 0 and age to 82, producing a line marked age.first. A second finish with unchanged age 82 yields an age.same line containing Yesterday, which matches the expected resultCopy output. The game.begin restore then resets prior to 82 and age to 40. A potential bug was flagged but not yet confirmed.\n\nThe first morning resultCopy correctly omits Yesterday because prior is zero. The test reads the resultCopy snapshot directly, which is the exact string the paint path assigns to the DOM. A broken paint path that bypassed this formatter would not be caught.\n\nThe paint path now calls resultCopy, which adds the Wobble Age to morning results. The save key and noteProgress both carry the prior age forward. A score of zero always yields age 82 through wobbleAge(0), not a hardcoded value in finishEvent.\n\nThe book line omits the age number, but the visible results copy includes the full age remark and rank. Both elements render together, so the morning result still shows today's age against yesterday.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe68c043-86f6-40eb-bdee-f6d80d1b1618-16","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function showResults|copy\\.|dataset\\.ui = 'copy'|id=\\\"copy\\\"|results","glob":"**/ui/menus.ts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe68c043-86f6-40eb-bdee-f6d80d1b1618-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"sceneProp|q:","glob":"**/sceneProp*","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe68c043-86f6-40eb-bdee-f6d80d1b1618-18","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"plaque|kind === 'plaque'|mark\\.x","glob":"**/*.{ts,js}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fe68c043-86f6-40eb-bdee-f6d80d1b1618-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"id: '(nothing|chair|heron|archer|comma|napkin|bridge|lighthouse)'","glob":"**/*pose*","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13335,"output_tokens":3138,"cache_read_input_tokens":54912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"c32b8a46-441c-4dcf-8bf7-5e2a4ac8571e"}
