11,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":10,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"verb: keep your centre of balance where it should be. Over five days the deadpan gets stranger. The plaques move.\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"**Exploration.** 20 pebbles, 12 \\\"Did you know?\\\" plaques, and each cast member has 3–5 new lines each day. Sit on a bench\"},{\"line_number\":277,\"content\":\"to watch the view with the Meditate clip. Wave at Gerald. Plaques visibly creep downhill across the days.\"},{\"line_number\":436,\"content\":\"Score: share of time in the ribbon. Tare hops beside you and talks, the plaques go by. At the end Gerald says: \\\"Nice weather\"},{\"line_number\":451,\"content\":\"- Actors get a slope push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\"},{\"line_number\":461,\"content\":\"2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\"},{\"line_number\":667,\"content\":\"**Make these as props** (`node x new prop labs/game/props/<name>`; parts are geometry by id and material by id, with `tint`): mats, Tare's Platform, Noticeboard, plaques, Cairn pebbles (squashed rounded\"},{\"line_number\":821,\"content\":\"- \\\"Did you know? This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":882,\"content\":\"**Key components** (plain data): `flow` (mode: front, roam, event, cutscene, results; event, phase, tick; day), `wobble` (per seat), `seat` (input per seat), `island` (tilt), `round`, `pebble`, `plaque`, `ghost`, plus one per activity. Time in whole steps, randomness from named streams, loops in `w.query` order, `Math.pow` not `**`.\"},{\"line_number\":996,\"content\":\"5. **The joke.** Still Pond. Then Cairn, plaques, day cycle.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5bb0dddf-45eb-4b85-b328-2b5d99c14f12"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1109","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plan specifies plaques creep downhill across the days and should be made as props.\n\nThe prior gap required plaques to shift downhill and assert new positions from the island step. The implementer moved mark.x. Round 1 accepted marks as plaques. The gap did not require adding meshes if they were already the representation.\n\nMoving mark positions fixes the no-op creep bug. Yet if plaques are not rendered, the shift is invisible to the player. The code-correctness floor requires a feature to be fully wired and visible.\n\nThe prior gap explicitly required moving mark positions in dress(). The implementer fulfilled that contract. Raising a new drawing requirement now would violate the anti-ratchet rule. If those marks are not consumed by any visual system, the creep remains invisible.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21725f76-a038-4315-a851-623b54f3451d-31","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"query\\('mark'\\)|components: \\{ mark|kind plaque|drawBox|noticeboard|prop:plaque","glob":"**/*.{ts,js,mjs}","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21725f76-a038-4315-a851-623b54f3451d-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Wobble Age|tiltX|seaTurn|ageRemark|pebble:","glob":"**/*.html","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-21725f76-a038-4315-a851-623b54f3451d-33","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md","offset":420,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2680,"output_tokens":741,"cache_read_input_tokens":81792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"2f4c3c1a-6b03-453c-ad6a-8f463144a983"}
