{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1119","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Plaque lines exist in the book, but `roam()` only sets `act.text` from STATIONS and ignores plaques.\n\nPlaques have no mesh and remain invisible. The creep moves an unused coordinate. The prior gap required plaques to shift downhill and assert new positions from the island step. This was implemented. Visibility is a pre-existing plan item that round 1 did not flag as a bug. Anti-ratchet rules forbid raising new objections unless they are demonstrable defects or the prior gap is not actually fixed. The key question is whether downhill shifting counts as fixed if nothing displays it.\n\nGap 3 is accepted. The island-step assertion confirms downhill shifting is working.\n\nAge display logic checks out. finishEvent stores the prior age before computing the new one, and game.begin restores it correctly after a morning.\n\nA bug remains: remember omits age.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c8708c2b-41c5-479a-b913-74e12cc5ef90-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/menus.ts","offset":330,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c8708c2b-41c5-479a-b913-74e12cc5ef90-56","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts","offset":300,"limit":100}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-c8708c2b-41c5-479a-b913-74e12cc5ef90-57","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"const copy|copy = |dataset.ui","glob":"**/ui/stage.ts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1621,"output_tokens":635,"cache_read_input_tokens":105344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"e64a7309-61f2-49f3-ad29-8937fc54af7d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c8708c2b-41c5-479a-b913-74e12cc5ef90-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"330→      .slice(0, 4)\\n      .map((event) => ({ label: NAMES[event] ?? event, id: event }));\\n    items.push({ label: 'Back', id: 'back' });\\n    host.open(\\n      items,\\n      'Today',\\n      'programme',\\n      (id) => {\\n        if (id === 'back') showPause(1);\\n        else {\\n340→          host.run('game.start', { event: id });\\n          host.resume();\\n        }\\n      },\\n      () => showPause(1),\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const showHubPause = () => {\\n    host.open(\\n350→      [\\n        { label: 'Resume', id: 'resume' },\\n        { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\\n        { label: `Voices ${pct(host.prefs.voices)}`, id: 'voices' },\\n        { label: host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'Icons Xbox' : 'Icons PlayStation', id: 'icons' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' },\\n      ],\\n      'Paused',\\n      'pause',\\n      (id) => {\\n360→        if (id === 'music')\\n          host.prefs = {\\n            ...host.prefs,\\n            music: host.prefs.music >= 1 ? 0 : Math.round((host.prefs.music + 0.1) * 10) / 10,\\n          };\\n        if (id === 'voices')\\n          host.prefs = {\\n            ...host.prefs,\\n            voices: host.prefs.voices >= 1 ? 0 : Math.round((host.prefs.voices + 0.1) * 10) / 10,\\n          };\\n370→        if (id === 'icons') host.icons = host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'playstation' : 'xbox';\\n        host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, icons: host.icons };\\n        host.applyPrefs();\\n        if (id === 'about') {\\n          host.aboutFrom = 'hub';\\n          showAbout();\\n        } else if (id === 'resume') host.resume();\\n        else showHubPause();\\n      },\\n      () => host.resume(),\\n380→    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const showResults = (event: string, rank: string) => {\\n    host.open(\\n      [\\n        { label: 'Again', id: 'again' },\\n        { label: 'Carry on', id: 'on' },\\n      ],\\n      rank || 'Done',\\n390→      'results',\\n      (id) => {\\n        if (id === 'again') host.run('game.start', { event });\\n        else host.run('game.carry');\\n        host.close();\\n        host.screen = 'play';\\n        host.publish();\\n      },\\n    );\\n  };\\n400→\\n  const showEvening = () => {\\n    host.open([{ label: 'Sleep', id: 'sleep' }], 'Evening', 'evening', () => {\\n      host.run('game.sleep');\\n      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n      host.publish();\\n    });\\n  };\\n\\n410→  const showCredits = () => {\\n    host.open(\\n      [\\n        { label: 'Walk the lawn', id: 'walk' },\\n        { label: 'A new morning', id: 'morning' },\\n      ],\\n      'Credits',\\n      'credits',\\n      (id) => {\\n        if (id === 'walk') host.run('game.leave');\\n420→        else host.run('game.start', { event: 'morning' });\\n        host.close();\\n        host.screen = 'play';\\n        host.publish();\\n      },\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const showDev = () => {\\n    const slice = TUNABLES.slice(host.devPage * 4, host.devPage * 4 + 4);\\n430→    host.sliders.hidden = false;\\n    host.sliders.replaceChildren();\\n    for (const tunable of slice) {\\n      const label = document.createElement('label');\\n      label.dataset.ui = 'slider';\\n      const name = tunable.path.replace('game.', '');\\n      const current = host.setting(tunable.path);\\n      label.textContent = `${name} ${current}`;\\n      const range = document.createElement('input');\\n      range.type = 'range';\\n440→      range.min = String(tunable.min);\\n      range.max = String(tunable.max);\\n      range.step = String(tunable.step);\\n      range.value = String(current);\\n      range.dataset.ui = 'slider-range';\\n      range.addEventListener('input', () => {\\n        host.inspector()?.set(tunable.path, Number(range.value));\\n        label.textContent = `${name} ${range.value}`;\\n      });\\n      label.append(range);\",\"content_concise\":\"330→      .slice(0, 4)\\n      .map((event) => ({ label: NAMES[event] ?? event, id: event }));\\n    items.push({ label: 'Back', id: 'back' });\\n    host.open(\\n      items,\\n      'Today',\\n      'programme',\\n      (id) => {\\n        if (id === 'back') showPause(1);\\n        else {\\n340→          host.run('game.start', { event: id });\\n          host.resume();\\n        }\\n      },\\n      () => showPause(1),\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const showHubPause = () => {\\n    host.open(\\n350→      [\\n        { label: 'Resume', id: 'resume' },\\n        { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\\n        { label: `Voices ${pct(host.prefs.voices)}`, id: 'voices' },\\n        { label: host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'Icons Xbox' : 'Icons PlayStation', id: 'icons' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' },\\n      ],\\n      'Paused',\\n      'pause',\\n      (id) => {\\n360→        if (id === 'music')\\n          host.prefs = {\\n            ...host.prefs,\\n            music: host.prefs.music >= 1 ? 0 : Math.round((host.prefs.music + 0.1) * 10) / 10,\\n          };\\n        if (id === 'voices')\\n          host.prefs = {\\n            ...host.prefs,\\n            voices: host.prefs.voices >= 1 ? 0 : Math.round((host.prefs.voices + 0.1) * 10) / 10,\\n          };\\n370→        if (id === 'icons') host.icons = host.icons === 'xbox' ? 'playstation' : 'xbox';\\n        host.prefs = { ...host.prefs, icons: host.icons };\\n        host.applyPrefs();\\n        if (id === 'about') {\\n          host.aboutFrom = 'hub';\\n          showAbout();\\n        } else if (id === 'resume') host.resume();\\n        else showHubPause();\\n      },\\n      () => host.resume(),\\n380→    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const showResults = (event: string, rank: string) => {\\n    host.open(\\n      [\\n        { label: 'Again', id: 'again' },\\n        { label: 'Carry on', id: 'on' },\\n      ],\\