{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1123","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `continue` function spreads the entire save into `game.begin`, including prior and finds.\n\n`applySave` reads `finds` and `prior` correctly. A potential bug was spotted: if the save's `prior` is 0, it is still treated as defined and applied. There may also be an age comparison issue when continuing into the next morning.\n\nThe age comparison logic is sound. The stored prior of 82 is discarded and replaced with the correct yesterday value of 40. The next morning correctly compares today against 40 rather than 82. All five gaps appear genuinely fixed. The hub log will be checked for regressions.\n\nThe verify.log is only nine lines and precedes npm-test. It may be a stub echoing success without running the suite. I need to read verify.mjs and the full log to confirm whether the tests actually executed. Production code was stable from 04:40 onward.\n\nThe test files were modified at 04:59, 24 milliseconds after the npm-test report was written. This suggests a formatting tool such as Prettier updated both files simultaneously, likely after the tests had already passed.\n\nThe test file writes at 04:59:00 occurred before the check began, so they were likely formatted afterward. The assertions still match the implementation, so this is low risk.\n\nThe hub log will be scanned for regressions.\n\nA test confirmed that pose clip speed zero works correctly with the animation system.\n\nNaN storm rates fall back to 0.15. Delivery skips Nan pebbles at spawn. Stone phase overwrites tilt with body*6. Dawn resets tilt to sea level. Plaque downhill direction matches westward lean. Four centimeters of daily creep reaches twelve centimeters by day four.\n\nThe HTML contains the verified fix strings. The hand-in files are present and already checked. I will read the verify.log and hub.log tail to confirm this round's evidence still shows credits and a hub pass.\n\nThe bench scene may lack pebbles, but applyFinds safely no-ops when marks are absent. The dress-plaque loop and the taken check both use the number 1, so they do not conflict.\n\nA potential visual bug surfaced in the pose clip system. When switching poses, the old clip freezes at its last frame while the new one scrubs. Both slots may blend simultaneously, causing two poses to appear at once. The gap only required playing and scrubbing the current pose, so this overlap is a regression.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5709541-9b21-4c2a-94f9-5b7b22ec85ba-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"export function playClip|function playClip","glob":"**/*.ts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5709541-9b21-4c2a-94f9-5b7b22ec85ba-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/hub.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5709541-9b21-4c2a-94f9-5b7b22ec85ba-68","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/verify.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1469,"output_tokens":1722,"cache_read_input_tokens":112512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"9e350e40-8043-4e23-a5cd-de6d6f7a6ebb"}
