18,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,101,120,105,116,45,105,110,116,101,114,118,105,101,119,46,106,115,111,110,10,52,58,32,32,32,32,34,115,111,117,114,99,101,34,58,32,34,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,34,44,10,49,55,58,32,32,32,32,34,117,115,97,103,101,34,58,32,34,97,100,100,101,100,32,111,110,32,105,109,112,111,114,116,34,10,52,48,58,32,32,32,32,34,110,97,109,101,34,58,32,34,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,34,44,10,52,53,58,32,32,32,32,34,115,111,117,114,99,101,34,58,32,34,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,34,44,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":4,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/exit-interview.json\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\"    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"    \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":40,\"content\":\"    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Thumb Yoga\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"    \\\"source\\\": \\\"Wii Fit\\\",\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"22823252-2c53-415e-a5b6-a95f5d47097c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1127","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boot logs may predate the HTML rebuild.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The five prior gaps match the current sources and the captured 28-test run. Writing the verdict."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2875f496-8ce4-4a50-a95f-0ac0da65e80e-75","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/goal-verdict-ed8f613011b3-2-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"out/test/report.json 28/28 (pose scrub, sea/CoB, plaques, pebble restore, downhill, age prior); island.ts:187-326, tilt.ts:76-134, score.ts:52-69, driver.ts:103-106,221-252, stage.ts:526; verify.log EXIT:0; hub.log pass for 2/3/4 and host-leave.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"# Re-check\\n\\nAll five prior gaps are fixed in the current sources. The captured vitest report (28/28, started 04:54:48) names the new island and age tests as passed. `verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0`. `npm-check.log` ends `EXIT:0` on `my-3dge@e7a1243`. Hub players 2, 3, 4, and host-leave are `pass: true`. Both boots report `ready: true` and `errors: []`. The work-root HTML (04:47) is newer than the production sources and contains `Your Wobble Age`, `Yesterday it was`, `age.first`, `game.tilt.rate`, `pebble:`, and `RETREAT/Nothing`. PLAN changes only tick the checklist and record the existing cut line.\\n\\n## Prior gaps\\n\\n1. **Pose scrub** — `poseScrub` (`island.ts:187-201`) picks `RETREAT/${Capitalized id}` and sets `t` from enter `left/(4*60)` and scored-hold `left/steps`. Clip duration is 1s with keys at 0 and 1 (`clips.ts:31`), so that `t` is the whole pose. `scrub` (`island.ts:300-326`) `playClip`s the pose once and writes `slot.t` in the `rules` phase, after `actors.clips`. `island.test.ts` boots the island, `game.start` pose-a, steps `poseA.bot`, and asserts `RETREAT/Nothing` then `RETREAT/Chair` `t` increase. Report: passed, 1070.8ms.\\n\\n2. **Tilt is consumed** — Storm writes `tiltX = base + (left/60)*game.tilt.rate` (`tilt.ts:76-81`). East delivery subtracts 0.5° once when a guest first crosses x>58 (`tilt.ts:107-109`). The stone copies CoB into `tiltX/tiltZ` (`tilt.ts:130-133`). `dress` counter-rotates `sceneProp.q` (`island.ts:270-276`); `props.readback` runs before `rules`, and `stageProps.ts:89-93` draws that quaternion. `roam` subtracts `sin(tiltX°)` from move x (`island.ts:343-346`). The island test checks stick vs still (lean and sea), rate 1 vs 0 (tilt ≈ 1.4 vs 0.4), one delivery of −0.5° that does not repeat, and downhill drift. All passed.\\n\\n3. **Plaques** — `dress` sets `mark.x = home.x - (day-1)*0.04` from the home table (`island.ts:277-283`), so day 4 is 12cm west and a second step does not stack. West matches `applyLean` (`driver.ts:60-71`), which raises `tiltX` each day. Test passed.\\n\\n4. **Wobble Age** — `finishEvent` stores yesterday in `prior`, then sets today's `age` and `ageLine` (`driver.ts:103-106`). `ageRemark` includes both numbers (`score.ts:52-62`). Morning results paint `resultCopy`, which prefixes that sentence (`snap.ts:163-167`, `stage.ts:526`). `noteProgress` and `remember` persist `prior` (`save.ts:84-92`, `stage.ts:495-504`); Continue spreads the save into `game.begin` (`menus.ts:108`), and `applySave` restores it (`driver.ts:247`). The retreat test finishes two real mornings (prior 0 then 82, line `age.same`, copy contains `Yesterday`) and reloads prior 82. Passed.\\n\\n5. **Finds** — Pebbles spawn as `pebble:0`…`pebble:3` (`island.ts:243-246`). Pickup increments only while `taken` is clear (`island.ts:288-294`). `applyFinds` marks saved ids taken and does not add (`driver.ts:220-228`). The island test picks one up, `game.begin`s the find, walks over it again (count stays), then counts a second id. Passed.\\n\\nNo regression showed up in the director seeds, hub harness, boots, or check. Camera bank and prop knock stay out of scope: the prior gap asked for a visible, deed-driven consumer, and the sea, the slope, the rate, and the −0.5° delivery are that consumer.\\n\"\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2875f496-8ce4-4a50-a95f-0ac0da65e80e-76","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/goal-classifier-ed8f613011b3-2-skeptic-0.md","content":"# Re-check\n\nAll five prior gaps are fixed in the current sources. The captured vitest report (28/28, started 04:54:48) names the new island and age tests as passed. `verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0`. `npm-check.log` ends `EXIT:0` on `my-3dge@e7a1243`. Hub players 2, 3, 4, and host-leave are `pass: true`. Both boots report `ready: true` and `errors: []`. The work-root HTML (04:47) is newer than the production sources and contains `Your Wobble Age`, `Yesterday it was`, `age.first`, `game.tilt.rate`, `pebble:`, and `RETREAT/Nothing`. PLAN changes only tick the checklist and record the existing cut line.\n\n## Prior gaps\n\n1. **Pose scrub** — `poseScrub` (`island.ts:187-201`) picks `RETREAT/${Capitalized id}` and sets `t` from enter `left/(4*60)` and scored-hold `left/steps`. Clip duration is 1s with keys at 0 and 1 (`clips.ts:31`), so that `t` is the whole pose. `scrub` (`island.ts:300-326`) `playClip`s the pose once and writes `slot.t` in the `rules` phase, after `actors.clips`. `island.test.ts` boots the island, `game.start` pose-a, steps `poseA.bot`, and asserts `RETREAT/Nothing` then `RETREAT/Chair` `t` increase. Report: passed, 1070.8ms.\n\n2. **Tilt is consumed** — Storm writes `tiltX = base + (left/60)*game.tilt.rate` (`tilt.ts:76-81`). East delivery subtracts 0.5° once when a guest first crosses x>58 (`tilt.ts:107-109`). The stone copies CoB into `tiltX/tiltZ` (`tilt.ts:130-133`). `dress` counter-rotates `sceneProp.q` (`island.ts:270-276`); `props.readback` runs before `rules`, and `stageProps.ts:89-93` draws that quaternion. `roam` subtracts `sin(tiltX°)` from move x (`island.ts:343-346`). The island test checks stick vs still (lean and sea), rate 1 vs 0 (tilt ≈ 1.4 vs 0.4), one delivery of −0.5° that does not repeat, and downhill drift. All passed.\n\n3. **Plaques** — `dress` sets `mark.x = home.x - (day-1)*0.04` from the home table (`island.ts:277-283`), so day 4 is 12cm west and a second step does not stack. West matches `applyLean` (`driver.ts:60-71`), which raises `tiltX` each day. Test passed.\n\n4. **Wobble Age** — `finishEvent` stores yesterday in `prior`, then sets today's `age` and `ageLine` (`driver.ts:103-106`). `ageRemark` includes both numbers (`score.ts:52-62`). Morning results paint `resultCopy`, which prefixes that sentence (`snap.ts:163-167`, `stage.ts:526`). `noteProgress` and `remember` persist `prior` (`save.ts:84-92`, `stage.ts:495-504`); Continue spreads the save into `game.begin` (`menus.ts:108`), and `applySave` restores it (`driver.ts:247`). The retreat test finishes two real mornings (prior 0 then 82, line `age.same`, copy contains `Yesterday`) and reloads prior 82. Passed.\n\n5. **Finds** — Pebbles spawn as `pebble:0`…`pebble:3` (`island.ts:243-246`). Pickup increments only while `taken` is clear (`island.ts:288-294`). `applyFinds` marks saved ids taken and does not add (`driver.ts:220-228`). The island test picks one up, `game.begin`s the find, walks over it again (count stays), then counts a second id. Passed.\n\nNo regression showed up in the director seeds, hub harness, boots, or check. Camera bank and prop knock stay out of scope: the prior gap asked for a visible, deed-driven consumer, and the sea, the slope, the rate, and the −0.5° delivery are that consumer.\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1567,"output_tokens":2537,"cache_read_input_tokens":122112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5cc7bf1d-3c04-4a3a-92bd-be11b67054a3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-2875f496-8ce4-4a50-a95f-0ac0da65e80e-75","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"{\\n  \\\"refuted\\\": false,\\n  \\\"findings\\\": [],\\n  \\\"evidence\\\": \\\"out/test/report.json 28/28 (pose scrub, sea/CoB, plaques, pebble restore, downhill, age prior); island.ts:187-326, tilt.ts:76-134, score.ts:52-69, driver.ts:103-106,221-252, stage.ts:526; verify.log EXIT:0; hub.log pass for 2/3/4 and host-leave.\\\",\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"high\\\",\\n  \\\"blocking\\\": \\\"none\\\",\\n  \\\"details_md\\\": \\\"# Re-check\\\\n\\\\nAll five prior gaps are fixed in the current sources. The captured vitest report (28/28, started 04:54:48) names the new island and age tests as passed. `verify.log` ends `0 failures` / `EXIT:0`. `npm-check.log` ends `EXIT:0` on `my-3dge@e7a1243`. Hub players 2, 3, 4, and host-leave are `pass: true`. Both boots report `ready: true` and `errors: []`. The work-root HTML (04:47) is newer than the production sources and contains `Your Wobble Age`, `Yesterday it was`, `age.first`, `game.tilt.rate`, `pebble:`, and `RETREAT/Nothing`. PLAN changes only tick the checklist and record the existing cut line.\\\\n\\\\n## Prior gaps\\\\n\\\\n1. **Pose scrub** — `poseScrub` (`island.ts:187-201`) picks `RETREAT/${Capitalized id}` and sets `t` from enter `left/(4*60)` and scored-hold `left/steps`. Clip duration is 1s with keys at 0 and 1 (`clips.ts:31`), so that `t` is the whole pose. `scrub` (`island.ts:300-326`) `playClip`s the pose once and writes `slot.t` in the `rules` phase, after `actors.clips`. `island.test.ts` boots the island, `game.start` pose-a, steps `poseA.bot`, and asserts `RETREAT/Nothing` then `RETREAT/Chair` `t` increase. Report: passed, 1070.8ms.\\\\n\\\\n2. **Tilt is consumed** — Storm writes `tiltX = base + (left/60)*game.tilt.rate` (`tilt.ts:76-81`). East delivery subtracts 0.5° once when a guest first crosses x>58 (`tilt.ts:107-109`). The stone copies CoB into `tiltX/tiltZ` (`tilt.ts:130-133`). `dress` counter-rotates `sceneProp.q` (`island.ts:270-276`); `props.readback` runs before `rules`, and `stageProps.ts:89-93` draws that quaternion. `roam` subtracts `sin(tiltX°)` from move x (`island.ts:343-346`). The island test checks stick vs still (lean and sea), rate 1 vs 0 (tilt ≈ 1.4 vs 0.4), one delivery of −0.5° that does not repeat, and downhill drift. All passed.\\\\n\\\\n3. **Plaques** — `dress` sets `mark.x = home.x - (day-1)*0.04` from the home table (`island.ts:277-283`), so day 4 is 12cm west and a second step does not stack. West matches `applyLean` (`driver.ts:60-71`), which raises `tiltX` each day. Test passed.\\\\n\\\\n4. **Wobble Age** — `finishEvent` stores yesterday in `prior`, then sets today's `age` and `ageLine` (`driver.ts:103-106`). `ageRemark` includes both numbers (`score.ts:52-62`). Morning results paint `resultCopy`, which prefixes that sentence (`snap.ts:163-167`, `stage.ts:526`). `noteProgress` and `remember` persist `prior` (`save.ts:84-92`, `stage.ts:495-504`); Continue spreads the save into `game.begin` (`menus.ts:108`), and `applySave` restores it (`driver.ts:247`). The retreat test finishes two real mornings (prior 0 then 82, line `age.same`, copy contains `Yesterday`) and reloads prior 82. Passed.\\\\n\\\\n5. **Finds** — Pebbles spawn as `pebble:0`…`pebble:3` (`island.ts:243-246`). Pickup increments only while `taken` is clear (`island.ts:288-294`). `applyFinds` marks saved ids taken and does not add (`driver.ts:220-228`). The island test picks one up, `game.begin`s the find, walks over it again (count stays), then counts a second id. Passed.\\\\n\\\\nNo regression showed up in the director seeds, hub harness, boots, or check. Camera bank and prop knock stay out of scope: the prior gap asked for a visible, deed-driven consumer, and the sea, the slope, the rate, and the −0.5° delivery are that consumer.\\\\n\\\"\\n}\",\"to