{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1147","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe prior bug used `act.hold` instead of `act.left`, which kept the pose clip near zero. I need to confirm that `act.left` increments during hold and that the test boots the island and steps the real activity.\n\nNext, I'm examining the tilt fix: wiring tilt into player-visible state so deeds can change it, and testing that a non-zero CoB affects consumed tilt.`prop:sea` has no body\n\nThe tilt fix is now wired into the game. field, so `propBody` returns undefined and `body` becomes -1. `game.tilt.rate` feeds storm, guest delivery subtracts 0.5 from tiltX, centre stone writes tiltX/tiltZ from body position, sea counter-rotates via `seaTurn`, and guests are pushed downhill by `tiltX`. Tests in island.test.ts cover these paths. I still need to verify that a non-zero CoB actually","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1631,"output_tokens":314,"cache_read_input_tokens":91904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"a0abec22-ebe7-4c17-9535-28cf521f182c"}
