{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1149","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" through the sea quaternion or guest push.\n\nChecking the plaques gap. The code shifts plaques west by `(day - 1) * 0.04` each day. The test expects positions like `6` and `6 - 0.12`, which maps to day 4. I need to confirm the test actually steps the island forward so these positions are driven by real day progression.\n\nChecking PLAN.md to confirm whether plaques creep west or downhill. The wobble age gap is next: show today's age against yesterday on the morning result and persist it through save.","signature":"UcZ5t21C2fOccoOXMvw7prJ5ak3PoTM8vkPJrGuLAzhyBweB13Q6PoMoy+c1t8i4fygXuXCmb5/xf8GucaVgL46m/Wt/rpJlUYFrXGsF6VdzYxgzABp2U82aO9UK2jU4AjTJZ8NuzCbXAPPNk98/h6z4h1230POC10uPOTyhmuNuzSVEtqiTSY0VHV/Y0yzdiJWPJTs3YncTpzE3qT5LwMBC2Zt7WYIyj2zy2qLwoAagGSYnnvUg7E9SYZnlrKxyIsRvGRJKz0VgAMOribw"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-921b0da3-cf2b-4ed8-a2ff-c3760f46c999-40","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"type: 'none'|body:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/props","glob":"**/*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-921b0da3-cf2b-4ed8-a2ff-c3760f46c999-41","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function defineProp|DEFAULT|body:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"**/prop*.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2930,"output_tokens":217,"cache_read_input_tokens":93440,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"1fd5b605-86c5-48fb-82f7-2eae6702c139"}
