{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1150","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe age remark is wired into the morning result in snap.ts, but I still need to confirm it actually paints on screen and that remember() persists the prior age. The pebble finds fix marks each found pebble as taken by ID and skips counting it again; I will read the tests carefully to verify this logic holds.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The five prior fixes are in the source. Next I’ll check whether the tests actually drive those paths and whether the captured verify log shows them passing."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Checking the default body in prop.ts around line 182.","signature":"AxA8NsIErsS7VyuBJLjmtuPpv2/DVXXjfKeqtj3uQMbSNWFNO4vUaQf6jYJ9MM1tLp9OD6bzBJxopyDLJyEhp4NEjNrSzVYxeUwyOBnea0KkL/gv"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71cc9db5-2554-4b0f-bbbd-b86ceb64cfc5-42","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/props/prop.ts","offset":160,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-71cc9db5-2554-4b0f-bbbd-b86ceb64cfc5-43","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"slot\\.t|speed: 0|hold: true","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim","glob":"**/*clip*"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1965,"output_tokens":198,"cache_read_input_tokens":96256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"b28d06ae-4cd9-47e3-b07b-14386a175e24"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-71cc9db5-2554-4b0f-bbbd-b86ceb64cfc5-42","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"160→const PLACE_FIELDS = {\\n  spawn: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The spawn name whose points place it, on their floor (a glyph with spawn: 'crate'); '' none.\\\",\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The light-spot tag whose spots place it, on the top of the spot's tile ('torch'); '' none.\\\",\\n170→  },\\n} as const satisfies Schema;\\n\\n/** The fields of a `prop` entry. */\\nexport const PROP_FIELDS = {\\n  description: { type: 'string', default: '', description: 'What it is, in plain sentences.' },\\n  parts: {\\n    type: 'array',\\n    items: { type: 'object', properties: PROP_PART_FIELDS },\\n    default: [],\\n180→    description: 'Its meshes: { name, geometry, params, material, top, tint, position, rotation, shadow, flame }.',\\n  },\\n  body: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BODY_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Its body in the physics world, standing on its base: { type, shape, size, radius, height, … }.',\\n    properties: BODY_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n190→    default: defaultsOf(LIGHT_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"Its light spot, for the light pool (WP 7.1): { tag, color, intensity, … }; tag '' for none.\\\",\\n    properties: LIGHT_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  place: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(PLACE_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Where a level places it (levelProps): on spawn points by name, or under light spots by tag.',\\n    properties: PLACE_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n200→  health: {\\n    type: 'number',\\n    default: 0,\\n    minimum: 0,\\n    description: 'Its hit points (WP 13.16): damage takes them, and at 0 it breaks; 0: it never breaks.',\\n  },\\n  breaks: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BREAK_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"What breaking leaves: { into (the pieces' prop), pieces, shards (the event it breaks with) }.\\\",\",\"content_concise\":\"160→const PLACE_FIELDS = {\\n  spawn: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The spawn name whose points place it, on their floor (a glyph with spawn: 'crate'); '' none.\\\",\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The light-spot tag whose spots place it, on the top of the spot's tile ('torch'); '' none.\\\",\\n170→  },\\n} as const satisfies Schema;\\n\\n/** The fields of a `prop` entry. */\\nexport const PROP_FIELDS = {\\n  description: { type: 'string', default: '', description: 'What it is, in plain sentences.' },\\n  parts: {\\n    type: 'array',\\n    items: { type: 'object', properties: PROP_PART_FIELDS },\\n    default: [],\\n180→    description: 'Its meshes: { name, geometry, params, material, top, tint, position, rotation, shadow, flame }.',\\n  },\\n  body: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BODY_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Its body in the physics world, standing on its base: { type, shape, size, radius, height, … }.',\\n    properties: BODY_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n190→    default: defaultsOf(LIGHT_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"Its light spot, for the light pool (WP 7.1): { tag, color, intensity, … }; tag '' for none.\\\",\\n    properties: LIGHT_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  place: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(PLACE_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Where a level places it (levelProps): on spawn points by name, or under light spots by tag.',\\n    properties: PLACE_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n200→  health: {\\n    type: 'number',\\n    default: 0,\\n    minimum: 0,\\n    description: 'Its hit points (WP 13.16): damage takes them, and at 0 it breaks; 0: it never breaks.',\\n  },\\n  breaks: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BREAK_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"What breaking leaves: { into (the pieces' prop), pieces, shards (the event it breaks with) }.\\\",\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/world/props/prop.ts\",\"offset\":160,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"const PLACE_FIELDS = {\\n  spawn: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The spawn name whose points place it, on their floor (a glyph with spawn: 'crate'); '' none.\\\",\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'string',\\n    default: '',\\n    description: \\\"The light-spot tag whose spots place it, on the top of the spot's tile ('torch'); '' none.\\\",\\n  },\\n} as const satisfies Schema;\\n\\n/** The fields of a `prop` entry. */\\nexport const PROP_FIELDS = {\\n  description: { type: 'string', default: '', description: 'What it is, in plain sentences.' },\\n  parts: {\\n    type: 'array',\\n    items: { type: 'object', properties: PROP_PART_FIELDS },\\n    default: [],\\n    description: 'Its meshes: { name, geometry, params, material, top, tint, position, rotation, shadow, flame }.',\\n  },\\n  body: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BODY_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Its body in the physics world, standing on its base: { type, shape, size, radius, height, … }.',\\n    properties: BODY_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  light: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(LIGHT_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"Its light spot, for the light pool (WP 7.1): { tag, color, intensity, … }; tag '' for none.\\\",\\n    properties: LIGHT_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  place: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(PLACE_FIELDS),\\n    description: 'Where a level places it (levelProps): on spawn points by name, or under light spots by tag.',\\n    properties: PLACE_FIELDS,\\n  },\\n  health: {\\n    type: 'number',\\n    default: 0,\\n    minimum: 0,\\n    description: 'Its hit points (WP 13.16): damage takes them, and at 0 it breaks; 0: it never breaks.',\\n  },\\n  breaks: {\\n    type: 'object',\\n    default: defaultsOf(BREAK_FIELDS),\\n    description: \\\"What breaking leaves: { into (the pieces' prop), pieces, shards (the event it breaks with) }.\\\",\\n\",\"total_lines\":373}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-71cc9db5-2554-4b0f-bbbd-b86ceb64cfc5-43","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,78,111,32,109,97,116,99,104,101,115,32,102,111,117,110,100,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":1,\"match_count\":0,\"file_matches\":[]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"1267efee-9f97-4652-8607-8c9e83856e64"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1151","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-8","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/island.test.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-9","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"ageRemark|prior|age\\.|remember|flow\\.age|flow\\.prior","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.{ts,js,mjs}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-10","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pose scrub|plaque|pebble|tilt|wobble age|ageRemark|finds","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/npm-test.log"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-11","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"failures|EXIT|pose|plaque|pebble|Wobble|credits","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/verify.log"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14115,"output_tokens":1435,"cache_read_input_tokens":36480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"f1d817e0-4dd2-4dd0-a76d-bdbb40eeaf1e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-8","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\n10→import { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n20→  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n30→    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n40→  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n50→/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n70→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n80→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n90→  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n100→    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n110→  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n120→      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n130→    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n140→    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n150→    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n160→    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n170→    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n180→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n190→    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n200→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n210→  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n220→    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n230→    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\n10→import { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n20→  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n30→    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n40→  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n50→/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n60→/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n70→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n80→    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n90→  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n100→    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n110→  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n120→      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n130→    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n140→    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n150→    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n160→    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n170→    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n180→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n190→    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n200→    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n210→  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n220→    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n230→    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/island.test.ts\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * @file The island and the pavilion boot through the shipped scenes and take a few steps.\\n * Pose scrub, tilt, plaques and pebbles are asserted from the island step, not a stand-in.\\n */\\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest';\\nimport type { EngineFrame } from '../../engine';\\nimport { createAppHost } from '../../engine/app/headless';\\nimport type { World } from '../../engine/sim-api';\\nimport { stickIntents } from './scenes/bot';\\nimport { actOf, flowOf } from './scenes/events/kit';\\nimport { poseA } from './scenes/events/pose';\\nimport { island } from './scenes/island';\\nimport { round } from './scenes/round';\\nimport { freshSave, noteProgress } from './ui/save';\\nimport { readSnap } from './ui/snap';\\n\\n/** A live island and the menu actions that drive it. */\\nfunction boot(seed: number, settings?: Record<string, unknown>) {\\n  const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed, settings });\\n  const w = run.session.world as World;\\n  const menu = (name: string, args?: unknown) => {\\n    (run.inspector.actions as { run: (action: string, value?: unknown) => void }).run(name, args);\\n  };\\n  return { run, w, menu };\\n}\\n\\n/** Clip time on the guest, or -1 when that clip is not playing. */\\nfunction slotT(w: World, clip: string): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as {\\n    role?: { who: string };\\n    clips?: { state?: { slots?: { clip: string; t: number }[] } };\\n  }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  const slot = who?.clips?.state?.slots?.find((row) => row.clip === clip);\\n  return slot?.t ?? -1;\\n}\\n\\n/** The sea's turn. q[2] is the west-lean component. */\\nfunction seaZ(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('sceneProp') as unknown as { sceneProp: { prop: string; q: number[] } }[];\\n  return rows.find((row) => row.sceneProp.prop === 'prop:sea')?.sceneProp.q[2] ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** The island lean the sea is reading. */\\nfunction tiltX(w: World): number {\\n  const rows = w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n  return rows[0]?.island.tiltX ?? 0;\\n}\\n\\n/** A mark of one kind and text. */\\nfunction spot(w: World, kind: string, text: string) {\\n  const rows = w.query('mark') as unknown as {\\n    mark: { kind: string; text: string; x: number; z: number; taken: number; follow: number };\\n  }[];\\n  const row = rows.find((item) => item.mark.kind === kind && item.mark.text === text);\\n  if (!row) throw new Error(`${kind} ${text}`);\\n  return row.mark;\\n}\\n\\n/** Where the guest is standing. */\\nfunction guestAt(w: World): { x: number; z: number } {\\n  const rows = w.query('actor') as unknown as { role?: { who: string }; actor: { x: number; z: number } }[];\\n  const who = rows.find((row) => row.role?.who === 'guest');\\n  if (!who) throw new Error('no guest');\\n  return who.actor;\\n}\\n\\ndescribe('places', () => {\\n  it('boots the island and walks a step', () => {\\n    const run = createAppHost({ scene: island, seed: 1 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    run.stepOnce({ move: [0, 1] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    expect(world.query('flow').length).toBe(1);\\n    expect(world.query('actor').length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(world.query('mark').length).toBeGreaterThan(4);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('boots the pavilion and keeps a ghost seat', () => {\\n    const run = createAppHost({ scene: round, seed: 2 });\\n    run.stepOnce({ 'game:ghosts': [1, 1, 0.2, -0.1, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0] });\\n    const world = run.session.world;\\n    const ghosts = world.query('ghost') as unknown as { ghost: { on: number; seat: number } }[];\\n    expect(ghosts.length).toBe(3);\\n    expect(ghosts.some((row) => row.ghost.seat === 1 && row.ghost.on === 1)).toBe(true);\\n  });\\n});\\n\\ndescribe('island day', () => {\\n  it('scrubs the pose clip from the class the guest is actually in', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.pose.hold': 4 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'pose-a' });\\n    run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const early = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing');\\n    expect(early).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 20; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    expect(actOf(w).phase).toBe(0);\\n    expect(slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Nothing')).toBeGreaterThan(early);\\n    let chair = false;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 800 && !chair; i += 1) {\\n      run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n      chair = actOf(w).pose >= 1;\\n    }\\n    expect(chair).toBe(true);\\n    const held = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 15; i += 1) run.stepOnce(poseA.bot(w, 'perfect'));\\n    const later = slotT(w, 'RETREAT/Chair');\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(0);\\n    expect(later).toBeGreaterThan(held);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('tips the sea with the centre of balance, and a delivered guest takes lean off', () => {\\n    const still = boot(1);\\n    const pushed = boot(1);\\n    still.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    pushed.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:stone' });\\n    let leanGap = 0;\\n    let seaGap = 0;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 120; i += 1) {\\n      still.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 0, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      pushed.run.stepOnce(stickIntents({ x: 1, y: 0 }, {}));\\n      leanGap = Math.max(leanGap, Math.abs(tiltX(pushed.w) - tiltX(still.w)));\\n      seaGap = Math.max(seaGap, Math.abs(seaZ(pushed.w) - seaZ(still.w)));\\n    }\\n    expect(leanGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.25);\\n    expect(seaGap).toBeGreaterThan(0.001);\\n    expect(seaZ(still.w)).not.toBe(0);\\n\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 1 });\\n    menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) run.stepOnce({});\\n    const fast = tiltX(w);\\n    const fastSea = seaZ(w);\\n    expect(fast).toBeCloseTo(1.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n\\n    const calm = boot(1, { 'game.tilt.rate': 0 });\\n    calm.menu('game.start', { event: 'tilt' });\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 60; i += 1) calm.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(tiltX(calm.w)).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 2);\\n    expect(fastSea).toBeLessThan(seaZ(calm.w));\\n\\n    const east = boot(2);\\n    east.menu('game.jump', { step: 'tilt:east' });\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    const before = tiltX(east.w);\\n    const beforeSea = seaZ(east.w);\\n    expect(before).toBeCloseTo(0.4, 3);\\n    expect(beforeSea).toBeLessThan(0);\\n    const guest = spot(east.w, 'guest', 'Gerald');\\n    guest.follow = 1;\\n    guest.x = 59;\\n    guest.taken = 0;\\n    actOf(east.w).px = 70;\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(guest.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n    expect(seaZ(east.w)).toBeGreaterThan(beforeSea);\\n    east.run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(tiltX(east.w)).toBeCloseTo(before - 0.5, 3);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n\\n  it('shifts plaques west as the day advances', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6, 5);\\n    menu('game.jump', { day: 4 });\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).day).toBe(4);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.moved').x).toBeCloseTo(-6 - 0.12, 5);\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(spot(w, 'plaque', 'plaque.want').x).toBeCloseTo(6 - 0.12, 5);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('keeps a found pebble taken when the save comes back', () => {\\n    const { run, w, menu } = boot(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    const first = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:0');\\n    const at = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = at.x;\\n    first.z = at.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).line).toBe('find.pebble');\\n    const snap = readSnap({ world: w } as unknown as EngineFrame);\\n    expect(snap.finds).toContain('pebble:0');\\n    expect(noteProgress(freshSave(), snap).finds).toEqual(['pebble:0']);\\n    first.taken = 0;\\n    menu('game.begin', { day: 1, cursor: 0, pebbles: 1, finds: ['pebble:0'] });\\n    expect(first.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    menu('game.leave');\\n    const back = guestAt(w);\\n    first.x = back.x;\\n    first.z = back.z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(1);\\n    const second = spot(w, 'pebble', 'pebble:1');\\n    second.x = guestAt(w).x;\\n    second.z = guestAt(w).z;\\n    run.stepOnce({});\\n    expect(second.taken).toBe(1);\\n    expect(flowOf(w).pebbles).toBe(2);\\n  });\\n\\n  it('walks downhill when the island is leaning west', () => {\\n    const flat = boot(1);\\n    const tipped = boot(1);\\n    flat.menu('game.leave');\\n    tipped.menu('game.leave');\\n    const flatIsland = flat.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const tippedIsland = tipped.w.query('island') as unknown as { island: { tiltX: number } }[];\\n    const flatLean = flatIsland[0]?.island;\\n    const tippedLean = tippedIsland[0]?.island;\\n    if (!flatLean || !tippedLean) throw new Error('no island');\\n    flatLean.tiltX = 0;\\n    tippedLean.tiltX = 20;\\n    const flat0 = guestAt(flat.w).x;\\n    const tipped0 = guestAt(tipped.w).x;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 200; i += 1) {\\n      flat.run.stepOnce({});\\n      tipped.run.stepOnce({});\\n    }\\n    const flatDrift = guestAt(flat.w).x - flat0;\\n    const tippedDrift = guestAt(tipped.w).x - tipped0;\\n    expect(tippedDrift).toBeLessThan(flatDrift - 0.2);\\n  }, 120_000);\\n});\\n\",\"total_lines\":232}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cdbdfd49-848f-4c1e-a4bf-78830b52293e-9","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99