3,117,97,115,104,101,100,32,114,111,117,110,100,101,100,10,54,55,56,58,42,42,69,102,102,101,99,116,115,42,42,32,40,96,100,101,102,105,110,101,69,109,105,116,116,101,114,96,41,58,32,114,105,112,112,108,101,32,114,105,110,103,115,44,32,115,112,108,97,115,104,101,115,32,115,109,97,108,108,32,97,110,100,32,104,117,103,101,44,32,112,101,98,98,108,101,32,99,108,97,99,107,32,100,117,115,116,44,32,99,97,108,109,32,119,97,118,101,44,32,115,112,97,114,107,108,101,32,111,110,32,115,116,97,109,112,115,44,32,115,101,97,103,117,108,108,32,102,101,97,116,104,101,114,115,44,32,99,111,110,102,101,116,116,105,32,111,110,32,85,110,115,101,116,116,108,105,110,103,44,32,114,97,105,110,32,97,110,100,32,115,112,114,97,121,32,105,110,32,116,104,101,32,115,116,111,114,109,46,32,66,117,105,108,116,45,105,110,115,32,119,111,114,116,104,32,117,115,105,110,103,58,10,55,48,56,58,32,32,32,84,104,101,32,107,101,121,32,102,111,114,109,97,116,39,115,32,108,101,103,101,110,100,32,105,115,32,96,76,69,71,69,78,68,96,32,105,110,32,96,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,97,110,105,109,47,99,108,105,112,47,108,101,110,115,46,116,115,96,46,32,73,110,32,115,104,111,114,116,58,32,96,104,105,112,115,32,91,102,111,114,119,97,114,100,44,32,114,105,103,104,116,44,32,117,112,93,96,32,105,110,32,112,101,114,99,101,110,116,32,111,102,32,104,105,112,32,104,101,105,103,104,116,32,40,49,48,48,32,115,116,97,110,100,115,44,32,50,56,32,115,105,116,115,32,111,110,32,116,104,101,32,102,108,111,111,114,41,59,32,96,98,111,100,121,47,99,104,101,115,116,47,104,101,97,100,32,91,116,117,114,110,44,32,108,101,97,110,44,32,116,105,108,116,93,96,32,105,110,32,100,101,103,114,101,101,115,59,32,108,105,109,98,115,32,96,91,102,111,114,119,97,114,100,44,32,111,117,116,44,32,117,112,44,32,98,101,110,100,44,32,116,119,105,115,116,93,96,46,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":40,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\"paddling, a slackline, a tilting sand garden, sitting perfectly still while a frog judges you) is played through one\"},{\"line_number\":22,\"content\":\"verb: keep your centre of balance where it should be. Over five days the deadpan gets stranger. The plaques move.\"},{\"line_number\":34,\"content\":\"2. **Your thumb is the exercise.** The character's limbs follow the input directly, by scrubbing animation (section 11).\"},{\"line_number\":38,\"content\":\"4. **The daily ritual.** A morning check, one big number, a stamp, a growing stack of pebbles. Coming back is the game.\"},{\"line_number\":39,\"content\":\"5. **A small joke grows into the world.** The tilt starts as a sign that says \\\"Please keep to the centre\\\". It ends with\"},{\"line_number\":91,\"content\":\"- **Old Nan** (she): 91, Wobble Age 19. Stands where you left her. Nobody has seen her arrive.\"},{\"line_number\":99,\"content\":\"| 1 Arrival | Ferry leaves. Tare greets you. First Wobble Age is terrible. Sign: \\\"Please keep to the centre.\\\" |\"},{\"line_number\":194,\"content\":\"Activity-specific mouse feel: in Sand Garden the pointer's place on the tray is the tilt; in Hoop Patrol you circle the\"},{\"line_number\":267,\"content\":\"**Wobble Age.** The Morning Check's result, from 18 to 82: `age = round(18 + 64 × (1 − s)^k)`, `k` is `game.age.k` (1.3).\"},{\"line_number\":273,\"content\":\"slightly according to your last Wobble Age and stands true at 18. Thresholds unlock things, shown on the Noticeboard:\"},{\"line_number\":276,\"content\":\"**Exploration.** 20 pebbles, 12 \\\"Did you know?\\\" plaques, and each cast member has 3–5 new lines each day. Sit on a bench\"},{\"line_number\":277,\"content\":\"to watch the view with the Meditate clip. Wave at Gerald. Plaques visibly creep downhill across the days.\"},{\"line_number\":279,\"content\":\"**Tilt as story.** A value `island.tilt` starts at 0.4° on Day 1 and rises by 0.5° a day, so drinks slide, marbles roll,\"},{\"line_number\":282,\"content\":\"**Saves** go in the page store (`createStore`, prefix unique to your game): day, done list, ages, pebbles, finds,\"},{\"line_number\":302,\"content\":\"| Reps Hall | Annex | Side three-quarter, mirror behind | Lean scrubs the body |\"},{\"line_number\":320,\"content\":\"`s = 0.45A + 0.3B + 0.25C`; score `s × 1000`; Wobble Age as in section 5. Reveal: a large CSS dial spins past 100, \\\"recalibrating\\\",\"},{\"line_number\":328,\"content\":\"  progress advances; progress scrubs the pose strip, so the body goes into the pose exactly as your thumb does. If you never\"},{\"line_number\":348,\"content\":\"(`game.reps.tempo`, 3 s a rep). Stick depth moves your marker and scrubs the body. Stay within 0.2 of the band to bank the\"},{\"line_number\":352,\"content\":\"- **Polite Push-Ups** (8): hold both feet (\\\"palms on the floor\\\") and scrub the push-up clip with the stick.\"},{\"line_number\":412,\"content\":\"A raked sand tray on a stand, seen from above. Lean tilts it up to 12° (`game.garden.tilt`); the mouse pointer's place on\"},{\"line_number\":420,\"content\":\"**Air** (about 2 s): lean y spins you, lean x twists, scrubbing a rotation strip. Enter the water within 15° of vertical.\"},{\"line_number\":428,\"content\":\"to catch it. Up to eight at once. Score: hoops × seconds, scaled. The hip-circle strip scrubs with your stick's angle, so\"},{\"line_number\":436,\"content\":\"Score: share of time in the ribbon. Tare hops beside you and talks, the plaques go by. At the end Gerald says: \\\"Nice weather\"},{\"line_number\":449,\"content\":\"**How the tilt works.** `island.tiltX, tiltZ` are sim values. The island's geometry never moves. Instead:\"},{\"line_number\":451,\"content\":\"- Actors get a slope push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\"},{\"line_number\":457,\"content\":\"Tilt grows by `game.tilt.rate`, and each deed below takes some off.\"},{\"line_number\":461,\"content\":\"2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\"},{\"line_number\":465,\"content\":\"3. **Counterweights (45 s).** Two pebble carts on rails, cranked by alternating feet while you lean into the slope with the\"},{\"line_number\":468,\"content\":\"   whole island. **Now the tilt is your CoB:** the stick moves your weight, and your weight moves the island. Waves are the\"},{\"line_number\":476,\"content\":\"remark, so the ending always comes. Score: delivered guests, tilt at the end of step 4, breath. It feeds the final remark only.\"},{\"line_number\":486,\"content\":\"**UI look:** pebble-shaped rounded panels in warm off-white with soft shadows, not the source's look. A rounded system stack\"},{\"line_number\":513,\"content\":\"- **Results:** rank word, score, pebbles falling onto a little cairn, a line from Plumb or Tare; \\\"Again\\\" or \\\"Carry on\\\".\"},{\"line_number\":525,\"content\":\"- **Live sliders with Reset**, per group and for all: every numeric `game.*` setting in this plan, plus `game.pebbles.mult`. They are\"},{\"line_number\":529,\"content\":\"- **Cheats:** bot plays for me, no topple, unlock all, give pebbles, reset save, a throwaway save mode (`createStore` `sandbox`).\"},{\"line_number\":530,\"content\":\"- **Tools:** time scale (0.25, 1, 4), pause and frame step, free camera (`cam3=fly`), state overlay (CoB, calm, sync, tilt, event,\"},{\"line_number\":618,\"content\":\"  `engine.input.virtual.axis('game:ghosts', […])` to actors on the other mats, tinted with `info.players[i].color`, leans scrubbed by their CoB,\"},{\"line_number\":620,\"content\":\"- Finished: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats at most six, names at most 16 characters (\\\"Wobble Age\\\", \\\"Best hold\\\", \\\"Breath\\\"),\"},{\"line_number\":667,\"content\":\"**Make these as props** (`node x new prop labs/game/props/<name>`; parts are geometry by id and material by id, with `tint`): mats, Tare's Platform, Noticeboard, plaques, Cairn pebbles (squashed rounded\"},{\"line_number\":678,\"content\":\"**Effects** (`defineEmitter`): ripple rings, splashes small and huge, pebble clack dust, calm wave, sparkle on stamps, seagull feathers, confetti on Unsettling, rain and spray in the storm. Built-ins worth using:\"},{\"line_number\":708,\"content\":\"   The key format's legend is `LEGEND` in `engine/anim/clip/lens.ts`. In short: `hips [forward, right, up]` in percent of hip height (100 stands, 28 sits on the floor); `body/chest/head [turn, lean, tilt]` in degrees; limbs `[forward, out, up, bend, twist]`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-841e2212-bbea-40eb-bca1-9118a83502f9-46","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,51,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,47,84,104,117,109,98,32,89,111,103,97,45,87,105,105,32,70,105,116,45,103,114,111,107,45,52,46,55,45,120,104,105,103,104,45,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,47,101,110,103,105,110,101,47,115,105,109,47,115,121,115,116,101,109,115,46,116,115,10,50,53,58,32,42,32,115,121,115,116,101,109,115,46,97,100,100,40,39,116,104,105,110,107,39,44,32,40,119,41,32,61,62,32,119,46,108,111,103,46,112,117,115,104,40,39,116,104,105,110,107,39,41,44,32,123,32,112,104,97,115,101,58,32,39,97,105,39,32,125,41,59,10,56,52,58,32,32,114,101,97,100,111,110,108,121,32,112,104,97,115,101,58,32,80,104,97,115,101,59,10,49,49,51,58,101,120,112,111,114,116,32,102,117,110,99,116,105,111,110,32,112,104,97,115,101,73,110,100,101,120,40,112,104,97,115,101,58,32,80,104,97,115,101,41,58,32,110,117,109,98,101,114,32,123,10,60,47,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,62],\"stderr\":[],\"exit_code\":0,\"match_count\":3,\"file_matches\":[{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/systems.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":25,\"content\":\" * systems.add('think', (w) => w.log.push('think'), { phase: 'ai' });\"},{\"line_number\":84,\"content\":\"  readonly phase: Phase;\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"export function phaseIndex(phase: Phase): number {\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"5f734dbf-b498-4095-aba0-c0d6fc064924"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1155","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" and calls ageRemark in snap.ts line 167. I need to verify if that return value is painted on the results screen. I also need to check if remember() stores the prior.\n\nTwo `remember` functions exist: one in wobble.ts for balance history, and one in stage.ts for UI save. The prior gap concerned the latter, which must survive reloads.\n\nI need to read save.ts noteProgress and stage.ts remember/paint carefully to confirm the save path works.\n\nThe retreat tests may call ageLine directly instead of driving the real finish path.The plan mentions plaques creeping downhill across\n\nFor Gap 5, applyFinds marks pebbles taken the days. and pickup skips them. The test teleports a pebble to the guest and steps.\n\nThe pebble test drives real pickup and applySave. It saves, resets taken, then reloads via game.begin. The first pebble stays taken after reload. A second pebble increments normally.\n\nA potential bug remains: game.begin might respawn the world and invalidate the test's pebble object reference.\n\nThe prior gap required plaques to shift downhill across days. The implementer instead moved them west by a fixed 4cm per day. The slope push from the pilot system should use `slope × sin(tilt)` to drive the movement.\n\nWestward creep is a constant direction. Downhill on a domed island means moving away from the peak. This is a demonstrable defect: plaques east of the summit would","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-93d1f523-2aa8-4971-96b0-36099ab5bdef-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/tmp/grok-goal-ed8f613011b3/implementer/npm-test.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-93d1f523-2aa8-4971-96b0-36099ab5bdef-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656