{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1156","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" creep toward the peak instead of west.\n\nThe test asserts a westward offset, matching the current code. Strictly speaking, this is a real behavioral miss of the downhill requirement. The anti-ratchet rule only allows new objections when they demonstrate a defect in shipped behavior. Since the prior gap explicitly required downhill shifting, the westward creep Checking whether resultCopy is used when paintingleaves that gap unfixed. the morning results.\n\nDownhill should follow the terrain gradient, not a fixed westward vector. The 4cm daily shift is too small to be visibly noticeable.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e624a9f1-1770-4b42-bf35-545a0c7342e9-17","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"resultCopy|ageRemark|rankLine|sentence|flow\\.line|snap\\.line","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/stage.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e624a9f1-1770-4b42-bf35-545a0c7342e9-18","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/retreat.test.ts","offset":200,"limit":130}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e624a9f1-1770-4b42-bf35-545a0c7342e9-19","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function step|phase|hold|pose\\.id|Nothing|Chair","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/pose.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6629,"output_tokens":423,"cache_read_input_tokens":57472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"ae931057-8fab-4898-96dc-4912053f