{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1163","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nI suspect a save/load bug. The first morning stores prior 0 and age 82. On the second morning finishEvent sets flow.prior to yesterday's age before updating flow.age. I need to check if game.begin restores that saved prior during page boot. If the boot path only passes day and pebbles, the prior is lost on reload.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/ui/menus.ts","offset":70,"limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","offset":297,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-25","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"plaque|creep|four centimetre|downhill|wobble age|finds","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work","glob":"PLAN.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-26","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"sceneProp|q:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine","glob":"*.{ts,js,mjs}","head_limit":40}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5971,"output_tokens":1928,"cache_read_input_tokens":66816,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"1ff3d867-a595-40bd-8397-a36272a0dd63"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-23","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"70→export function createMenus(host: Host): Menus {\\n  const pct = (n: number) => `${Math.round(n * 100)}%`;\\n\\n  const showTitle = () => {\\n    const kept = readSave(host.store);\\n    host.open(\\n      [\\n        { label: 'Begin', id: 'begin' },\\n        { label: 'Continue', id: 'continue', disabled: !kept },\\n        { label: 'Free Play', id: 'free', disabled: !kept || (kept.day <= 1 && !kept.credits) },\\n80→        { label: 'Group Class', id: 'group' },\\n        { label: 'Settings', id: 'settings' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' },\\n      ],\\n      'Thumb Yoga',\\n      'title',\\n      (id) => pickTitle(id),\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n90→  function pickTitle(id: string): void {\\n    if (id === 'begin') {\\n      host.prefs = freshPrefs();\\n      host.icons = 'playstation';\\n      host.applyPrefs();\\n      host.save = freshSave();\\n      host.persist();\\n      host.run('game.begin', {});\\n      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n100→      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'continue' || id === 'free') {\\n      const kept = readSave(host.store);\\n      if (!kept) return;\\n      host.save = kept;\\n      host.prefs = kept.settings;\\n      host.icons = host.prefs.icons;\\n      host.applyPrefs();\\n      host.run('game.begin', { ...kept });\\n      if (id === 'free' && !kept.credits) host.run('game.leave');\\n110→      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'group') {\\n      host.run('game.start', { event: 'group' });\\n      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'settings') showSettings(0);\\n    else {\\n120→      host.aboutFrom = 'title';\\n      showAbout();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const showSettings = (page: number) => {\\n    const items: MenuItem[] =\\n      page === 0\\n        ? [\\n            { label: `Music ${pct(host.prefs.music)}`, id: 'music' },\",\"content_concise\":\"70→export function createMenus(host: Host): Menus {\\n  const pct = (n: number) => `${Math.round(n * 100)}%`;\\n\\n  const showTitle = () => {\\n    const kept = readSave(host.store);\\n    host.open(\\n      [\\n        { label: 'Begin', id: 'begin' },\\n        { label: 'Continue', id: 'continue', disabled: !kept },\\n        { label: 'Free Play', id: 'free', disabled: !kept || (kept.day <= 1 && !kept.credits) },\\n80→        { label: 'Group Class', id: 'group' },\\n        { label: 'Settings', id: 'settings' },\\n        { label: 'About', id: 'about' },\\n      ],\\n      'Thumb Yoga',\\n      'title',\\n      (id) => pickTitle(id),\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n90→  function pickTitle(id: string): void {\\n    if (id === 'begin') {\\n      host.prefs = freshPrefs();\\n      host.icons = 'playstation';\\n      host.applyPrefs();\\n      host.save = freshSave();\\n      host.persist();\\n      host.run('game.begin', {});\\n      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n100→      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'continue' || id === 'free') {\\n      const kept = readSave(host.store);\\n      if (!kept) return;\\n      host.save = kept;\\n      host.prefs = kept.settings;\\n      host.icons = host.prefs.icons;\\n      host.applyPrefs();\\n      host.run('game.begin', { ...kept });\\n      if (id === 'free' && !kept.credits) host.run('game.leave');\\n110→      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'group') {\\n      host.run('game.start', { event: 'group' });\\n      host.close();\\n      host.screen = 'play';\\n      host.publish();\\n    } else if (id === 'settings') showSettings(0);\\n    else {\\n120→      host.aboutFrom = 'title';\\n      showAbout();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  const showSettings = (page: number) => {\\n    const items: MenuItem[] =\