e push: the pilot system (section 14) adds `slope × sin(tilt)`, downhill, to the move it writes.\"},{\"line_number\":461,\"content\":\"2. **Everyone East (75 s).** Slope push is on. Twelve guests (crowd agents; Gerald, Bex and Nan among them) drift downhill\"},{\"line_number\":667,\"content\":\"**Make these as props** (`node x new prop labs/game/props/<name>`; parts are geometry by id and material by id, with `tint`): mats, Tare's Platform, Noticeboard, plaques, Cairn pebbles (squashed rounded\"},{\"line_number\":821,\"content\":\"- \\\"Did you know? This plaque was four centimetres to the left on Tuesday.\\\"\"},{\"line_number\":882,\"content\":\"**Key components** (plain data): `flow` (mode: front, roam, event, cutscene, results; event, phase, tick; day), `wobble` (per seat), `seat` (input per seat), `island` (tilt), `round`, `pebble`, `plaque`, `ghost`, plus one per activity. Time in whole steps, randomness from named streams, loops in `w.query` order, `Math.pow` not `**`.\"},{\"line_number\":996,\"content\":\"5. **The joke.** Still Pond. Then Cairn, plaques, day cycle.\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4b766b19-c3f2-41de-9848-644fa5901d4a-26","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50,50,51,54,53,54,95,95,120,53,52,102,97,99,99,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,97,116,32,108,101,97,115,116,32,52,48,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,46,98,117,105,108,100,45,118,50,95,95,50,48,50,54,49,49,48,52,45,50