{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1166","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"npm check and tests passed.A critical potential bug has been identified.\n\nPose scrub logic verified. Phase 2 release timing and first-frame pose entry are correct. Clip name capitalization checks out for Heron and Comma.\n\n`props.readback` overwrites `sceneProp.q` and `sceneProp.y` from the physics body. If it runs after `dress`, those values would be wiped every frame. The tests still pass, so the phase order must differ.\n\nNapkin, Polite Bridge, and Lighthouse pose ids were checked against clip names. Mismatched ids would cause playClip to throw and break the pose class. Tests passed, so these clips\n\nIf readback runs before rules, dress's values are correctly mapped. survive until the next frame. If the sea prop has no physics body, readback skips it entirely and dress's values remain intact. The next step is to verify whether prop:sea actually has a body.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b8ad83e1-7c2b-4cf9-b02c-ce162338ba6a-59","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/data/poses.ts","offset":85,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b8ad83e1-7c2b-4cf9-b02c-ce162338ba6a-60","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts","offset":145,"limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-b8ad83e1-7c2b-4cf9-b02c-ce162338ba6a-61","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/driver.ts","offset":120,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":