size, the readback's layout, what was asked, pipelines built, and how long it took. */\"},{\"line_number\":81,\"content\":\"  readback: Readback;\"},{\"line_number\":113,\"content\":\"/** Drops the row padding of a readback: `height` rows of `width` pixels from rows of `rowBytes(width)` bytes. */\"},{\"line_number\":129,\"content\":\"): Promise<{ pixels: Uint8Array; readback: Readback }> {\"},{\"line_number\":134,\"content\":\"    readback: { bytesPerRow: rowBytes(width), bytes: bytes.length },\"},{\"line_number\":245,\"content\":\"  const { pixels, readback } = await readPixels(renderer, targets.colour, width, height);\"},{\"line_number\":246,\"content\":\"  const result: ShotResult = { width, height, readback, built: 0, ms: 0 };\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/stageProps.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":155,\"content\":\"        a.fromArray(before.q).slerp(b.fromArray(after.q), k);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/props.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":6,\"content\":\" * (`physics.readBody(id)`) or, for a prop without one, `propPose(placement)`; the meshes stand `propCentre` below it,\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim-api.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":260,\"content\":\"export { propPose } from './world/props/place';\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/gfx/enhanced/particles.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":19,\"content\":\" *   readback; `bounds()` estimates where they are from their births (no drag, swirl or bounce).\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/spine.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"  const l = Math.hypot(...q);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/anim/clip/frames.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":78,\"content\":\"  const l = Math.hypot(...q);\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/binding.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":4,\"content\":\" * world and adds the system `physics`, in the phase of that name, after `ai` and `anim` and before `readback`; and\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/world.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":21,\"content\":\" * same name, after `ai` and `anim` and before `readback`, where systems copy results into components.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/physics/crowd.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":123,\"content\":\"/** A crowd agent: its body, its make and what the last readback saw (`CROWD_AGENT_FIELDS` says what each means). */\"},{\"line_number\":333,\"content\":\" * The crowd's step, after the physics step (the phase `readback`), over every agent in id order: reads each body\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/engine/sim/propBlocks.ts\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"    blocks.push(boxOf([x, y, z], size, new Quaternion(...q)));\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc