,\"content\":\"- `driftChecks` (function): Every drift check except the examples: comments, codes, paths, generated docs and PROGRESS.md.\"},{\"line_number\":9740,\"content\":\"- `MAX_COMMENT_LINES` (const): The longest a file comment (PLAN.md §6.8) or `docs/PROGRESS.md` (one screen) may run, in lines.\"},{\"line_number\":9741,\"content\":\"- `PROGRESS` (const): The one screen every session reads first: where things stand, what is next, the open issues.\"},{\"line_number\":10608,\"content\":\"- `PROGRESS_MS` (const): How often a wait for the page sends progress, ms.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/TASK.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/STAGE.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":1,\"content\":\"Build the game PLAN.md describes. Take your file names and what to hand in from TASK.md, which is filled in for you. Keep your progress in PROGRESS.md, so you can pick up where you were after your context is compacted.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa35-d4ff-74f0-9f18-3308a1dd51dc","uuid":"569420a5-202d-48ed-992b-1386e8fdb122"}
