{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_1189","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"18 test cases are being written for activities using `it()` and `it.each()`.\n\nThe 28 total tests are confirmed: 18 `it()` cases plus 10 `it.each` cases. The next step is to inspect the pose scrub and playClip interaction when a clip is already playing.\n\nThe first scrub path for the Nothing pose is safe. The lean playClip calls occur before slot re-reads, but Nothing is already present so no duplicate plays happen. Additive lean resets are handled by the subsequent slot t updates.\n\nWhen the pose changes to Chair, playClip stacks over Nothing rather than replacing it. Nothing remains frozen at speed 0 while Chair scrubs on top. The player sees the new pose once its weight reaches 1 after the fade-in.\n\nThe fade-in delay for stacked poses is acceptable and not a bug.\n\nPebble double-counting across save reloads was also checked. On a full page reload, the scene spawns pebbles with taken=0, then game.begin applies the saved finds and sets taken=1. If the player walks over the pebble during roam, it remains taken and will not increment again.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a6478cdb-475e-44e1-92c1-0cc9f642f8e3-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function sweep|function visit","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game","glob":"*.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a6478cdb-475e-44e1-92c1-0cc9f642f8e3-66","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223656__x54facc/work/Thumb Yoga-Wii Fit-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-223656/labs/game/scenes/events/kit.ts","offset":1,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1044,"output_tokens":934,"cache_read_input_tokens":123648,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_t